window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":6201,"title":"Chapter 6201: World of Consciousness","paragraphs":["Chapter 6201: World of Consciousness","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hearing the name of the Great Realm King made him involuntarily frown.","“Realm King, you’re not joking, are you? Are you sure it’s the Great Realm King and not the Realm King God?”","The difference was significant.","In the Great Realm King’s domain, only the first generation of the Great Realm Gods existed.","The other Great Realm Kings had long since perished.","Only one was still alive, and they were in the starry sky.","None were on the Realm King Continent.","On the Realm King Continent, there was only one Realm King God.","However, the consciousness of the Realm King God here had several existences.","They were all previous Realm King Gods who had fallen.","Although Jian Wushuang’s talent was not bad, having the combat power of a seven-star Universe God now, it wasn’t enough to attract the attention of the Great Realm King!","“Believe it or not, the invitation from the Great Realm King has been sent out. Just say whether you’re going or not!”","“I’ll go!”","Jian Wushuang immediately agreed, tidying his clothes, with a halo above his head.","In this realm of consciousness, it was actually no different from the outside world, except you couldn’t leave.","“Then let’s go. How do we get to Chaos City?” The Northern Realm King, seeing him take the bait, let out a slight smile, conjured a small flying boat, and took Jian Wushuang away from this small Blue Star.","On the way, looking at the outside scenery, Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened.","He had seen quite a few wondrous sights, but the scenery along the way left him completely astonished.","This was true beauty!","There might be no place more beautiful in the world.","“Don’t be so surprised. This is a world born of consciousness. The scenery is naturally the most beautiful scenes recorded in consciousness. In simpler terms, the scenery here is all illusions. Don’t take it too seriously. When we get to Chaos City, it’ll be even more fun!”","Consciousness changes?","Jian Wushuang’s eyes moved as he looked at the beautiful scenery before him.","He lost himself in thought for a moment.","If the changes in consciousness were true, wouldn’t it be possible to become as strong as one desired, just like in the Land of Chaos?","There, countless demons were born, living recklessly and freely in the outside world.","They could open up anything at will.","There were no constraints.","A world born of consciousness, wasn’t it the same as the Land of Chaos?","Then where was the real world they lived in?","The starry sky, Realm King Continent, the Four Great Spacetimes, the universe, the myriad worlds.","These seemingly real things, could they also be illusions?","At this moment, a seed of doubt sprouted in his heart.","Self-doubt.","Doubt about the world.","He suspected the authenticity of this world.","This was his feeling after entering the world of consciousness.","Later, he quickly put these thoughts behind him.","Along the way, the Northern Realm King took his time, showing no urgency.","The strange sights along the road also piqued Jian Wushuang’s curiosity.","They stopped to play for a few days before continuing forward.","In the realm of consciousness, he encountered no danger.","It was like a fairyland.","He also met many Universe Gods’ consciousnesses, who seemed familiar with the Realm King.","They all greeted warmly, without any airs.","Even some nine-star Universe Gods were extremely polite.","Such a perfect world, living like this forever would actually be quite good.","The intrigues and battles in the outside world, what was the point?","Seeing the change in Jian Wushuang’s expression, the Realm King explained, “Don’t be fooled by the peace here. There are also some threats, and this world is too small, unsuitable for long-term survival, or the consciousness will collapse!”","“No wonder!” Jian Wushuang sighed, “If this were the real world, perhaps there wouldn’t be any cultivators. Everything could be resolved peacefully. Why need force?”","“Haha, your ambition is not bad, but it’s hard to achieve!”","This wasn’t an ambition, but a common thought among fallen cultivators.","Living here for a long time, some would sink into despair, seeing this place as their final refuge until they perished.","They would rather die than reincarnate.","They had reached a point where they were not afraid of death.","Some cherished their lives and wanted to accumulate fortune to reincarnate.","Actually, at their level, death was not truly frightening.","What was terrifying was losing the things they once had.","It all came down to human nature.","This was something he didn’t discuss with the Realm King.","The other party wasn’t human; even if he explained, it wouldn’t be understood.","Jian Wushuang was different. He came from the mortal world.","He had witnessed the multitude of beings among mortals.","Mortals would always contend.","For power, for honor, for superiority.","Such struggles would always arise.","Some struggles were physical fights, while others were battles within oneself.","Struggling against oneself.","For example, a poor boy from the mortal world might insist on marrying a rich girl.","Why?","Because he saw others doing it and felt he would lose face if he didn’t do the same.","So, he fought desperately, seeking others’ approval.","Until the end, when he died from exhaustion, he still left with a smile.","He fought for something better.","Jian Wushuang had also paid a price for this.","Even now, he asked himself if it was worth it.","Perhaps it wasn’t, but having walked this path, the brilliance of his life might not be any less than those who achieved great wealth and power.","When he fell, he would at least leave with a smile.","“Perhaps, I understand now!”","Jian Wushuang looked up at the enchanting scenery and gently closed his eyes.","Feeling the breeze, he leisurely continued on his journey.","Enjoying a brief moment of peace.","Several days later.","The Realm King finally brought him to Chaos City.","The yellowed ancient city didn’t exude an ancient aura or any intimidating power.","It was just an ordinary little mortal city.","Here, no matter how powerful you were, you couldn’t act on your own.","Otherwise, your consciousness would be erased.","There wasn’t even a guard at the gate.","The consciousnesses on the street each went their own way.","After arriving in Chaos City, Jian Wushuang noticed that the people here rarely smiled.","Most wore expressions of worry and sorrow.","This must be the pressure the Realm King mentioned.","Unable to let go of everything they once had, they wanted to be resurrected.","Outside, those they encountered had given up on reincarnation, living their final days in the Realm King God Realm.","But these people here, they fought for everything they once had.","“Come, let’s go to the arena!”","“The arena?”","“Why go there? Aren’t we here to see the Great Realm King?”","Jian Wushuang was a bit puzzled.","“Hehe, you’ll understand once we get there. To meet the Great Realm King, we must prepare a gift.”","“That’s true. You are thoughtful, Lord Realm King.” He nodded, realizing he had been too impatient.","Others could be in a hurry, but he would not.","His consciousness wouldn’t collapse, and he could slowly cultivate without needing to reincarnate, just mingling here with plenty of time.","So, he followed the Realm King to the arena.","Upon arrival, he found it was indeed a circular arena.","But who were the opponents?","Jian Wushuang was curious.","Entering here didn’t require any payment.","Because there weren’t even two guards.","The two of them entered casually.","After finding a place to sit down.","The Realm King leisurely said, “In a moment, there will be a battle between two Universe Gods whose consciousnesses are about to collapse. You must watch closely. Such a deathmatch is rarely seen in the outside world.”"]},{"number":6202,"title":"Chapter 6202: Dejection in the Arena","paragraphs":["Chapter 6202: Dejection in the Arena","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“An introspective and dying Universe God?” Jian Wushuang was taken aback and felt a twinge of curiosity.","However, he was more curious about why the Realm King had brought him here.","In such a place, what kind of meeting gift could be presented to the Great Realm King?","He didn’t rush to ask. Instead, he sat on a high platform, waiting for the battle to begin.","A quarter of an hour later, the bell rang.","More people began to gather.","Inside the entire arena, there were at least ten thousand Universe Gods’ consciousnesses.","All were waiting for this last battle before death.","Soon, two Universe Gods walked out, facing each other.","“It’s actually a Seven-Star Universe God!”","Jian Wushuang gasped.","Although there were Nine-Star Universe Gods here, such powerful Universe Gods, with their consciousness in decline and approaching death, were unwilling to reincarnate.","This astonished Jian Wushuang!","He had thought that only the weaker Universe Gods would participate.","He didn’t expect it would be such powerful Universe Gods.","The two Universe Gods in the arena looked different.","One had curved horns on his head.","The other had blue scales on his body.","Only the seven stars on their chests were the same.","Jian Wushuang also had stars on his chest.","He had six.","They represented his strongest divine power, but not necessarily his highest combat power.","The two in the arena did not waste words.","They directly began to fight.","Originally, he thought it would cause a great commotion like outside.","After they started fighting, he realized there was not much commotion at all.","At most, the intense collision of fists and feet caused bursts of energy.","Moreover, they did not invoke the Origin Source.","This made Jian Wushuang very curious.","“Realm King, could it be that the Consciousness Realm suppresses the power of the Universe Gods?”","“Not suppress, but weaken!”","The Realm King explained with a faint smile, “The Consciousness Realm is actually very fragile. Many, many people want to enter here; those are called reserve slots. Every genius in the Academy of the Gods has such a slot. After they fall, they will be guided into the Realm King God Realm. But this place cannot bear too many Universe Gods, so it weakens their power. For introspective Universe Gods, it applies some pressure to let them fall earlier, making it easier for later arrivals.”","“Could it be that Universe Gods fall every day in the outside world?” Jian Wushuang’s tone was surprised.","Although he had not stayed on the Realm God Continent for long, he had never seen a Universe God fall on the Realm God Continent. Just the fall of one Universe God caused an enormous stir.","How could Universe Gods fall every day?","This remark made the Realm King laugh, “Jian Wushuang, you know too little about the Starry Sky. If you understood the Starry Sky, you wouldn’t say that. You must know, whether it’s the four major spacetimes or the Realm God Continent, they are pitifully small compared to the Starry Sky. The number of strong individuals is vastly different.”","“You can think about it, in your original universe, there wasn’t even one Universe Master. Then compare the original universe to the Realm God Continent. Don’t Universe Masters fall every day there?”","Jian Wushuang understood.","It was his narrow perspective, or he had taken Universe Gods too seriously.","The vastness of the Starry Sky was beyond his imagination.","“Alright, let’s watch this battle first. Later, you will need to prepare a gift for the Great Realm King yourself!”","The Realm King stopped talking after speaking.","Watching the battle of the two Universe Gods in the arena.","Although there were no fancy moves, the intensity of the fight remained high.","They had already been reborn in death.","Naturally, there was no holding back.","A fight without the concern for life was the most brutal.","In the end, the blue-scaled man won.","He personally twisted off the opponent’s horn.","A consciousness disappeared in the Realm King God Realm.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but stand and cheer.","Although it was brutal, it was all their own choice, without any coercion.","Everything was voluntary.","He was also willing to respect the other’s choice and naturally cheered.","The battle ended, and a petite girl appeared in the arena. She looked pure, wearing a python-patterned robe, with a slightly aloof demeanor.","“Honored strong ones from various realms, today’s battle was won by King Mengxiang, marking his seventh consecutive victory. If he wins the next three matches, he will be able to visit the Great Realm King and receive the mystery of the Starry Sky in the supreme rules!”","After speaking, the girl handed a medal to King Mengxiang.","This was the seventh medal.","There were two axes on the medal.","The Giant Axe Medal.","Winning ten consecutive matches would earn one the Giant Axe Medal.","Not only could one learn the mysteries of the Starry Sky’s Supreme Law Rules, but also gain a chance for a super reincarnation.","Perhaps, after learning the ultimate secret of the Starry Sky’s mysteries, one wouldn’t want to die.","And the chance for super reincarnation meant being assigned to that particular tribe or family.","Even the Giant God Tribe was possible.","They would even be escorted and protected.","It could be said that after obtaining the Giant Axe Medal, not only would one not need to be dejected, but could also soar to great heights.","Therefore, those who participated in the arena battles were not only the Universe Gods who had become dejected and wanted to know the mysteries of the Starry Sky, but also those Universe Gods who wished to be reborn.","Hence, the arena was the liveliest place in the entire Chaos City.","Jian Wushuang now understood.","Why the Realm King had brought him here.","Wasn’t this just digging a pit for him?","He immediately turned around to leave.","The Realm King chased after him, persuading, “Jian Wushuang, this truly is the only way to meet the Great Realm King. I am not deceiving you!”","“Don’t you want to meet the Great Realm King even once?”","“I don’t want to!”","Jian Wushuang stopped, turned around to face the Realm King, and replied, “I just fell, and now you want me to risk my life, and it’s even ten life-and-death battles. How could I win them all?”","He didn’t even want to fight one battle.","As the Realm King had previously said, he would be resurrected anyway.","There was no need to fight ten life-and-death battles.","Torturing himself!","“Anyway, I will not participate because I don’t see the need. I would rather trust Huiqing than believe I could win ten matches!”","He didn’t even care about the benefits of winning.","What Starry Sky mysteries?","What super reincarnation?","He didn’t care about any of it.","He had already heard the Realm King explain before, about the origin of the Starry Sky.","It was born out of chaos.","What secrets could there be?","To put it bluntly, the current master of the Starry Sky was once a demon, a Realm Beast.","Just much stronger than other Realm Beasts.","Able to create a Starry Sky.","Upon hearing this, the Realm King didn’t want to give up and continued persuading, “Don’t you want to see the Great Realm King who could create the Realm God Continent?”","“I don’t want to!”","Jian Wushuang decisively refused, then sneered, “I’ve even seen Weiss, who is a Star Spirit, much stronger than the Great Realm King. No need to meet him.”","“Haha!” The Northern Realm King was amused, covering his mouth and said, “Oh right, right, right, the Star Spirit is indeed stronger than the Great Realm King!”","Hearing the sarcastic laughter, Jian Wushuang felt a bit defiant, “Am I not right?”","“Yes, you are!”","The Realm King nodded and said, “You are absolutely right, the Star Spirit is stronger than the Great Realm King!”"]},{"number":6203,"title":"Chapter 6203: Persuading","paragraphs":["Chapter 6203: Persuading","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“That settles it then.”","Jian Wushuang spread his hands and prepared to continue walking outside.","However, the Realm King called him back again.","“Have you ever thought about the fact that the former Great Realm King had the potential to rival the existence that created the Starry Sky?”","These words stunned Jian Wushuang.","He instinctively stopped in his tracks.","“You should know the goddess from the Ancient Moon Spacetime. She once attempted to replicate the Starry Sky but ultimately fell because her ambitions were too grand! But the Great Realm King nearly created a Starry Sky. For some unknown reason, he voluntarily gave up and instead developed the Realm King Continent, becoming the strongest existence among cultivators. The Twelve Star Spirits, indeed, are supreme beings, transcending the highest rules, but they are not cultivators!”","The Realm King sighed again.","“Although I am not a cultivator, you, Jian Wushuang, are a cultivator and the pride of our Northern Spacetime. I want you to go further. You possess the Origin Source of the Starry Sky; you have the potential to become the next Great Realm King, or even the next creator of the Starry Sky!”","This time, Jian Wushuang did not argue.","He stood there in a daze for a while before slowly speaking, “Is this the purpose of bringing me here?”","“Yes!”","“Believe me, meeting the Great Realm King will definitely be worth it. You will gain useful information for yourself. No matter what, he is a pioneer and beneficial to you. He might even give you some guidance. The risk of ten life-and-death battles is worth taking!”","Jian Wushuang was somewhat persuaded.","He now genuinely wanted to meet the Great Realm King.","To discuss the Origin Source of the Starry Sky with him.","Not to mention creating the Starry Sky, even developing his own spacetime was an issue.","Currently, he was still far from mastering the Origin Source.","He licked his lips, looked up at the Realm King, and said, “Alright! I will participate in the life-and-death battle!”","“That’s the spirit! It’s a rare opportunity!” The Northern Realm King immediately beamed with joy.","He grabbed Jian Wushuang and was about to return to register.","“Wait a minute!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t go directly but asked, “I am a Universe Master. I can’t possibly fight those seven-star Universe Gods, can I?”","“Don’t worry, it’s a battle of the same level. You are currently marked as a six-star Universe God, so your opponent will also be a six-star Universe God!”","This reassured Jian Wushuang.","He had the strength of a seven-star.","Although most Universe Gods came from the Starry Sky and had many trump cards,","facing a six-star Universe God with his seven-star strength wasn’t very difficult for him.","“Realm King, it seems you have prepared everything, just waiting for my agreement!”","“Don’t say that. After your fall, I thought you shouldn’t be too idle in the Realm King God’s Realm. Otherwise, how will you deal with Zamasu after your resurrection?”","Jian Wushuang lifted his head, disdainful, “I dealt with Xilu; Zamasu is nothing!”","“When Huiqing and the others get me out, if Zamasu doesn’t come for me, I will go to him and definitely kill him! By the way, between Zamasu and Xilu, who is stronger?”","“Hmm... Zamasu is slightly stronger, but now Zamasu is at the Academy of the Gods, preparing for the final push to become the Realm King God. He has definitely surpassed Xilu and might have already reached beyond the nine-star Universe God!”","“Beyond nine-star?”","Jian Wushuang frowned. He had thought Zamasu was at most a nine-star Universe God.","He hadn’t expected him to surpass nine-star.","“Stop thinking about it for now. Let’s go register first and then study your opponent!”","They walked back into the arena.","Instead of going to the viewing platform, they went to a stone house beside the arena.","A girl in a black robe with python patterns was flipping through some books.","Seeing the Realm King, she stood up and politely said, “Northern Realm King, what brings you here?”","“Nothing much. Didn’t a six-star Universe God from our Northern Spacetime fall? He wants to reincarnate early, so I thought I’d let him participate in the life-and-death battle to return to the Realm King Continent sooner!”","The atmosphere made Jian Wushuang feel somewhat amused.","As if the Northern Spacetime had many Universe Gods.","“That’s easy. Just carve your name on the stone wall, and it will automatically sort and select opponents of the same level to fight!”","“Thank you!” The Realm King cupped his hands and then motioned Jian Wushuang to carve his name.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate and immediately wrote his name on the stone wall.","The moment his name was engraved, his opponent was selected.","“Karo!”","A six-star Universe God from the Ninth Star Zone, known for his ability to kill opponents of the same level.","Also a Universe God in the Academy of the Gods.","There was a lot of information.","Jian Wushuang noted it all down.","After all, it was a life-and-death battle, so it was better to be cautious.","After all this, the Realm King took him away from the arena.","His battle with Karo was scheduled for one year later.","In the arena, a life-and-death battle occurred every three days.","This meant that more than a hundred Universe Gods would perish completely in a year.","This number was quite astonishing.","Time outside was calculated in epochs.","It was unclear how different the flow of time was from the outside world.","After leaving the arena, on the way, he asked about the girl in the black robe with python patterns.","It seemed this was his first time seeing a manager within the city of chaos.","The Realm King heard this and explained with a smile, “Hehe, let me tell you about her. She is the second eternal consciousness in the entire Realm King’s realm. The first is the Great Realm King.”","“She is called Meteor, given to the Great Realm King by the Great Star Officer. She is not a living consciousness but similar to a Star Spirit, not a cultivator. She has been in the city of chaos for billions of years. Whether it’s those Star Spirit Envoys or the Great Realm Kings of the past, they all respect her greatly. You should too. You don’t need to consider seniority but must respect her because her consciousness is connected to the entire Realm King’s realm. She is the god here!”","“The god of the Realm King’s realm?”","It was a bit of a mouthful, but not hard to understand.","Chatting with the Realm King, they eventually arrived at a tavern.","Strangely, no one greeted them at the tavern.","Everyone just went inside on their own.","They would find an empty room and settle in.","The tavern was a cave world.","Each room was a world.","The seemingly small Realm King’s realm was actually infinitely vast.","Because it could create overlapping spaces.","Although space could be infinitely large, it couldn’t bear more consciousnesses.","They found an empty room and pushed the door open.","It revealed a very cozy valley scenery.","There was a small fenced courtyard, a stream, and low hills.","“For now, settle here. In three days, there will be another life-and-death battle. Watch a few more, and you won’t return empty-handed.”","“I understand!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He was also learning the small rules of the life-and-death battles.","For example, the blue-scaled strong man who won the seventh battle today would face his next opponent in half a year, who also had seven consecutive victories.","A battle between the strong.","The stakes were high.","However, that blue-scaled strong man had a despondent consciousness and didn’t care about reincarnation. He seemed to want to know the ultimate secrets of the Starry Sky in his final moments and make his life a bit more exciting!"]},{"number":6204,"title":"Chapter 6204: Butcher","paragraphs":["Chapter 6204: Butcher","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the following days, he did not cultivate but continued to watch these life-and-death battles.","At his current level, he still needed significant improvement.","First and foremost was the Origin Source.","In the Starry Sky, he still had not condensed a river of spacetime.","The Origin Source of spacetime and the river of spacetime were different.","And the difference was vast.","You could cultivate an Origin Source of spacetime.","But you couldn’t create a river of spacetime.","The fundamental difference was a billion times.","Because a Universe Master could achieve the Origin Source of spacetime.","But creating a river of spacetime required a Realm King.","“With my current level, creating a river of spacetime is too difficult!”","Without creating a river of spacetime, he couldn’t even undergo a Divine Tribulation.","This was his path of Chaos.","For others, creating a universe was enough.","He needed to create a river of spacetime.","If he couldn’t even achieve that, there was no point in competing in the Starry Sky.","“Great Realm King!”","Meeting this existence who had developed the Realm God Continent might reveal to him the step he was missing in condensing the river of spacetime.","Therefore, he was not in a hurry to cultivate.","Instead, he watched life-and-death battles daily, immersing himself in them.","Reigniting his fighting spirit.","He watched continuously for half a year.","Most of the life-and-death battles were among five-star Universe Gods.","Seven-star Universe Gods rarely participated in life-and-death battles.","As for the battles of eight-star Universe Gods, they might not occur even once in hundreds of years.","Nine-star Universe Gods were even rarer.","In the entire Realm God Continent, there were probably not even ten nine-star Universe Gods willing to participate in life-and-death battles.","Being able to witness a battle between seven-star Universe Gods was already quite good.","On this day.","He came to the arena as usual.","Accompanying him was the Realm King.","Normally, the Realm King did not come.","But this time, the life-and-death battle was special.","Both sides had already won seven consecutive victories.","They were just three matches away from total victory.","Once they won, they would wait for the next seven-star Universe God with eight consecutive victories.","In the arena, there was a life-and-death ranking.","Among the seven-star Universe Gods, there was a super strong warrior with nine consecutive victories.","But he had been waiting for billions of years and couldn’t find another six-star Universe God with nine consecutive victories.","Of course, he could also skip the wait and directly challenge an eight-star Universe God.","That was possible.","And no matter how many consecutive victories the opponent had, a challenge could be issued.","The gap of one star was a chasm; no one dared to take such a risk.","Moreover, challenging an eight-star Universe God with nine consecutive victories was tantamount to courting death, rendering all previous efforts futile.","Jian Wushuang did not have this dilemma.","If he couldn’t find an opponent, he would challenge a seven-star Universe God.","However, he didn’t dare to be careless. If he encountered a super strong seven-star Universe God, it would be disastrous.","“Do you know who is the most nervous about today’s battle?”","“Who?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled upon hearing this.","The Realm King squinted his eyes and said, “The Butcher!”","“The one with nine consecutive victories among the seven-star Universe Gods?”","“Yes!” The Realm King nodded and said, “There is already a seven-star Universe God with eight consecutive victories. As long as a winner emerges today, there will naturally be a nine-star Universe God with nine consecutive victories, and the Butcher can finally be relieved!”","The Butcher!","This was a nickname in the Realm God Continent.","With a battle axe, he had achieved nine consecutive victories.","But then there were no more opponents.","There were only so many seven-star Universe Gods, not that many madmen.","He had waited for billions of years.","He was a Universe God who had just entered the Realm God Continent and started participating in life-and-death battles.","No one knew why.","Some said he was seeking reincarnation.","Others said he wanted to know the ultimate secrets of the Starry Sky as he approached the end of his life.","There were many differing opinions.","However, the butcher himself had never mentioned this matter.","He had always been very aloof towards the outside world.","He rarely appeared in the gladiatorial arena.","But this time, he showed up.","He stood on the sand platform, gazing at everything.","In his eyes, there was endless divine power.","Jian Wushuang could sense the other’s strength with just a glance.","Purely in terms of divine power, he was no match.","No wonder he had nine consecutive victories.","This was a super-strong opponent among those of the same rank.","The key point was that the butcher was not from the Academy of the Gods.","He came from the “Giant Race.”","Only one word different from the Giant God Race.","Yet, they were worlds apart.","He was barefoot, dressed in coarse cloth, with a battle axe hanging from his waist.","He looked like a wild man.","After a glance, Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “I can’t surpass him in divine power!”","“So what? You won’t encounter him anyway!”","“Actually, I really want to try.”","Jian Wushuang grinned.","If he actively challenged the opponent, it would probably anger the other soon-to-appear seven-star Universe God with nine consecutive victories to death!","He gazed at the arena.","Soon, a familiar figure appeared.","After a simple report on the achievements of both sides, the girl with the python pattern hastily left the stage.","The battle in the gladiatorial arena thus began.","Two seven-star Universe Gods with seven consecutive victories.","Later, there would be opponents with eight and nine consecutive victories waiting for them.","It could be said that they were only three steps away from the ultimate secret of the Starry Sky.","Naturally, they had prepared early.","Once they started, they seized each other’s weaknesses.","The hand-to-hand combat began.","Buzz!","The buzzing came from the divine body.","The divine body simulated in the world of consciousness was perfect.","Each battle consumed almost the same as in the outside world.","Jian Wushuang watched intently, but the Realm King beside him shook his head.","“It’s over, Longchang is going to lose!”","Longchang was the previous blue-scaled expert.","The opponent was “Yang Taixu.”","At this moment, the battle between the two had already become one-sided.","The more Yang Taixu fought, the stronger he became, and Longchang could barely hold on.","The outcome would soon be decided.","“This Yang Taixu’s secret technique is really ruthless. Each attack can stack power. Now, he probably has the combat strength of a quasi-eight-star Universe God!”","The secret technique stacked power.","There would be backlash, but the other party could always withstand it.","Moreover, his divine body showed no signs of fatigue, indicating that the secret technique had reached a perfect level.","This battle indeed had no suspense.","The butcher also left voluntarily.","He didn’t continue to watch.","But Jian Wushuang always felt that Longchang hadn’t exerted all his strength yet.","Because each of his moves was hesitant.","If he truly had no trump card left and was about to lose,","Why not fight desperately?","Even if he fell, it should be a spectacular battle.","Longchang was a depressed Universe God.","He shouldn’t be afraid of death.","“He really might have a hidden move!” The Realm King also noticed this issue.","For a moment, Jian Wushuang became curious as well.","The ones on the field were all Universe Gods, not fools.","Even a five-star Universe God, with enough combat experience, could see the problem.","Everyone anticipated Longchang’s absolute counterattack.","Unfortunately, the battle continued to the end, and Longchang did not show any outstanding performance.","His divine body was completely shattered.","This also meant his consciousness was extinguished.","This made everyone very disappointed.","“Is that all?”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but frown, “He definitely hid his strength!”","“That’s unlikely, right?” The Realm King found it hard to believe.","A depressed Universe God would indeed be peculiar.","But it wouldn’t be to the extent of holding back in a life-and-death battle, right?","Having seven consecutive victories, suddenly didn’t want to live?","Everyone left with doubts."]},{"number":6205,"title":"Chapter 6205: Invincible Divine Body","paragraphs":["Chapter 6205: Invincible Divine Body","Jian Wushuang and the Realm King also walked out of the arena.","Returning to the inn, they did not rush back to the Heaven and Earth World.","Instead, they sat on the balcony of the second floor of the inn, drinking tea and discussing the recent events.","“Longchang came from the Starry Sky, with a good background. He was also quite renowned","back then. I didn’t expect this to be his end. To be honest, I thought he had a good chance against the Butcher.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","The Realm King had seen far more life-and-death battles than he had.","He had even witnessed the Butcher’s battles.","As the two chatted, they saw Yang Taixu on the street.","He looked despondent, without a trace of the joy of victory.","Slowly, he walked into the inn.","He went straight into the Heaven and Earth World.","“Something’s definitely wrong!”","Jian Wushuang and the Realm King exchanged glances.","They were both puzzled but couldn’t ask directly.","They could only talk about it as a topic of conversation.","Time flew by.","Another half year passed.","Jian Wushuang’s first life-and-death battle had arrived.","A life-and-death battle among six-star Universe Gods attracted a considerable audience.","Moreover, it was the first life-and-death battle for both Jian Wushuang and Karo.","Everyone wanted to see how the newcomers to the six-star Universe Gods’ life-and-death battles would fare.","Perhaps in future battles, they might encounter each other.","The first three life-and-death battles could not be skipped.","After winning three consecutive battles, one could challenge stronger Universe Gods.","Of course, few dared to take such risks.","There had been an Eight-Star Universe God who challenged a Nine-Star Universe God.","He lost miserably.","However, he had no regrets.","He just wanted to see the difference.","Jian Wushuang was not like that. He wanted to regain that sense of urgency.","Fighting against a six-star Universe God posed no pressure for him.","In the arena.","The Realm King felt very confident about Jian Wushuang, chatting and drinking tea with several Universe Gods nearby.","“North Realm King, is this your disciple?”","“Sort of,” the Realm King nodded.","“Impressive. You let your disciple participate in a life-and-death battle, but you can’t even protect him as a Realm King?”","“Hmph!” The Realm King snorted coldly, “I’m a Realm King, not a nanny. Do you think protecting someone is easy?”","“Who made you like doing such things!”","Indeed, the Realm King often did such things.","He often visited the Realm King God Realm to persuade some people to reincarnate into the Northern Spacetime.","He promised to protect them personally.","But after so long, not a single Universe God had appeared.","It was only this time that the Great Realm King personally intervened, allowing Hu Qing to become a Universe God.","Bru also became a Universe God through Danbao, which had little to do with the North Realm King.","After such precedents, many Universe Gods no longer believed in the North Realm King. They often teased him about it.","Buzz!","The battle in the arena had already begun.","Jian Wushuang let out a low shout, and his divine power surged.","He instantly reached the level of a quasi-seven-star.","Karo’s expression changed.","He panicked immediately.","His strength was also considerable.","He chose the life-and-death battle aiming for ten consecutive victories.","He didn’t expect to encounter a quasi-Seven-Star Universe God in his first battle.","Karo clenched his fists and began to amplify his divine power, also reaching the quasi-Seven- Star level.","Those who came to participate in life-and-death battles as Universe Gods had some skills.","This was why Jian Wushuang did not dare to easily challenge the Ninth Tribulation.","If he encountered a tough opponent, he would suffer.","“Make your move!” Karo slowly took his stance.","Jian Wushuang did the same.","After a brief exchange of glances, they started to fight.","Powerful divine forces clashed, causing the surroundings to tremble.","Jian Wushuang threw a punch, hitting Karo’s back.","His hands felt numb.","“Unbeatable Divine Body!”","Karo smiled faintly and kicked Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang blocked with his hands but was sent flying.","His whole body shook.","He slowly stopped.","“You’re tough!” Jian Wushuang actually felt good about it.","If it were too easy, it would be boring.","He hadn’t even used the Ultimate Skill yet!","He clenched his wrist, thinking about how to break Karo’s Unbeatable Divine Body.","It was like a turtle shell.","Once broken, Karo would be at his mercy.","He pointed a finger.","A cold light flashed!","Karo chuckled, “That won’t work on me. Your divine power is indeed strong, but your","foundation is weak.”","This assessment was accurate.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was enhanced.","His basic divine power was naturally lacking.","It was indeed a matter of foundation!","“Then I’ll defeat you with Origin Source.” Jian Wushuang raised his hand and pointed.","The power of the Starry Sky erupted.","A blue cold light shot out like a sharp blade.","This made Karo’s expression freeze with some panic.","He hurriedly retreated.","He raised his hands to block.","Slash!","His palms split open.","Even his undefeated divine body cracked.","If he could be injured, he could be killed.","Karo didn’t dare to take the hit head-on again, but the cold light was too fast.","He had nowhere to hide.","So he could only attack.","He took the initiative to attack, trying to disrupt Jian Wushuang’s fighting rhythm.","The two began a tug-of-war.","Jian Wushuang kept retreating, while Karo kept charging forward.","The spectators in the arena watched with deep interest.","The onlookers saw it clearly, but those involved were confused.","“This Jian Wushuang is just playing; he’s not using his full strength at all. Karo is doomed to","lose!”","“A fearsome figure has appeared among the six-star Universe Gods.”","Many six-star Universe Gods frowned.","The surprise from these two newcomers was immense.","No matter who won, they posed a huge threat to the others.","But there was no way around it; they had to face it.","In the arena. “Jian Wushuang, all you can do is run?” Karo’s undefeated divine body was already in tatters.","If this continued, he would fall.","“If you want me to stop, then show your true strength!”","The feeling Karo had about his opponent was not just this.","Being strung along for so long, yet still staying calm.","Clearly, Jian Wushuang still had cards up his sleeve. He had been relying on his undefeated divine body to hold on.","Either he had no more cards, or his cards were powerful enough that he couldn’t reveal them","too early.","He wanted to save them for later.","Karo was the latter.","He frowned and suddenly stopped.","“Forcing me to go all out in just the first battle, Jian Wushuang, you should feel proud!”","As soon as Karo finished speaking, his aura began to change.","Arcs of electricity surrounded him, and black energy enveloped his entire body.","“Earth-shattering Transformation!”","Buzz!","The aura of divine power swept around.","At this moment, Karo’s divine power completely reached the level of a seven-star Universe","God.","“As expected of a Universe God from the Academy of the Gods, he really had a trump card!”","“Seven-star combat power, this six-star Universe God life-and-death battle is going to be exciting!”","The spectators on the viewing platform were all excited.","Most of them were Universe Gods who had not participated in the life-and-death battle, so","they felt no pressure.","Those who felt pressure were already frowning.","“Northern Realm King, it looks like your Jian Wushuang from Northern Spacetime is in","trouble!”","“Tsk tsk, look at the Northern Realm King’s calm expression. Maybe he has a trump card too.”","The Realm King said indifferently, “Win or lose, it doesn’t matter to me.”","He said this, but only he knew Jian Wushuang’s true strength.","Not to mention seven-star combat power, even quasi-eight-star or eight-star combat","power, so what?"]},{"number":6206,"title":"Chapter 6206: I Found You","paragraphs":["Chapter 6206: I Found You","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang could even cut down Xilu.","He had witnessed the power of that sword strike with his own eyes.","Although it required gathering sword intent, which was quite troublesome.","Over the years, Jian Wushuang had been accumulating sword intent, which was something he could see.","That sword strike could be saved for the end.","Or for the strongest opponent.","On the field.","After revealing his trump card, Karo directly suppressed Jian Wushuang.","There was suppression in divine power and suppression in speed.","However, despite Karo’s repeated attacks, he couldn’t force Jian Wushuang to retreat.","The powerful divine power posed no threat to Jian Wushuang.","He used the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique to easily dissolve it.","The important thing was the turtle shell on the opponent.","It had to be broken.","Otherwise, he couldn’t hurt the opponent.","After being suppressed, he simply used the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","“What’s going on?” Karo was startled.","Suddenly, he felt that Jian Wushuang’s movements had become smoother.","But his divine power hadn’t increased.","Yet his combat strength had risen to a terrifying level.","Without even making a move, he could easily shake him off.","“You’ve been hiding your strength, haven’t you?” Karo couldn’t help but ask.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded calmly.","After all, the opponent was a dead man, so there was nothing he couldn’t say.","“Have I lost the first match?”","Karo felt a sense of powerlessness.","He couldn’t touch Jian Wushuang at all.","And Jian Wushuang seemed to be toying with him, not taking the initiative to attack.","Just keeping him hanging.","“Give me a quick end!”","Karo was about to go crazy.","The audience in the arena felt the same.","Especially those six-star Universe Gods.","“This Jian Wushuang actually has the speed of a seven-star Universe God. How come we’ve never heard of him on Realm God Continent before?”","“Jian Wushuang!”","Indeed, it was an unfamiliar name.","There were quite a few Universe Gods on Realm God Continent, but those with the combat strength of a seven-star Universe God.","Most of them were well-known; it was impossible not to have heard of them.","Unless the person had been in seclusion and never came out.","But that was impossible. To have the combat strength of a seven-star Universe God while always in seclusion was too exaggerated.","While the Universe Gods in the audience were surprised.","Jian Wushuang also found the opponent’s weakness.","Invincible?","That was absolutely impossible.","Otherwise, why would the opponent fall?","There would always be weaknesses to be found.","“I found you!”","Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered, completely suppressing the opponent’s speed. Getting close to him was too easy.","When he reached Karo, the latter hadn’t even reacted.","He broke the invincible divine body with a single finger.","The turtle shell shattered instantly.","Karo was relieved.","He looked at Jian Wushuang, “So you’ve been looking for my weakness all along!”","His tone was calm, even in the face of death.","“Losing to you isn’t too shameful. You could have easily defeated me, yet you chose to find the weakness of my invincible divine body. I admire that!”","“Any last words? Perhaps I can help you.”","Jian Wushuang didn’t rush to make a move.","He didn’t know the opponent. Although this was the Consciousness Realm, it was the most brutal kind of death.","“None. I gave all my instructions the moment I fell. Coming here was an accident, meeting you was an even bigger accident. Before I die, let me give you a piece of advice: don’t be complacent, and don’t think you’re invincible. Invincibility is a lie; falling is the true destination!”","These words seemed simple but had profound meaning.","Invincibility was indeed a lie.","Even the creators of the starry sky had to worry about the invasion of the Chaos Land.","Star Spirits could also fail.","Let alone Universe Gods.","They still faced endless threats.","Eternal life had long been achievable.","Although they had transcended the Supreme Tribulation, they hadn’t transcended this starry sky.","The end of the path had already been sealed.","The road was dead.","Their destination was naturally falling.","“Message received!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes sharpened.","The final strike was decisive.","The opponent should not suffer too much.","With a single hand chop, he easily shattered the opponent’s Origin Source.","Instantly, the opponent perished.","Their consciousness dissolved, feeding back into the Consciousness Realm.","The battle was over.","A girl with snake-like patterns appeared, first congratulating Jian Wushuang on his victory, then announcing the time for his next life-and-death battle.","She also pinned a Giant Axe Medal on him.","There were many life-and-death battles for six-star Universe Gods.","Winning the first match was not uncommon.","Thus, the next battle was scheduled very soon, in three years.","Jian Wushuang did not feel overly happy, not because of the pressure from his opponent.","But because he gave his opponent pressure.","In the spectator stands, a short six-star Universe God showed fear.","“Why me, out of so many six-star Universe Gods, why me!” he roared in unwillingness.","This drew sympathetic glances from nearby Universe Gods.","Some disheartened Universe Gods thought he was embarrassing.","Two groups of people.","Two different perspectives.","Only Jian Wushuang respected his opponent’s will.","His second opponent was not a disheartened Universe God, and did not seek a glorious death in battle.","He fantasized about succeeding in ten battles and reincarnating into the Giant God Clan.","Although unwilling, he still accepted.","This was his choice, something he had to face.","A great victory in the first battle.","Yet Jian Wushuang walked out of the arena feeling downcast.","“Jian Wushuang, you have changed!” said the Realm King who followed him. “You no longer have that bloodthirsty and battle-hungry demeanor.”","This might be a sequela of falling!","He loathed battle.","He loathed death.","Whether it was himself or others.","He had thought he had recovered, but now it seemed he had drawn a circle around himself.","“Realm King, am I a failure?”","“Absolutely not!”","“Jian Wushuang, you are the pride of the Northern Spacetime. In the ancient Moon Spacetime, you protected the Life God of the Way and contributed one-third to the resurrection secret technique, slayed the metal lifeforms, protected the Wanliu Divine Tree. Even Lord Weiss praised you. You protected your home world, upheld the legacy of Qishen Temple, slayed the Starry Sky God of Death, and when you fused with Hu Qing, you were so spirited. Just think about Qishen Temple now; it’s the number one power in the Northern Spacetime!”","The Realm King recounted his past achievements.","These were glories in the eyes of others.","But after accomplishing them, he didn’t feel much.","Qishen Temple?","He had entered Qishen Temple back then, resorting to any means to become stronger.","Cooperated with Bai Junwang, blood-sacrificed Cang Mountain.","Like a demon lord.","The result was the emergence of a big figure, “Celestial Maiden Jiang Shang.”","In the end, Hu Qing’s master and disciple relationship ended in life and death.","He still hadn’t redeemed his disciple and had to run around rescuing him.","At first, Bai Junwang shielded him.","Later, when Bai Junwang fell, he had his divine subordinates kill Broly’s father.","Eventually, he provoked a terrifying existence.","In Qishen Temple, he navigated between gods and true spirits.","Gained a lot of resources, making rapid progress.","At that time, he was very happy.","He also met Gong Miaoyi, whose eventual death was filled with hatred.","It wasn’t until Mie sheng appeared that he finally did something human."]},{"number":6207,"title":"Chapter 6207: Distress","paragraphs":["Chapter 6207: Distress","He went to the Ancient Moon Spacetime to fight for inheritance.","He fought to protect.","It wasn’t until he returned to Qishen Temple and killed Miesheng that he found some solace.","Then came the Realm King Continent.","Danger always accompanied him.","Many people had fallen because of him.","Now he had fallen.","It seemed like everything was over, perhaps it should have ended a long time ago.","This world was fine, even if his consciousness dimmed, eventually falling for real was fine.","He just felt a little sorry for Teacher Xuan Yi.","This was his only regret in his heart.","“Jian Wushuang, don’t overthink it. Let me take you somewhere to cheer you up!”","In any case, the upcoming battles posed no threat to Jian Wushuang.","He wouldn’t go to the gladiatorial arena to watch life-and-death battles anymore.","Otherwise, it would only make him more depressed.","Jian Wushuang also felt the terrible nature of depression.","Completely denying oneself.","Wasn’t that depression!","The Realm King understood this well; the onlooker sees more clearly than the involved.","Jian Wushuang didn’t think he was depressed, he just felt that his existence would bring more threats to his friends.","Realm King Divine Realm, Northwestern Border.","The scenery here was vastly different from what Jian Wushuang saw in the Realm King Divine Realm.","The scene here could be described as apocalyptic.","Mountains and seas roared.","In an instant, high mountains collapsed, and seawater flooded in.","There were thunderstorm clouds in the sky.","This was entirely different from the center of the Realm King Divine Realm.","“This is the weakest part of the Consciousness Realm, with a powerful consciousness constantly invading here. If it weren’t for the Great Realm King holding the fort, the entire Consciousness Realm would have long been destroyed.”","“Who is so bold to invade here?” Jian Wushuang’s face showed surprise.","This was the Consciousness Realm.","A place created by the Great Realm King, who in the entire starry sky would have the guts?","Jian Wushuang’s eyes moved, thinking of the Land of Chaos.","“Chaos, Infinity!”","“In the starry sky, whether it’s the river of spacetime or the Realm King Continent, they are all targets of the Realm Beasts’ consumption, including the Consciousness Realm!”","The Land of Chaos.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was deep and contemplative, with many guesses surfacing in his mind.","The Land of Chaos, could it be the ultimate destination of the world?","It birthed the Starry Sky.","It birthed the supreme rules.","It seemed to be the origin of everything.","This piqued his immense interest in the ultimate secrets of the Starry Sky.","Although it was unrelated to his fighting spirit, it provided him some solace.","At least now he had something to look forward to.","He wasn’t as indifferent as before, with no ambitions.","He was too lazy to even cultivate.","“Realm King, I think I understand why you brought me here!”","Upon hearing this, the Realm King smiled faintly and said, “I just wanted to show you that some places are so small they cannot control people. You are the same; the road ahead is long. It’s just the beginning, and you have yet to eliminate the threat of Zamasu for me. Don’t lose your fighting spirit and become disheartened!”","“Understood!” Jian Wushuang nodded solemnly.","“By the way, Realm King, can the fractures here be repaired?”","“Of course. The Universe Gods who take on missions to accumulate karma are doing so to repair the flaws in the Consciousness Realm. To make this world more real and stable, we must clear these broken lands.”","“So what should I do?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the shattered land before him, clueless about where to start.","From the fractures, he sensed destruction.","It was a chaotic force.","If it invaded the entire Consciousness Realm, this place would be obliterated.","“It’s quite simple. Chaos City has a treasure that can absorb this force. When you take on a mission, they will give it to you. However, you must eliminate the absorbed consciousness yourself! It’s essentially a deeper battle of consciousness.”","Jian Wushuang felt lost hearing this.","After careful consideration, he understood.","In simple terms.","Treat the consciousness in the fractured lands as invading Realm Beasts from the Land of","Chaos.","Consciousness is intangible.","Jian Wushuang could appear here because of the Consciousness Realm.","With the Consciousness Realm, consciousness manifests.","The consciousness of Realm Beasts would also manifest in the depths of the fractured lands.","However, that wouldn’t be very meaningful.","Forcing an attack would consume more.","It’s better to disperse consciousness and slowly erode it.","What Jian Wushuang needed to do was use a specific treasure to absorb the invading Realm","Beast consciousness.","Then use his own consciousness to clear it.","A battle of consciousness!","“Let’s go back!”","Jian Wushuang decided to start clearing these consciousnesses from today.","Although his strength wasn’t the strongest in the Realm King Divine Realm.","His willpower was arguably the best.","Consciousness is mental power.","Willpower is the power within the brain.","That power was even more mysterious; the higher the talent, the stronger the willpower in","the brain.","Seeing Jian Wushuang regain his confidence, the Realm King was pleased.","The two immediately left.","They returned to Chaos City.","Zhenxie Hall!","There were even more Universe Gods here.","Disheartened Universe Gods were a minority; even fewer participated in the life-and-death","battle.","Jian Wushuang entered the hall.","Many people looked over.","To be precise, they looked at the Giant Axe Medal on his chest.","“Jian Wushuang?”","“He’s the one who shone in today’s life-and-death battle. Why is he here?”","Those who participated in the life-and-death battle would not come here to take on tasks to","accumulate karma.","So it was rare to see Universe Gods wearing the Giant Axe Medal here.","In their view, those who participated in the life-and-death battle were madmen.","However, seeing Jian Wushuang enter, they still showed friendly smiles.","Jian Wushuang walked straight to the counter.","No one was managing it.","To take on a task, he just needed to inject his consciousness into the karma list above the hall.","With a thought, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness entered the karma list.","Rows of names appeared above.","First: Jiang Shan","Accumulated Fate value: one million points!","Reincarnated, willpower, ultimate Universe God.","This was a nine-star Universe God. However, to have the title of ultimate Universe God.","He was probably close to expanding the universe and becoming a spacetime.","Those who could enter the Consciousness Realm were the geniuses of geniuses.","They had the hope of becoming spacetime gods among practitioners.","Of course, this required reincarnation.","Upon reaching the Ninth Tribulation Realm, actively expanding the universe to reach the","realm of Spacetime Master.","There were also some defiers of fate who could break all methods with one force, directly","becoming Spacetime Gods.","There were two types of Spacetime Gods.","Most were innate Spacetime Gods.","Such as the Realm King and Dan Bao.","Becoming an innate Spacetime God.","Did not have the combat power of a Spacetime God.","Only had the combat power of a Universe God. Upon reaching nine-star Universe God,","expanding the universe to become a spacetime river.","That was a Spacetime God.","This was learned from the Great Realm King.","However, many Universe Gods, in their impatience to break through, became Universe Gods","without firm willpower.","Upon reaching nine-star Universe God, their power peaked.","It was difficult to improve further, so they chose reincarnation."]},{"number":6208,"title":"Chapter 6208: Reincarnation Rankings","paragraphs":["Chapter 6208: Reincarnation Rankings","Without that courage, his consciousness would sink.","Jian Wushuang possessed the Starry Sky Origin Source, so he naturally did not consider this.","He never thought about these things.","It was only after seeing this Ultimate Universe God that he thought of it.","The other party likely couldn’t continue down the path, so they chose to enter the Consciousness Realm to accumulate fortune and then reincarnate.","The best way to reincarnate was to accumulate fortune.","Life-and-death battles were too risky.","Moreover, the chance of winning ten matches was almost impossible.","No!","It was against the Starry Sky.","A Nine-Star Universe God directly shattered themselves, forcibly expanding the universe to become a spacetime river.","In this way, they became a spacetime god.","In other words, a Master of Spacetime.","This was what Jian Wushuang once thought.","But it was far more complicated than he had guessed.","“Reincarnating with a million points of Fate value, he probably has already entered the Giant","God Clan!” Jian Wushuang stared at the leaderboard in a daze.","There were many names on the leaderboard.","There were tens of millions.","It was likely accumulated from the time it was built until now.","Otherwise, how could there be so many Universe Gods?","Since the Starry Sky was opened, countless ages had passed, and tens of millions of reincarnated Universe Gods were already very impressive.","The first place had a million fortune points.","The second place only had six hundred thousand.","The gap was very large.","Jian Wushuang glanced at his own ranking.","After tens of millions, his Fate value was zero.","But he did not need fortune to reincarnate.","Huiqing and the others would gather the Origin Source to save him.","Moreover, his consciousness was chaotic, similar to that of a Realm Beast.","Even the highest rules of the Starry Sky could not control him.","“Receive the task!”","With a thought, his consciousness walked out from the leaderboard.","An oval, gray-white pot appeared in his hand.","The Demon Pot!","Seeing the Demon Pot appear in his hand, the Universe Gods in the hall were stunned.","“What is Jian Wushuang doing? His second life-and-death battle is in three years, and he still takes a fortune task?”","“Is he crazy? Not preparing for battle and really taking on a task?”","Many people did not understand.","“You guys don’t know anything. I watched today’s battle. Jian Wushuang has the combat power of a Seven-Star Universe God. The second match will be no pressure at all. Taking the task is probably out of curiosity, wanting to try it out!” The person speaking glanced disdainfully at everyone.","“Then he is quite arrogant. There are some six-star Universe Gods with incredibly perverse strength. I wonder how he compares to the Jade Face Buddha?”","“Jade Face Buddha?”","Hearing this name, many people’s faces darkened.","This was an extremely terrifying six-star Universe God.","Nine battles and nine victories, all of them one-shot kills.","Because the strength difference with other contestants was too big, he had never been matched.","He was still on hold now.","Waiting for an opponent of similar strength.","After seven matches, opponents would be matched based on strength.","The gap couldn’t be too large.","That’s why he was on hold.","Otherwise, the Jade Face Buddha would have already left with all victories.","Although they had high hopes for Jian Wushuang, he still fell short compared to that formidable character.","Because today’s life-and-death battle for Jian Wushuang didn’t seem so simple to win.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care how others viewed him. He took the magic jug and walked out of","the Zhenxie Hall.","This time, he was alone.","Heading toward the northwest border.","He arrived once again at the Broken Land.","The shattering of consciousness was a silent battle.","He took out the magic jug and began absorbing the broken area.","Manipulating this treasure was simple, using only Thought power.","However, the treasure had a drawback; it filled up easily.","It didn’t take long.","The magic jug was full.","With a thought, he entered the magic jug.","He started clearing the absorbed destructive consciousness.","Buzz!","When his mental power entered the magic jug, he discovered it was a world.","The surroundings were very magical.","Like a terrifying hell.","“Wow!”","In front of him, a figure exuding an evil aura appeared.","It was a Realm Beast.","“A new kid?” The Realm Beast was very relaxed, without any pressure.","In the magic jug, the consciousness of the Realm Beast would be suppressed.","Moreover, the allocation of the magic jug was very particular.","Jian Wushuang’s basic divine power was that of a six-star Universe God, so the allocated","magic jug was a six-star artifact.","The absorbed destructive consciousness could at most condense into a six-star Universe God","Realm Beast.","However, the consciousness of the Realm Beast in the magic jug would be suppressed.","To be precise, it had only the combat power of a five-star.","Jian Wushuang could kill it with a single thought.","“Are you not afraid of me?” He was very surprised at the other party’s attitude.","“Haha, what’s there to be afraid of? Just being killed by you. Speaking of which, you really are","a pure newbie. Want me to explain?”","“I’m all ears!” Jian Wushuang politely cupped his hands.","He didn’t detect any deceit or conspiracy from the Realm Beast.","This was the world of the magic jug; the other party posed no threat.","“You’re quite polite, so I’ll tell you!”","“The so-called Realm King God Realm you all talk about is actually the Consciousness Realm, you should know this. But do you know what carries the Consciousness Realm?”","“The consciousness of the Great Realm King?”","“Correct, it is indeed the consciousness of the Great Realm King. Actually, I didn’t come for","the Consciousness Realm but to destroy the Great Realm King. This person deserves to die, raising the levels of cultivators again. The Land of Chaos must eliminate such cultivators.”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang revealed a look of surprise.","He didn’t expect this to be the reason.","Aren’t Realm Beasts inherently evil, supposed to devour everything without needing any","reason?","Seeing his surprised expression, the Realm Beast continued: “Hehe, actually, the Land of Chaos isn’t as bad as you cultivators think. But it’s not that good either. We exist to eliminate anomalies. The Starry Sky is an anomaly, so we are mortal enemies, needing no reason, just to","be mortal enemies!”","“You are quite straightforward!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but praise the other party.","No beating around the bush, directly stating the relationship between the two sides.","“Hehe, what’s this? I even drank with your Great Realm King before. The day before destroying the Consciousness Realm, I specifically informed him!” The Realm Beast said,","laughing loudly.","Admiring its own candor.","“In that case, there’s nothing more to say. It’s just that this world will lose a wonderful soul!”","Jian Wushuang did feel a bit reluctant to kill the other party. It would be great if he could","enslave it.","Hearing this, the Realm Beast was first stunned, then laughed: “You are a newbie, perhaps","not worth it. I won’t die. What you kill is just a consciousness. We will meet again soon!”","“Don’t believe it?”","“Continue absorbing the broken consciousness, we’ll meet again soon!”","After saying this, it voluntarily dispersed its consciousness.","Jian Wushuang widened his eyes. This was the first time he had encountered such an","opponent.","The Realm Beast disappeared, and on the luck ranking list, a wisp of luck was added behind","his name.","A wisp of Fate, unmeasurable.","Only by condensing the fruit of luck would it count as one point."]},{"number":6209,"title":"Chapter 6209: Morosa","paragraphs":["Chapter 6209: Morosa","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To condense the Fate Fruit, it was necessary to eliminate the fragmented consciousness of a nine-star Universe God.","Currently, only the fragmented consciousness of a six-star Universe God had been eliminated.","Jian Wushuang calculated carefully and realized that it might take billions of years to condense a single Fate Fruit.","As a six-star Universe God, he could only stay on the periphery.","A nine-star Universe God, carrying a Demon Pot, could venture deeper.","They could accumulate Fate Points much faster.","Most nine-star Universe Gods chose to reincarnate after obtaining 10,000 Fate Points.","This was because, in the Consciousness Realm, the consumption of consciousness was greater.","If one didn’t reincarnate and their consciousness weakened to the point of falling asleep, it would be disastrous.","It would be counterproductive.","Jian Wushuang’s mental power left the Demon Pot and continued to absorb the fragmented consciousness.","After absorbing to the full, the other party reappeared as expected.","This time, Jian Wushuang asked more questions.","The other party was quite talkative and would answer as long as asked.","Of course, certain very secretive matters would not be disclosed.","From the other party’s words, Jian Wushuang learned that only one Realm Beast was invading here.","It was the Realm Beast before him.","So, the other party was immortal.","“Morosa!”","“Aren’t you afraid of being slain by the Star Spirits, attacking the Great Realm King alone?”","Jian Wushuang was curious about the audacity of the other party.","Being able to attack the consciousness of the Great Realm King indicated that the other party was not weak and was a high-ranking entity in the Land of Chaos.","Yet still not a match for the Star Spirits, otherwise, it would be attacking the Starry Sky already.","“Star Spirits?”","The Realm Beast sneered, “This is the Consciousness Realm. The Great Realm King’s consciousness cannot bear the presence of the Star Spirits, so I am immortal.”","Only then did Jian Wushuang understand.","No wonder the other party was so fearless.","“Also, let me tell you, you better reincarnate quickly. There is another consciousness stronger than mine in the Land of Chaos, preparing to invade here. When that happens, the Consciousness Realm will become even weaker.”","“Accumulating those Fate Points is useless. Some things require talent. It’s the same in the Land of Chaos. There are powerful Realm Beasts and weak ones!”","At this point, Morosa’s tone shifted, and he continued, “I see your consciousness is quite good. How about reincarnating to the Land of Chaos? I can find you a very good body, and you’ll have a territory no less than the Starry Sky, far more carefree than being a cultivator in the Starry Sky!”","“No wonder!” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly, “No wonder you’re telling me all this. You must have deceived all the Universe Gods who came here, just to draw them into the Land of Chaos?”","“You finally got it. That’s exactly my plan. With one less Universe God on your side, it’s like gaining two units of combat power for us!”","“Wishful thinking!” Jian Wushuang’s mental power shot out a powerful beam of light, instantly killing the other party’s consciousness.","His mental power left the Demon Pot again and continued to absorb consciousness.","This cycle continued, and three years passed in the blink of an eye.","He then got up and left.","Returning to Chaos City, he returned his Demon Pot.","Then he went to the arena.","This time, he felt at ease.","Upon arriving at the arena, he found that his opponent had not yet arrived.","The girl with the python pattern observed the time.","Once the time was up, if the opponent had not arrived, Jian Wushuang would be declared the winner.","However, the opponent would surely perish.","In the northwest border area.","Jian Wushuang had just left the place.","A figure appeared there.","He was not there to clear the invading fragmented consciousness.","He was there to negotiate with the Realm Beast.","Moruosa!","“I agree to reincarnate into the Land of Chaos!”","This person was the one who had a life-and-death battle with Jian Wushuang.","He knew he was not a match for Jian Wushuang.","He was now preparing to defect to the Land of Chaos.","But things were not that simple.","Because when they arrived, their consciousness was already marked by the Great Realm King.","Once they compromised with the Realm Beast.","Their consciousness would instantly dissipate.","Although Moruosa was on par with the Great Realm King.","This was still the Great Realm King’s territory.","He was powerless.","“It’s still a win, a gain!”","At least there would be one less Universe God.","In the arena.","“Jian Wushuang wins!”","The girl with the python pattern directly awarded Jian Wushuang the Giant Axe Medal.","“Your next life-and-death battle will be in thirty years!”","This time, the delay was even longer.","Because the opponents needed to be matched one by one.","After seven consecutive victories, each wait required tens of thousands of eons.","Sometimes even longer.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","He wouldn’t wait.","After three consecutive wins, he would challenge those Seven Star Universe Gods.","By then, he wouldn’t wait anymore.","After leaving the arena, he went straight to the Temple of Suppressing Evil.","But this time, the magic pot he took was not of the Six Star Universe God level.","It was a Nine Star one.","Because there was no one managing it, he only needed to choose.","“Jian Wushuang just participated in a life-and-death battle and now he’s taking on a mission. It seems like he’s just curious to try it out!”","“One coward didn’t show up and got eliminated directly. I’m afraid Jian Wushuang is even more reckless and doesn’t care about the upcoming life-and-death battles!”","Isn’t that right!","Many people were chattering.","Jian Wushuang left the place.","Heading towards the northwest border area.","This time, relying on the Nine Star Magic Pot, he entered the depths of the border area.","There, the consciousness was already gone.","It was an actual area of black rock.","Surviving there was very difficult.","Consciousness would wear away quickly.","Jian Wushuang didn’t waste any time and directly instructed the shepherd to absorb the fragmented consciousness.","This time, it took a full month to fill up.","With a thought, he entered the jade pot.","Wow!","He almost appeared simultaneously with the Realm Beast.","“Nine Star Magic Pot?” Moruosa’s face was surprised.","“Kid, do you really want to die?”","“We’ll see about that!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm.","The Nine Star Magic Pot absorbed the consciousness of the Realm Beast, equivalent to the combat power of a Nine Star Universe God. However, because the pot was refined by the Great Realm King, it suppressed the consciousness of the Realm Beast.","Now, Moruosa only had the power of an Eight Star.","But in Moruosa’s eyes, even with Eight Star power, Jian Wushuang was no match for him.","He could kill Jian Wushuang with a breath.","“Tsk tsk, I see you really want to die!” Moruosa sneered, “I actually wanted to give you a chance, but it’s a pity!”","Reincarnating into the Land of Chaos?","It was always a huge scam.","Because no one had ever succeeded.","Even if they did, they couldn’t transmit it back!","Actually, many people knew this.","But faced with death, or after being disheartened and collapsed.","They entertained the idea of reincarnating into the Land of Chaos.","At first, the Great Realm King tried to advise against it, but it was useless.","Some people just couldn’t be awakened.","There was no way out.","Reincarnating into the Land of Chaos was just a pretext used by the Realm Beast.","Once someone gave up resistance, they would be devoured by the Realm Beast.","Enhancing its own consciousness power.","That’s why Moruosa didn’t give Jian Wushuang the chance to reincarnate this time.","Because he had the power to kill Jian Wushuang and then devour his consciousness.","There was no need to deceive him.","“What, not persuading me to reincarnate this time?”","Jian Wushuang sneered, and drew the Wanjie Sword!"]},{"number":6210,"title":"Chapter 6210: Order in Chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 6210: Order in Chaos","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Clang!","The sword’s brilliance dazzled the eyes!","The terrifying chaotic force also surrounded the sword’s blade.","Seeing this, Morosa’s eyes revealed a look of fear.","That fear seemed innate, stemming from deep within his consciousness.","“Haha, no more words?” Jian Wushuang sneered.","He was in such a hurry to return for another reason.","To know why his opponent had not appeared.","It was because the opponent had been devoured.","“Don’t be so smug. Even if you have Seven-Star combat power, you still can’t be my match now!” Morosa stubbornly retorted.","At the same time, he recognized Jian Wushuang’s terrifying potential.","He couldn’t be allowed to live.","Perhaps in the future, he would become the next Realm King, or even the Great Realm King.","The Land of Chaos could not tolerate such a prodigy appearing in the Starry Sky.","He must be eliminated.","Immediately, a terrifying black mist spread.","The divine power had also reached the peak of the Eight-Star Universe God.","“Perish!” Morosa punched out, accompanied by a massive buzzing sound. The black mist condensed into an ugly-faced monster, shooting towards Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang remained unmoved, gripping the Sword of Tribulations in his hand, his consciousness surging.","Although he was not a Universe God, his consciousness power was far stronger than that of a Universe God.","“This sword is for the sake of chaos!”","“It can rival eternity!”","“Even chaos has order!”","With a shout, the sword’s shadow instantly cleaved out.","It shattered the black mist monster directly.","His figure flashed, charging towards the beast proactively.","“You... how is this possible?” Morosa was incredulous.","He sensed that Jian Wushuang’s divine power wasn’t that strong.","Yet he could unleash such terrifying consciousness power.","Directly suppressing him.","Especially with this sword.","“Even chaos has order?”","Morosa panicked, gathering black mist with both hands to form a giant shield, attempting to block it.","“You can’t stop it!”","The sword’s brilliance erupted again, countless beams shooting skyward.","A single sword’s cold light exploded.","The giant shield shattered instantly.","Morosa’s consciousness also vanished immediately.","Morosa, absorbed into the Demon Pot, was already dead.","The main consciousness outside felt the pressure.","The consciousness containing the power of the Nine-Star Universe God was gone just like that.","He would need millions of years to recover.","Or absorb a Nine-Star Universe God to fully restore.","“Damn it, Jian Wushuang, a mere Six-Star Universe God, actually managed to kill my Nine-Star consciousness!”","Morosa was both resentful and fearful.","Such a power specifically targeting the chaotic force made him uneasy.","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts emerged from the Demon Pot.","With a shift in his expression, he looked at the black rocks and coldly said, “Morosa, let’s continue!”","He used the Demon Pot to continue absorbing Morosa’s consciousness power.","A month later.","The Demon Pot was full again.","He entered once more, slashing Morosa with a single sword.","Even though Morosa had the combat power of an eight-star, he posed no threat to him.","A single sword strike.","Killing Morosa’s consciousness, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness also grew stronger.","Devouring?","This was his old skill.","However, he still left a trace of power for the Realm King God Realm.","Returning to the Realm King God Realm.","His contribution points skyrocketed to the top million within a year.","This shocked all the Universe Gods in the Realm King God Realm.","From a ranking of over ten million, he shot up to the top million in just one year.","And the speed was astonishingly fast.","There was almost no pause.","He relentlessly eradicated Morosa’s consciousness, ignoring any weakening of his own.","Three years passed quickly.","Jian Wushuang had slain Morosa nearly forty times.","If not for the lengthy absorption time of the Demon Pot, he could have devoured even more.","During this period, his divine power didn’t increase much, but his consciousness grew rapidly.","“If I were to absorb all of Morosa’s consciousness, what would happen?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up; the thought was unimaginable.","But it was just a casual guess.","It was impossible to truly devour all of Morosa’s consciousness. The weakening over the past few years was merely a drop in the ocean.","To completely resolve Morosa, it would likely take billions of epochs.","And once severely injured, Morosa would escape.","It was impossible to wear him down to death.","“Morosa’s true form should be a super powerhouse on par with the Great Realm King. Relying on consumption to kill him is probably unrealistic, but being able to drive him away is good enough!” Jian Wushuang secretly nodded.","As long as he could drive away this threat, it would be a significant achievement.","In the blink of an eye, the deathmatch arranged by the arena began.","The third opponent had quasi-seven-star strength.","But compared to him, it was still far inferior.","Fortunately, the opponent’s consciousness was depressed, so killing him didn’t cause any psychological burden.","To honor the opponent’s brilliant fight.","He suppressed his strength throughout, only winning at the last moment with a slight edge.","Before falling, the opponent smiled at him.","It was a form of release.","In fact, with his current willpower, he could burst out with quasi-eight-star strength.","To deal with the consciousness of the Realm Beast, he could unleash nine-star strength.","And he would continue to grow stronger.","After obtaining the third Giant Axe Medal, the fourth battle was scheduled for twenty years later.","He wasn’t as concerned as before and shared his thoughts briefly with the Realm King before heading to the frontier.","Upon hearing his thoughts, the Realm King stood in place, unable to calm down for a long time.","“Absorb Morosa?”","“Jian Wushuang, you are truly a freak!”","Although unable to accompany Jian Wushuang to the frontier, he could go to the Town of Evil Hall and constantly monitor Jian Wushuang’s ranking.","Every month, he would leap a rank, sometimes even hundreds of ranks.","Slaying a nine-star Realm Beast consciousness once a month.","It amounted to about half a merit point.","Six merit points a year.","Sixty in ten years.","Six hundred thousand in a hundred thousand years.","If Jian Wushuang didn’t stop.","He could probably take the first place within two hundred thousand years.","The people in the Town of Evil Hall watched anxiously.","“Won’t this guy’s consciousness weaken?”","“To keep fighting non-stop, he must have a treasure that enhances consciousness!”","Everyone showed expressions of disbelief.","Ten years passed, and Jian Wushuang didn’t stop.","Now, another ten years had passed.","Jian Wushuang had already broken into the top hundred thousand.","Frontier!","Amidst the chaotic swallowing.","Jian Wushuang seemed to be the end of it all.","Making the terrifying Morosa hate him to the bone.","Now, the terrifying one was no longer Morosa.","But Jian Wushuang.","Morosa had started to fear.","In just twenty years, the consciousness he lost would take an epoch to recover.","This was more than the consumption of hundreds of epochs before.","Hundreds of epochs consumed this bit of consciousness, not to mention he could restore himself by swallowing the consciousness of the Realm King God Realm.","Even just pure recovery would offset it.","But since Jian Wushuang appeared, not only did his swallowing of the Realm King God Realm slow down, he now didn’t even have time to recover himself.","“Jian Wushuang, let’s talk peace!”"]},{"number":6211,"title":"Chapter 6211: Vow","paragraphs":["Chapter 6211: Vow","“Whatever you want, I can give it to you!”","Morosa once again tried to tempt Jian Wushuang.","Because he had already run out of options. Over the years, he had used threats and insults, but none of it worked.","However, Jian Wushuang was impervious to both soft and hard tactics.","“Morosa, you are a king in the Land of Chaos, yet you don’t find yourself childish?”","Inside the Demon Pot.","Jian Wushuang had just drawn his sword when Morosa began to beg for mercy.","It made him feel quite amused.","If he were the one begging, would the other party spare him?","If Morosa had the power to kill now, he probably wouldn’t hesitate to strike!","“Jian Wushuang, listen to me. I’m not deceiving you. The Land of Chaos has many secrets, more than your Starry Sky. Don’t you want to know them?”","“I know why you want to kill my consciousness. Isn’t it for reincarnation?”","“I can give you a large amount of consciousness voluntarily, making you the first in the Qishen Temple. You can reincarnate anytime and also learn the secrets of the Land of Chaos. Among your Starry Sky cultivators, fewer than ten people know these secrets, including that Great Realm King!”","To get rid of Jian Wushuang, Morosa was willing to go to great lengths.","He did indeed have some secrets of the Land of Chaos that he could reveal.","Telling Jian Wushuang wouldn’t matter much.","Because it held no value.","Could Jian Wushuang possibly fight his way to the Land of Chaos?","If he did, it would be best; Morosa could kill Jian Wushuang with a single slap of his true form. “Interesting!”","Jian Wushuang held the Tribulation Sword and arrogantly said, “Let’s hear it. I’ve found it boring to keep killing you all these years!”","“Ha ha, now that’s the spirit!” Morosa said excitedly, “Staying in the Consciousness Realm does you no good. You won’t regret cooperating with me!”","“Enough nonsense, get on with it!”","Jian Wushuang shouted angrily, not wanting to waste any more words.","“Don’t rush. You need to make some guarantees before I cooperate with you!” Morosa wasn’t a fool.","He feared Jian Wushuang might go back on his word.","“What kind of guarantees do you want?”","“At least make a deadly oath!”","Jian Wushuang immediately reached out and swore to the rules of the Consciousness Realm.","There were even a few clauses added by Morosa.","They were as deadly as possible.","No room for negotiation.","Although breaking these oaths wouldn’t really affect Jian Wushuang.","The oaths were extremely vicious, just thinking about them could change a person’s mindset.","They still had some binding power.","“This time, is it enough?” Jian Wushuang’s face was cold, pretending to be unhappy.","In truth, it was all an act to deceive the other party.","Hearing this, Morosa finally smiled and said calmly, “Now it’s fine. Next, listen carefully. Maybe after hearing the secrets of the Land of Chaos, you’ll want to join willingly!”","“Oh, now I’m quite eager!”","His interest was genuinely piqued.","The secrets of the Land of Chaos.","He had heard quite a bit about them.","From the Realm King, Great Realm King, to Morosa now.","All the mysteries seemed to be in the Land of Chaos.","The entire world was wrapped.","The outside world was chaotic.","The Starry Sky turned from chaos into an ordered space.","It gave birth to Supreme Law Rules.","This entire process was the greatest secret.","Jian Wushuang wanted to know this the most, hoping the other party could reveal something","useful.","Seeing this, Morosa felt the atmosphere had reached its peak.","So he began to speak.","Starting with everything in the Land of Chaos.","“The Land of Chaos!”","“Heh heh!”","Morosa first let out a cold laugh, seemingly both disdainful and proud of his origins.","Jian Wushuang listened intently, initially thinking the other party was fooling him.","But as he listened further, the logic became clear, aligning with what the Realm King had told","him.","There were just some things the Realm King hadn’t told him, perhaps because the Realm King himself didn’t know.","The origin of the Land of Chaos was actually a world with Supreme Law Rules.","The world described was the current Land of Chaos.","It had boundaries and a flourishing civilization.","Vast and immense, as seen in the present-day Land of Chaos.","Even the most prosperous civilizations can face destruction.","For unknown reasons, the orderly world began to collapse.","Until it completely fell.","With the destruction of the orderly world, life naturally perished as well.","However, from Morosa’s words, Jian Wushuang learned that the original world did not","contain life.","It was a world of coexisting consciousness.","The concept of life did not exist.","The stronger the consciousness, the more powerful it was.","Just like the current Realm King Divine Realm.","When Jian Wushuang heard this secret, his pupils contracted.","Although there was no evidence to prove that the other party was telling the truth, he","believed it.","Because he had had similar suspicions.","Where did the world originate from, after all?","There must be a source.","Or an endpoint.","When Morosa spoke of this, his tone grew somber.","“To be honest, I was also a consciousness from the Origin Source. Since the destruction of the","Origin Source world, transforming into the Land of Chaos, my consciousness has taken on this form, drifting aimlessly, becoming a walking corpse with no path to follow.”","“Time is blurry; no one can sense time, because everything is chaotic. Until later, a powerful consciousness emerged and created the Starry Sky!”","“The creator of the Starry Sky?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","This was what he was most concerned about.","The destruction of the Origin Source world sounded shocking, but it was not as important as","the creation of the Starry Sky.","This was directly related to his future path.","How far he could go in the future depended on how the creator of the Starry Sky created it.","Morosa looked at him, nodded, and sighed, “I once followed the creator of your Starry Sky.","Back then, everyone revered him as a god, a savior!”","Speaking of this, Morosa’s eyes turned blood red.","“But he deceived us!!!”","This sentence was almost a roar.","“And the Star Spirits, those damned Star Spirits!!!”","“Even if they died ten thousand times, it wouldn’t be enough!”","“Jian Wushuang, do you think the realm beasts are all evil?” Morosa suddenly looked at Jian Wushuang and began to question, “Don’t you think we all deserve to die, unworthy of living, and should not invade the Starry Sky!!”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded without any hesitation.","“Haha!!!”","Morosa laughed madly, “I knew you would say that, I knew it...”","“But it’s a pity for those old brothers back then, who believed the creator of the Starry Sky,","who said he would bring us a new home, but in the end, used their consciousness as fuel to","forge the Starry Sky.”","“Countless old brothers who drifted from the Origin Source world were all killed by the creator of the Starry Sky, using their consciousness to open up the Starry Sky, creating the supreme reincarnation, giving you your current consciousness and those damned flesh bodies, which he had promised to us.”"]},{"number":6212,"title":"Chapter 6212: How Did He Forget?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6212: How Did He Forget?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“How could he forget, forget the promises he made to us back then!”","As Morosa spoke, tears appeared in his eyes.","Although it was unclear if they were genuine or not, the founder of the Starry Sky in this story was indeed deserving of death!","He had deceived people into working for him, only to discard them once they were no longer useful.","But these things had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang.","“What you are saying has nothing to do with me, and I don’t want to know!” he said coldly.","He could sympathize, but their positions were different, and there was no need to say comforting words.","It was now a matter of life or death.","He couldn’t possibly join Morosa in rebelling against the Starry Sky, could he?","Without the founder of the Starry Sky, there would be no practitioners like them.","He couldn’t possibly switch sides just because of the other party’s grievances!","“You ingrate!”","“We only wanted a home of our own, what did we do wrong?”","“You did nothing wrong, and what did we do wrong?” Jian Wushuang retorted angrily. “You seek revenge against the founder of the Starry Sky, I won’t stop you, nor do I have the power to stop you. But you can’t attack practitioners, that won’t do!”","“I said too much!” Morosa also felt he had said too much.","He quickly waved his hand and said, “Let’s not talk about this, let me tell you about those imitators!”","“Imitators?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. “Could there be other starry skies in the Land of Chaos?”","Morosa sneered, “Hmph, creating a Starry Sky is not that simple. The worlds they create are fundamentally unstable. Ever since the founder of the Starry Sky appeared, we have instinctively resisted. The Land of Chaos is only so large. The emergence of one Starry Sky has already put pressure on our survival. If a second one appears, there will be a third, a fourth, and by then, we might really become demons, affecting the development of life and being naturally eliminated!”","What the other party said was quite true.","Chaos and order had no distinction of right or wrong.","Only positions.","From the other party’s standpoint, what they did was not wrong.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He somewhat understood the other party’s position.","Because all of this was too distant from him.","To create a second Starry Sky, he had that ambition, but it was a long way to go.","“All destroyed by you?” Jian Wushuang showed a look of surprise.","Morosa was quite proud.","“That’s right, all devoured by us. Those old guys who wanted to imitate deserved to die!”","“The Land of Chaos ultimately belongs to the consciousness of us originating from this world. We originally lived there, and no one can drive us away!”","Jian Wushuang also thought of the past goddess who had failed to replicate the Starry Sky.","Or rather, she had been interfered with by Weiss, ultimately falling.","Since they were to oppose the Land of Chaos, why didn’t they help the goddess back then?","It was for this reason that he had hidden his Origin Source of the Starry Sky, always being cautious.","But now with the threat of Chaos, he felt some things didn’t add up.","“Morosa, does the Land of Chaos have boundaries?”","“I don’t know!”","Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow and sneered, “You can’t even answer this question?”","“Hehe, you underestimate me. The matters within the Land of Chaos, I can actually tell you all about them. Even if I tell you, it’s of no use to you!”","“The Land of Chaos, chaos is chaos, how can it have boundaries? Even if you find a boundary and break through the space, you will still reach another Land of Chaos!” Morosa said proudly.","The power of the Land of Chaos was far beyond comparison with the Starry Sky.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang had a terrifying thought in his heart.","“I understand now!” He nodded.","Inwardly, he was extremely shocked. “The ambitions of the founder of the Starry Sky might be the same as these world beasts!”","The Great Realm King Realm could be expanded using the consciousness of the Great Realm King.","Similarly, the starry sky could be expanded based on the starry sky’s creator.","Back then, the consciousness of so many Realm Beasts was extinguished to create a real world.","It was probably to open up a space similar to the Origin Source World.","The extinguished consciousness of the Realm Beasts transformed into particles, eventually mastering life.","This was likely one of the secrets within the starry sky.","It was far from being as cold-blooded as Morosa had claimed.","Those extinguished Realm Beast consciousnesses might still be grateful to the creator of the starry sky.","Everything the other party did was truly beneficial for this world.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang felt resolute in his heart!","His aura suddenly erupted.","With a single grip of his hand, he gathered a cyclone.","“Morosa, I’ve decided, you must get out of the Realm King God Realm!”","With that, he immediately struck.","Morosa was furious but helpless.","“Life, life!”","“All you damned life forms, you all deserve to die!”","“Faithless, damned!”","Morosa voluntarily incinerated his own consciousness, not giving Jian Wushuang a chance to strike.","“Hmph!”","Jian Wushuang coldly sneered in his heart, “Escaped pretty fast!”","Just as well, he learned a lot this time.","He would go back and discuss with the Realm King in depth.","Perhaps the Realm King might know something about these matters.","Returning to the city, he first attended the life-and-death battle.","He won very easily.","For him, achieving ten consecutive victories was only a matter of time.","After finding the Realm King, he spoke about the situation with Morosa.","The Realm King was also startled upon hearing it.","It wasn’t about the secrets Morosa mentioned.","Rather, it was about what Jian Wushuang planned to do next.","“You want to completely annihilate Morosa’s consciousness?”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded firmly.","“Wait a moment, let me catch my breath first. To annihilate Morosa’s consciousness... do you know his exact strength?” The Realm King took a while before asking.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows and said, “I don’t know, but as long as I have enough time, I can do it!”","“He recovers quickly, it’s possible to eradicate him, but can your consciousness handle it?”","That was what worried the Realm King. One Morosa wasn’t enough to cost Jian Wushuang his life.","Cultivators in the starry sky were much more precious than Realm Beasts.","“Watch closely!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, and the divine power formed from his consciousness instantly surged.","Buzz!","In an instant, he reached the level of a Nine-Star Universe God, with even more room for growth.","He was already close to a Spacetime God.","“I have the strength, and I can absorb Morosa’s consciousness. Not only won’t I get hurt, but I can also grow stronger. Although it’s only my consciousness growing stronger, it can help expand my Origin Source Starry Sky. I just can’t fill it with power. This is the Consciousness Realm, there’s no starry sky power for me to absorb!”","Speaking of this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sigh.","The Realm King’s eyes widened, first surprised at the strength of Jian Wushuang’s consciousness, then his eyes moved, and he said in astonishment, “The Realm Beasts in the Land of Chaos, to be precise, are transformed from consciousness. Haven’t you heard that? Since their consciousness can have divine power, why can’t you?”","“Me?”","Jian Wushuang pointed at himself, then his heart trembled.","“That’s right!”","Only then did he realize."]},{"number":6213,"title":"Chapter 6213: Small Target","paragraphs":["Chapter 6213: Small Target","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","His consciousness was powerful enough that within his own Origin Source Starry Sky, he could have whatever he wanted.","Of course, he wasn’t yet powerful to that extent.","But extracting power from chaos was something he could do.","In this way, both his consciousness and Origin Source power could be enhanced.","“Realm King, you are truly my lucky star!” With that, he couldn’t resist trying it out in the Origin Source Starry Sky.","Sure enough, he could extract some power.","This power was chaotic power.","Chaotic transformations.","Encompassing everything!","Any power could be obtained as long as there was enough chaotic power.","He indeed had this power; having absorbed Morosa, he could practically reach the heavens!","“Realm King, please ask the Great Realm King if there is a larger Demon Pot. The current one no longer satisfies me!”","Jian Wushuang felt the surge of power.","He could no longer suppress the growing conviction.","At this moment, he once again returned to his initial state of forging ahead fearlessly.","“You overestimate me. This is the original Great Realm King, the one who created the Realm King Continent and the Realm King Divine Realm. It’s not like I can meet him whenever I want.”","“Hey, let me finish!”","“You just do your best; leave the rest to me!” Jian Wushuang’s figure had already risen into the air. He gestured to the Realm King and then soared into the sky.","The Northern Realm King, left behind, rubbed his hands together, somewhat helpless.","“Alas, Great Prophet, you’ve really put me in a tough spot. If this guy goes crazy, I can’t handle him! Forget it, I’ll go meet the Great Realm King myself!”","The Realm King also left his residence, heading towards the center of the city!","Jian Wushuang, meanwhile, had returned to the frontier once again.","This time, he went even deeper.","It was all to quickly fill the Demon Pot.","This would make things more efficient.","At this time, his merit points were still far from reaching first place.","“Let’s set a small goal first—no stopping until I reach a billion merit points!”","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the virtual space of the frontier, with the Demon Pot beside him absorbing Morosa’s consciousness.","He was refining chaotic power within the Origin Source Starry Sky.","Eventually, it all transformed into starry sky power.","Enhancing both his Origin Source and divine body.","Moreover, he was multitasking once again.","He simultaneously began studying the Beast God Weapon.","And the Ultimate Ancient Transformation.","The Ultimate Ancient Transformation still needed improvement.","He was even looking ahead to the levels beyond the Ultimate Ancient Transformation.","Time passed amidst Morosa’s constant cursing.","Jian Wushuang returned several times in between.","He did not see the Realm King.","After attending the life-and-death battle above, he hurried back.","Over the years, the Universe Gods in the city had been discussing him.","On one hand, sweeping through all in life-and-death battles.","On the other, gaining points in the Suppressing Evil Hall.","Ten thousand years passed.","Now, Jian Wushuang was ranked seventy-sixth in the Suppressing Evil Hall.","“I wonder if the Realm King has gotten me a stronger Demon Pot!”","He was still thinking about a stronger Demon Pot.","The interval had decreased from once a month to once every ten days, yet he was still not satisfied.","At his current position, it was practically on Morosa’s face.","Going further, he feared he would fall into the Land of Chaos.","At that time, Morosa would quickly take control of him.","Over the years, his Origin Source had improved rapidly.","His basic divine power was rather average, although his divine body could endure it, he didn’t think much of the slight increase in divine power.","He preferred to improve the Ultimate Ancient Transformation. If he could enhance it by just one more level, it would mean billions of divine power.","If those Universe Gods knew he could not only cultivate in the Realm King Divine Realm but was also dissatisfied, they would probably jump up and curse him.","“When will the first perfect river of spacetime truly condense successfully?”","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back, surveying his Origin Source Starry Sky.","At this moment, his Origin Source Starry Sky had expanded due to the strength of his consciousness.","Various empty spaces had appeared in all directions.","In the darkness, a long river was gradually being perfected.","The entire starry sky was dotted with countless stars.","Its vastness was beyond imagination.","Now, if his starry sky were compared to the outside world, it was already the size of the Northern Spacetime.","And his starry sky origin had illuminated to the size of the ancient Moon Spacetime.","Although compared to the Northern Spacetime it was just a river of spacetime connected to the universe,","the power it contained was unimaginable.","After all, the ancient Moon Spacetime once carried an unknown number of lives.","That required an even greater consciousness.","Of course, all of this was being borne by the Realm King.","Even without a Universe God, the Realm King could bear it.","If he couldn’t bear it, he would arrange for people to enter the Realm King Continent.","The principle was similar to that of the Realm King God Realm.","But it differed by a spatial level.","The path Jian Wushuang was walking now was inspired by the secrets Morosa had revealed.","First, create a world that could retain consciousness.","Then, create life.","Because without consciousness, life would be foolish.","This was also why he wasn’t in a hurry to create life.","As for that cat brought by Weiss back then, it was definitely tampered with by Weiss.","Otherwise, that cat couldn’t have been so smart.","Just by looking into its eyes, one could tell it was highly intelligent.","“The spacetime still isn’t right, like a hastily built house, it’s not stable enough and lacks the realm of spacetime!”","He patrolled around, noticing that what was lacking wasn’t just Origin Source power.","It also needed a supplement in terms of realm.","After all, he was still a Universe Master.","His vision was high enough, and his structure was decent.","But these were empty; he had to create a substantial river of spacetime.","This was not as simple as creating an Origin Source.","An Origin Source could be used as soon as it was condensed.","A river of spacetime that bore consciousness required step-by-step exploration.","Every step couldn’t be wrong.","Time flew by.","Jian Wushuang used the demon pot to absorb Morosa’s consciousness, then killed him, waiting to refine the absorbed consciousness, expand the Origin Source, and increase his divine power.","In the blink of an eye, his eighth battle arrived.","After seven consecutive victories, he had waited in line for millions of years.","He had also reached second place on the Suppressing Evil list.","Nine hundred thousand merit points.","He was still far from his goal of one hundred million.","It would take nearly a hundred more eras.","On the day of the life-and-death battle, Jian Wushuang hurried back to the city.","At this time, the arena was already full.","Everyone was waiting for this battle.","Originally, Jian Wushuang had planned to challenge the seven-star Universe God, but because his fighting spirit was reignited, he focused on cultivation and did not choose the seven-star Universe as his opponent.","It could be said that he didn’t take the life-and-death battle to heart.","But this time, after seeing his opponent and their information,","he made a change.","“Wu Fei!”","Coming from the starry sky, she was a disciple of a Star Spirit messenger under Weiss and had even been guided by Weiss.","Her divine power was that of a six-star Universe God, with the combat power of a seven-star Universe God.","She was the strongest opponent he had encountered in a life-and-death battle.","Even stronger than those with eight consecutive victories, she had every chance of achieving ten consecutive victories.","The key was her identity, being one of Weiss’ people.","Although Weiss was a Star Spirit and appeared carefree,","he actually had some influence.","Speaking of which, Jian Wushuang was also part of Weiss’s faction.","If he could show leniency, it would be best.","It would make future encounters easier.","“Jian Wushuang, I know I’m not your match, but I admit it!”"]},{"number":6214,"title":"Chapter 6214: Unlucky Universe God","paragraphs":["Chapter 6214: Unlucky Universe God","Wu Fei wore a fiery red leather dress that swayed with her aura.","Her downfall was quite pitiful. While roaming the Starry Sky, she encountered a terrifying poisonous insect. Instead of returning after being poisoned, she continued to explore,","seeking more treasures.","Unexpectedly, the poison came from the void, and its toxicity exploded.","She had almost no time to call for help and perished instantly.","Fortunately, she also came from the Academy of the Gods and was a disciple of the Star Spirit Envoy.","Naturally, she was arranged to be in the Realm King Divine Realm, with the hope of reincarnation.","Despite this, she remained stubborn.","Unwilling to waste her consciousness accumulating Fate Points, she decided to try the arena instead.","The first seven battles went smoothly.","Unfortunately, she encountered Jian Wushuang.","“Don’t rush to admit defeat. Who said my opponent was you?” Jian Wushuang said with a calm smile, motioning with his hand, “I’ve decided to change my opponent!”","His words shocked the entire audience!","“What, changing opponents at this time? That’s against the rules!”","“He must be crazy!”","“Could it be that he has fallen for this Universe God from the Academy of the Gods?”","“It’s quite possible. Six-star female Valkyries are rare. Such beauty is probably renowned even in the Academy of the Gods. It’s a pity she fell. In the Realm King Divine Realm, especially in the arena, no one would pity her, except for Jian Wushuang now!”","Many people stared at Jian Wushuang in surprise, wondering what he was up to.","At this moment, a skinny old man in the seats spoke up.","“Don’t forget, there’s a rule in the arena. Changing opponents on the spot not only requires challenging a seven-star Universe God but also challenging a Universe God with one more consecutive win than oneself!”","Everyone turned to look.","The old man wore a black robe and had a calm face.","He was a nine-star Universe God, and a very ancient one at that.","He also participated in life-and-death battles and had already achieved six victories.","He had waited for an opponent for billions of years, never reaching the seventh battle. “Old Man of Sorrow, it’s rare to see you watching a junior’s life-and-death battle!” “Tsk tsk, this might be my last time watching a life-and-death battle!” The Old Man of Sorrow shook his head with a bitter smile.","He couldn’t wait any longer. His consciousness was on the verge of fading. He was preparing for reincarnation.","After waiting billions of years, he could choose to withdraw.","Upon withdrawal, consecutive wins could be converted into merit points for reincarnation.","Hearing this, everyone was surprised by the Old Man of Sorrow’s decision.","But soon, their attention shifted back to the center of the arena.","A girl in a python robe appeared.","“Jian Wushuang, are you sure? Next, a randomly selected seven-star Universe God with eight consecutive wins will be your opponent!”","“I’m sure. Let’s begin!” Jian Wushuang nodded calmly.","Wu Fei stared at Jian Wushuang in extreme surprise.","“Why do you want to avoid the battle?”","She was utterly confused.","He could easily defeat her.","Moreover, among six-star Universe Gods, there were those with nine consecutive wins.","It was the fastest way to achieve ten consecutive wins. Yet, at this point, he chose to switch opponents.","Jian Wushuang replied lightly, “I want to get the Giant Axe Medal for ten consecutive wins today. It has little to do with you!”","“Giant Axe Medal?”","“When did you say you’d get ten consecutive wins?” Wu Fei couldn’t believe her ears.","“Today!”","Jian Wushuang answered confidently, causing a stir in the entire audience.","Achieving ten consecutive wins in one day was simply impossible.","After winning the seventh match, Jian Wushuang would need to choose a seven-star Universe","God with nine consecutive wins for the quickest life-and-death battle.","After eight consecutive wins, he would need to choose an eight-star Universe God, regardless of their winning streak.","The final battle would be against a nine-star Universe God, also regardless of their winning streak. All opponents were random!","If Jian Wushuang challenged a seven-star Universe God without considering their winning streak, people believed he had the strength.","But facing an eight-star Universe God, even without considering their winning streak, there was no hope.","Not to mention an eight-star Universe God, even challenging a seven-star Universe God with eight consecutive wins seemed impossible.","The girl in the python robe manipulated the space, and a row of names appeared, jumping","around.","Finally, it settled on a foreigner.","“Haha, it’s me. Looks like I got lucky this time!”","A terrifying giant with a crocodile head jumped down from the audience, landing heavily on","the arena floor.","He slowly raised his head to look at Jian Wushuang.","“Human, your luck is terrible, encountering me. I heard you’re ranked second in the Zhenxie Hall, about to surpass the first. I really didn’t want you to meet me. I was looking forward to seeing you surpass the first!”","His words drew curses from the audience.","He got a cheap advantage and still acted pretentiously.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind, slowly extending his hand and saying calmly, “You indeed won’t","see it. It’s really a pity!”","“Universe God Jian Wushuang, seventh battle, begin now!” Wu Fei was immediately transported to the viewing platform, while Jian Wushuang and the powerful foreigner in front","of him began to fight.","“Death Space!” The foreigner with a crocodile head roared.","The surrounding space shifted. The intent of death filled the entire arena. Jian Wushuang","remained unmoved.","When the space completely descended, he suddenly drew his sword.","Clang! A blue cold light flashed. A sharp beam illuminated the entire world, then exploded.","Sword light filled the death world.","Countless tiny cracks appeared.","The space was instantly dominated by Jian Wushuang.","“I understand death better than you!” Jian Wushuang sheathed his sword after just one strike.","Crack!","The death space shattered.","Death space versus death strike.","This was the result.","His true understanding of death was absorbed from Mie Sheng, far beyond what any foreigner","could compare to.","“Y-you, you actually broke through my Death Space!” The foreign expert was somewhat","incredulous.","His Death Space could trap the vast majority of seven-star Universe Gods and even had the","effect of killing them.","A six-star Universe God had no chance of surviving.","Let alone breaking it.","“Don’t get complacent. This is not my true strength. Draw your sword, and then we can...”","Before the word “fight” left his mouth, the alien expert’s consciousness and divine body","began to collapse.","Just like the Death Space.","Finally, it collapsed with a boom.","Dead beyond any possibility of revival.","This was the power of the Origin Source.","And he had only used the Death Sword from the Starry Sky Origin.","Now, the strength of his Origin had reached an unfathomable level.","Completely unmatched by ordinary Universe Gods.","One sword strike to kill a seven-time champion Seven-star Universe God, the entire arena was","shocked.","No one spoke, silence reigned!","“Is this a library?”","“It’s so quiet!”","The Northern Realm King grumbled as he walked into the gladiatorial arena. Seeing Jian","Wushuang standing arrogantly in the center of the arena, he was not at all surprised.","This was normal.","Although he hadn’t watched Jian Wushuang’s previous battles, he had heard plenty about","them.","All were instant kills.","The same for his seven consecutive victories.","“Just seven consecutive victories, no need to be so shocked!”"]},{"number":6215,"title":"Chapter 6215: Despair","paragraphs":["Chapter 6215: Despair","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Realm King of the North, look closely at Jian Wushuang’s opponent. That’s a seven-star Universe God with an eight-win streak!”","“What?”","The Realm King was so shocked that he jumped up.","“How is that possible? His opponent was supposed to be Wu Fei! How can it be a seven-star Universe God?”","Suddenly, the arena erupted in thunderous cheers.","And heated discussions followed.","Only then did the Northern Realm King learn that Jian Wushuang had changed opponents midway.","The original opponent, Wu Fei, stood on the viewing platform, her face overwhelmed with shock.","“I want to take the eighth battle!” Jian Wushuang shouted loudly.","At this moment, there was only one person whose face was ashen.","It was the Nine-Win seven-star Universe God.","He glared at Jian Wushuang with a dark expression.","This battle, he couldn’t avoid.","He had waited for a long time, wanting to face a seven-star Universe God with a nine-win streak.","In the end, he was met with a monster.","A monster who could cut down a seven-star Universe God with a single sword.","Although he was very proud, having nine consecutive wins,","He wasn’t so arrogant as to think he could defeat an eight-win seven-star Universe God with a single strike!","Fight?","Not fight!","Where to retreat?","He had nowhere to escape.","There was no need for selection.","He was directly teleported to the arena by the girl in the python robe.","“No!”","“I am unwilling. Nine consecutive wins over billions of years, how can it end like this!”","He did not blame Jian Wushuang.","Instead, he glared at the girl in the python robe.","“This is unfair. I choose not to fight. Even if I die, I want to defend my right!”","But as soon as he finished speaking, his consciousness completely collapsed.","“Jian Wushuang wins the eighth battle!”","This scene once again shocked the entire audience.","“This guy really would rather die than give in!”","“You don’t understand. Proud people are unwilling to lose to weaker opponents. They don’t want to be just a stepping stone!”","“By the way, I heard that when he first entered the arena, it was because his consciousness was depressed. Later, for some reason, he suddenly wanted to be reborn, and he fought his way to the end. Who would have thought it would end like this!”","This outcome made many people sigh.","What a pity for a genius about to be reborn.","However, they were now more concerned about Jian Wushuang’s next move.","Would he really take the ninth battle?","That would be an eight-star Universe God!","And it would be random.","If it happened to be those with high consecutive wins, it might be over.","“Jian Wushuang, don’t be impulsive!”","The Realm King began to persuade, “There are a few Six Star Universe Gods with nine consecutive wins. If you don’t want to wait too long, you can stop now and choose to fight across levels in a few days. There is still an Eight-Win seven-star Universe God, don’t rush!”","This statement angered the seven-star Universe Gods.","“Northern Realm King, I advise you to be kind. Brother Wushuang’s combat power can cut down a seven-star with one sword and scare a nine-win seven-star Universe God to death. Cutting down an eight-star Universe God is no difficulty. Stop interfering and affecting Brother Wushuang’s performance!”","“Yes, you should go cool off somewhere else. Stop messing around here!”","“Jian Wushuang, we support you. Keep fighting. Get ten wins today, and you’ll be the most powerful Universe God in the entire Starry Sky!”","What did they mean? The Realm King understood, and immediately started arguing with several seven-star Universe Gods.","The gap between a seven-star Universe God and an eight-star Universe God was very large.","Even if Jian Wushuang had cut down a seven-star Universe God with one sword, any eight-star Universe God could do the same.","It was a complete qualitative gap.","Unbridgeable.","“I don’t know if he’s the strongest Universe God, but I know he’s the strongest Universe Master!”","Jian Wushuang merely glanced at the Northern Realm King and then gestured with his hand.","“I want to take the ninth battle!”","Boom!","The entire arena shook once more.","“Well done, brothers of the Seven-Star Universe God, we’ve survived the greatest Tribulation of our fate!”","“I actually want to fight Jian Wushuang. I also use a sword; I wonder whose sword is stronger!” Some disheartened Universe Gods were disappointed.","However, this drew the ire of those Universe Gods who wanted to achieve rebirth through ten consecutive victories.","“Stop pretending to be an expert. With your limited strength, you wouldn’t even be able to draw your sword before Wushuang. Stop pretending to be a master!”","“Do you want to fight?”","“Fine, get your eighth consecutive win first, and see how I crush you!”","For a moment, the audience was in chaos.","The girl in the python robe now had an additional trace of admiration.","When she looked at Jian Wushuang, her tone was no longer stiff.","“Jian Wushuang, are you sure you want to start the ninth battle today? Your opponent will be an eight-star Universe God, and it will be a random eight-star Universe God. It might even be an eight-star Universe God with six consecutive wins!”","“Sure!” Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate at all.","Seeing his determination, the girl in the python robe stopped talking nonsense and began the selection immediately.","At this moment, the entire arena was silent, everyone waiting for the name to appear.","Many eight-star Universe Gods clenched their fists.","They wanted to see who would have such good luck.","Swish!","“Ye Liangchen, eight-star Universe God, six consecutive wins!”","In the audience.","A very arrogant young man stared at the name in disbelief.","“It’s me!”","The next moment, his face lit up with joy.","“Haha, my Fate Point is so high that even if I were to reincarnate, I would probably be reborn into the Giant God Clan!”","Ye Liangchen laughed madly.","Many eight-star Universe Gods cast envious glances.","They envied him for picking up a Giant Axe Medal for free!","He could achieve seven consecutive wins among the eight-star Universe Gods.","By then, he would only be three matches away from ten consecutive wins.","“Congratulations, Brother Ye!”","“Congratulations, Emperor Ye!”","“Congratulations, Brother Liangchen!”","Many had already begun congratulating him.","Ye Liangchen clasped his fists and responded politely, “Thank you, thank you, but don’t praise me too much. Perhaps Wushuang has a hidden trick, and I might just become a stepping stone!”","He said this, but who would believe it?","A six-star Universe God, beating an eight-star Universe God?","And Ye Liangchen had the strength of a quasi-nine-star.","Who could break that?","Those who had been praising Jian Wushuang now all congratulated Ye Liangchen.","It was clear.","Jian Wushuang had no chance of winning.","Boom!","Ye Liangchen took a step forward and broke through the air.","He landed in the arena and gestured, “Brother Wushuang, to be fair, I’ll slightly suppress my divine power. Let’s have a relatively fair fight!”","Hearing this, the Realm King cursed.","“You’re taking advantage and still pretending to be noble. Jian Wushuang, hold your ground and beat him to death!”","The Realm King couldn’t help but jump and curse.","Although worried for Jian Wushuang, he also wanted to see Jian Wushuang’s rationality.","To voluntarily accept a life-and-death battle against an eight-star Universe God.","He must have an ace up his sleeve.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t disappoint the Realm King.","“Do as you wish!”","He gripped his hands, and this time, instead of using the Origin Source, he used his divine power.","Ultimate Ancient Transformation!!!","With an angry roar, Jian Wushuang’s divine power began to climb continuously.","“Ah, ha!”","Boom!"]},{"number":6216,"title":"Chapter 6216: Fight! Fight! Fight!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6216: Fight! Fight! Fight!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The entire arena was shaking.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power erupted directly to the level of eight stars.","“What?”","Ye Liangchen was also startled.","Not to mention the Realm Kings in the audience.","“He’s supposed to be a six-star Universe God, so how is his divine power already at eight stars?”","“He’s probably been hiding his true power!”","Jian Wushuang turned a deaf ear, his figure flashing as he actively charged towards Ye Liangchen.","Although surprised that Jian Wushuang’s divine power could reach the level of eight stars, he remained calm inside.","After all, he possessed the strength of a quasi-nine star.","However, after taking Jian Wushuang’s next punch, he chose to go all out.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was around eight stars, but his combat strength could reach nine-stars.","One punch caused Ye Liangchen to retreat, injured.","“You, how are you still hiding your power?” His eyes widened in disbelief.","Jian Wushuang didn’t give him time to react.","He attacked again, appearing directly behind his opponent, and condensed a terrifying seven-colored light beam, which burst forth and directly pierced through Ye Liangchen’s divine body.","This time, it wasn’t just an injury; it was a severe wound.","“It’s over!”","The arena fell silent once again.","Even the Realm King was gaping.","He knew that Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source was even stronger, and now his divine power had reached the nine-star level. Didn’t that mean his Origin Source could slay a nine-star?","At this moment, he truly relaxed.","“Jian Wushuang, you can’t be this strong, you must be cheating!”","“A six-star Universe God shouldn’t be this powerful. Even if you have eight-star divine power, you shouldn’t be this strong!”","“That’s because your knowledge is limited!” Jian Wushuang slowly shook his head and said, “Now I’ll broaden your horizons!”","With that, he fully unleashed his power.","His speed became like a white flash.","In an instant, he was behind his opponent again.","He punched, shattering Ye Liangchen’s left arm.","The next moment, his right arm also exploded.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to kick his opponent into the air.","Below him, masses of peach-colored power began to gather.","A huge light wave was born.","He suddenly raised his hand, and in an instant, it rushed towards the airborne Ye Liangchen!","Boom...","The explosive sound even pierced the eardrums of those in the audience.","“Is he dead?”","Someone pointed blankly at the sky where Ye Liangchen had been reduced to nothing, his eyes vacant.","“It seems so. Now the pressure is on the nine-star Universe Gods. It has nothing to do with us seven-star Universe Gods, haha!!!”","Someone had already lost their sanity.","They even began to suspect that Jian Wushuang might be a spy from the Land of Chaos, sent to eliminate the high-end combat power in the Starry Sky.","This idea was later dismissed.","Because the Great Realm King, in this city, was invincible.","In Chaos City, he dared to challenge the heavens!","This was the proclamation of the City Lord’s Mansion.","No one dared to oppose it.","Because once, a nine-star Universe God challenged the Great Realm King’s bottom line.","As a result, his consciousness was instantly shattered.","Only then did they realize that their consciousness was within the Realm King God Realm, and the Realm King God Realm was within the Great Realm King’s sea of consciousness.","Especially within Chaos City, whatever the Great Realm King wanted, he could create at will.","He could create anything out of thin air.","Any Origin Source path could be born at will.","It was no different from the Land of Chaos.","The only difference was that the Great Realm King was invincible in his domain, while the Realm Beasts of the Land of Chaos were not.","After all, Star Spirits had gone out to slay Realm Beasts.","There was no invincible Realm Beast in the Land of Chaos.","Otherwise, why would they still worry about the Starry Sky?","...","“Ninth battle, Jian Wushuang wins!”","The voice of the girl in the python robe fell, and the entire arena did not tremble.","Everyone was watching the nine-star Universe Gods who participated in the life-and-death battle. At this moment, they were even more excited than Jian Wushuang.","They all wanted to witness this unprecedented feat.","Among them, an old man in a black robe took a deep breath.","“Six consecutive victories in the eight-star Universe Gods, wouldn’t it also be six consecutive victories in the nine-star Universe Gods?”","“Don’t worry, senior, this time we all support you. Why don’t you go up voluntarily?”","Several nine-star Universe Gods walked up with forced smiles.","This time, they were really a bit scared.","Just now, Jian Wushuang’s combat strength had reached the level of a nine-star Universe God.","Although they were not ordinary nine-star Universe Gods, they were afraid that Jian Wushuang might explode again.","At that time, they would be dumbfounded.","“Cough, cough, don’t try that with me. Everything is up to fate. I don’t believe it will be me!” The Old Man of Sorrow smiled arrogantly.","He didn’t want to step onto the stage.","It wasn’t that he was afraid, he just didn’t want to.","Simply didn’t want to.","He just wanted to see Jian Wushuang break through everything.","To witness history together.","Rather than becoming history himself.","Whether winning or losing, being chosen would mark him in history.","For example, if he won against a heaven-defying Universe God,","He would be scorned!","If he lost, he would still be scorned!","Being called a failure, that’s not pleasant!","The girl in the python robe began the selection again.","This time, there were very few names.","Only a few Ninth Tribulation Universe Gods.","Everyone’s eyes didn’t dare to blink, all waiting for the result.","Crack!","“Old!”","“Man!”","“Of!”","“Sorrow!”","Four large characters floated in the air.","“Such is my fate!”","The Old Man of Sorrow looked up at the sky, “Is it really about the name?”","He was indeed very unfortunate.","Originally, he was a superpower in the Ninth Star Region of the Starry Sky.","He had a family, but later, the family was devoured by monsters from the void.","He aspired to become the strongest among the Universe Gods.","He joined a sect.","But the sect was destroyed, and he was hunted by enemies.","He fled through the starry sky for endless ages.","Finally, he became a Ninth Tribulation Universe God. On his way to revenge, he encountered a rare attack by a realm beast.","It shattered the Realm King Continent.","He descended to the Ninth Star Region.","The Old Man of Sorrow, on his way to revenge, was killed by the aftermath of a battle between star spirits and realm beasts.","He fell in a very humiliating manner.","To compensate, he entered the Realm King Divine Realm.","After coming here, he had doubted himself.","Later, he found his luck was still alright.","In the arena, he won six consecutive life-and-death battles.","Gradually, he regained his confidence.","Later, when he couldn’t find an opponent, which is now, he had the idea of reincarnation.","He wanted to start over.","By then, his family and sect would be renewed.","He would have everything he once had again.","But the day before he prepared to reincarnate, driven by curiosity, he came to the arena to watch the life-and-death battle of a Six-Star Universe God.","Unexpectedly, the life-and-death battle of a Six-Star Universe God could drag him into the fray.","If we talk about the level of misfortune,","In the Starry Sky, he claimed the first place, and no one dared to claim the second.","“Sigh!”","The Old Man of Sorrow sighed deeply and voluntarily stepped down from the audience seats.","“Jian Wushuang, I don’t know if you are fated to be unfortunate, or if I, named Misfortune, am meant to be unfortunate!”","This statement made Jian Wushuang a bit embarrassed, as he couldn’t understand it.","“Senior Sorrow, you are the strongest among the Ninth Tribulation Universe Gods, how could you be unfortunate?”","He then thought about his own journey from weakness, that was truly unfortunate.","Having everything taken away, he understood that feeling more than anyone."]},{"number":6217,"title":"Chapter 6217: Final Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 6217: Final Battle","On the night of his wedding, his wife was taken.","He spent an incalculable amount of effort searching for his wife’s whereabouts.","Later, when he found his wife, he thought his life had reached its end.","Yet, he embarked on the journey to find his master.","He had originally thought he had reached the pinnacle.","That he could quickly find his master.","As a result, this journey left his wife and children in an unknown state.","Eons passed in the blink of an eye.","Everything turned to dust!","Old Man of Sorrow, also known as Elder Misfortune.","“Elder Misfortune, compared to mortals, you are infinitely better off. To become a nine-star Universe God, with Fate Points that defy the heavens, I don’t think you are unfortunate. On the contrary, I believe you are very lucky!”","“Then I’ll take your kind words!” Elder Misfortune smiled bitterly.","The two bowed to each other.","This battle was a farewell.","“Let’s begin!”","Jian Wushuang shouted, a fierce sword light appearing in his eyes.","Divine power and Origin Source erupted simultaneously.","Clang!","The Wanjie Sword was unsheathed.","He intended to use his strongest sword to face his strongest battle.","“Even a nine-star can be defeated!”","Clang!","Sword light burst forth.","Forming an infinitely large sword shadow.","As if it would cleave the entire Realm King Divine Realm.","It rushed towards Elder Misfortune.","The sixth sword move of the Starry Sky Chronicles was far beyond comparison to the first five sword moves.","This sword carried too many things.","It was also the perfect sword condensed from the chaotic force he had absorbed over the years.","It had reached the pinnacle of the sixth sword.","To fully utilize the sixth sword move, he still needed to pass the Supreme Divine Tribulation.","Elder Misfortune frowned as he gazed at the sword strike.","He raised one hand, and a black rhombus-shaped mirror appeared before him.","“Refraction!”","“With my life, I exchange yours!”","“Let’s see whose fate is more unfortunate!”","At the moment the mirror appeared.","Everyone revealed shocked expressions.","“This is the Fate God’s mirror, how does Elder Misfortune have it?”","“It’s over, the Fate God is a genuine God of Spacetime, more powerful than the Star Spirit’s envoy, almost reaching the Great Realm King. How could his life-bound treasure be in Elder Misfortune’s hands!”","“This isn’t real, it’s just an imitation!” The Realm King, with his vast experience,","immediately spotted the oddity.","Because the refracted fate didn’t reach the level of the supreme rule.","The sword light surged forward.","The mirror indeed reflected a sword light.","But the sword light still headed towards Elder Misfortune.","Stronger than the original sword light from Jian Wushuang.","Because refraction adds power.","What was originally the power of one sword was forcibly doubled by Elder Misfortune’s treasure.","“It seems my fate is st a bit ore unfortunate!”","He completely gave up.","He opened his arms to embrace death.","Swish!","The sword passed, piercing through Elder Misfortune.","His consciousness and divine body shattered.","Everything turned into nothingness.","One of the strongest nine-star Universe Gods in the entire Realm King Divine Realm.","Jian Wushuang had defeated his opponent.","The reason it wasn’t stated as a fall was because his opponent still had some consciousness","remaining.","“Look at the sky!”","Everyone looked up.","A huge phantom appeared in the sky.","Its skin was the same as the Realm King’s, and it even looked similar in appearance.","However, the aura of majesty made everyone show their respect.","The Northern Realm King knelt down.","“Great Realm King!”","Jian Wushuang, though not kneeling, bowed deeply in respect.","This was the strongest existence in the Consciousness Realm.","The founder of the Realm God Continent and the first Great Realm King of the Realm King","Divine Realm.","Apart from the Star Spirits, this was the highest being.","Although the Star Spirits were powerful in combat, they ultimately were not practitioners.","But the first Great Realm King was a practitioner.","“Greetings, Great Realm King!” The girl in the python robe also bowed!","The phantom smiled faintly, “Jian Wushuang, congratulations on your ten consecutive victories. Later, come to the City Lord’s mansion to see me!”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded respectfully.","He hadn’t expected the Great Realm King to be so approachable.","After speaking, the consciousness that was connected to the old man of misfortune","dissipated.","It was only then that everyone realized Jian Wushuang had won.","He had won thoroughly.","With his strongest strike, he had achieved ten consecutive victories.","He became the fourth in history.","And he was the first six-star Universe God to defeat a nine-star Universe God, achieving ten consecutive victories, becoming a super Universe God in history.","Congratulations poured in endlessly.","Jian Wushuang showed no excitement.","Because he had that confidence.","Even if the sixth sword was not enough, he could completely unleash his consciousness,","elevating his divine power to nine-star consummation.","At that time, who would be his opponent?","nine-star consummation, there were only a few on the entire Realm God Continent.","They were the true supreme beings.","Invincible under the God of Time and Space.","That’s why he was so confident.","“Old man of misfortune???” Jian Wushuang looked at the girl in the python robe.","He was curious as to why the old man of misfortune was taken away.","Of course, he didn’t want to kill him.","Just pure curiosity.","This was the rule, a life-and-death battle!","Yet, he was taken away just like that.","Others were not surprised because he had defeated a nine-star Universe God; who cared about","the fate of the old man of misfortune.","Misfortune, indeed he was aptly named.","But when Jian Wushuang learned the truth, he admired the old man’s fate.","“The old man of misfortune decided it was time for his reincarnation. Perhaps you all didn’t","notice, there is no difference between day and night in the Realm King Divine Realm, this you","should know. Actually, a lot of time passed when I was speaking earlier, now it’s the second","day!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang admired the old man of misfortune even more.","He actually had the girl in the python robe delay time for him.","His fate was simply too good.","As for why the life-and-death battle wasn’t interrupted, it was due to the Great Realm King’s","order, wanting to see if Jian Wushuang could defeat the old man of misfortune.","Now it seemed, he had won.","In every aspect, he had won.","He calmly walked out of the gladiatorial arena.","Cheers followed him.","He didn’t go directly to the City Lord’s mansion.","Instead, he returned to the place he stayed with the Realm King.","The Cave Heaven World.","By the lake!","Jian Wushuang leisurely fished.","Splash!","Only then did the Realm King rush over.","“Why did you come back? Still in the mood to fish, the outside world is full of discussions","about you. The old man of sorrows has reincarnated, but even if he awakens his memories, he will be ridiculed. If anyone here successfully reincarnates, your achievements will be exposed. Then you will become a peerless talent in the Starry Sky, while the old man of misfortune will","remain the old man of misfortune!”","“Just rumors, not misfortune at all. If he truly awakens his memories, he will have succeeded, more successful than many here. Why call it misfortune!” Faced with Jian Wushuang’s rebuttal, the Realm King nodded.","“Jian Wushuang, you’ve grown. Now you even educate me!”","“How dare I!” Jian Wushuang waved his fishing rod and said calmly, “How about fish for","dinner?”","“Sounds good!”","The reason he didn’t go directly to the City Lord’s mansion was for his state of mind.","Fishing to cultivate the heart.","Eating fish...","“Go, remember to be respectful when you see the Great Realm King!”","The Realm King looked at Jian Wushuang’s back, his eyes filled with pride and satisfaction."]},{"number":6218,"title":"Chapter 6218: Meeting the Great Realm King","paragraphs":["Chapter 6218: Meeting the Great Realm King","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Northern Spacetime’s complete rise was something that depended on Jian Wushuang.","After Jian Wushuang left.","His transmission token received a message.","The seven Origin Sources had already been gathered.","Jian Wushuang could be revived at any time.","“Wait a bit longer!”","This was the Realm King’s response.","Perhaps the longer Jian Wushuang stayed here, the faster he would grow.","Outside the City Lord’s Mansion.","Jian Wushuang arrived alone.","On the way, he encountered many Universe Gods who greeted him, and he responded to each one.","There was not a trace of arrogance in him despite his ten consecutive victories.","“Junior Jian Wushuang requests an audience!”","He called out, but there was no response.","He didn’t know whether to enter or not.","But just as he looked up, he found himself already inside the City Lord’s Mansion.","It was an elegant pavilion.","On the second-floor balcony, the Great Realm King sat in a chair, leisurely drinking tea.","Looking at Jian Wushuang below, he said, “Come up and chat!”","With just one sentence, Jian Wushuang was already seated in the chair next to the Great Realm King.","Magical!","Curious!","This was Jian Wushuang’s current state of mind.","However, these were minor matters, and he couldn’t waste time and opportunity.","He immediately said, “Senior Great Realm King, I want to know the ultimate secret of the Starry Sky, and I also want to obtain a magic pot capable of bearing more Realm Beast consciousness!”","“Simple!” The Great Realm King waved his hand, and the surrounding world changed once again.","Chaos!","The vast Land of Chaos.","It was all desolate, without any movement.","But Jian Wushuang could feel the flow of time.","With every breath, countless cycles of reincarnation passed.","After several breaths, the scene began to change.","Jian Wushuang seemed to be deeply immersed in it.","“Look, the Starry Sky is about to be born!”","Buzz!","Countless figures suddenly appeared in the desolate chaos.","Each one was a Realm Beast.","And they were all incredibly powerful Realm Beasts, each no less than Molasa.","The moment these Realm Beasts gathered in this place.","Jian Wushuang remembered Molasa’s words.","Sure enough.","The creators of the Starry Sky were the Realm Beasts.","In just the blink of an eye, these Realm Beasts began to perish.","A single point absorbed all their consciousness and power.","Immediately, the point began to radiate brilliant light.","It continued to shine.","It showed no signs of stopping.","This made Jian Wushuang curious. Could it be that the spacetime created by the Starry Sky would still undergo a long period of time?","With each breath, countless cycles of light passed.","The Great Realm King seemed to see his confusion and said indifferently, “The Starry Sky has already been created. It is this very point!”","“What?”","“This tiny point?”","He found it hard to believe and thought the Great Realm King was joking with him.","“If you don’t believe me, let’s go back and magnify it for you to see!”","The Great Realm King waved his hand, and time rewound to before the Realm Beasts perished.","The point began to magnify rather than expand.","Within the point was the current Starry Sky.","But at that time, there were no four major spacetimes or the Realm King Continent.","The Starry Sky had 12 layers.","12 star regions.","At the same time, a bizarre life form in strange attire appeared.","This was a Star Spirit.","Each of them held a scepter.","Jian Wushuang saw Vess, who seemed to see him too and gave him a signature smile.","Even the gesture of covering the mouth hadn’t changed.","Looking at the other Star Spirits, their appearances were similar.","Among them, a petite Star Spirit stood in the first star region.","This one seemed different from the others, though Jian Wushuang couldn’t pinpoint why.","After the images of the 12 Star Spirits appeared, there was also a throne in the first star region.","The throne had its back to Jian Wushuang.","But he could see a slender arm on the throne.","The hand was unlike that of humans; it had yellow skin and four fingers.","“Is he the creator of the Starry Sky?”","The Great Realm King nodded and said, “Yes, the entire Starry Sky was created by him.”","“Can’t we see his face?”","“No!” The Great Realm King shook his head.","In truth, Jian Wushuang was most curious about the creator of the Starry Sky.","He was curious about his appearance and other identities.","Since hearing the secret from Morosa, he had begun to wonder.","Could Teacher Xuan Yi be the creator of the Starry Sky?","Otherwise, why would he give him such a powerful supreme treasure?","And from a young age, he had been guiding him.","It seemed he had been leading him to the Starry Sky all along.","Now, unable to see his face, he felt somewhat disappointed.","Teacher Xuan Yi’s appearance should be that of a kind old man.","It looked nothing like the arm that was exposed.","Continuing to watch, time in the Starry Sky passed quickly.","In the first star region, he saw a giant eye, and his heart trembled, as if he had seen it before.","“This is the Eye of the Giant God, the ancestor of the Giant God Clan!”","“The Eye of the Giant God?” Jian Wushuang’s heart was shaken. This was also a prominent figure.","It was said that he was already the ultimate powerhouse among the spacetime gods.","The life he created was the first in the Starry Sky.","As the scene kept changing, the Realm King Continent appeared above the Starry Sky.","He also saw the young Great Realm King, full of spirit.","He came from the ninth star region.","He was the pride of the entire ninth star region.","He created the four major spacetimes and the Realm King Continent.","He also created the Realm King God Realm, a unique consciousness world.","It was just like the origin world that Morosa had spoken of.","When the scene finally ended, Jian Wushuang realized that the Great Realm King’s era was actually in this very moment.","Because it all took less than a breath.","Yet it experienced so much in the Starry Sky.","“Phew!”","After watching all this, Jian Wushuang let out a long breath.","He wasn’t excited.","He had already guessed most of it.","Now he was naturally very calm.","The Great Realm King glanced at him with a smile and said, “Little guy, you’re the first to be so calm after seeing all this!”","“To be honest, I had already guessed most of it, so I wasn’t very excited!” Jian Wushuang answered truthfully.","“Aren’t you curious why, after the Realm Beasts perished, twelve Star Spirits appeared?”","“Aren’t they also Realm Beasts?” Jian Wushuang pointed at Vess’s image and continued, “They should have a good relationship with the creator of the Starry Sky and help manage it better!”","This was also his guess.","The Great Realm King laughed after hearing this, “You think too narrowly of the creator of the Starry Sky and underestimate the existence of the Star Spirits. They are indeed Realm Beasts, but they are the culmination of the Realm Beasts. After the consciousness of those perished Realm Beasts was completely shattered, not all of it entered the Starry Sky. Instead, twelve Star Spirits were condensed. To be precise, there is only one Star Spirit, the Great Star Officer. But back then, the Great Star Officer couldn’t bear so much power and took out eleven portions from his body, creating the current twelve Star Spirits. Speaking of which, these Star Spirits have to call the Great Star Officer ‘Father God’!”","“So that’s how it is!” Jian Wushuang was startled.","The power was too great to bear, so he casually took out eleven portions, resulting in eleven Star Spirits."]},{"number":6219,"title":"Chapter 6219: The Origin of Chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 6219: The Origin of Chaos","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","How powerful must this Great Star Officer be?","There was already a significant difference between Star Spirits and cultivators.","One could even say that a cultivator could never surpass a Star Spirit in their lifetime.","Even the Great Realm King, who defied the heavens and was a figure that overshadowed the Starry Sky, was no match for the Star Spirits.","Encountering a Star Spirit would result in being crushed.","The Great Realm King represented the pinnacle of the God of Time and Space.","However, compared to the Star Spirits of the Starry Sky, there was indeed a large gap.","But when it came to innate talent, the Great Realm King did not pale in comparison to the Star Spirits.","After all, the power of the Star Spirits came from the Great Star Officer and involved the Origin Source, which was the power left behind by those realm beasts.","No wonder Morosa harbored such hatred towards the Star Spirits.","The origins of the Starry Sky were already sparsely known, but Jian Wushuang’s heart was still preoccupied with Morosa.","He admired the Great Realm King even more.","Being able to carve out this Consciousness Realm in the Starry Sky.","Wouldn’t it also be possible to carve out the Starry Sky?","Only hindered by insufficient power.","Power, in fact, could be cultivated or absorbed.","Back then, didn’t the God King deceive those realm beasts into sacrificing themselves, ultimately creating the Starry Sky?","“Senior Great Realm King, I have one last question to ask you!” Jian Wushuang spoke respectfully, bowing his head in salute.","“Feel free to ask!”","The Great Realm King had a kind expression, looking as if he would spare no knowledge.","“Junior wants to know the origins of the Land of Chaos!”","He had long wanted to ask this question.","He did not dare to believe what Morosa said and wanted to learn something from the Great Realm King.","The secrets of the Starry Sky no longer attracted him.","He was more eager to know the essence of this world or its origin.","Upon hearing this, the Great Realm King took a deep breath but remained silent for a long time.","Finally, he sighed.","“This question, I cannot answer you!”","“Because I don’t know either. The Land of Chaos holds too many secrets. It’s not just those realm beasts. Perhaps only when you reach the true limit will you understand all of this!”","The Great Realm King gently shook his head.","But one’s eyes cannot lie.","Even though Jian Wushuang’s strength was nothing compared to the Great Realm King, he could still see the apprehension in the other’s eyes.","Perhaps due to the God King, he couldn’t speak.","Not even in the world he had created.","“It was rude of me!”","Jian Wushuang stood up and saluted again.","“It’s nothing. Your concern is justified. You should not limit your perspective to the Realm God Continent or the Starry Sky but look at the entire Land of Chaos. Once you reach the level of a Universe God, right and wrong will no longer constrain you, and you should pursue the ultimate!”","As the Great Realm King said this, his eyes flickered.","There was a light of reminiscence.","This light was a black mist.","Jian Wushuang bowed his head and did not notice.","The conversation with the Great Realm King soon ended.","He also obtained a magical pot capable of containing the power of time and space gods.","This would allow him to quickly devour Morosa’s consciousness.","It was an unexpected gain.","With the magical pot in hand, he was ready to head directly to the border.","But he was stopped by the Northern Realm King.","“Jian Wushuang, are you really not planning to leave?”","Ten consecutive victories in the arena had earned him the Giant Axe Medal.","He could designate a reincarnation, carrying his memories from his past life.","However, people like Hui Qing outside had already collected special Origin Source for him, allowing him to reshape and be reborn.","Both paths led directly to reincarnation.","But at this moment, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry. Instead, his battle intent surged.","He wanted to eliminate threats for the Great Realm King.","To completely put an end to Morosa.","“Wait for me for a while, I want to help the Great Realm King eliminate Morosa!”","This statement startled the Realm King.","He stared at Jian Wushuang with an incredulous look, glanced around, and upon finding no one else, urgently said, “Jian Wushuang, are you crazy?”","“Do you understand what kind of being Morosa is?”","“I know, he is a Realm Beast, an incredibly powerful Realm Beast, the kind that can challenge the Star Spirits!” Jian Wushuang replied bluntly.","“And you still want to go? Even if your mental power is strong and your consciousness pressure can wear down Morosa, have you thought about the fact that anything can happen in the Land of Chaos? If there’s a method targeting you, you’re finished!”","“Morosa can fail many times, and when he’s too exhausted, he can just leave, but you? You only have one life. You can’t outplay those Realm Beasts. Let’s go quickly!” The Northern Realm King continued to persuade him.","But he couldn’t sway the determination in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","What he said, he would do.","“Ten thousand eras, tell Huiqing and the others, wait for me for ten thousand eras!”","Without further explanation, he soared directly into the sky.","Heading once again towards the borderlands.","Buzz!","Upon his return, Morosa appeared directly.","“Jie jie, it looks like you’re really against me?”","“What else?”","Jian Wushuang immediately took out the Demon Pot and began absorbing Morosa’s consciousness.","The Demon Pot, personally refined by the Great Realm King, was indeed extraordinary.","It only took one day to fill up.","With a thought, he entered the Demon Pot.","Morosa’s clone was already waiting for him.","“You’re truly arrogant, absorbing so much of my power. Do you know what my current strength is?”","“I don’t know, but killing you will be enough!”","Besides the Great Realm King, his consciousness was the strongest in the entire Consciousness Realm.","Boom!","Without hesitation, the sword light swept through the entire world within the Demon Pot.","In just a few breaths, he shredded Morosa’s clone.","In the Land of Chaos, Morosa’s true body.","His extremely ugly face was contorted with rage.","“Damn, wretched human cultivator!”","He roared, causing the surrounding void to tremble.","In his ugly red eyes, mist swirled.","“Bes, bring me that treasure of yours!”","His gaze also turned to the depths of the Land of Chaos.","Where countless statues stood.","At the call of Bes, one of the statues began to move, cracks forming on its surface until finally, a Realm Beast similar to Morosa emerged.","Its gaze also turned to the one who had summoned it.","“Morosa, a mere human boy has pushed you to this point, you truly are a waste!”","Though it said this, its body acted honestly, rushing towards Morosa’s true body at the fastest speed.","Jian Wushuang, unaware of this, was indeed as the Realm King had said, facing an unknown countermeasure of Morosa.","In fact, he was too confident, believing that he could handle any contingency.","This was underestimating the Realm Beasts.","Several cycles passed.","The amount of Origin Source from the Realm Beasts he absorbed increased.","In the Starry Sky of Origin Source, more universes lit up.","The complete river of spacetime grew increasingly brighter, representing many perfect universes.","In the blink of an eye, an era passed.","Morosa’s consciousness also noticeably diminished.","Jian Wushuang was extremely excited and sped up.","Each time was a quick kill.","With each ebb and flow, Morosa was no match at all.","Buzz!","After absorbing Morosa’s consciousness once again, Jian Wushuang’s thought moved and he entered the Demon Pot.","As usual, upon entering the Demon Pot, he intended to immediately strike and kill Morosa’s clone."]},{"number":6220,"title":"Chapter 6220: The Great Realm King Makes a Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 6220: The Great Realm King Makes a Move","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, after going all out this time, the opponent, Morosa, remained completely unmoved.","“Jian Wushuang, do you still think I’m the same as before?”","Morosa raised his hand slightly, and a powerful oppressive force instantly surged forward.","That terrifying power had reached the level of a Universe God.","It was definitely not a force Jian Wushuang could contend with.","“This?”","Jian Wushuang was also taken aback. He didn’t expect the other party to find a way to counter him so quickly.","But this was the Demon Pot!","He knew exactly how much power he had absorbed; Morosa shouldn’t be this powerful.","“What, are you surprised?”","Morosa had a look of disdain on his face.","“There are many things that will surprise you, but you won’t have the chance to see them because you will soon be devoured by me, becoming part of my power!”","“That’s impossible! The Demon Pot was crafted by the Great Realm King. You can’t bring in so much power!”","He knew precisely the power the Demon Pot contained; it couldn’t carry even an iota more.","How could Morosa find a loophole?","Upon hearing his doubts, Morosa’s lips curled into a proud smile, “You don’t think the Great Realm King who created this world...”","Before he could finish his sentence, the Demon Pot suddenly shattered.","Morosa was shocked and angrily shouted, “Old man, how dare you interfere?”","With the Demon Pot shattered, Jian Wushuang also broke free from the oppressive force and instantly felt relieved.","“Morosa, do you really think you can suppress me?”","An angry roar came from above.","A huge face appeared, exuding a powerful aura that made it hard to breathe.","Morosa’s avatar instantly disappeared from the outside world, followed by the appearance of another enormous face.","But this face was extremely ugly.","“Great Realm King!”","Upon seeing the newcomer, Jian Wushuang was overjoyed and couldn’t help but feel excited. This was the first time he had seen the pinnacle of practitioners.","It was also the pride of practitioners.","The Great Realm King!","To confront Morosa, a Realm Beast that could spar with the Star Spirits.","“Stand back!”","The Great Realm King glanced at Jian Wushuang with kindness in his eyes.","“Yes!”","Jian Wushuang said no more, bowed, and then left immediately.","This was no longer something he could interfere with.","Naturally, he had to leave.","Staying behind would only be a hindrance and distract the Great Realm King.","After leaving the border area, he felt a powerful surge of energy from behind.","He couldn’t help but shudder.","“Indeed, Morosa’s backup plan is beyond my imagination!”","Jian Wushuang sighed. According to the original plan, they were supposed to eliminate Morosa, but now it seemed he had been naive.","Even the Northern Realm King had seen through this, but he had charged forward regardless.","Although he felt a bit disappointed, the thought of returning to the Realm God Continent soon lifted his spirits considerably.","The Northern Realm King was already waiting for him at the city gate.","As soon as he waved, the Realm King hurried over.","“Jian Wushuang, we need to leave now. Morosa has set his sights on you. Staying any longer will be detrimental to you!”","“Yes!” He nodded solemnly.","Seeing this, the Realm King immediately took out a jade slip, muttered a series of incantations, and then both of them were enveloped in a seven-colored light.","“Haha, we’re finally leaving!”","The Northern Realm King laughed heartily.","These years he had had enough of this place. Unlike Jian Wushuang, who could train and fight, he could do nothing.","Returning to the Realm God Continent or heading to his own Northern Spacetime would be much more comfortable.","The light flashed.","Jian Wushuang and the Realm King’s consciousness instantly disappeared from the consciousness world.","A pair of large hands held the two of them, and in a whirlwind, they returned to the Realm King Continent.","However, it was their consciousness that returned, not their physical bodies.","Their consciousness drifted above the Realm King Continent.","The Realm King’s eyes darted around, and then, seeing a point of light, he exclaimed, “That’s it!”","It was the central part of the eastern section of the Realm King Continent.","The Dongsheng Star Field!","As soon as he had identified the location, Jian Wushuang felt his consciousness being pulled away, a sensation that made him very uncomfortable.","But it was only temporary. In an instant, he regained clarity.","When he opened his eyes, he found himself floating in the sky.","The surroundings were bright and sunny, with no one in sight.","Looking down, he saw that he was completely naked.","With a thought, a wide, black robe appeared on his body.","“Phew!”","Only then did he let out a long breath.","“Where is the Realm King?”","He glanced around but did not see the Realm King.","Nor did he see Hu Qing and the others.","He was alone, floating above a small island.","Just having been reborn, he felt an uncontrollable excitement in his heart. He landed on the small island and picked an unknown fruit to munch on.","After taking a couple of bites, he remembered he could use the communication token.","When he took it out, he found many messages on it.","“Brother Wushuang, we are on Qianye Planet in the Dongsheng Star Field. The Realm King is also here. Come quickly!”","“Wait for me one day!”","He tossed away the fruit, and with a surge of energy, he shot into the sky.","His figure soared higher, leaving that world behind.","He reappeared in the void.","After locking onto Qianye Planet, he set off immediately.","At this moment, Babata’s voice also rang out.","“Master, you finally returned. I’ve been waiting so long!”","“Sorry to make you worry!” Jian Wushuang smiled self-deprecatingly.","He then asked, “By the way, why are Hu Qing and the others on Qianye Planet?”","He had expected to go to Northern City or the Star Field of the Gods.","He hadn’t expected them to be on Qianye Planet in the Dongsheng Star Field.","He had heard of this place.","It was the extreme eastern region of the Realm King Continent.","Just like the central state of the entire Realm King Continent.","There were countless strong beings there.","Universe Gods were very common.","Could it be that they encountered trouble?","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but clench his fists and feel the substantial divine power within.","Now, he was no longer in the Realm King Divine Realm but in the real Realm King Continent.","Divine power here was naturally not as exaggerated as in the consciousness realm.","But it wasn’t much different either.","This physical body carried two hundred million units of base divine power.","There were also two stars on his chest.","Two-star Universe God.","Two hundred million units of base divine power was quite good for him now.","He also had the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and the Ultimate Ancient Transformation.","Plus, his strongest trump card, the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","It was hard to imagine how powerful his peak combat strength had become.","“Back then, Weiss said that the Ninth Tribulation’s Extreme Freedom Intent Technique could reach the minor perfection realm. It seems I’m still a bit short!”","He was still in the Ninth Tribulation and had not yet undergone the Divine Tribulation.","It wasn’t that his strength was insufficient, but that he lacked a good entry point.","In terms of Origin Source, although he had reached the quasi-spacetime level, he still lacked something.","Compared to the Northern Spacetime, he was probably lacking in realm.","This required opportunity and couldn’t be rushed.","He had originally thought that in the Realm King Divine Realm, he could find a suitable opportunity, such as killing Morosa to undergo the Divine Tribulation.","Unfortunately, he hadn’t managed to do that.","Babata held back for a long time before slowly answering, “There is some trouble, but no danger. It seems to be an agreement between Wu Zuo and the Realm King God!”","“An agreement?”"]},{"number":6221,"title":"Chapter 6221: The Agreement With the Realm King","paragraphs":["Chapter 6221: The Agreement With the Realm King","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised, still thinking about the agreement with the Realm King.","In the years he had been away, it seemed a lot had happened.","Now, Wu Zuo and the others could even establish connections with the Realm King.","“When Wu Zuo was searching for an Origin Source, he encountered the Realm King. They made an agreement, and only then did the Realm King hand over the Origin Source to Wu Zuo. Now that the master has revived, Wu Zuo and Hu Qing have gone to Qianye Planet to fulfill that agreement!”","“What kind of agreement?”","“It seems like a competition. There is an ancient relic on Qianye Planet that appears once in every cycle. When it appears, all the Universe Gods come to compete. The strongest one can obtain a treasure nurtured by the Realm King Continent!”","Upon hearing Babata’s explanation, Jian Wushuang exclaimed in surprise, “A treasure nurtured by the Realm King Continent? Isn’t that a gift from the Realm King? What kind of agreement is that?”","He didn’t quite understand.","Babata understood even less.","However, Jian Wushuang could sense that there was something more to this.","He increased his speed.","In the extreme east, Qianye Planet.","It was called a star, but it actually resembled a giant war machine.","Even the spacetime around it was gray.","From the outside, the star looked ancient and dilapidated.","But the power it held was undeniable, especially the renowned Qianye.","Each leaf was enormous, spanning billions of miles.","Moreover, they were incredibly sharp. If someone were to activate Qianye Planet to attack a practitioner, even a nine-star Universe God would struggle to defend against it.","It was a super treasure capable of crushing a nine-star Universe God.","This was Jian Wushuang’s first reaction upon seeing it.","Swish!","He descended onto Qianye Planet.","With a thought, he detected the presence of Wu Zuo and the others.","In a flash, he appeared on a steel island covered in sewage.","Splash!","He landed from the sky.","Standing right in front of Wu Zuo and the others.","“Jian Wushuang!”","The sharp-eyed Wu Li was both surprised and delighted to see him.","Wu Zuo and Hu Qing quickly turned their heads to look.","Upon seeing that familiar face, they could no longer contain their excitement and ran towards him.","“Everyone, sorry to keep you waiting!”","He nodded slightly.","“It has been a long wait!”","The Northern Realm King appeared behind him.","Looking at them, his eyes were filled with relief.","“Come on, let’s go inside and talk. We won’t leave until we’re drunk tonight!”","“No problem!”","The five of them entered a nearby dilapidated hut.","Although it looked ruined from the outside, the interior was intact.","They sat facing each other, looking out at everything through the gray iron windows.","Raindrops fell slowly.","Inside, they clinked their cups.","After drinking a considerable amount of wine, they began to talk about the events of the past years.","Jian Wushuang started by sharing the events of the Realm King’s realm.","He first described the structure of the Realm King’s realm, which alone left them gaping in astonishment.","When he mentioned his ten consecutive victories in the arena, their blood boiled with excitement.","As for the matter of Morosa, he didn’t mention it because it was too far removed from their experiences.","If it hadn’t been for his time in the Realm King’s realm, Jian Wushuang himself wouldn’t have encountered it.","So, he didn’t bring it up.","“My experiences over these years may not be as exciting as Brother Wushuang’s, but they aren’t bad either!”","Wu Zuo raised his wine glass and smiled smugly.","“It’s just that you’ve connected with the Realm King. Someone might think you’re the Great Realm King!”","“Well, you’re not wrong. Back then, the Realm King did say that I had the demeanor of a Realm King!” Wu Zuo wasn’t annoyed by these words; instead, he seemed quite proud.","Wu Li shook his head with a bitter smile.","He didn’t argue further, knowing Wu Zuo was shameless.","Everyone knew about Wu Zuo’s deeds, except Jian Wushuang.","So, Jian Wushuang was the most curious.","“Brother Wu Zuo, tell us, how did you connect with the Realm King?”","“That’s a long story!” Wu Zuo smiled faintly, a nostalgic look in his eyes.","“It was a terrifying place, I swear I’ll never go there again, never dare to even glance at it!”","Through Wu Zuo’s eyes, it seemed one could glimpse that horrifying place he described.","Hell!","A place so dreadful even the Universe Gods considered it hell.","Everywhere were the evil thoughts of life after death.","Once fallen, one became neither human nor ghost.","It was there that Wu Zuo met the Realm King.","The reason he went there was to find an Origin Source to revive Jian Wushuang.","“The Origin of Death!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang patted Wu Zuo’s shoulder, saying everything without words.","Grateful for his help.","“At that time, I went deep into it, encountering an extremely evil thought that wanted to drag me in. At the critical moment, the Realm King appeared, not only saving me but also giving me the Origin of Death!”","“Of course, nothing in the world is free. Only after I agreed to one of the Realm King’s requests did he give me the Origin Source!”","At this point, Wu Zuo deliberately paused, glancing at Jian Wushuang.","Everyone else knew the answer, so they didn’t care.","The first time they heard Wu Zuo tell this, they were just like Jian Wushuang, eyes wide with surprise and curiosity.","This was the effect Wu Zuo wanted; seeing Jian Wushuang hooked.","Then he continued: “It wasn’t exactly a request, but a promise. However, you all only know that the promise was to find the opportunity granted by the Realm God Continent on Qianyue Planet. You don’t know the real meaning!”","“What meaning?” Wu Li asked, full of curiosity.","Wu Zuo hadn’t mentioned this before.","“Fishing!”","Wu Zuo’s face turned slightly serious as he spoke, “The opportunity granted by the Realm God Continent wouldn’t interest the Realm King without reason. It was to lure out a threat to the Realm God Continent!”","“Damn, why didn’t you say so earlier!”","Wu Li and King Shenmu showed frightened expressions.","Wu Zuo hadn’t said this before.","He only mentioned helping the Realm King with a small favor.","So they followed, thinking they could make a good impression on the Realm King.","But now, hearing the truth from Wu Zuo, they panicked.","A terrifying existence threatening the Realm God Continent.","That was extremely dangerous.","To threaten the Realm God Continent.","At the very least, it would be a Ninth Tribulation Universe God.","Among them, the strongest, Hu Qing, was only a seven-star Universe God.","The others, despite years of cultivation, had greatly improved.","But they were only two-star Universe Gods; besides Hu Qing, the strongest was Wu Zuo, a three-star Universe God.","How could they help the Realm King fish?","Lure out the terrifying existence behind the scenes.","“I see!”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He was curious about this part; the rest of Wu Zuo’s story didn’t interest him. He just acted intrigued to give Wu Zuo face.","“Well, now that Brother Wushuang has been revived, this matter is indeed dangerous. I won’t force you; you can withdraw. Wushuang and I will go alone!”"]},{"number":6222,"title":"Chapter 6222: Thousand Gates Divine Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 6222: Thousand Gates Divine Palace","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“At this point, how could we possibly withdraw?”","Divine Wood King glared at Wu Zuo, then turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","“Wushuang, how strong are you now? Do you have the power of the seven-star?”","Everyone revealed curious expressions and looked at Jian Wushuang when this was asked.","Especially Hu Qing, whose eyes also carried a hint of battle intent.","“Me?”","Jian Wushuang pointed at himself, took a deep breath, and chuckled, “Not bad, I should have the power of the seven-star!”","It wasn’t that he was hiding it from everyone; he just hadn’t fought since his revival and couldn’t be sure.","“Everyone should attend together. Any danger should be manageable!” His tone was calm but carried a sense of confidence.","The Realm King, seeing this, finally spoke, “Everyone, since this is a task from the Realm King God, be careful. This time, I won’t be able to help you!”","“Don’t worry!”","Wu Zuo shamelessly patted the Realm King on the shoulder and joked, “As long as I’m here, your position as Realm King is absolutely secure. Even if that Zamasu comes, it won’t matter. After helping the Realm King God, we’ll have a strong backing!”","“Get lost!”","The Realm King laughed and cursed.","...","They chatted with everyone until late at night.","Finally, they talked about the ruins of Qianye Planet.","Although they were called ruins, they were more like an ancient inheritance.","An inheritance from a Spacetime God.","Each cycle hosted a peak competition among Universe Gods.","The opponents were powerful Universe Gods from all directions.","Their task was to take first place.","Or to draw out the terrifying existence mentioned by the Realm King God, which would count as completing the task.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing didn’t particularly care about this opportunity.","With Hu Qing’s current strength and realm, he didn’t need such an opportunity.","If they could get it, it would be a good choice for others to use.","After making their decision, it was the third day since Jian Wushuang’s revival.","On this day, many super-strong individuals arrived at Qianye Planet.","Dozens of Universe Gods descended.","There were also some Universe Masters.","Thousand Gate Island!","Outside the Qianye Temple.","A long queue had formed here.","One by one, Universe Gods or Universe Masters were heading to the grand hall.","“This is a test of divine power. With 80 million divine power, you qualify to enter the grand hall. This is very simple for us!”","Wu Zuo, the most familiar with this place, began to explain to everyone.","At this time, a tall alien Universe God walked to the front door.","The black-armored alien warrior crossed his arms suddenly, then erupted with an unparalleled aura.","“Ha!”","He raised a fist and launched a fierce strike.","The power of this punch made everyone tremble.","Even the Universe God guarding the place couldn’t help but exclaim.","“90 million!”","This had reached the level of a two-star Universe God.","He was currently the strongest Universe God.","“Is that enough?”","The black-armored warrior arrogantly raised his head and entered the grand hall with pride.","The people in line behind him marveled for a moment, then entered the grand hall in an orderly manner.","There were no failures; most of those who could come here were Universe Gods.","Their divine power naturally exceeded 80 million. As for Universe Masters, those who came here were also not weak, with divine power above 80 million, though they needed to use their full strength.","Jian Wushuang and his group didn’t wait long before reaching the entrance.","There stood a huge black obsidian divine stone.","At the front of the line, Wu Zuo’s lips twitched slightly, and he raised his hand to strike the divine stone.","Boom!!!","A loud crash echoed through the air.","The surrounding area trembled violently.","This new presence was far more powerful than the previous black-armored alien Universe God.","“So strong, a Universe God, at least a three-star Universe God!”","Many Universe Masters were shocked.","Some Universe Gods also silently noted Wu Zuo’s appearance, marking him as a formidable opponent in this trial.","“Divine power, one hundred seventy million, pass!”","An elderly man in a black robe outside the temple recorded Wu Zuo’s divine power and nodded, then teleported Wu Zuo into the great hall.","Without exerting his full strength, a casual strike from Wu Zuo had reached one hundred seventy million in divine power, indeed the combat strength of a three-star Universe God.","Divine Wood King, who was next in line, felt a bit envious but didn’t want to fall behind Wu Zuo.","He raised his hand slightly, and a beam of light burst forth, striking the Black Obsidian Divine Stone firmly.","Buzz!","After the buzzing sound, a massive number appeared.","“220 million, pass!”","The black-robed elder raised his eyebrows slightly.","Although it was merely a test to screen Universe Masters, the Universe Gods didn’t need to take it too seriously.","However, Divine Wood King enjoyed the looks of astonishment from others and swaggered into the temple.","Those behind him gasped in amazement once again.","“He must have used seventy percent of his power, not just a casual strike!”","“But he’s still at least a quasi-three-star, if not a full three-star Universe God!”","“It seems this place is filled with hidden talents!”","Strong contenders appeared one after another.","After Wu Zuo and Divine Wood King entered, it was Wu Li’s turn.","He was also competitive by nature and didn’t want to be outdone by the previous two.","He directly revealed his true strength, causing the spacetime behind him to tremble with his full power.","The black-robed elder overseeing the test widened his eyes.","“There’s no need for this, it’s just a simple test. If you want to show off, go inside and fight!”","Boom!!!","Wu Li finished gathering his energy and unleashed a punch.","His divine power soared to three hundred million.","Three-star Universe God.","Wu Zuo, Wu Li, and Divine Wood King.","All of them possessed the combat strength of three-star Universe Gods.","Bruby, though stronger than these individuals, kept a low profile.","He entered the temple with a casual punch.","In reality, his combat strength ranked among the top three of the six of them.","“My turn!”","Jian Wushuang was relaxed. He didn’t like drawing too much attention either, so he casually pointed his finger.","The divine power climbed to two hundred million before stopping.","“It seems my control has waned after being away from the real world for so long.”","He shook his head with a wry smile, perhaps because he had become too powerful now.","Although he was not yet a Universe God, his basic divine power had reached its limit, surpassing ordinary Universe Gods. The key was his enhancements.","Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!","Ultimate Ancient Transformation!","And the Beast God Weapon, all his trump cards.","As for transcending the Tribulation, it might just depend on fate, as his path differed from others, and he couldn’t rush it.","After passing the test, he entered the giant bronze door.","Hu Qing followed behind him.","The group was quite relaxed; it wasn’t a particularly remarkable feat.","However, they caught the attention of two mysterious figures in the team.","These figures were dressed in black robes, obscuring their faces and even concealing their aura.","“Not bad strength, perhaps they could assist us this time.”","The smaller of the two black-robed figures spoke with a tone of satisfaction.","The burly black-robed figure beside him was taken aback and exclaimed, “Them? They’re just some ordinary Universe Gods, and that kid with the sword isn’t even a Universe God!”","“Heh, don’t underestimate them, especially the kid with the divine sword. His strength isn’t weak, and you might find it difficult to defeat him!”"]},{"number":6223,"title":"Chapter 6223: You Can’t Control Me","paragraphs":["Chapter 6223: You Can’t Control Me","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“How is that possible?” The tall man was very surprised to hear this.","“Let’s wait and see!”","The two exchanged their thoughts briefly and arrived outside the bronze door.","Like Jian Wushuang and the others, they each unleashed a burst of over a billion divine power and entered the bronze door.","In just an hour, there was no one left outside the bronze door.","Everyone had entered the world beyond the bronze door.","At this moment, the old man guarding the door also closed the bronze door.","The sound of a bell rang, awakening a terror that had slept for billions of years.","Buzz!","The world behind the door.","It was like an endless desolate land.","Seemingly chaotic.","The divine power here was extremely violent.","Everyone couldn’t suppress the shock in their hearts.","Of course, some had participated several times and were not too concerned.","They all stayed in place, as if waiting for something.","Jian Wushuang and the others curiously looked around.","“When I came, I had collected some information about this place, but it differs from what others said!”","“Huh? How so?” Wu Li looked over in surprise after hearing Wu Zuo’s words.","Wu Zuo raised his hand to gather divine power and explained, “If I’m not mistaken, our divine power has been amplified, at least by ten percent!”","At the peak of his divine power, he was a three-star Universe God.","Now he could unleash 350 million divine power.","That meant his divine power had increased by 30 million.","“I didn’t even notice!” Jian Wushuang felt a bit embarrassed. Although he was the strongest among them, he was not as observant as Wu Zuo and the others.","He hadn’t realized that this place could amplify divine power.","But on second thought, this place was similar to the Land of Chaos, where divine power was not suppressed by supreme rules and could be somewhat unleashed.","If it were the actual Land of Chaos, the amplification would be even stronger.","“The Realm King Divine Realm is the same!”","With this thought, he felt a stirring in his heart.","Back in the Realm King Divine Realm, his divine power could erupt to the level of a nine-star or even a spacetime god.","It was because the rules’ suppression was gone, and his mind power was unleashed, making him so powerful.","In the Northern Spacetime, he had obtained a divine domain with the same principle.","That treasure could circumvent the power of rules and thus unleash stronger divine power.","Unfortunately, the stronger one’s power, the harsher the rules’ suppression.","Such heaven-defying treasures no longer existed.","Unless created by the Starry Sky founder.","Otherwise, even the Star Spirits had to follow the rules.","“If everyone is amplified, then it’s not really an amplification, is it?”","King Shenmu covered his face, not caring at all.","He had a point; if everyone became stronger, it was like no one became stronger.","“That makes sense!” Wu Zuo scratched his head, then turned to look at a blood-red cloud behind them and said, “Everyone, something big is coming!”","Following Wu Zuo’s reminder, everyone looked over.","The blood cloud descended.","Before entering this place, Wu Zuo had mentioned that the danger came from Universe Gods all over.","But to make them fight, some measures were needed.","This blood cloud was one of them.","Everyone uncontrollably soared into the air, heading towards the blood cloud.","“Don’t be nervous!”","Not sensing any malice, everyone relaxed.","Uncontrollably flying towards the blood cloud.","But when Wu Zuo turned his head, he realized Jian Wushuang hadn’t followed.","He was still standing in place!","“This?”","He had never encountered such a situation!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, his hands clenched. He had just resisted a powerful mind force and had actually managed to withstand it.","The consciousness of this place couldn’t do anything to him, allowing him to move freely.","“You don’t need to worry about me!”","He reassured them, his figure flashing as he directly surpassed everyone, arriving in the blood cloud in the blink of an eye.","Surrounded by desolation, he could only enter this place.","Wow!","Landing on the blood cloud, he finally saw its appearance clearly.","It was a massive arena.","Various towering pillars stood on it.","Just as he was surprised, a voice reached his ear.","“You, how did you get here?”","Upon hearing the voice, Jian Wushuang looked up and said indifferently, “Of course, I flew here!”","Moreover, the people below were also flying towards the blood cloud. Wasn’t this a normal thing?","What was there to be surprised about? He was somewhat curious. Could it be because he entered on his own?","Whoosh!","A pair of pitch-black eyes in the blood cloud suddenly shot out, as if facing a formidable enemy, angrily shouting, “Without my intention, it’s impossible for you to be here. Could it be that you are a realm beast that came through the Land of Chaos?”","“Realm beast?”","Jian Wushuang laughed upon hearing this, “If I were a realm beast, this place would have been destroyed long ago!”","He had witnessed the power of Morosa and had heard of realm beasts as powerful as star spirits.","If he could truly enter this place, he could destroy this world with ease. Even the Realm God Continent could be devastated.","Besides, realm beasts wouldn’t fancy this place!","Noticing his disdain, the eyes were filled with anger, shouting, “Do you know who my master is?”","“I know, the God of Spacetime!”","Jian Wushuang answered calmly.","To him, this was nothing.","He had seen it before.","Moreover, the God of Spacetime he had seen was still alive.","Besides, he had seen Star Spirits; what was there to fear about a dead God of Spacetime?","“Ignorant cultivator, this is the domain left by the great God of Spacetime. If you dare to defy the Law Rules of the God of Spacetime, you will be expelled!”","“After all that talk, why don’t you make a move!” Jian Wushuang sneered.","If the other party could do anything to him, they would have done it long ago. Why waste words here?","It was simply because they couldn’t do anything to him.","Since he had freed himself from the control of the consciousness, this place was just an ordinary space to him.","As for the claim of the God of Space-Time.","He didn’t believe it much.","This was a chaotic world, and it was still within the Realm God Continent. Even if it were the God of Space-Time, it would be the God of Space-Time of the Realm God Continent. What was there to fear?","“You, you brat!”","“Enough talk, I’ll give you some face and leave on my own. Otherwise...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes glared at the other party, causing them to feel fear and unable to speak for a long time.","If the other party dared to speak more nonsense, he wouldn’t mind directly seizing the treasure in this place.","It was the treasure needed by the Realm King God.","He just felt that since even the Realm King God followed the rules, there was no need for him to take risks.","It wasn’t like he couldn’t obtain the treasure.","No cultivator here could be his opponent.","At this moment, all the cultivators had gathered on the massive arena.","His figure moved, and he rushed down.","At the same time, he also saw all the cultivators who entered this place.","Scanning with his eyes.","His eyebrows furrowed.","“Hmm?”","“What’s that?”","He couldn’t believe his eyes, actually sensing a familiar aura.","Scanning with his mind, he even discovered two mysterious powerhouses he couldn’t see through.","“Interesting!”"]},{"number":6224,"title":"Chapter 6224: A Familiar Aura","paragraphs":["Chapter 6224: A Familiar Aura","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Returning to Wu Zuo and the others, his heart stirred, and he signaled everyone to look at the strong figure he had discovered.","Wu Zuo and the others hadn’t had the chance to ask about what had just happened but were intrigued by the familiar aura he mentioned, so they all looked up.","“How... how is he still alive?”","Shenmu Wang, Bru, and Wu Li didn’t recognize the person.","But Wu Zuo and Hu Qing were very familiar with him.","Especially Wu Zuo, who had suffered a major loss at this person’s hands before.","He had almost lost his life.","Hu Qing had experienced the same.","Back then, in single combat, no one was his match.","Even he and Hu Qing were no match for him.","“Broly!!!!” Wu Zuo shouted directly.","Hearing the name, the other three were stunned, completely bewildered. They didn’t recognize this lunatic who had once dealt Jian Wushuang and the others a heavy blow.","“Who is he?” Wu Li asked in surprise. “When did you meet such a person on the Realm King Continent?”","Shenmu Wang, curious, used his mind power to sense the other party’s aura and said calmly, “His strength isn’t that great. He’s a one-star Universe God or a quasi-two-star Universe God, not as exaggerated as you say!”","“Don’t be fooled by his appearance. When this guy goes crazy, no one can stop his divine power!”","“He is indeed a lunatic!” Hu Qing nodded solemnly.","Seeing them so tense, Bru spoke up, “But his divine power is less than two billion!”","“If you want to see him go crazy, let Brother Wushuang handle it!”","After Wu Zuo spoke, he looked at Jian Wushuang.","“No need to worry too much. I’m just curious about how this guy got here. Wasn’t he thrown into the abyss before? How did he end up on the Realm King Continent?”","“I’m afraid it’s intentional!”","After glancing twice, Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows furrowed.","The current Broly seemed like a different person, not displaying that madness. Instead, he looked somewhat honest, following behind a green-skinned girl like a guard.","There was also an elder and a proud-looking young man beside him.","Their strength was much greater than Broly’s, already quasi-three-star Universe Gods.","However, the leading girl was only a two-star Universe God.","It seemed that Broly was the weakest cultivator among them.","Moreover, he was despised by the elder and the young man.","Only the green-skinned girl was very polite to Broly.","After observing everything, Jian Wushuang withdrew his gaze.","He then turned to look at another side.","Those two mysterious figures that even he couldn’t see through.","Both were wearing black robes and had no aura.","One of them, a small figure, was floating in mid-air, exuding an extreme sense of mystery.","He didn’t tell the others about this to avoid causing them unnecessary tension.","“Uh-huh!”","When he inadvertently glanced at the small figure floating in mid-air, that person also looked at him, seemingly able to sense his gaze, and nodded at him.","Suddenly discovered, Jian Wushuang didn’t panic but returned a kind gaze.","However, he felt some pressure inside.","Originally thinking it would be an easy victory, he didn’t expect to encounter trouble.","These two mysterious figures gave him a lot of pressure.","There was also the troublesome Broly. Once discovered by the other side, he might revert to his former mad state.","Thinking about this gave him a bit of a headache.","He had just returned to the Realm King Continent, only to draw out these terrifying presences.","It would have been better to stay in the Realm King God Realm.","On second thought, leaving the Realm King God Realm had caused quite a bit of trouble as well.","With a sigh of frustration, he decided to take it one step at a time.","At this moment, the blood clouds in the sky closed.","This made everyone look up.","A massive face appeared in the clouds.","“I am the guardian of this place. You who enter the blood cloud space seeking opportunities will undoubtedly be crowned as the greatest!”","Buzz!","As soon as the voice fell, the giant pillars on the ground began to sink.","Until they reached the ground, they were only a foot high.","“What does this mean?”","Because the rules were different every time, even some Universe Gods who had entered this place several times didn’t know what the guardian was playing at.","“There are eight giant pillars here. As long as you stand on top, the pillars will rise by one zhang every breath. If there are no cultivators on the pillars, they will fall by one zhang every breath. When the pillar rises to ten thousand zhang, a blood light will automatically isolate everything, marking the victory!”","When these words were finished, the whole place was in an uproar.","The meaning was obvious.","Defend the pillar.","Ten thousand zhang meant ten thousand breaths, which was about one hour.","There were tens of thousands of Universe Gods here.","But only eight pillars.","Which meant that on average, each pillar would be attacked by thousands of strong contenders!","The difficulty was immense.","“What should we do?”","Wu Zuo turned to look at Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang.","Although their strength could compete, they needed others to assist them.","But Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang did not need assistance.","“How about this, Hu Qing and Brother Wushuang each take one pillar, and we assist?”","Wu Li was a bit hesitant; he didn’t dare stand on the pillars.","Being surrounded by countless strong contenders was not a pleasant experience.","Jian Wushuang glanced around, quickly forming a plan in his mind.","“Since everyone is here, let’s go up and enjoy the view from above!”","“Isn’t that a bit forced?”","Wu Zuo was also hesitant. His strength was inferior to Broly’s, and he would certainly be knocked down if he went up.","At this moment, the eight pillars were empty. No one dared to make the first move.","Everyone knew that the first ones up would definitely be attacked.","Jian Wushuang noticed their concerns and said, “Don’t worry, Hu Qing and I will guard you. We’ll let you occupy four pillars first, and then Hu Qing and I will each take one.”","“Right!” Wu Zuo slapped his forehead, finally realizing.","If no one was on the pillars, they would fall by one zhang, but with someone, they would rise by one zhang.","It was said to be ten thousand breaths, but this competition would definitely not end within ten thousand breaths.","Having made up their minds, Wu Zuo and Wu Li exchanged a glance.","“Then we won’t be polite!”","With that, they each flew to the nearest pillars.","Plop!","The two landed steadily on top of the pillars.","An ancient aura trembled.","“Huh?”","“Someone’s on the pillars!”","“Attack! Even if we can’t get on the pillars ourselves, we can’t let them!”","Several powerful Universe Gods, seeing Wu Zuo and Wu Li on the pillars, also stepped onto the giant pillars.","Although they hadn’t expected such rules this time.","Most of the strong contenders here came in groups.","They chose the strongest among them to go up first, while the others guarded.","The battle started instantly.","Facing the powerful attacks, Wu Li’s legs felt weak.","He shouted loudly, “Brother Wushuang, guard me!”","It wasn’t that he didn’t trust Hu Qing, but he felt Jian Wushuang was stronger.","Buzz!","As soon as Wu Li shouted, a blood-colored shield appeared around him.","Rumble!","Countless attacks landed on the blood shield.","Wu Li gasped for breath as he watched the explosive shockwaves. If he had taken the attacks himself, he would have been seriously injured in an instant."]},{"number":6225,"title":"Chapter 6225: Tasha","paragraphs":["Chapter 6225: Tasha","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Turning his head, Jian Wushuang glanced at him, already standing in front of him.","“Stand firm, no one can approach you!”","Jian Wushuang stood in front of Wu Li, looking down at the many strong figures below, raising his hand to strike.","A dark red beam of light directly divided the battlefield.","The recent attack had already surpassed the level of a six-star Universe God.","It directly stunned all those strong figures who wanted to come forward and cause trouble.","“So strong, he is actually a six-star Universe God!”","“Move to the next one!”","Realizing Jian Wushuang was a tough opponent, they left him aside and went to besiege Wu Zuo.","Unfortunately, they hit another iron wall.","Hu Qing’s attack was equally fierce. Without a shield to protect Wu Zuo, fearing that Wu Zuo might be instantly killed, he directly unleashed his strongest power. An ancient long staff swept across the entire battlefield.","As the staff fell, the Universe Gods dropped like raindrops.","The melee began, but around Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, no Universe God dared to offend.","They all went to attack the others.","Broly, whom Jian Wushuang paid special attention to, did not join the fight.","He was always following the green-skinned alien girl, standing on the outermost edge, with hollow eyes, showing no special expression.","But Jian Wushuang knew, when this guy went crazy, he was a combat monster.","Besides him, there were two other mysterious strong figures that caught his attention.","These two stood on pillars, and although there were attacks around them, they easily deflected them.","However, they did not strike heavily, as there were always disturbances.","On the remaining four pillars stood five-star Universe Gods, with dozens of four-star Universe Gods protecting them.","Some were not accompanied but had taken out benefits in advance to invite many four-star Universe Gods as protectors.","The weaker Universe Gods knew that this time there was no way to gain benefits, so they could only rely on those powerful Universe Gods, otherwise, they would have come in vain.","Although Universe Masters were weak, they reversed the situation in this battle.","Not by fighting, but by standing on the pillars, with each breath, the pillars could rise a hundred zhang.","In a hundred breaths, it could reach ten thousand zhang.","Those with a keen mind used this advantage, letting the Universe Masters stand up first, and when they reached nine thousand zhang, they would stand up themselves.","Using this trick, they sped up the progress of the battle.","“It can actually be done this way!”","Wu Zuo stared at the highest pillar in surprise, his mouth agape.","At this moment, their pillar was only a thousand zhang high.","Seeing through it, Jian Wushuang turned his head and said to Wu Li, “Let me go up!”","“Huh?”","“If you go up, what about me?”","“I can’t protect you!”","Wu Li was startled and a bit at a loss.","“Just stand aside and watch!” After Jian Wushuang stepped onto the pillar, with just one breath, the pillar suddenly soared a hundred feet.","This scene startled everyone.","No one expected Jian Wushuang to be a Universe Master.","With such immense power, he was actually a Universe Master.","The Universe Gods standing on the pillars all looked over, exclaiming, “How did he do that?”","“He can’t possibly be a Universe Master, his divine power is at least that of a six-star Universe God, how can he be a Universe Master?”","“There must be something wrong, where’s the guardian? Come out and explain!”","On the outermost pillars, two powerful mysterious figures also looked at Jian Wushuang.","“He is indeed not within the order!”","“A Universe Master, it seems he has broken the rules, once he successfully overcomes the tribulation, he might become a Spacetime God!”","Broly also witnessed this scene.","His hollow eyes fixed on Jian Wushuang, and his chest suddenly pounded.","Battle intent surged into his mind.","“Jian... Jian... Jian Wushuang!”","Hearing Broly speak, the green-skinned girl was surprised, “Big guy, you can talk?”","“Tasha, what’s this big oaf saying?”","The arrogant young man furrowed his brows. He had always thought Broly was a fool, never expecting him to speak.","Although Broly was a powerful Universe God, after arriving on the Realm King Continent, he somehow lost the ability to speak and his eyes became vacant, like a block of wood.","However, he had a good impression of the green-skinned alien girl who had awakened him, so he stayed by her side.","At this moment, seeing Jian Wushuang triggered fragments of memories to resurface in his mind.","“Hey, big guy, what’s your name?”","Hearing the girl’s call, the previously agitated Broly suddenly quieted down.","He stammered, “Broly!”","“Broly... what a strange name, but it sounds pleasant...”","This remark made the proud young man’s face darken. He snorted coldly, “Tasha, he’s just a slave, a fool. Why waste so many words? The priority is to occupy a pillar!”","“With our current strength, how can we capture a pillar? Do you have a plan?” The alien girl looked at the arrogant young man with disdain. She liked a fool but didn’t even want to glance at the young man. Seeing him at a loss for words, she pursed her lips and said, “Elder, why don’t you and Tuoshan join some teams? Otherwise, this trip will be in vain. Broly and I won’t get involved in this mess!”","The elder was the elder of their tribe, and the arrogant young man named Tuoshan was a prospective elder and the elder’s personal disciple.","“Miss, the leader’s task this time is for you to make a name for yourself. If you don’t participate in the battle, it will be hard to establish our Eternal God Domain’s reputation!”","Tasha took a deep breath and frowned, “But my father wouldn’t want me to risk my life in battle!”","As the standoff continued, Broly finally spoke a complete sentence.","“Capture a pillar, I... I will protect you!” He looked at the half-height Tasha with determination.","“You?”","Tuoshan sneered, “You think you can fight and protect Tasha? With your limited divine power, you’ll be cannon fodder. Who do you think you are?”","He couldn’t help but burst into mocking laughter.","Among the eight Blood Cloud Pillars, the super existences that could sweep everything were present, and the remaining ones were all five-star Universe Gods, with a large number of four-star Universe Gods by their side.","What could Broly, a mere two-star candidate, do?","Facing the ridicule, Broly didn’t retort, but his hollow eyes showed determination.","The elder, however, was pleased to hear this. He knew that his young lady had a good impression of Broly, and he wanted to make a name for the Eternal God Domain in this battle, so he chimed in, “Miss, Broly is right. I can also protect you.”","“No matter what, this old man can reach the peak strength of a five-star Universe God. If the young lady is willing to offer some treasures, we can completely recruit a group of four-star Universe God guardians. As long as we capture a pillar, the Eternal God Domain will surely stand up again on the Realm King Continent, and even restore its former glory!”"]},{"number":6226,"title":"Chapter 6226: Secret News of the Eternal Divine Domain","paragraphs":["Chapter 6226: Secret News of the Eternal Divine Domain","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Absolutely not!” Tasha shook her head firmly and said, “It’s too dangerous. Many people will die!”","“Die?”","If other experts heard this, they would definitely laugh out loud.","They were already Universe Gods, yet still cared about death.","It was simply childish.","However, the elder was already used to this and earnestly said, “Miss, don’t forget the promise you made to the leader when you left. If you can’t fulfill it, I can only take you back to the Divine Domain. By then, you won’t be able to come out again!”","The meaning of the words was very clear, it was a threat.","Tasha was somewhat uncertain. She glanced at the elder, her eyes filled with hesitation.","Seeing her hesitation, Tuoshan, who was standing beside her, spoke up, “Tasha, don’t worry. I also have the strength of a quasi-five-star, which is enough to protect you. We just need to pick a weaker pillar. At that time, you don’t need to do anything; just stand on the pillar. As for the treasures spent, it’s nothing. Our Divine Domain doesn’t lack treasures; what we lack is the opportunity to stand on the Realm King Continent again!”","“But...” Tasha was still somewhat uneasy.","Seeing this, the elder seized the opportunity and said, “Miss Tasha, don’t forget those once noble ascended warriors who sacrificed for the tribe. Are you willing to let the Divine Domain tribe be buried in the grave of the Realm King Continent? It’s time for us to stand out. As long as we play a role in this war and make a name for ourselves, we can once again illuminate the entire continent!”","“Illuminate the Divine Domain?”","Although Tasha was naive, she sensed something amiss and said in a low voice, “Elder, Tuoshan, are you hiding something from me?”","“This...”","The two exchanged glances and felt there was no need to hide it anymore, so they told her the truth.","Long ago, the Eternal Divine Domain was very famous on the Realm King Continent and had produced many super beings.","Unfortunately, during an attack by the realm beasts, all those strong beings perished, and the entire Divine Domain was corrupted by the realm beasts.","The corrupted strong beings of the Divine Domain became even more powerful.","They helped the realm beasts shatter the Realm King Continent.","However, they were soon suppressed by the seventh generation Realm King.","They were suppressed until today, only recently seeing some relaxation.","Some people from the Eternal Divine Domain were allowed to come out and walk around the Realm King Continent.","But to make the Eternal Divine Domain shine again was not so simple.","Now there was an opportunity right in front of them!","Competing for the fortune here, obtaining the super Origin Source.","This could get the Realm King’s pardon.","The elder had known this for a long time, but the leader’s will was not firm, wanting to stay isolated from the world.","However, the elder and his disciple, Tuoshan, didn’t want to live that way anymore.","They were once the most noble Eternal Gods on the Realm King Continent.","Now they were nailed to the pillar of shame, how could they be willing!","That’s why they came here.","Not only to show their faces but more importantly, to help the Realm King.","Although they didn’t even know where the Realm King was, they had to first make a name for themselves, or rather, prove their worth before they could meet the Realm King.","After learning all this, Tasha’s eyes flickered, and she clenched her fists.","When she looked up, her eyes had already become determined.","“For the Divine Domain!”","She murmured, and Tuoshan and the elder nodded and murmured as well.","Only Broly stood foolishly in place, his gaze fixed on Tasha.","As long as she nodded, he would explode.","“Elder, shall we go occupy one of the divine pillars?”","Tasha turned to look at the eight divine pillars.","Among them, two had already been abandoned by everyone.","They were the divine pillars of Jian Wushuang and Guardian Hu Qing.","Jian Wushuang’s dedicated divine pillar had already reached eight thousand zhang.","It was the fastest-moving divine pillar. Originally, there had been another divine pillar that reached nine thousand zhang, but it was knocked down by Hu Qing.","Now it had fallen back to one thousand zhang.","An elder was about to speak when he was interrupted by Broly.","Frowning with some displeasure, he refrained from saying anything due to the young lady’s fondness for the other party. Instead, he looked over.","Broly raised his head and pointed towards Jian Wushuang’s direction, saying, “Let’s seize that one!”","The elder’s face instantly darkened upon hearing this.","“Indeed a fool. Can’t you see that existence is a Universe God above six-stars? To seize that divine pillar would require at least a hundred elders or ancient Eternal Divine Generals from all generations. Who do you think you are?”","Tuoshan couldn’t help but mock him.","Even Tasha shook her head in despair this time and comforted, “Broly, our strength is limited. We must avoid that existence and not take risks!”","Broly seemed to follow Tasha’s words unconditionally and did not retort. Instead, he nodded heavily.","He gradually suppressed his battle intent towards Jian Wushuang.","The elder ignored Broly and turned to Tasha.","“Miss, I have already contacted a quasi-five-star Universe God. He is currently besieging the seventh divine pillar, which is the weakest. We only need to offer enough Ancient Divine Stones, and they will help us seize that divine pillar. Additionally, 30 four-star Universe Gods will assist!”","He had already made all the necessary contacts in secret.","After confirming everything, he directly contacted the quasi-five-star Universe God.","The Universe Gods on the seventh divine pillar seemed to sense something was wrong. Just as they were about to call for help, they saw several Universe Gods attacking them.","Among them was a powerful elder from the divine realm, with terrifying divine power, already a pinnacle expert among five-star Universe Gods. With one punch, he blasted the five-star Universe God off the pillar.","The seventh divine pillar changed hands once again.","Such events had become commonplace.","With each rise of the pillar, the battles became extraordinarily fierce.","Tasha’s eyes showed reluctance, but she still landed on the pillar. With a wave of her hands, a white light shield appeared around her.","“Broly, come to me. It’s too dangerous outside!”","This was a life-saving treasure given to her by her father, capable of withstanding a full-force attack from a six-star Universe God. For a five-star Universe God to break it, it would take a great deal of effort.","Additionally, with the protection of the divine realm elders and dozens of bribed Universe Gods around, her pillar was actually very stable.","There was no need for Broly to take action.","Besides, in her eyes, Broly’s strength was not formidable.","He was merely a quasi-two-star Universe God.","He would be of no use and would only die in vain if he went.","Broly looked at Jian Wushuang’s position once more before nodding heavily.","He walked to Tasha’s side, his burly figure like a divine tower.","Although he loved to fight, he had to choose his opponents wisely.","He didn’t even spare a glance at the Universe Gods in front of him.","Naturally, he didn’t intend to take action.","Tuoshan saw this and looked at Broly with extreme disdain.","“You just said you wanted to protect Tasha, but now you’re hiding behind a woman. I underestimated you!”","He initially thought Broly was a fool, but it turned out he was quite smart.","If he rashly went to battle, a two-star Universe God would quickly fall.","Hiding behind was indeed a good choice.","Buzz!"]},{"number":6227,"title":"Chapter 6227: Too Greedy","paragraphs":["Chapter 6227: Too Greedy","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just as the seventh divine pillar was changing ownership, Jian Wushuang’s first divine pillar had reached nine thousand nine hundred feet.","It was currently the tallest divine pillar.","“Wu Li, come up!”","Jian Wushuang took a step and descended from the divine pillar.","“Alright, alright!”","Wu Li, who had been standing awkwardly behind Jian Wushuang, perked up immediately upon hearing his name and quickly stepped onto the divine pillar.","“Just one hundred feet left. I’ll trouble you to guard me a bit longer, Brother Wushuang!”","“Rest assured, you’ll be the first!”","After descending from the divine pillar, Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow and glanced at the seventh divine pillar. With just one look, he withdrew his gaze.","He could sense that Broly seemed to be watching him as well. Their brief eye contact stirred a powerful desire for battle within him.","“Whew!”","Taking a deep breath, he did not linger at the first divine pillar but moved to the second one.","Although the pillars were far apart, it was just a blink of an eye for him.","“Hu Qing, go to the first divine pillar. I’ll take over here!”","Hu Qing did not hesitate and went directly to Wu Li’s place.","Wu Zuo also understood the situation and stepped down from the divine pillar, allowing Jian Wushuang to ascend.","This would save a lot of time.","“It seems you don’t need me much!”","Hearing the voice, Jian Wushuang turned his head indifferently towards Blu and said, “What, feeling itchy?”","“A bit!” Blu nodded.","From the beginning, he and Shenmu Wang had been sitting cross-legged in the void, with Hu Qing alone blocking the attacks from those Universe Gods.","The key was that these attacks didn’t last long before dissipating.","This left him, a super strongman fused with a true god’s body, feeling lonely.","“Well then, I’ll point you in the right direction. Over at the seventh divine pillar, the attacking strongmen are the most numerous. You can completely mix in, and take the opportunity to kick out that alien girl. From what I see, the only strongman by her side is that old man with green scales, a five-star Universe God, who is no match for you at all!”","“Oh?” Blu raised his head and looked towards the seventh divine pillar. Although it was some distance away, he could still see the situation clearly.","It was indeed the weakest among these pillars.","But he didn’t know that it was a trap.","He did not recognize Broly.","“Go ahead, the pillar here will soon reach ten thousand feet. I’ll come to help you shortly!”","There was a hint of a bad smile in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","He wanted to take the opportunity to test Broly’s current strength.","On the surface, a two-star Universe God posed no great threat to Blu.","Wu Zuo, standing nearby, also saw through his intentions and added fuel to the fire, “Brother Bro, when you fought with Lan Yan back then, your strength was extremely formidable. Now you probably have the power of a six-star Universe God. Sweeping through the seventh divine pillar shouldn’t be much of a problem. It’s a good chance to show us your skills!”","Blu had been suppressing his strength for many years without a real battle.","He stretched his shoulders, licked his lips, and said with battle spirit, “It’s been a while since I stretched my muscles. I’ll go meet those Universe Gods and see how much effort it’ll take!”","With that, he broke through the air and left.","His divine power suddenly surged to that of a quasi-six-star Universe God, and the terrifying oppressive force made the surrounding Universe Gods avoid him.","“Not good, this guy is with the people from the first and second divine pillars!”","Many Universe Gods looked over, treating Blu with extra caution.","“Don’t you think you’re being too greedy?” an elder from the Divine Domain asked, stepping forward as Blu approached the seventh divine pillar.","His gaze was dark, and there was a hint of apprehension in his heart.","The divine power Blu had just emitted was already at the level of a quasi-six-star.","This was before the battle even started, yet his divine power was already so formidable.","He was definitely not a minor character and very likely a six-star Universe God.","The gap between him and a quasi-six-star was too vast. Moreover, Blu was allied with two other super beings, so the elder had to be careful. One wrong move, and he could fall.","Blu landed among the crowd and, with a wave of his hand, sent a slash of energy that directly repelled the Universe Gods attacking the seventh divine pillar.","“I don’t like to bully people, but I want this divine pillar. Anyone guarding it can fight me. If you lose, I will retreat!” His words were arrogant, but no one dared to challenge him.","The elder from the Divine Domain looked a bit embarrassed. Among the strong guards of the pillar, besides him, no one dared to fight Blu. Moreover, those people were hired by him; they wouldn’t risk their lives, especially not against a quasi-six-star or even a six-star Universe God. A four-star Universe God couldn’t hold out for a moment, and a quasi-five-star could only watch from the sidelines.","Tuoshan, seeing Blu appear, also looked downcast and quietly asked, “Master, what should we do now?”","“You take the others to protect Miss Tasha. Leave the rest to me!” The elder from the Divine Domain seemed to have made a heavy decision. He clenched his hands tightly, shattering his robe to reveal a complete blue-scaled battle armor.","Facing Blu, he said solemnly, “Since you insist, I will fight you alone. This battle involves no one else!”","“Fine!” Blu replied calmly. “If you can hold me off for a quarter of an hour, you win!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he attacked directly. His powerful divine power stirred the surrounding spacetime, creating waves. Blu’s green arm extended thousands of feet, rushing toward the elder from the Divine Domain.","Despite Blu’s formidable approach, the elder didn’t panic. He crossed his arms, trapping Blu’s arm in his embrace, and with a sudden force, snapped it off. At that moment, his powerful divine power was revealed, surging from a quasi-six-star Universe God to six billion.","The terrifying combat strength made everyone gasp. The onlookers were all taken aback, realizing that no matter who won, they wouldn’t be able to take this divine pillar. They began to retreat one by one.","However, three people remained, their eyes burning with intensity. These three looked different but had a strange symbol on their foreheads, clearly from the same faction, and their strength was not weak, each possessing quasi-five-star power.","“Jie jie, a quasi-six-star Universe God, comparable to an ordinary six-star Universe God. This stage’s strong practitioners are perfect for us!” The leader, a gaunt-faced man, exuded an evil aura in his eyes. The two beside him nodded, revealing greedy looks.","“Wait a bit longer. They still have hidden divine power. No need to rush!”","...","The battle between Blu and the elder from the Divine Domain had reached a fever pitch.","Blu, with one arm broken, didn’t restore it immediately but fought single-armed, still managing to press his opponent.","His divine power broke through six billion, making him a genuine six-star Universe God.","Over the years, his divine power had indeed increased significantly.","Initially, just by partially merging with the divine body of the Danbao, he became a four-star Universe God.","After fully merging, his divine power reached quasi-six-star.","With years of cultivation, he had reached the level of a six-star Universe God."]},{"number":6228,"title":"Chapter 6228: Battle for the Divine Pillar (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6228: Battle for the Divine Pillar (1)","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Ha ha, this is exhilarating!”","Blu was struck by his opponent and thrown against the edge of a stone pillar. He didn’t take the opportunity to sneak attack Tasha but leisurely stood up, tearing off the tattered white skin on his body.","He revealed a sturdy upper body with extremely noticeable green muscles.","“Ha!”","He roared and directly restored his broken left arm, moving it slightly. He calmly said, “Warm-up is over, now we can really fight!”","“What?”","The elder from the Divine Domain was a bit dumbfounded. He had just used all his strength to barely draw even.","He didn’t expect this was just the beginning.","Before he could react, Blu appeared behind him, kicked him in the back, and sent him plummeting from the void.","As he was rapidly falling and just trying to steady himself, another heavy blow landed on his head.","Boom!","This heavy blow made his consciousness fuzzy, and the world spun around him.","Blu clenched his hand, condensing a wave of energy in his palm, and shot it at the constantly falling elder from the Divine Domain.","Boom boom boom!!!","Countless waves of energy burst out from his hand.","The impact caused the spacetime to tremble.","“If you don’t surrender now, you’ll only face your doom!”","Blu reminded him, starting to condense an even larger wave of energy with both hands.","This scene reminded Broly, who was on the pillar, of Jian Wushuang.","His eyes suddenly began to burst.","Tasha, who had been watching the battle, noticed Broly’s abnormality and exclaimed, “Broly, what’s wrong with you?”","She thought Broly was scared and quickly comforted, “Don’t worry, nothing will happen. At worst, we can give up this divine pillar!”","Tuoshan, who noticed something was wrong from a distance, also flew over to the pillar, concerned for Tasha’s safety.","“We’re doomed this time. Even the master isn’t an opponent; we can only give up the divine pillar!”","“If I had known, I would have brought senior brother too. With his strength, he shouldn’t be weaker than that guy!”","Tasha, however, shook her head and said silently, “Besides the Eternal God, no one can easily take the divine pillar. Don’t forget he has comrades!”","The Eternal God!","That was a title bestowed upon the super strong individuals throughout the ages in the Eternal Divine Domain.","From ancient times to the present, only a few super strong individuals have earned that title in the Eternal Divine Domain.","Tasha’s father was one of them.","Only such super beings could dominate a place like this, just like Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","Unfortunately, this time they came in a hurry.","Tasha herself hadn’t thought much about it.","Tuoshan now remembered that Blu was with Jian Wushuang and others.","He turned his head to look at the first divine pillar, which had completely acquired the Blood Cloud Shield, being the first to meet the requirements.","Then the second divine pillar also reached 9,000 feet.","It would soon succeed.","And now they came to seize the seventh divine pillar.","Among their group of six, two were absolute super strong individuals.","Another one was fighting with the elder, a genuine six-star Universe God.","The remaining three were not to be underestimated, as they could all obtain divine pillars.","They indeed had no chance.","Tuoshan, who had been standing proudly, also lowered his head.","Tasha’s thin lips parted slightly, wanting to admit defeat on behalf of the elder.","But someone gently patted her shoulder.","Turning her head, it was naturally Broly.","“Let me.”","Broly’s words were brief. He took a small step forward and moved in front of Tasha.","In such a situation, he still wanted to take action.","Although Tuoshan wanted to mock him, he couldn’t help but sigh at the other’s loyalty, reluctantly advising, “Forget it, your strength isn’t enough, far from enough!”","“Wait... wait for me!” Broly finished speaking and directly jumped off the divine pillar.","Tasha anxiously shouted, “Broly!”","“This big fool!” Tuoshan took a deep breath.","Indeed, it was loyalty, but unfortunately, he didn’t consider the situation.","This kind of battle was not one that a two-star Universe God could participate in.","The two of them looked simultaneously at the battle below.","They also saw Broly descending.","Tasha didn’t hesitate and immediately shouted, “Senior, we admit defeat and are willing to relinquish the divine pillar!”","“Impossible!”","The elder of the Divine Domain, although seriously injured, still didn’t want to give up.","This was a battle to restore the glory of their Eternal Divine Domain. Even if he died, he couldn’t admit defeat.","If they died in battle, perhaps the Realm King God would see it and give their Eternal Divine Domain a chance to rise again.","If they easily admitted defeat, everything would become a shadow.","At this moment, he hadn’t noticed Broly appearing.","Instead, he turned to look at Blu, firmly saying, “In this battle, I can die at your hands, but I beg you to spare the people on the pillar. They pose no threat to you!”","“Why bother?” Blu shook his head lightly.","For a moment, he felt a bit soft-hearted.","Originally, he wasn’t like this, but after merging with the life divine body of Danbao, he felt compassion for all living things and was somewhat reluctant.","He thought about sealing first and then taking the divine pillar.","But before he could make a move, a terrifying figure had already silently descended behind him.","The elder of the Divine Domain, who was facing Broly, saw it clearly. Seeing Broly’s transformation, his eyes narrowed slightly.","Just as he was about to speak, he realized that Broly had undergone a tremendous change.","Especially in his divine power.","This scene also made the onlookers notice.","“Another five-star Universe God!”","“Unfortunately, against a six-star Universe God, it’s of no use!”","Blu thought the same, suddenly turning around and punching Broly’s chest, sending him flying billions of miles away.","This blow was enough to seriously injure a five-star Universe God.","Tasha, on the pillar, was extremely worried.","Tuoshan was shocked that Broly had hidden his divine power.","Pretending to be a two-star Universe God around them for so long, it turned out he was a five-star Universe God.","But it didn’t change the current situation.","Just as he thought this, he was proven wrong.","Broly steadily stopped his flying figure and then charged at Blu again.","And this time, his divine power surged again, reaching the peak of a five-star Universe God.","“How... how did he do that?”","Tuoshan’s pupils contracted, staring incredulously at Broly below.","Tasha was the same. She didn’t expect Broly to be so powerful.","“Good!”","Only the elder of the Divine Domain was secretly delighted, taking the initiative to attack, wanting to join forces with Broly to besiege Blu.","The battle became intense once more.","Blu then blocked the elder of the Divine Domain and took a closer look at Broly. What he saw shocked him.","“Life is changing?”","After merging with Danbao’s life god body, he could see the life body of practitioners with a glance.","For example, the elder of the Divine Domain’s life body was a special life from the Realm God Continent, rare in the Eternal Divine Domain.","This kind of life was not unique but belonged only to the Realm God Continent.","To be precise, it was a life that couldn’t cultivate in spacetime.","Only on the Realm God Continent could they cultivate.","But Broly was different. His god body transformed according to his opponents."]},{"number":6229,"title":"Chapter 6229: Battle for the Divine Pillar (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6229: Battle for the Divine Pillar (2)","Encountering strength with strength!","It was just a brief burst, but it had already reached the level of a quasi-six-star Universe God.","Blu felt a pressure approaching.","He turned and punched, divine power erupting completely, and the shadow of his fist smashed into the chest of the elder of the Divine Realm like a stream of light.","Crack!","A sound of the divine body shattering came, and the elder of the Divine Realm’s divine body directly shattered.","Pfft!","Blood sprayed out, dyeing the void red.","One more hit, and he would probably fall.","Seeing this, Broly, still retaining some consciousness, shouted loudly, “Go... go away!”","He wanted to fight Blu alone.","“Still not conceding?”","Blu didn’t know how strong Broly was. He thought that severely injuring the elder of the Divine Realm would be enough to make the other party retreat.","Unexpectedly, Broly’s fighting spirit soared, and he charged towards him again.","Divine power continued to rise, quickly surpassing six hundred million.","“Hmph!” Blu snorted coldly, gathering power again. He struck out with both fists, sweeping the sky like two flood dragons, shattering everything as they charged forward.","These two punches were enough to kill a quasi-six-star Universe God.","It was clear he intended to kill.","At this moment, Broly had just stabilized at the level of a six-star Universe God. Even if he didn’t die, he would be severely injured.","Yet he didn’t dodge at all, meeting the attack head-on.","His hands opened, grabbing the necks of the two flood dragons, and with a forceful squeeze, he instantly broke Blu’s killing move.","“What?”","Blu’s face darkened. He hadn’t expected Broly to be so powerful, breaking his killing move and completely ignoring his attack methods.","His defense was astonishing, his power comparable to a six-star Universe God, and crucially, he could keep growing stronger.","He instantly felt a bit panicked.","His figure suddenly soared, divine power crackling around him as he dodged Broly’s assault. His eyes sank, beginning to gather his strongest secret technique.","“Demonic Flash Tribulation!”","Blu roared, and the surrounding spacetime began to condense into a mass, continuously generating demonic power.","Terrifying life force swept in.","All the beings present felt their breaths quicken.","Even Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing could clearly feel that attraction.","But it posed no threat to them, merely making their bodies uncomfortable.","Jian Wushuang watched all this, feeling a bit surprised. He wasn’t surprised by Broly’s increase in strength, but by Blu’s growth over the years.","Since fusing with the life divine body of Danbao, in terms of potential, he was definitely among the top three in the Northern Spacetime.","Only weaker than himself and Hu Qing.","“Uzo, it’s your turn!”","He stood up, directly leaving the divine pillar.","He still reached ten thousand feet.","Wu Li was the first to reach ten thousand feet, and now the second divine pillar had also been successfully reached.","The third divine pillar was guarded by a quasi-six-star Universe God, with several Five-Star Universe Gods protecting it.","It had already reached over nine thousand feet.","Unfortunately, Hu Qing and Divine Wood King snatched the peach.","Now only he, Hu Qing, and Blu were left idle.","“It’s time to meet Broly!”","Seeing Blu use his strongest secret technique, it was almost time for him to act.","Hu Qing also approached.","The two nodded to each other and then flew towards the seventh divine pillar.","But just as they were flying over.","Blu’s ultimate move was released.","A rotating light wave shot down from high altitude, aiming straight at Broly.","“Ah!”","Broly struggled to resist with both hands, his divine body trembling.","The continuously rising divine power actually began to decline.","The difficult resistance forced him to retreat continuously.","At this moment, the three evil powerhouses who had been watching the battle suddenly","erupted.","“Prepare to act!”","Swish!","In almost an instant.","The speed of the three reached an unimaginable height.","Even Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing in the distance didn’t react in time.","Jian Wushuang saw three black shadows rush to Broly’s side. Two of them supported Broly, while the third took out an unexpected treasure.","The Demon Jar!","Seeing the mark on it, Jian Wushuang’s pupils contracted, and he instantly sped up, intending","to intercept the three of them.","But as soon as he moved, he was trapped by a powerful binding force.","“Huh?”","This invisible binding force seemed to come from the supreme rules of the Realm God","Continent.","“Who is it?”","He frowned. Previously, even the blood cloud’s mental suppression couldn’t affect him, but","now he was trapped.","Hu Qing also noticed something strange and tried to help, but he was also blocked.","Both of them were immobilized.","They could only watch as Broly’s power was absorbed by the Demon Jar.","“Haha, this time it’s definitely enough, let’s go!”","The bald-headed brute in the lead laughed, stowed the Demon Jar, and kicked Broly away","from the sky.","Above, Bru stared down in astonishment, not knowing what to do.","Broly, who had been desperately resisting, was now defenseless after being ambushed by the","three five-star Universe Gods.","Even Broly was a bit stunned, thinking that these three Universe Gods were helping him. For a moment, he stood in the sky, at a loss.","Seeing the three about to escape, Jian Wushuang hurriedly reminded, “Bru, stop them!”","“Got it!” Bru responded without hesitation and tried to stop the three.","But as soon as he made a move, the three dodged.","“Big guy, you’d better not find trouble for yourself!”","The bald-headed strongman in the lead took out a gray-white token and crushed it, saying disdainfully, “Now you bugs can continue to fight over that trash!”","With his words, a spacetime passage opened, and the three of them instantly entered.","Jian Wushuang could no longer hold back, and his divine power surged.","“Super Eternal Transformation!”","Boom!","His divine power instantly reached the peak of six-star.","But this wasn’t enough!","A dark red power with electric arcs rose up.","“Ultimate Eternal Transformation!”","He roared, and his divine power broke through to eight-star!","The Beast God Weapon appeared behind him.","In an instant, he broke free from the binding force.","This scene shocked the two mysterious black-robed powerhouses on the fifth and sixth god","pillars.","“He actually has eight-star combat power!”","An eight-star Universe God was already a super powerhouse on the Realm God Continent.","The Realm Kings of the four spacetime dimensions at most reached six-star.","The Northern Realm King was an exception because he didn’t have a divine body. If he did, he","could reach five-star or even six-star Universe God.","The Great Realm King had combat power reaching the seven-star Universe God level.","But all of these were true gods!","They had the potential to advance to spacetime gods.","They had unlimited potential.","But now, Jian Wushuang, a cultivator from Northern Spacetime, had divine power surpassing","the Great Realm King.","How could they not be surprised?","“I can’t stop him!”","The tall black-robed powerhouse on the sixth god pillar exclaimed and had to let go.","This also caught Jian Wushuang’s attention. He turned his head and gave the two a cold","glance.","Then he rushed towards the spacetime passage.","The appearance of the Demon Jar in the real world made him vigilant.","Because this treasure was used to deal with realm beasts. Where would realm beasts be on the","Realm God Continent?"]},{"number":6230,"title":"Chapter 6230: A Solo Journey","paragraphs":["Chapter 6230: A Solo Journey","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, before he could reach the entrance of the spacetime passage, he was stopped by two figures.","“Jian Wushuang, your task is complete!”","The indifferent tone left Jian Wushuang momentarily stunned.","At the same time, he had a suspicion.","At this moment, Wu Zuo and others also caught up.","“What do you mean?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows, wanting to confirm the facts.","But there was an insurmountable force that seemed to be restraining him.","This also proved that this matter needed to be resolved beyond the room and didn’t require his intervention.","The figure in the black robe said indifferently, “It’s simple, Wu Zuo’s promise has been fulfilled. The remaining matters are none of your concern!”","“Could it be that you are...?”","Wu Zuo’s expression became serious as he recalled the promise made earlier; otherwise, he wouldn’t have come to this place.","The black-robed figure just nodded without directly answering.","After giving Jian Wushuang a thoughtful glance, he flashed into the spacetime passage.","Everyone present was stunned by this sudden scene.","Tasha and the elders also took the opportunity to lead the injured Broly away through the spacetime passage.","Knowing that staying would bring no benefit, they could only flee first.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care in the slightest.","In his heart, he was puzzled about the purpose of the two black-robed figures, but on second thought, since it no longer concerned him, it was all the better. Even if there was a Realm Beast crisis, it had nothing to do with him.","He was just a cultivator after all.","After witnessing everything in the Consciousness Realm, he understood the ultimate secret of the Starry Sky.","His curiosity had also waned.","Sometimes, trying to let go is the greatest mercy to oneself.","“Alright, let’s not just stand here. Since the promise has been fulfilled, whether to stay or leave is up to you!”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang let go of many things, thinking that the Realm God Continent was so vast, and he hadn’t really explored it properly. There was no need to get caught up in those so-called conspiracies.","Moreover, with his current strength, no one would dare to scheme against the Northern Spacetime, so he could venture freely.","Wu Zuo and the others also breathed a sigh of relief. Although they had two super strong practitioners, Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang, the initial promise still put some pressure on them. Now, with nothing to worry about, a sense of fighting spirit emerged instead.","They decided to stay and continue exploring.","But Jian Wushuang had no such interest.","He looked down on the opportunities in this place; even if he obtained them, they would be useless.","Seeing that everyone wanted to stay, he didn’t leave immediately but protected Wu Zuo and others as they stood on the divine pillar, while he himself did not ascend.","“Everyone, it’s time to part ways!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and voiced his thoughts.","He was not yet a Universe God because he was walking a new path, different from ordinary cultivators.","The opportunities he needed were different.","The group remained silent for a while until Wu Zuo finally spoke, “Actually, I noticed this after you revived. Over the years, you have seen it too. Our strength is gradually falling behind yours and Hu Qing’s. It’s indeed time for us to part ways.”","“I won’t leave!” Hu Qing rarely smiled and said, “I’ve already comprehended my future and understand my endpoint. Further efforts would be futile. Perhaps I will live with everyone for a long time to come!”","Such optimism from Hu Qing made Jian Wushuang very pleased. He patted Hu Qing’s shoulder and said, “That’s good, at least it won’t be so tiring. As for me, I don’t even know how I will pass my Divine Tribulation. Perhaps in the coming time, I’ll be constantly on the move!”","“If you get tired, you can come back anytime!”","Wuli and the Divine Wood King also looked over together.","After bidding farewell to everyone, Jian Wushuang casually waved his hand, forcibly breaking open a passage through spacetime. After taking one last look at everyone, he hurriedly left.","As he departed, the consciousness within the blood cloud let out a sigh of relief.","Others only knew that Jian Wushuang’s true combat power was that of an eight-star Universe God, but no one knew that his consciousness could shield everything, surpassing the consciousness within the blood cloud. If he wished, he could set new rules for this place.","...","In the northwest border of the Realm God Continent.","This place was a gathering spot for myriad races and also a place where the practitioners from the four great spacetimes dared not tread.","This was because the beings here originated from before the Realm God Continent shattered.","Their ancestors were buried deep here.","Speaking of which, the Realm God Continent had the Star Field of the Gods as well as the Graves of the Gods.","And the ancient wilderness in the northwest was the core of the God’s graveyard.","Countless powerful beings were buried here.","Among them were some with strength comparable to Jian Wushuang.","There were even graveyards of nine-star Universe Gods.","The entire ancient wilderness was far larger than the Qianmen Star Field.","It occupied about one-tenth of the entire northwest continent.","Yet, the number of powerful beings here was more than half of the northwest continent.","The reason was simple: the God’s graves.","Jian Wushuang walked in the void, shrinking his figure to the size of a Universe Master, attracting no one’s attention.","Universe Masters were too common in this place.","No one cared who passed through here.","However, Jian Wushuang kept observing the continent below.","“The Tomb of Zhu Huo!”","On a majestic divine mountain below, there was a dazzling tombstone. Though it was said to be dazzling, it did not shine with white light but with a glimmer of black light.","The inscription on the tombstone was ancient, exuding an indestructible aura.","“The fall of a powerful being must nourish an area. The Universe Gods nearby are likely the descendants of this Universe God!”","He thought to himself. His true body remained still, while a strand of his consciousness drifted downward.","Below the divine mountain, numerous large cities sprawled.","To him, the powerful beings in these cities were all of different races.","All of them had retractable wings on their backs, whether they were Universe Masters or Universe Gods.","Jian Wushuang’s consciousness transformed into an avatar, retaining only the realm of a Universe Master with a very faint aura. Others would only think he was an outsider Universe Master.","As he entered a small city near the divine mountain, not many people paid attention to him, each busy with their own affairs.","Though it appeared to be a mundane city, it was a super city accommodating hundreds of thousands of Universe Masters.","There were dozens of Universe Gods alone.","And this was just one city.","Before entering the northwest continent, he had only roughly understood the situation here, knowing that there was an ancient wilderness considered the core.","He knew nothing else.","This time, he descended as an avatar to explore the situation.","Since time was nearly infinite, he could take his time to explore.","On his way here, he had spent millions of eons, stopping and starting, and had acquired some peculiar treasures, though none were helpful for his Divine Tribulation.","Now, seeking opportunities for his Divine Tribulation was like grasping at straws; he could only take one step at a time.","As he reached the city center and just stopped, a young man dressed in splendid attire approached him."]},{"number":6231,"title":"Chapter 6231: Xiang Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 6231: Xiang Family","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior, are you from another region?”","The young man had wings on his back, looked extremely handsome, and his manners were courteous, making people feel very comfortable.","Jian Wushuang was surprised and asked, “How did you know?”","There were still quite a few humans here, and the other party could tell at a glance that he was an outsider.","“It’s simple. Senior doesn’t have the aura of the Wild Ancient Domain or the aura of the Zhu HuoGod. I guessed that Senior must be from outside!”","“Oh!” Jian Wushuang’s interest was immediately piqued.","Speaking of this aura, he had indeed studied it.","He hadn’t found it particularly unique, but he didn’t expect that the experts here paid so much attention to it.","“If Senior doesn’t have a place to stay, why not come to my Xiang family to rest first? In Giant Deer City, the Xiang family still has some influence. No matter why Senior has come, we can help a little!”","The young man’s face lit up with pride when he mentioned his family.","“Then I’ll take you up on your offer!”","Jian Wushuang did not refuse and agreed immediately.","Following the young man into the east side of the city, there were high-walled courtyards everywhere, each exuding an extraordinary aura, and all inhabited by some super experts.","But to Jian Wushuang, they were much weaker.","Even those Universe Gods posed no threat to him.","So he agreed so readily.","It was also to learn about some things in the Wild Ancient Domain.","The young man stopped in front of a grand courtyard and gestured, “Please, Senior!”","Stepping into the Xiang residence, a breeze carried a scent that made Jian Wushuang’s nose twitch.","That scent was very familiar, one he had been fortunate to smell many years ago.","“Blood, a metallic scent?”","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","He hadn’t smelled this scent outside the gate, but as soon as he entered the residence, he detected it.","“Friend Xiang Yang, the formation in your residence is truly remarkable!”","He pretended to praise, hoping to get some information.","At this moment, his avatar was just an ordinary Ninth Tribulation Universe Master, with divine power only at forty million.","Not even a demigod.","His mental power was the same, after all, it wasn’t his true body.","So, he hadn’t sensed that aura through the courtyard. He could have had his true body descend to investigate directly, but there was no need for that.","The young man who had invited him, Xiang Yang, got excited when he heard about their formation, “Senior indeed has sharp eyes. The formation here was personally set up by a Universe God, who specializes in formations and was once a disciple of the Fire God!”","This identity was indeed quite intimidating.","The God of Fire, Zhu Huo, had fallen countless years ago. Because the Realm God Continent had shattered back then, most of the Universe Gods had perished, leaving behind only a few rising stars.","The fact that there were still remnants of Universe Gods also genuinely surprised Jian Wushuang.","After expressing his admiration, he didn’t ask further questions.","Xiang Yang instructed his servants to prepare a banquet to entertain the guest.","Jian Wushuang didn’t decline and, after a brief tour of the front courtyard, began discussing some matters related to the vicinity of Zhu Huo’s tomb.","As they walked, he listened and nodded frequently, displaying a look of astonishment.","But in reality, it was just as expected.","This place backed onto Mount Huoshen, which was also the tombstone mountain of the God of Fire, Zhu Huo.","Zhu Huo was a six-star Universe God before the shattering of the Realm God Continent.","Whether before the shattering or on the new continent, a six-star Universe God was an extremely formidable force.","However, compared to Jian Wushuang, they were far inferior.","Now, let alone a six-star Universe God, even an eight-star Universe God was insignificant in his eyes.","Because his own strength had already surpassed eight stars.","“Senior Wushuang, although there aren’t many cities around Mount Huoshen, there are many forces. Firstly, there’s the Zhu family. This goes without saying, as they are the most blessed by the God of Fire!”","This Jian Wushuang knew well.","When a Universe God fell, the first to be rewarded was the Origin Source of the Realm God Continent, followed by the place where they perished.","Then came the expansion of the bloodline power.","When ascending to Universe God, one could enhance the family bloodline, and the same occurred upon falling, returning blessings to the family bloodline.","Therefore, the Zhu family was the top force around Mount Huoshen.","Next were the tribes originally living near this area.","Before the Realm God Continent shattered, this place belonged to the Feather God Tribe.","Zhu Huo came from the Fire God Tribe but married into the Feather God Tribe.","So, they established themselves at Mount Huoshen.","After his fall, the surrounding Feather God Tribe strongmen were also blessed.","“Then, Young Master Xiang must be a descendant of the Feather God Tribe!”","“Indeed, most of the cultivators living on Mount Huoshen now are descendants of the Feather God Tribe. Of course, in recent years, because Mount Huoshen is open to the public, it has attracted many foreign experts, such as Senior Wushuang!”","Xiang Yang’s words were intriguing, especially the last sentence, clearly attempting to probe Jian Wushuang.","The intentions of foreign experts were simple: they either sought opportunities on Mount Huoshen or fled to the Wild Ancient Domain for refuge.","However, most refugees were Universe Gods.","Strongmen like Jian Wushuang, who appeared to be Universe Masters, mainly aimed for Mount Huoshen.","Although Mount Huoshen was open to the public, not everyone could access it.","One needed to obtain qualifications.","And these qualifications were monopolized by the major families and forces around.","Climbing the mountain based on one’s own strength was extremely difficult.","But for Jian Wushuang, it posed no challenge.","The key was that he didn’t even regard Mount Huoshen highly.","The reason he had his Dharmakaya descend was merely to scout the Wild Ancient Domain.","He did not hold back from Xiang Yang’s probing and directly stated his intentions.","He was entering the Wild Ancient Domain for the first time, knew nothing, and wanted to gather information and find a foothold.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s intentions, Xiang Yang was delighted.","This was practically a strongman delivered to their door!","These major families had deep foundations, but few strongmen, hence they needed retainers to hold the fort.","Jian Wushuang’s displayed strength was around forty million divine power, not quite at the demigod level, but in Ju Lu City, he was considered a top expert.","The banquet began shortly after their conversation.","To entertain him, Xiang Yang showed great respect, arranging for several exotic beauties to accompany them.","Apart from these beauties, there were two Ninth Tribulation experts.","An old man and a young man!","They were not from the Xiang family but were worshipped by the Xiang family.","Moreover, they were strongmen under Xiang Yang’s command.","Throughout the banquet, they continuously boasted about how many benefits they had gained upon entering the Wild Ancient Domain, all thanks to the Xiang family and Young Master Xiang Yang.","Such tactics were merely to flaunt their abilities.","Jian Wushuang was well aware of these tricks, simply nodding with a smile."]},{"number":6232,"title":"Chapter 6232: Sealing the Original Body","paragraphs":["Chapter 6232: Sealing the Original Body","“Senior Wushuang, if you don’t mind, you can stay at the Xiang residence in the future. Whatever treasures you need, just ask. Although I, Xiang Yang, may not be much in this Giant Deer City, the Xiang family still has some connections!”","Xiang Yang boasted, displaying his pride as a member of the Xiang family.","The two attendants beside Xiang Yang also nodded frequently, flattering him.","Jian Wushuang found it amusing; he was well aware of such methods to win people over.","But was there a need to be so blatant about it?","Moreover, he had only met the other party a day ago.","So, he didn’t express much nor directly state his needs.","Xiang Yang wasn’t in a hurry. Seeing Jian Wushuang not respond, he shifted the topic to the Wild Ancient Domain.","This time, Jian Wushuang showed a curious look.","“It seems Senior Wushuang is more interested in the Wild Ancient Domain. Let me share my views and understanding,” Xiang Yang paused briefly before continuing, “In fact, the resources in the Northwest Continent are very scarce. Compared to the major star fields in Central State and the Eastern Continent, our resources are nothing in the eyes of those big shots. Only some super strong individuals who have reached a bottleneck would come here to try their luck. To put it nicely, it’s the graveyard of the gods. To put it bluntly, it’s a garbage dump!”","This statement made Jian Wushuang’s expression freeze.","He didn’t expect this Xiang family junior to dare say such a thing, especially since the other party was merely an ordinary Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Moreover, Xiang Yang himself was a native powerhouse of the Wild Ancient Domain.","Wasn’t he tarnishing his own reputation by saying this?","“Young Master Xiang, that’s not quite accurate. I’ve heard that the Wild Ancient Domain even has divine tombs of nine-star Universe Gods, and countless opportunities left behind. To outsiders, it seems like a huge treasure trove!”","This was also what Jian Wushuang had gathered from his inquiries. Most outsiders viewed it this way.","Moreover, there were many super strong individuals in the Wild Ancient Domain, occupying half of the Northwest Continent.","They also accounted for one-tenth of the entire Realm God Continent.","There was no need to belittle it so much.","But the next words revealed the underlying meaning.","“Sigh, Fellow Daoist Wushuang, you might not be aware of the situation since you just arrived!”","At this moment, an elder beside them slowly spoke, explaining the reason.","It turned out Xiang Yang belittled the Wild Ancient Domain because of the families that inherited the Universe Gods’ legacies.","For instance, the Zhu family.","Relying on the blessings of Zhu Huo God, they ruled the Fire God Mountain region.","The treasures and opportunities belonged to them.","The open ones were just some garbage.","The foreign powerhouses and local strong individuals were just scavenging for treasures in the garbage heap.","Hearing this explanation, Jian Wushuang finally understood.","However, as an outsider, he didn’t feel it was appropriate to comment. He just frowned in thought.","He had already reached the peak of the Ninth Tribulation Realm.","His basic divine power had reached three billion.","Relying on secret techniques, he could match a nine-star Universe God.","But he still couldn’t find a way out in terms of realm.","That’s why he came to the Wild Ancient Domain, but now he was at a loss.","He couldn’t just rely on his strength to charge around recklessly.","Fighting would only muddy the waters.","He would become the fish that couldn’t find the treasures he needed.","But he had a vague feeling.","Jian Wushuang felt that his opportunity was in the Wild Ancient Domain.","This was also why his true self stayed in the void, sending a clone into the Wild Ancient Domain to search.","Opportunities sometimes did not rely on strength.","Just like when he was in the Northern Spacetime.","Sometimes strength was not the key factor, but without strength, it was impossible.","Now, what he needed to do was to slowly explore.","The opportunity of the Divine Tribulation was not achieved overnight.","It required continuous accumulation, and sometimes he needed to transform into a mortal to","search.","“No rush!”","Jian Wushuang’s heart moved, and then he smiled and went to learn about the Wild Ancient","Domain.","The banquet lasted for two hours.","Afterwards, he was arranged to stay in a secluded small courtyard.","From beginning to end, he never mentioned his needs, only saying that he wanted to find a hope for advancement here.","This did not deceive the other party.","It’s just that the divine position he wanted to advance to was not something outsiders could","understand.","After Xiang Yang knew, he silently nodded and said nothing more.","After saying goodbye.","The small courtyard was left with only Jian Wushuang.","The courtyard was not big, with only a dry well and a loquat tree.","There was also a round table under the tree.","After a glance, he entered the master bedroom.","Pushing the door open, the furnishings inside were quite old but spotless and very tidy.","Pop!","Jian Wushuang snapped his fingers, and a round small ball appeared under the beam.","His figure flickered and disappeared.","When he reappeared, he was already in a cavern.","Then he sat cross-legged and began to plan his path to divinity.","Originally, he did not know the specific situation of the Wild Ancient Domain, but now he had","learned some basics from Xiang Yang.","Naturally, he had to start planning.","His clone did not move.","But his true self had already begun.","In the void, his true self suddenly increased his mental power.","The originally small figure instantly transformed into a size of millions of miles.","The terrifying power directly shook the Wild Ancient Domain.","Countless Universe Gods raised their heads, using their mental power to sense the void.","They found a majestic figure.","Immediately, they were all stunned.","“What is this????”","“A nine-star Universe God!!!!!!”","Since the Realm God Continent shattered, the number of strong individuals had sharply","declined.","In the past, there were many nine-star Universe Gods.","But now, each was as elusive as a dragon.","No one in the entire Wild Ancient Domain dared to claim the presence of a nine-star Universe","God.","But now one had suddenly appeared in the void of the Wild Ancient Domain.","It inevitably made everyone bewildered, speculating about the intention.","The main concern was still the identity.","Everyone was guessing which great god had descended.","In the void.","Jian Wushuang looked up, his aura had long changed, no longer the pure power of the Starry","Sky.","But pure chaotic power.","Power similar to that of a Realm Beast, but his true self was within the rules.","This created a strange phenomenon.","The entire void began to flash with thunder, as if competing with Jian Wushuang.","“Chaos is also order, ultimately it will break this shackle!”","Jian Wushuang murmured to himself.","The surrounding thunder seemed to understand, retreating one after another.","“Heh!”","Words followed by law, just so.","Breaking ten thousand laws with one force was not just talk.","Eventually, he had to walk that path.","“All things!”","He spoke softly, and countless forces of all things converged within him.","Countless clones appeared.","Like meteors, they fell from the sky.","His true self began to turn to stone.","Starting from his feet, a grayish-white color enveloped his entire body.","Jian Wushuang’s movements became extremely difficult. Ultimately, he was completely petrified.","Countless clones fell into various places in the Wild Ancient Domain.","A super-strong nine-star Universe God had just turned into this state.","It shocked many strong individuals who were secretly observing, making some of them","confused and unclear."]},{"number":6233,"title":"Chapter 6233: Shock","paragraphs":["Chapter 6233: Shock","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just after descending, he fell?","The towering figure in the void turned into a statue, devoid of any aura or mind power.","In an instant, all the strong ones in the entire Wild Ancient Domain were stunned.","They rushed into the void to investigate.","Gazing at the statue, its features were indistinguishable.","Because Jian Wushuang had been wearing a mask, and with his aura and mind power gone, no one could identify him.","Soon, this news spread throughout the entire Wild Ancient Domain.","It even reached the entire Northwestern Continent.","A mysterious strong man had descended upon the Wild Ancient Domain, transformed into a statue, and scattered his power.","Countless powers fell into the entire Wild Ancient Domain.","Strong ones who were initially uninterested in this place also came, wanting to investigate and attempting to find out the secret of the mysterious strong man’s descent.","For a time, numerous strong ones arrived.","The Wild Ancient Domain became lively.","However, none of them found the power that had fallen from the mysterious strong man.","A strong one fell, leaving behind a blessing.","Yet, no one obtained it.","This seemed quite odd.","Many strong ones joined the search for the blessing.","Unfortunately, even though they racked their brains, they could not find these so-called blessings.","Because these powers had all condensed into individual super strong ones.","From strong to weak.","There were 2 eight-star Universe Gods.","10 seven-star Universe Gods.","Over 100 six-star Universe Gods.","These were all incarnations of Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, they were hidden in various places, ready to be revived with a single thought.","And the source controlling these incarnations was hidden within Giant Deer City.","“Sealing the true body might be the best choice!”","Jian Wushuang, sitting cross-legged in a cave, opened his eyes.","At this moment, even the Origin Source was sealed.","His Origin Source Starry Sky had already condensed the river of time and space.","Once he crossed the Tribulation, he would reach the level of a Time and Space God.","This would also mark the beginning of a qualitative change.","But to successfully cross the Tribulation required immense opportunity and perseverance.","He had the strength, but he lacked the insight for a breakthrough.","Sealing his true body now was the best choice, otherwise, blindly seeking based on strength alone would only affect his judgment.","It was better to lie low in this Wild Ancient Domain and seek his own opportunity.","Giant Deer City was the starting point.","He had just finished everything here.","A call came from the outside.","The visitor surprised him.","It was the young man from the banquet earlier.","Also, a guest under Xiang Yang’s command.","Hearing the call, Jian Wushuang put away the magic sphere and walked out of the small courtyard.","Opening the courtyard door, he saw the other standing outside with furrowed brows.","“Brother Dantai, what’s the matter?”","He could sense that the other’s divine body was a bit unstable, clearly due to a battle.","“Young Master Xiang Yang is in trouble!” Dantai said anxiously, “A few days ago, I accompanied Young Master Xiang Yang to the Dusky Plains and encountered the Rat Nirvana. Now he is trapped, and I escaped at the risk of falling!”","“Don’t rush, speak slowly. Whatever you need me to do, just say it!” Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed, seeing this as an opportunity.","A chance to make the other party owe him a favor was naturally not something he would ignore.","“Sigh, actually, after I escaped, I had the Xiang family send someone for rescue, but the Xiang family just sent a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master with only thirty million units of divine power, not even as strong as me. They couldn’t rescue Young Master Xiang Yang, so I came to find Brother Wushuang!” After speaking, Dantai’s face showed some anger.","After all, Xiang Yang was a member of the Xiang family. Although his strength was only at the Eighth Tribulation Universe Master level, his talent was exceptional, and it wouldn’t be difficult for him to become a demigod in the future.","Moreover, this time he went to the Twilight Plains for a family mission, yet now they were abandoning him to die.","This inevitably left the followers disheartened.","If they didn’t rescue their own people, they definitely wouldn’t save them if something happened to them in the future.","After Jian Wushuang understood the situation, he immediately said, “I’ll go with you. Let’s leave now!”","“Then thank you, Brother Wushuang!”","Tantai didn’t expect him to be so straightforward and revealed a look of admiration.","After all, he and Xiang Yang were merely acquaintances.","If it were someone else, they would have patted their backside and left without anyone saying anything.","It was already absurd for the Xiang family to not rescue their own and instead ask an outsider for help.","The situation seemed suspicious, and if it were before, Jian Wushuang would have shrugged it off and left.","But now things were different.","He had countless avatars, and if one died, another would take its place.","So he had ample confidence to explore.","The two didn’t waste any more time and immediately found a few other strong individuals who had a good relationship with Xiang Yang and left the Xiang mansion together.","After leaving Julu City, Tantai took out a piece of bamboo leaf.","As the wind blew, the leaf instantly expanded to a size of ten thousand feet.","It formed a small boat.","This was the Green Bamboo Boat, a semi-divine artifact.","During a banquet, Tantai had boasted that Xiang Yang had purchased it for him through special channels, and it was very cheap, something ordinary people couldn’t buy.","Naturally, its speed was also very fast.","It was similar to Jian Wushuang’s previous pyramid.","But it couldn’t compare to the divine artifact Shield of the Void.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang had given that treasure to Wu Zuo.","Now, this avatar only had a few ordinary treasures.","The Beast God Weapon and the Myriad Tribulations Sword were sealed with his true self.","Even his strongest avatar didn’t carry the key treasures.","However, the strength of this avatar was enough for use within Julu City.","With a basic divine power of forty million, even without the Beast God Weapon and the Myriad Tribulations Sword, his secret techniques were still intact.","Additionally, he had a few artifacts suitable for demigods.","Even if a Universe God came, they wouldn’t be his match.","Buzz!","The flying boat soared through the sky.","In Julu City, a pair of eyes had been watching them.","Since they left the mansion, they had been under surveillance.","Jian Wushuang also sensed those eyes.","“Interesting, a Universe God is so focused on Xiang Yang. It seems that the matter at Twilight Plains isn’t simple!”","His heart stirred, and while on the way, he chatted with Tantai.","He also asked about the situation at Twilight Plains.","The nearby Universe Masters who had been recruited also shared their thoughts and plans to rescue Xiang Yang.","Twilight Plains.","Located north of Fire God Mountain, it was a vast grassland.","The dangers on the grassland weren’t many; the biggest obstacle was the Zhu family.","Because the grassland contained a special kind of crystal, which was a specialty of the entire Wild Ancient Domain.","Therefore, the Zhu family strictly prohibited entry.","To enter, one needed the Zhu family’s permission.","Xiang Yang was able to enter because he took on a family task.","And the Xiang family accepted a task from the Zhu family.","With layers of progression, they had the opportunity to enter Twilight Plains.","At first, everything was fine as they dug for crystals in the mine pit, but while digging, they uncovered a Twilight Mouse hole.","One monster mouse wasn’t much.","At most, it was just an Emperor.","But a swarm of mice, combined with their consciousness and innate secret techniques, posed a crisis that could destroy most Universe Masters.","Xiang Yang’s team instantly lost several Universe Masters."]},{"number":6234,"title":"Chapter 6234: Rescue","paragraphs":["Chapter 6234: Rescue","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Later, they constructed a formation, which was the only way to resist it.","However, the time they could hold out was limited.","Someone needed to seek help.","As for the Zhu family, they wouldn’t intervene; they were only responsible for guarding the Dusk Plains.","So, Dantai first went back to the Xiang family for help.","This led to the events that followed.","After learning everything, the others began discussing countermeasures.","Jian Wushuang remained silent during this time.","However, Dantai kept glancing at him intentionally or unintentionally.","Among these people, the strongest divine power was just over forty million.","The stronger ones had been taken away by Xiang Yang.","Dantai himself was injured and much weaker than before.","Now, the strongest one present was Jian Wushuang.","Naturally, they had to act according to Jian Wushuang’s decisions.","“Dantai, why not follow this plan? At worst, we’ll destroy a piece of land. After all, we are working for the Zhu family, and they can’t blame us for it!”","A Universe Master with a sharp, long mouth spoke confidently. His plan was simple: use divine fire to drive away the swarm of rats, create a path, and rescue Xiang Yang.","Several Universe Masters, who had been roped in, agreed. After all, there was no risk involved, just driving them away. It was a case of harming the enemy at the expense of damaging oneself, but the loss would be on the Zhu family!","“I agree with Long Mouth’s plan. Even if the Zhu family blames us, the Xiang family is still there!”","Dantai glanced at everyone, his expression somewhat troubled.","He actually liked this plan too, but if trouble arose, he would be the main culprit.","Expecting the Xiang family to cover for them wasn’t realistic either.","Because the ones trapped were the Xiang family’s disciples, and they were from the main lineage.","The Xiang family could be perfunctory about such matters.","They might not even be perfunctory with them, directly handing them over to the Zhu family for punishment.","At that time, the first to suffer would be him as the mastermind.","So, he hesitated.","This time, he directly pushed the problem to Jian Wushuang. Although it was quite unethical, there was no other way.","“Brother Wushuang, your strength is the greatest in this action. Why don’t you make a decision and see if there’s a better plan?”","Dantai’s tone was somewhat anxious.","It was already a great favor that Jian Wushuang came this time.","Now, pushing this difficult problem to him was almost too much.","Who was Jian Wushuang?","He had seen many storms and waves, how could he not understand?","If it were in the past, he wouldn’t hesitate to kill these people.","But now, he was exceptionally calm, even speaking gently, “Since everyone agrees to set a fire, then let’s do it. I have no objections!”","Dantai was stunned for a moment after hearing this, then his brows relaxed, and he nodded, saying, “Then let’s arrange it this way. This time, I thank you all on behalf of Young Master Xiang Yang for your great help!”","These people were indeed offering great help.","When they were benefiting from the Dusk Plains, they didn’t involve them. Now that trouble arose, they remembered them. Once Xiang Yang was rescued, they must be compensated well.","After everyone finalized their plans, they quickly arrived at the Dusk Plain.","Looking down, the plain was just as its name suggested.","The dusk’s light shone on each blade of grass, and even the dew was a pale yellow.","It was as if the entire grassland had entered its twilight years, devoid of vitality.","Instead, there was a sense of despair just before autumn.","The impression it gave was one of desolation, from the outside in.","“Vibrant twilight?”","Jian Wushuang saw this scene, and his eyelids twitched as he instantly understood the reason.","The dusk did not come from the sky. It was very likely that there was a certain power below, absorbing all life.","This formed the dusk halo descending from the sky.","This wasn’t difficult to discern; any Universe God could detect it.","The reason they hadn’t explored it was probably because that power also brought them benefits, such as those special Blood Crystal Shards.","Buzz!","Just before the flying boat landed, a wave of energy suddenly attacked, but it stopped just in front of them.","Within the light wave were two figures, one tall and one short, revealing their true faces with a flame-shaped mark on their foreheads.","These were the Zhu family guards stationed here.","Both were demigods.","“Dantai, bringing so many people in is against the rules!”","Before they could speak, the other party had already taken a confrontational tone.","But Dantai still wore a smiling face and said, “Brother Chang Ling, you know the situation inside is complicated. I’m just trying to get Young Master Xiang Yang out quickly to preserve the Blood Crystal Shards!”","His voice deliberately lingered on the mention of the Blood Crystal Shards.","The two brothers of the Zhu family also understood that they were all mining for their own benefit and originally wanted to take advantage of the situation, so they reluctantly left.","Once the two brothers left, Dantai’s expression instantly turned cold.","“Hmph, those two have lived for countless years, yet they are so greedy, lacking even fifty million in divine power. They only dare to bully us!”","The others also quietly expressed their agreement with hatred.","Jian Wushuang did not expect these people to harbor such resentment toward the Zhu family.","He became curious about the Zhu family.","This was the first inherited family he encountered in the Wild Ancient Domain.","A family with the inheritance of the God Tomb.","Although it was only the inheritance of a six-star Universe God, he really wanted to see through this inheritance and glimpse what the Realm God Continent was like in the past.","There were too many hidden stories under the brilliant cultivation civilization.","Just like the Dusk Plain before them.","It was once a place full of life, but in the blink of an eye, it had reached its twilight years.","The flying boat entered the Dusk Plain, and after advancing for several more hours, they reached the depths of the plain.","The ground here was filled with many huge pits.","These were all mined pits.","“We’ve arrived!” Dantai’s face was solemn.","Everyone looked up into the distance, where a massive formation stood tall. Around it was a dark mass, which upon closer inspection, turned out to be demonic rats.","The number was incalculable, but it could be said that within a billion miles, there were demonic rats everywhere.","Among them were millions of pillars, and these pillars were formed by the rat hordes.","At the top of the pillars were golden demonic rats.","All were Universe Masters.","In other words, there were millions of demonic rats at the level of Universe Masters here.","Seeing this scene, everyone was stunned.","They looked anxiously at Dantai and said, “This isn’t a mouse plague; it’s clearly a rat epidemic. Even as demigods, we can’t save Young Master Xiang Yang!”","“I don’t know either. When I left, the scale wasn’t this large!” Dantai also panicked.","He wasn’t lying; if it really was this scale, he wouldn’t be able to handle it either.","Now that everyone was here, there was no reason to retreat.","He could only grit his teeth and proceed with the original plan.","Dantai took the lead, transforming divine power into fire.","This was a secret technique that all cultivators around Fire God Mountain knew.","“Use the Seven Flame Fire directly!”","“Ordinary divine fire can hardly drive away those Universe Master-level demonic rats!”","Everyone nodded and took action.","Instantly, divine fire descended from the sky, and colorful flames quickly swept from the edges to the center of the rat horde.","This speed was very fast because there was a wind-type Universe Master behind them."]},{"number":6235,"title":"Chapter 6235: Set Fire","paragraphs":["Chapter 6235: Set Fire","A great wind swept through, carrying the pungent smell of something burnt.","“Quick, follow me in!”","The flames parted, and Dantai, quick on his feet, immediately maneuvered the flying boat through the opening.","Beneath the charred line lay countless corpses.","On both sides, the swarms of rats kept approaching.","They only retreated half a step when encountering divine fire, but then they moved forward again.","It seemed as if they were not afraid of death at all.","Roar!!!","Just as they charged in, an angry roar came from deep within.","The sound made everyone pause.","“It’s the Rat King, with divine power of at least thirty million!”","Dantai quickly made the assessment.","A single Rat King wasn’t much of a threat; any one of them could easily kill it.","But a Rat King with thirty million divine power could command an enormous swarm of rats.","“Retreat, the divine fire can’t drive them away!”","Someone had already started to lose their nerve. If they charged further, the path behind would disappear, and they would all be consumed.","Dantai gritted his teeth. Although he wanted to save people, he couldn’t lead so many to their deaths.","“Retreat!” In the end, he gritted his teeth and ordered the retreat.","After escaping the rat swarm, Dantai’s face was filled with frustration.","He had earned Xiang Yang’s trust and even staked his life for him for good reason.","At this moment, Dantai’s eyes were fixed on the strong figure sent by the Xiang family for","rescue.","A newly promoted Ninth Tribulation Universe Master with divine power of thirty million. “Brother Dantai, it’s not that I’m not trying, but you saw the situation. I’m really powerless!” “Hmph, that’s not what I’m saying. Why didn’t the third elder give you any treasures?” Dantai blurted out in his urgency.","“No, absolutely not. Elder Chi only instructed me to rescue Young Master Xiang Yang, without giving me any treasures!”","Dantai’s expression paused, a sneer forming at the corner of his mouth, “Nothing? If he didn’t give you any treasures, would he let you die with Young Master Xiang Yang? Fine, now go back in!”","The words frightened the man, his face turning pale.","Several others, who were close to Xiang Yang, glared at the man menacingly.","They couldn’t vent their anger on Elder Chi.","Although Jian Wushuang appeared calm, he was also curious about the Xiang family’s intentions. They weren’t even rescuing their own people.","If this rat plague was an accident, sending a newly promoted Ninth Tribulation Universe Master for rescue was deliberate.","This had to be either internal family strife or some unknown conspiracy.","It certainly wasn’t just to scheme against an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master. The bigger reason might be the land beneath their feet.","The Twilight Plains.","Where Blood Ling Crystals were born.","A product left behind after the Realm God Continent shattered, very beneficial to cultivators.","There were many places in the Wild Ancient Domain where Blood Ling Crystals could be found, but they were all controlled by large families, making it difficult for outsiders to obtain them without paying a hefty price.","As tensions rose, the outer rat swarm suddenly erupted into chaos.","“Are they launching a full attack?” Dantai’s face showed a hint of despair.","This was truly the end.","They couldn’t get in.","Jian Wushuang looked out, forming a plan in his mind.","He couldn’t act directly, but he hadn’t forgotten.","His divine body was present throughout the entire Wild Ancient Domain.","With a mere thought.","A dazzling light came from the sky, like a meteor streaking across.","The light was incredibly bright, reaching the Twilight Plains in an instant.","This shocked the Zhu family experts guarding the area.","Especially the Universe God, who rushed out immediately.","“Who dares intrude on the Zhu family’s territory?”","The newcomer wore a wooden mask with green patterns and a wide hat, hiding their","appearance.","But the divine sword in their hand emanated a blue aura.","“Fellow Daoist, do not be alarmed. I am merely here to save someone!”","The man holding the sword responded calmly, and in a flash, he charged towards the swarm of rats.","The people, who had already given up, were stunned to see a mysterious strong figure arrive.","They watched as the mysterious man with the sword instantly entered the swarm, his divine sword dancing gracefully, its sword intent unfolding. Countless sword shadows slashed through the pillars of rats.","The rat plague, which even Universe Masters and demigods found insurmountable, was vanquished in less than the time it takes to burn a stick of incense.","Even the Rat King was beheaded.","“He’s terrifying!” Dantai looked at the figure with admiration and envy.","Wielding a sword, he could cut down everything.","It was the ultimate dream of all sword cultivators!","Crash!","The man with the sword stood proudly in the sky, and countless corpses fell behind him.","The corpses were all severed in two; they were the slain demon rats.","The scene resembled hell.","Everyone gasped in awe.","In the center of the rat swarm was a broken formation.","In the center of the formation stood a young man, looking very disheveled. He composed","himself and spoke with a calm demeanor.","“Thank you, senior, for saving my life. Xiang Yang will never forget it!”","This was the trapped Xiang Yang. He never expected a Universe God would come to his rescue.","The formation had previously blocked all communication, so he couldn’t contact Dantai and didn’t know if it was a strong family member who had arranged for this rescuer.","He had never heard of a sword-wielding Universe God in his family.","He was confused, but the fact that he had escaped death filled him with excitement.","This time, he had gained immensely.","Returning to the family would surely bring him great merit, and the Ninth Tribulation realm","was within reach.","This was destiny; seizing it would allow him to soar to great heights.","“I did not come to save you but to save him!”","The man with the sword pointed, and a corpse in the center of the formation floated up. His","eyes flashed with red light as he looked at the corpse.","At this moment, Dantai and others flew over but did not dare to approach.","Soon after, the Universe God of the Zhu family arrived.","Seeing this scene, he didn’t rush to speak.","After a while, the man with the sword spoke sorrowfully, “I told you not to come, but you","insisted!”","He shook his head reluctantly.","In the crowd, Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a slight smile, admiring his own acting skills.","The man with the sword above was one of his incarnations.","A three-star Universe God.","At the peak of his power, he was nearly a four-star.","He was the strongest incarnation near Huoshen Mountain.","Several other incarnations also began to awaken at this moment.","They had already quietly entered the major cities near Huoshen Mountain.","The chessboard began to move at this moment.","Jian Wushuang’s incarnation, after a moment of silent mourning, collected the corpse, then looked at the Zhu family’s Universe God with an apologetic expression, saying, “Fellow Daoist, I apologize for the disturbance. If there is any punishment, I will accept it.”","Upon hearing this, the Zhu family’s Universe God had no complaints. They were both three- star Universe Gods, and he had given enough face to the other."]},{"number":6236,"title":"Chapter 6236: One Hundred Thousand Years","paragraphs":["Chapter 6236: One Hundred Thousand Years","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was naturally impossible to blame him, and instead, they quickly comforted Jian Wushuang’s clone.","The two Universe Gods naturally ignored the Universe Master below them. After exchanging a few words, the Universe God of the Zhu family began to win over Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Xiang Yang and the others below, letting out a long sigh.","In the end, he followed the Universe God of the Zhu family and left directly for the Twilight Plains.","As for the Universe Master’s law body, it was placed within the Xiang family.","Through this rescue operation, Xiang Yang developed a great fondness for this newly accepted retainer.","In addition, having achieved a great merit this time, Jian Wushuang went into seclusion for three years upon returning to the family, successfully undergoing a tribulation to become a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master. Afterward, he hosted frequent feasts, small gatherings every three days, and large banquets every five days.","He constantly tried to win over Jian Wushuang.","During these gatherings, Jian Wushuang also expressed some of his needs; otherwise, it would have been too obvious.","If he had no desires or requests, and the other party was not a woman, who would work so hard?","Their relationship grew closer, but Jian Wushuang made no substantial progress within the Xiang family.","For example, regarding the matter of the Twilight Plains last time, he still had not found the cause.","However, he did see a real Blood Crystal from Xiang Yang.","This was even faster than the law body of the Universe God from the Zhu family.","From the Zhu family, he did not gain any benefits, but his knowledge greatly increased.","After all, the Zhu family was also a large and influential family.","Inherited families had accumulations passed down from generation to generation and knew many more secrets.","For instance, the Wild Ancient Domain on the surface.","One Emperor, Three Saints, Five Revered, and Ten Kings!","These corresponded to the Tomb of the Barbarian Emperor in the Wild Ancient Domain.","The Three Saints’ Graves!","The Five Revered Temples!","The Ten Kings’ Halls!","These were the strongest group of experts before the Realm God Continent was shattered.","The Barbarian Emperor was an existence who could kill a nine-star Universe God with a flick of his wrist.","The Three Saints were all Upper nine-star Gods.","They far surpassed ordinary nine-star Universe Gods and could easily crush ordinary nine-star Universe Gods.","The Five Revered were all peak nine-star Universe Gods.","The Ten Kings were also extraordinary.","There were so many famous nine-star Universe Gods.","It was imaginable how glorious the Realm God Continent was back then!","Beneath the surface, the Wild Ancient Domain had even greater legends.","The foremost legend was actually related to Jian Wushuang.","It was about the recent statue in the void.","The statue formed by his true self.","It had now become an object of exploration for all Universe Gods.","Jian Wushuang merely smiled at this and did not elaborate.","How could he not be aware of his true self’s matters?","Those bold Universe Gods were already standing on his shoulders, ready to pry open his divine body to study his true self.","He did not care much about this; his true self’s divine power was nearly infinite, and it did not matter if some was taken.","The most important thing was the current layout.","He needed to conduct a carpet search of the entire Wild Ancient Domain, not missing a single corner.","He had to investigate every strange event he encountered and all the rumored ones.","Currently, there were two main lines.","The Zhu family’s Twilight Plains and the familiar aura from the Xiang family.","Both needed thorough investigation.","In the blink of an eye, he had been lurking in the Wild Ancient Domain for a hundred thousand years.","Giant Deer City.","The Xiang Family!","As usual, Jian Wushuang was leisurely drinking tea in the small courtyard.","Outside, urgent shouts could be heard.","This time, it was still Dantai.","Since the last incident, he and Dantai had become Xiang Yang’s right-hand men, and over the years, following Xiang Yang had brought them many benefits.","Whenever there was a good opportunity, Xiang Yang would take the two of them along.","Dantai’s strength had also improved rapidly, and he was now almost a demigod.","In just a hundred thousand years, his divine power had increased by 5 million.","It now reached 45 million.","Jian Wushuang’s dharma body had also improved considerably, though it still felt somewhat ethereal compared to his true self.","“Come in!”","Since he was quite familiar with Dantai, Jian Wushuang didn’t stand up and continued sipping his tea.","Dantai entered the courtyard, looking anxious. He paced in front of Jian Wushuang and exclaimed, “Brother Wushuang, how can you still have the mood to drink tea? The inheritance tasks for the three main branches have been assigned, and Young Master Xiang Yang has encountered a major problem!”","The inheritance tasks were essentially modeled after those set by inheritance families.","The ancestor of the Xiang family was a three-star Universe God.","However, he had long since fallen, and the family was currently led by a two-star Universe God.","The inheritance left by the ancestor would be given to each direct descendant, but they needed to complete tasks to obtain it.","Moreover, the tasks were divided into several rounds.","Xiang Yang had already completed the fourth round of the Ninth Tribulation.","One would think that the inheritance he had obtained was sufficient, but human nature is never satisfied, and he insisted on participating in the fifth round of tasks.","This time, his opponents were the most elite Ninth Tribulation Universe Masters in the entire Xiang family.","Naturally, the tasks were also very difficult.","And this time, Xiang Yang was assigned the most challenging task.","He needed to go to the Twilight Plains to find the Rat Emperor’s nest.","Just thinking about the experiences in the Twilight Plains made Dantai shudder.","Not to mention Xiang Yang, who had almost died there once.","This was why he was so anxious.","After hearing the details, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","“Wasn’t the Rat Emperor slain? How can there still be this task?”","Dantai sighed, “The old Rat Emperor was killed by a predecessor, but a new Rat Emperor has been born. It may not be as powerful as the last one, but it’s still formidable. Moreover, this time the task is to find the nest and slay the Rat Emperor, making it ten times more dangerous than before. Isn’t this just courting death?”","“Indeed, it was impulsive!” Jian Wushuang also rose from his chair.","This dharma body had finally worked its way into Xiang Yang’s inner circle, so he couldn’t let Xiang Yang die.","He had originally advised Xiang Yang not to act so recklessly.","Completing the fourth round of the inheritance was already considered an A-class talent.","At the demigod level, he had the qualification to enter the ancestral land, which was enough for him.","If he really wanted to fight, he should wait until he was undergoing the Tribulation.","Right now, he wasn’t even a demigod. No matter how fiercely he fought, he wouldn’t gain much.","Why risk his life?","But since the task had already been accepted, he had no choice but to help Young Master Xiang Yang plan.","He followed Dantai to Xiang Yang’s courtyard.","There were already quite a few people gathered there.","In addition to several familiar retainers, Xiang Yang’s mother and older brother were also present.","Before even entering the main house, they heard a loud, angry shout.","“Xiang Yang, do you know what you’re doing?”","The speaker was Xiang Yang’s older brother, “Xiang Mu.”","His strength far surpassed Xiang Yang’s; he was already a demigod with 60 million divine power.","Back then, he had only taken on the fourth round of tasks.","The fact that his younger brother could keep up with him was already impressive.","There weren’t many geniuses in the three main branches, and Xiang Yang’s achievements were enough to secure his place. There was no need to push himself so hard.","The fifth round of tasks could only be completed by the top geniuses of each branch.","And too many had perished attempting it.ff"]},{"number":6237,"title":"Chapter 6237: Alien Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 6237: Alien Girl","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang stood aside, his gaze filled with absolute determination.","“Heh, don’t worry. I’ll take full responsibility for the task I’ve accepted, unlike some people who shirk their duties!”","“Yang’er, you must not speak of your brother that way,” Jian Wushuang’s mother reprimanded him sternly.","But Jian Wushuang paid no heed and stormed out the door.","As he walked out of the room and saw the many guests in the courtyard, he slowly turned his head and said coldly, “Xiangmu, do you know why no one follows you? It’s because you’re selfish and self-centered!”","Without waiting for a response, he led the group out of the courtyard without looking back.","Within the Xiang family, even without mentioning the whole, the two brothers, Jian Wushuang and Xiangmu, from the third household, did not get along.","This made Jian Wushuang feel somewhat amused.","In truth, the brothers did not harbor any deep-seated hatred for each other.","It was just that, in their youth, they both fell for the same girl.","Because of this trivial matter, Jian Wushuang had always compared himself to his elder brother.","If Xiangmu passed the fourth round of the inheritance task, Jian Wushuang would strive to pass the fifth round, determined to prove his superiority.","Although it seemed childish, Jian Wushuang’s determination was quite admirable.","Just because of a grudge, he was willing to risk his life—he was a fierce person indeed.","With Jian Wushuang’s departure, the courtyard instantly fell silent.","Xiangmu clenched his fist, remaining silent.","His clenched fist dug into his palm, and red blood dripped from between his fingers.","“Why don’t you tell your brother about it? There’s no need for you to shoulder this burden alone!”","“No!” Xiangmu shook his head and looked at his mother with disappointment. “I’m already in too deep; I can’t let Jian Wushuang fall into it too. Otherwise, the third household will be finished!”","Their conversation concealed much, but unfortunately, Jian Wushuang knew none of it.","Leaving the Xiang residence in a huff, Jian Wushuang led his group straight out of Julucheng.","They still traveled on Dantai’s Qingzhu flying boat, heading toward the Twilight Plains.","During the journey, Jian Wushuang stood at the bow of the boat, staring silently at the horizon.","After a long moment of silent reflection, he turned to look at his followers.","“My friends, entering the Twilight Plains this time will be very dangerous. I do not wish to drag you into this peril. If anyone wants to leave, you may do so at any time. There’s no need to risk your lives with me!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were sincere.","Dantai immediately stood up, generously saying, “Young Master Jian, without your care all these years, how could we, outsiders in cultivation, have achieved such success in Julucheng? Now that you face difficulties, how can we not help?”","“That’s right, everyone, think about it. Without Young Master Jian, how could our strength have improved so rapidly?” Jian Wushuang also took the opportunity to speak.","The two of them were Jian Wushuang’s right-hand men and had never left his side for ten thousand years.","Now, saying such things was clearly an attempt to rally support.","Some of those who had initially thought of leaving gave up on the idea after hearing these words.","Adventure and reward go hand in hand.","Following Jian Wushuang might be much better than pledging allegiance to other families.","After all, they had followed him for so many years. Leaving now and finding another leader would take a long time to invest in.","The great families of the Wild Ancient Domain valued experience the most.","They had to weigh the pros and cons carefully.","Such is the way of cultivators.","Solo endeavors require confidence and strength.","Otherwise, one can only rely on those great families to make a living.","Moments later, everyone expressed their loyalty, deciding to accompany Xiang Yang into the Twilight Plains.","Xiang Yang was very pleased with this and, after taking a deep look at Jian Wushuang and Dantai, turned and stood proudly on the flying boat, gazing into the distance.","However, he did not know that this trip to the Twilight Plains would bring about dangers far beyond the scope of a Universe Master.","As Xiang Yang entered the Twilight Plains, the Xiang family also dispatched several demigod powerhouses into the Twilight Plains that day.","Among them was a cold and aloof woman from a different race. She had no aura but possessed a unique temperament.","If Jian Wushuang saw her, he would be greatly astonished. The woman had the aura of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","This was also the familiar aura he had sensed when he entered the Xiang family.","The speed of the alien woman was very fast, almost treading on the heels of Xiang Yang and his companions as they entered the Twilight Plains.","However, their goals were different.","Xiang Yang’s side entered the Twilight Plains out of loyalty.","He planned to start from the mines to search for the mouse holes.","But with thousands upon thousands of mines around, who knew how long it would take to find them this way?","Jian Wushuang certainly wouldn’t wait for these people to search.","Although his current avatar was only at the demigod level, his mental power inherited from his true self.","Among all the avatars, this one was the most superior.","His powerful mental power could easily envelop the entire Twilight Plains.","Such strong mental power could only be achieved by a five-star Universe God.","And since there were no five-star Universe Gods on the entire Mount Huo, it was impossible for anyone to detect the expansion of his Thought power.","Even so, it was still incomparable to his true self.","His true self’s mental power could directly envelop the entire Wild Ancient Domain; that was the real terror.","Now it was just a minor issue.","After careful probing, he found a trace of a demon mouse’s aura in a certain mine.","“I’ll go check the west side!” Jian Wushuang found an excuse to act alone.","Swish!","In a flash, he arrived at the mine dense with the demon mouse’s aura, glanced at the bottomless pit, and threw a ball of divine power with one hand.","The divine power, flashing with white light, fell into the mine and responded with a dull echo in just a moment.","But no demon mouse appeared.","“Something’s wrong!”","Jian Wushuang immediately became alert.","He could sense the strong aura of demon mice below, yet none emerged!","Even if the Mouse King didn’t move, ordinary demon mice should have made some noise.","Yet, despite his probing, there was no response.","The next moment, a familiar aura came from a distance.","That aura, one he had once been fascinated by, even fought to the death within.","“The aura of the Ten Thousand Willow?”","Jian Wushuang’s brows furrowed as he detected the familiar aura from a distance.","It was the same familiar aura he had sensed from the Xiang family.","Moreover, this aura was now mixed with a demonic aura.","No need to guess; it must be the demon mice.","He instantly understood.","“No wonder there’s no movement in the mouse holes. Those demon mice are dealing with that person!”","However, this situation seemed too coincidental to him. The last time the demon mice besieged Xiang Yang and his group, it was very suspicious.","Moreover, considering the Third House’s attitude, it was clear they intended to protect Xiang Yang, yet last time they did nothing to help.","There were contradictions before and after.","It was clear that someone deliberately set Xiang Yang up and even made the Third House’s experts dare not intervene.","This was definitely the intention of the higher-ups in the Xiang family.","Now Xiang Yang had just taken on the fifth round of the inheritance task and encountered Xiang family members again.","And it was that familiar aura.","Jian Wushuang squinted slightly, seeming to see through the opponent’s plan.","With a point of his finger, he created a huge disturbance."]},{"number":6238,"title":"Chapter 6238: Zhu Family’s Movements","paragraphs":["Chapter 6238: Zhu Family’s Movements","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Immediately, it attracted the attention of Xiang Yang and the others, and they hurried over.","“Brother Wushuang, have you found the rat nest?” Xiang Yang was the first to arrive, flying over.","Jian Wushuang pointed below, pretending to be excited, “I found it, it’s just down there!”","At this moment, a large hole had been smashed open in the mine below, revealing countless tiny tunnels.","Those tunnels were dug by the demon rats.","A dense cluster of them led to the abyss beneath the earth.","“Hmm? Why haven’t those damned demon rats come out? Could it be a trap?” Dantai looked worried.","Xiang Yang, on the other hand, was reckless. Seeing the tunnels, he didn’t think twice.","In his view, with so many people entering together, there was nothing to worry about.","Perhaps he was lucky, and all the demon rats had gone out.","This time, he was indeed lucky.","The demon rats had gone to block that alien woman.","At this moment, only the rat queen and a small group of ordinary rats were left in the nest.","It was the perfect time to enter.","However, one thing was not in their favor; once the nest was attacked, the demon rats would surely rush back.","Entering now was more like aiding the person trapped inside.","It had a bit of the “surround Wei to save Zhao” strategy in it.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t care about that. Right now, he just wanted to see what kind of person possessed the aura of Wanliu.","Back when the Wanliu Divine Tree was taken, it should have returned to the Starry Sky and couldn’t have appeared on the Realm God Continent.","Therefore, there was only one possibility: the opponent’s secret technique or supreme treasure might be related to the Wanliu Divine Tree.","This discovery was actually a small opportunity.","It might be useful to a Universe God, but it wasn’t very useful to him.","After ten thousand years of dormancy, encountering this opportunity wasn’t too bad.","The future was still long.","In ten thousand eras, he might encounter an opportunity that interested him.","Among countless opportunities, he might find one that could help him.","So he wasn’t in a hurry at all.","These years, it wasn’t just this avatar of his that was moving. A large number of his avatars had already infiltrated various major heritage families.","Or they had established their own forces, spread across the entire Wild Ancient Domain.","It wouldn’t be long before he could turn the entire Wild Ancient Domain upside down.","At this moment, as he followed Xiang Yang into the rat nest.","The Zhu family had also made a new discovery.","Mount Zhu Huo.","In the cave of the Zhu family’s ancestor.","Several Universe Gods were gathered there.","Among them was the Universe God who initially invited Jian Wushuang into the Zhu family and was also the formidable expert stationed at the Twilight Plains.","“The Xiang family has been enduring for so many years, it seems they can no longer hold back!”","The only person seated on the throne within the cave mansion, a red-haired elder, slowly stood up. His aura was terrifying, a genuine four-star Universe God.","He gazed at everything below him in silence. No one dared to speak.","“The Twilight Plains, the item that the alien girl has her eyes on, is in the Twilight Plains. You will take everyone to the outskirts of the Twilight Plains. Do not startle the snake before she emerges; once she does, bring her directly to Fire God Mountain!”","After the order was given, the Zhu family’s Universe Gods below finally dared to speak.","“Yes, Patriarch!”","The patriarch of the Zhu family slowly raised his hand and said indifferently, “Go and prepare!”","They left quickly, and once outside the cave mansion, the five three-star Universe Gods with some strength in the Zhu family began to assemble their subordinates and split up to act.","“Fuhai, the Twilight Plains are your territory. You are responsible for keeping an eye on that area. As for the Xiang family and Giant Deer City, I will handle them!”","“Don’t worry, Second Brother. I will take people to the Twilight Plains immediately!” Fuhai was very confident and left with a bow.","He then notified all the powerful beings under his command.","To be cautious, he also contacted Jian Wushuang.","In fact, he had little confidence in this guest who had been recruited ten thousand years ago because Jian Wushuang had not moved around much over the years and had always been comprehending the Fire God Stele at Fire God Mountain.","Originally, he didn’t want to call on Jian Wushuang, but since Jian Wushuang had done nothing but comprehend their Zhu family’s Fire God Stele all these years, he thought it was time to make him contribute.","Little did he know, this played right into Jian Wushuang’s hands.","As the gods of the Zhu family descended from the mountain, a storm began to sweep across Fire God Mountain.","Jian Wushuang’s two avatars were both caught up in it.","The weaker one was with the Xiang family, and the stronger one was with the Zhu family.","No matter which side won, it wouldn’t affect him much.","At the Twilight Plains, Jian Wushuang’s Universe Master avatar delved into the mouse nest, causing destruction everywhere.","Especially because Dantai had almost fallen in the last mouse tide, this time he was very diligent in destroying the mouse nests.","Xiang Yang was the same.","Maybe it was because there weren’t many demon mice in the nests; everyone was relaxed and had little defense.","However, Jian Wushuang’s heart was always on edge.","Especially knowing that the Zhu family had already started taking action against the Xiang family.","He felt that this opportunity might level up.","He had originally thought he would hibernate at Fire God Mountain for a long time, but it seemed this time would be shortened.","Just as they were wantonly destroying the mouse nests, a black mist emerged from the ground.","The mist instantly devoured the demon mice.","A sense of unease grew in everyone’s hearts.","“What is that?” Dantai pointed to the black mist below, his eyes widening.","Jian Wushuang, well-versed in many things, recognized it at a glance.","“Death Qi, everyone be careful, shield your divine bodies with mental power!”","Hearing this, everyone quickly enveloped their bodies with mental power and held their breath.","The Death Qi surged out continuously from the ground, making Jian Wushuang feel uneasy.","“How many people must have perished to gather such a vast amount of Death Qi?” He thought, recalling the Extinction event.","Although the Death Qi here couldn’t compare to that of the Extinction, producing so much Death Qi meant that even if all life in the Northern Spacetime was sacrificed, it wouldn’t generate this much.","There was only one possibility: the Death Qi originated from the time when the Realm God Continent shattered.","This intrigued Jian Wushuang greatly. Since the Death Qi appeared from underground, there might be a massive world down there.","It could be an ancient mass grave or a world annihilated to produce such immense Death Qi.","The vitality of the Twilight Plains was probably not absorbed but disrupted by the Death Qi.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang ignored the others and directly charged underground.","He wanted to explore.","Seeing him rush in recklessly, Xiang Yang hurriedly shouted, “Brother Wushuang, don’t be rash. There might be danger below!”","Jian Wushuang paid no heed and rushed to the source of the Death Qi.","He parted the black mist with his hands, revealing an entrance.","“As expected, there’s a huge world hidden below!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes showed delight.","A concealed world would be extraordinary.","Although the strongest Universe Gods near Fire God Mountain only had four-star combat power, countless years had passed, and there must have been super experts who stayed here, possibly six-star or even seven-star Universe Gods."]},{"number":6239,"title":"Chapter 6239: Death Energy Revival","paragraphs":["Chapter 6239: Death Energy Revival","Even they hadn’t discovered that this place concealed a great world, so the foundation of this great world was definitely not ordinary.","It might even be larger than the entire Wild Ancient Domain.","With a thought, he first used his mind power to project into the great world below, while his dharma body turned back.","This dharma body was too weak; going down wouldn’t yield much.","Moreover, the entrance was right here, so he wasn’t in a hurry. He could completely send a stronger dharma body to investigate.","“The nearest six-star dharma body to Fire God Mountain needs four hours!” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow slightly. It was almost enough time.","The premise was that his three-star Universe God Dao Image had to hold off the Zhu family. “Wushuang, you just scared me!” Dantai, seeing him return, let out a sigh of relief.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, saying calmly, “Just curious, wanted to take a look!” “Curious?” Everyone was a bit puzzled.","This was a matter of life and death, and he wanted to take a look just out of curiosity?","Being in the midst of deathly energy would erode one’s vitality, and in severe cases, it could even lead to immediate death.","Moreover, they could all see that Jian Wushuang’s divine power had greatly diminished, just because the deathly energy had eroded his divine power.","But Jian Wushuang remained calm, which was somewhat inexplicable.","Xiang Yang, although somewhat suspicious, didn’t ask much and changed the topic: “Everyone, the mutation in the mouse hole has exceeded our control. It’s time to leave now!”","“That’s right. Discovering the deathly energy cave might still be a great achievement. This time, Young Master Xiang Yang will surely be greatly rewarded by the family!”","Facing the flattery, Xiang Yang was not proud; instead, he felt a bit fearful at this moment. It might also be due to delayed realization.","As they prepared to leave, Xiang Yang noticed that Jian Wushuang hadn’t moved, showing a reluctance to leave, so he stopped.","“Wushuang, what’s wrong?”","Jian Wushuang stood still, looking at everyone, and said calmly, “Young Master Xiang Yang, you’d better not leave this place now!”","Because the Xiang family in Giant Deer City was already gone.","The Twilight Plains were also surrounded by Zhu family experts.","Leaving now would lead to certain death.","In the past hundred thousand years, Jian Wushuang had realized that although Xiang Yang came from a prestigious family, he didn’t put on airs towards ordinary practitioners and had a decent character.","Now, at the moment of parting, he wanted to help if he could.","Hearing this, Xiang Yang was somewhat confused and frowned, saying, “Are you going to stop me?”","He had already been somewhat suspicious of Jian Wushuang’s odd behavior. Now, hearing his slightly threatening words, he naturally refused to back down.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit helpless and had to make up a lie, saying he had a companion in the Zhu family. Just now, Giant Deer City had been taken by the Zhu family, and all the Xiang family experts had been executed.","Upon hearing this news, everyone laughed.","Because they simply didn’t believe it.","Just a day ago, everything was fine; how could it be gone now?","This time, however, Xiang Yang took it seriously and hurriedly tried to contact his mother.","But he found he was already cut off.","This inevitably made him panic.","He then tried to contact his father and some elders in the family, but he couldn’t reach any of them.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang spoke again, “Why don’t you try contacting Elder Chi of the third house?”","Hearing this, Xiang Yang grabbed onto this last hope and hurriedly contacted Elder Chi of the third house.","The rest of the people also sensed that something was amiss at this moment and fell silent, their faces serious.","They were all on the same boat now. If the Xiang family were to be ruined, they wouldn’t escape either.","“Elder Chi, what on earth is happening? Why can’t I reach anyone inside Julu City?” Xiang Yang almost roared into his communication talisman.","After a short while, the talisman echoed with Elder Chi’s deep voice.","“Xiang Yang, has a Death Cave appeared inside the rat hole? Quickly tell me its location!”","Elder Chi’s tone was also urgent.","Xiang Yang had a thousand questions he wanted to ask, but hearing Elder Chi’s voice, he suppressed them all.","He now wanted to ask clearly face-to-face, so he revealed his location.","As soon as he finished speaking, a rift in space-time appeared above the rat hole.","A group of people emerged from it.","At the forefront was an alien woman wearing a mask.","When she appeared, Xiang Yang’s eyes widened.","“It’s you!!!”","He could hardly believe it. The woman before him, who was supposed to have fallen, was still","alive.","Although she wore a mask, he recognized her at a glance.","The alien woman didn’t even look at him, heading straight towards the exit of the deathly","aura.","Elder Chi followed behind her, also ignoring Xiang Yang.","At this moment, Xiang Yang’s state of mind was shattered by the events of the day.","Jian Wushuang sighed, walked up, patted his shoulder, and consoled, “Some things are better not known. The most important thing now is survival. Follow me closely later!”","But after saying this, he himself headed towards the upper mine pit.","Xiang Yang was stunned for a moment, feeling increasingly that Jian Wushuang was too","mysterious.","Even Dantai beside him spoke up, “Young Master Xiang Yang, why don’t we follow","Wushuang?”","But just as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang, who had just left, sent a message telling the","two to wait in place.","Following his current avatar would be courting death.","They should follow his other avatar.","At this moment, above the Twilight Plains, a large number of Zhu family experts were","gathering.","Among them was Jian Wushuang’s avatar.","“No more waiting, go in and search for people. Kill all the Xiang family members. Remember,","all Xiang family members, not anyone else!”","“Yes!”","The many experts responded in unison, shaking the heavens.","Jian Wushuang’s voice was also among them.","However, the most noticeable was a small alien youth in the team, with light blue skin.","It was another of Jian Wushuang’s avatars.","With the battle power of a Six-Star Universe God.","Enough to sweep across the entire Fire God Mountain.","The team dispersed after entering the plains.","This gave Jian Wushuang a chance to gather his three avatars.","He did not rush to reveal his identity.","Swish!!!","Three figures appeared above the mine pit.","Using the avatar of the Universe Master as the main body, he controlled everything.","“Finally, I can open that hole and see what’s hidden below!”","Jian Wushuang, after the strong reinforcements arrived, directly rushed towards the cave","below.","The two super avatars then revealed the location, bringing the Zhu family experts.","A grand drama was about to unfold.","Inside the rat hole.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s avatar return, Xiang Yang seemed to grasp the root of everything,","wanting to know the family’s situation from Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang only shook his head lightly.","The Xiang family was already gone.","Now was not the time for attachment; they should consider whether they could survive.","Moreover, the Xiang family had repeatedly schemed against their own kin, using Xiang Yang,","the big fool, to take the lead and attract firepower.","Gone was gone.","If not for his avatar’s intervention last time, Xiang Yang would have already died.","There was nothing worth holding on to about such a family."]},{"number":6240,"title":"Chapter 6240: Mysterious Great World","paragraphs":["Chapter 6240: Mysterious Great World","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang braved the deathly aura once more, reaching the edge of the cave.","At that moment, several powerful members of the Xiang family, led by the foreign woman, were gathered nearby, all remaining silent.","“Are they all under control?” Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised. He hadn’t expected the foreign woman to have such a skill, as he hadn’t noticed it before.","“Throw him in!” Unexpectedly, before he could speak, the foreign woman directed her attention toward him.","“Yes!” Elder Chi responded without hesitation and prepared to act against Jian Wushuang.","“No need, I’ll go in myself!” He understood that they wanted to use him to test what lay inside.","This also revealed that the foreign woman’s strength was not particularly formidable; otherwise, she would have gone in already instead of hesitating. Clearly, she was unsure of what was hidden beneath the cave.","Seeing his cooperation, the foreign woman’s eyes showed surprise. Through the empty spaces in her mask, she looked at Jian Wushuang, seemingly sensing a familiar aura, and wanted to retract her words.","However, before she could, Jian Wushuang leaped into the cave.","Swoosh!","Passing through the deathly aura, Jian Wushuang fully entered the cave.","The inside of the cave was chaotic, filled with the deathly aura.","Roars echoed, causing his expression to change.","“As expected, there is life in this great world!” He was quite satisfied with this discovery and, with a thought, activated his divine power.","Two giant avatars that had been guarding the mine above simultaneously rushed downward.","Entering the rat’s nest startled Xiang Yang.","He recognized one of the avatars as Jian Wushuang’s three-star Universe God avatar.","Back then, that avatar’s exceptional swordsmanship had left Xiang Yang in awe.","Seeing it again now, he still felt the same admiration.","But before he could speak, the avatar rushed into the deathly aura cave below.","The foreign woman at the cave entrance was shocked, thinking that the experts of the Zhu family had found this place. She hurriedly prepared to act but realized that the avatar ignored her and directly entered the cave.","Swoosh!!","The next moment, it was inside.","“This avatar of mine can’t be kept!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, and his divine power shattered.","The deathly aura’s erosion was too severe.","He retained only his consciousness.","The other shorter avatar also shattered its divine body.","It began to merge with the sword-wielding avatar.","The three avatars fused into one.","Although the divine power did not increase much, the consciousness nearly doubled.","In an instant, he had the combat power of a quasi-seven-star.","An invisible sword appeared in his hand, and with one slash, it pierced the void, humming with a sword cry.","“Reincarnation of Time and Space!”","Jian Wushuang roared.","With a single slash, he broke through the entrance of the cave.","Time and space shattered along with it.","The originally small entrance instantly opened wide.","The roars hidden within the deathly aura seemed to find an exit, surging towards the crack as if trying to escape this great world.","Jian Wushuang was indifferent to this.","Standing amidst the deathly aura, he watched countless demons and monsters fly out.","The outside world was thrown into chaos.","The foreign woman who had been spying on the area hurriedly led her people to retreat.","But behind them were the Zhu family experts chasing her.","It was a dead end.","Fortunately, the demons in the deathly aura did not discriminate; like beasts unleashed, they bit anything in sight.","“What’s happening?”","The Universe God from the Zhu family was also stunned. They knew about the rat hole here but never expected such creatures to be hiding inside!","Seeing the situation deteriorate, they wanted to retreat.","They no longer cared about the foreign woman.","The demons varied in strength but were all at the Universe God level.","As if driven mad, they frantically ran out.","They tore apart any strong opponent standing in their way.","Xiang Yang and his group were terrified, not knowing where to go.","In their helplessness, Jian Wushuang emerged with his sword.","However, wearing a mask, Xiang Yang couldn’t recognize him.","But the Zhu family’s Universe God knew and wanted to step forward to inquire, but Jian Wushuang struck directly.","With a single sword strike, he shattered both the demons and the Zhu family’s experts into pieces, entangled with time and space.","Zhu Fuhai was shocked.","That sword strike just now had surpassed his understanding.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang lightly removed his mask, revealing his true face.","Xiang Yang was stunned.","“Jian Wushuang?”","Jian Wushuang, who was previously a Universe Master, had suddenly become a Universe God, a super expert capable of breaking through time and space with one sword. How could he not be surprised?","Although they had known each other for ten thousand years, Xiang Yang had always found Jian Wushuang somewhat mysterious but never thought he hid his strength so deeply.","“If you want to live, stand behind me!” Jian Wushuang held his divine sword in reverse, his tone authoritative.","At this moment, the former calmness was gone.","Xiang Yang didn’t dare to breathe heavily in front of him and obediently stood behind him.","“You come here too!” Jian Wushuang turned to the foreign woman.","She couldn’t die either; he hadn’t yet asked about her secrets.","As for the Zhu family members, they knew the secrets of this place and couldn’t be left alive.","He raised his hand and slashed several times.","The entire Twilight Plains instantly became a rift in time and space.","He destroyed this treasure land.","He wanted to cover the great world below.","Otherwise, with more people, it would be more troublesome to explore.","Xiang Yang and the foreign woman stood obediently behind him, not daring to say a word.","After dealing with the rest, Jian Wushuang turned to them.","“Thank you, senior, for saving our lives!” Xiang Yang quickly knelt and bowed.","The foreign woman, however, remained proud, even looking at Jian Wushuang with her head held high, saying nothing.","“Heh, quite resilient!”","Jian Wushuang smiled slightly, waved his hand, and directly enveloped the two, rushing into the time and space rift.","As he entered the rift, the destroyed Twilight Plains returned to calm.","The rift instantly healed.","Only a void remained where the grassland used to be.","Above the void stood a young figure identical to Jian Wushuang.","This was his Dharma body.","One of the five major Seven-Star Universe God Dharma bodies.","He personally guarded this place.","Jian Wushuang could now explore the great world below with peace of mind.","The Zhu family’s Fire God Mountain had just been swept into flat ground.","However, it didn’t attract much attention in the entire Wild Ancient Domain.","Most of the super experts were exploring the newly emerged secret realm.","It was Jian Wushuang’s original divine body.","No one paid attention to the destruction of a small Fire God Mountain.","But a few Universe Gods from Yushen Mountain came to investigate the ruins for a few days, found nothing significant, and left.","Later, the surrounding territories of Fire God Mountain were naturally swallowed by other forces.","Twilight Plains became history, with no one paying attention.","As for the Dharma body of Jian Wushuang that entered the mysterious great world, no one knew about it.","In the depths of twilight.","The hidden great world unfolded before Jian Wushuang.","“Whoosh whoosh!!!”","The sound of seawater crashing against the shore echoed continuously."]},{"number":6241,"title":"Chapter 6241: Xing Luo","paragraphs":["Chapter 6241: Xing Luo","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","On a mysterious world, three figures lay sprawled on a beach.","Two men and a woman.","Judging by their appearance, they seemed to have been washed ashore by the sea, and all of them were unconscious.","A young man dressed in a green robe was the first to wake up.","His eyelids fluttered, and as he opened his eyes, the first thing he saw was the white sandy beach and the greenery on the island.","“What is this place?”","The awakened man slowly got up, looking around at everything with a sense of shock.","It wasn’t the island’s scenery that surprised him, but a feeling of powerlessness.","“Where is my divine power?”","The young man clenched his hands, talking to himself.","A moment ago, he was a sword god with surging sword intent, but now he was as powerless as a child.","This man was none other than Jian Wushuang.","He had entered this world together with a foreign woman and Xiang Yang.","He had saved Xiang Yang in passing, while he intended to investigate the identity of the foreign woman and understand why she possessed the power of Wanliu.","Unexpectedly, as he ventured deeper into the Death Cavern, he felt increasingly powerless.","Even his near seven-star combat strength couldn’t withstand it.","He had planned to leave and send in a stronger incarnation to explore further.","But at that moment, the death energy had seized him, dragging him into this world.","After that, he lost consciousness completely.","Upon waking up, he found all his divine power gone.","He was left with a body that had been weakened countless times.","At this moment, he was no different from an ordinary person.","He couldn’t even use the storage ring on his finger.","The crucial point was that he had lost contact with the outside world.","He couldn’t communicate with his true self.","This meant his consciousness was trapped in this world.","Thinking back to the crazed demon that had been fleeing earlier, it was likely a cultivator trapped in this world as well.","Thinking of this, he stumbled and fell onto the foreign woman.","Gush!","The foreign woman, pressed by his weight, opened her mouth and spat out a mouthful of seawater. After a few coughs, she also woke up.","Jian Wushuang paid no heed, unable to fathom how, after entering this world, he would be stripped of his divine power.","Now, his consciousness was sealed as well.","Wasn’t he trapped here for good?","“What should I do?”","Jian Wushuang became anxious.","In the past, when he encountered such situations, he at least had a backup plan.","For instance, the True Spirit or the Realm King could support him.","But now, no one knew he was trapped in this strange world.","No one would come to rescue him.","He had to rely on himself.","Without the guidance of his true self’s mental power, the incarnations in the outside world would fall into slumber.","Even his divine body in the void would be the same.","He had really thrown himself into a pit of fire this time.","“Get off me!” The foreign woman, now awake, found herself pinned under Jian Wushuang and pushed him away.","She brushed the sand off her body with disdain, stood up, and unlike Jian Wushuang, she seemed not shocked but rather excited.","It was as if she had returned to her homeland, taking deep breaths of the air.","Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed. Although he had lost his divine power, his eyesight remained sharp. He wasn’t a child; he immediately noticed that the foreign woman was very familiar with this place.","“Have you been here before?”","The alien girl turned her head and gave him a sidelong glance, mocking, “What’s it to you?”","She didn’t care how powerful Jian Wushuang was in the outside world; in this world, it was useless.","Without even looking at Jian Wushuang properly, she lifted her head and prepared to leave.","Seeing that being soft didn’t work, Jian Wushuang got up and chased after her, grabbing her shoulder. He spoke in a cold, harsh tone, “Since you won’t talk nicely...”","Just as he was about to use force, he felt a strange power emanate from her. With a mere frown, she sent him flying back a hundred feet, and he plunged into the sea again.","“He didn’t lose his power?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Earlier, he had guessed that this world would strip people of their power, but she still had some kind of power.","Though it wasn’t divine power, the aura was still not that of a mortal.","This confirmed his suspicion even more.","Swimming to the shore, Jian Wushuang glared at the alien girl who was about to leave and shouted angrily, “Don’t think I can’t deal with you. If my avatar falls, I’ll return to the outside world, and this entire great world will be doomed!”","This threat was not an empty one.","He was ready to sacrifice himself, abandoning both his mental strength and divine power.","However, there was one thing he didn’t dare to gamble on—that if he fell, he wouldn’t be able to transfer his consciousness to the outside world. That would truly be the end.","But he gambled that she didn’t know this.","When the alien girl stopped in her tracks, he knew he had won the bet.","“Are you threatening me?” The alien girl slowly turned her head, her gaze icy as she stared at Jian Wushuang.","A wave of murderous intent hit Jian Wushuang, almost making him lose his footing.","But having experienced many life-and-death situations, he wasn’t going to be scared by a girl, even if he had lost all his power. Standing firm, he said resolutely, “You can think of it that way!”","“Hmph, then just die!” The alien girl sneered and prepared to leave directly.","Jian Wushuang didn’t expect her to be so straightforward.","She didn’t care about his threat at all; he had thought it would work.","Just then, a voice called out to the alien girl.","“Xing Luo, is that you?”","Hearing this voice, the alien girl froze. This time, she didn’t show the indifference she had towards Jian Wushuang but a sorrow that was hard to describe. Finally, she replied in a trembling voice, “Xing Luo is already dead. I’m not her!”","“You can’t fool me!”","Xiang Yang stood up, ignoring the peculiarities of the place, and walked straight towards the alien girl.","“Why did you abandon me back then? Why?” Xiang Yang’s voice was heart-wrenching.","This left Jian Wushuang confused. He didn’t expect the two to have a past, and their relationship seemed unusual.","The alien girl, Xing Luo, took a deep breath, glanced sideways at Xiang Yang, and said softly, “If you want to know, swim thirty miles southeast. I’ll be waiting there!”","With that, her figure rose into the air, and that power erupted again.","Unfortunately, this power was very weak, like a mortal just beginning to practice, relying on ordinary energy to support the body.","Naturally, her strength wasn’t impressive.","Watching her back, Xiang Yang didn’t hesitate and prepared to leap up, only to realize that his divine power was long gone.","He looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“What happened?”","“How should I know? Swim!”","Jian Wushuang spread his hands, helpless. They had no choice but to follow her instructions.","The two of them headed southeast, diving into the vast ocean.","Years of cultivation had made them forget how fragile a mortal body was.","After swimming less than three miles, they were both on the verge of collapse.","They swam purely on willpower.","Thirty miles took them the entire day."]},{"number":6242,"title":"Chapter 6242: Robbed by a Mortal","paragraphs":["Chapter 6242: Robbed by a Mortal","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If not for encountering a giant sea turtle, the two would have drowned in the sea.","Jian Wushuang had never been so frustrated.","Back when he was tempering his body, he could compare to the gods even with a mortal body.","Now, he was in this state.","In the outside world, he was a Ninth Tribulation Universe God.","Midnight.","The two finally swam to shore.","There was a pier built by mortals here.","Even at night, it was brightly lit, with people coming and going.","Seeing two young men in melted clothes swimming over from the sea, everyone widened their eyes, looking incredulous.","“Whoo, whoo!”","Jian Wushuang dragged his exhausted body, sprawling on the dock, panting heavily.","Next to him, Xiang Yang was even worse off, unable to catch his breath.","A few porters, curious about the spectacle, walked up and asked softly, “Young masters, what happened to you?”","Because Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were dressed well, these porters were quite polite.","But Xiang Yang was too naive, perhaps never having experienced the mortal world, and he immediately gave away their situation.","Jian Wushuang wanted to stop him but couldn’t.","As soon as Xiang Yang regained some strength, he loudly proclaimed his identity and mentioned he was searching for Xing Luo.","Seeing the noble young man before them being completely out of touch, the porters’ eyes showed disbelief.","What Fire God Mountain, what Giant Deer City.","They had never heard of these places, but they did notice the jade pendant hanging from Xiang Yang’s waist, their eyes revealing a greedy gleam.","“Old Third, that jade pendant looks nice. If we took it, we could enjoy ourselves in town for a while!” A sly-looking porter showed a greedy look but didn’t have the courage, so he nudged a sturdy porter next to him to try and get some benefits from Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang.","The burly porter glared at him and sneered, “Do you think I’m that kind of person? Let me tell you, Chen Mazi, if you dare cause trouble at the pier, I’ll be the first to deal with you!”","After saying that, he turned and scolded the others, “What are you looking at? Don’t you have work to do? Get back to work!”","As soon as the burly porter spoke, the onlookers all shrank back, not daring to disobey, and quickly turned to leave.","However, Chen Mazi couldn’t help but look back at Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang as he left.","After the others left, the burly porter spoke to Xiang Yang, “I’ve never heard of any Fire God Mountain or Giant Deer City, but there is a small island thirty miles away, probably Oasis Island. It’s quite something that you young masters with such delicate skin could swim over from there!”","“Also, the nearest big city from here is Yong City, and this is Chishui Pier in Qingshan Town. If you have acquaintances, you can send a letter to have someone pick you up. If not, you can wait at the pier. There will be merchant ships traveling the river to Yong City, and you can take one of those!”","The burly porter’s words were quite polite, and he even pointed them in the right direction.","But Xiang Yang couldn’t listen, shouting and searching for Xing Luo.","This made everyone at the pier look over.","The highest three-story building on the pier lit up, and an elderly man stepped out, questioning, “Hu San, what’s going on? Who’s shouting?”","“Master Liu, two people floated in from the sea, saying they want to go to some Giant Deer City, Fire God Mountain?” Hu San replied truthfully.","Master Liu frowned, looked at Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang through the dim light, his eyes softened, and he said calmly, “Bring them up!”","Upon hearing this, Xiang Yang seemed to grab a lifeline, thinking the person upstairs knew about Giant Deer City.","Jian Wushuang and Hu San were dragged upstairs eagerly.","However, Hu San, walking ahead, clearly showed signs of hesitation, and there was a hint of worry in his eyes when he looked at the two of them.","The rough-looking man before them seemed intimidating but was kind-hearted deep down. This was the insight Jian Wushuang had gained from his many years of experience.","“Xiang Yang, stop dreaming. Let me tell you honestly, this world is different from the Realm God Continent. Don’t fantasize. Be careful when we go upstairs and follow my lead,” Jian Wushuang warned cautiously.","He regretted not informing Xiang Yang about the situation here earlier.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Xiang Yang visibly paused, showing disbelief in his eyes.","However, recalling Jian Wushuang’s strength outside, he began to think Jian Wushuang might be telling the truth.","Otherwise, where had his divine power gone?","Even his Thought power was missing.","By this time, they had followed Hu San upstairs.","Walking along the creaky corridor, they could see the vast ocean through the window. That was where they had come from. But now, they couldn’t fly, nor could they use mental power to investigate. They couldn’t find an exit at all. Their only hope was to find Xing Luo, who surely knew the secrets of this great world. The only one who could help him leave this world was Xing Luo, or the aura of Wanliu on her.","Following Hu San into the only room on the third floor, a pungent smell immediately interrupted Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, causing him to look over in annoyance. He saw a man known as Master Liu lying diagonally on the bed, smoking a dry tobacco pipe, with an ugly but well-built woman leaning beside him.","It had been a long time since Jian Wushuang had seen such a combination of appearance and demeanor. The women he had encountered were all extraordinary; otherwise, they wouldn’t catch his eye. Yet, this ugly woman in the room didn’t even spare a glance at them, as if looking down on them.","The pungent smell came from under the bed, and what it was needed no explanation.","“Master Liu, I’ve brought them!” Hu San cautiously reminded as he stood before the bed.","Master Liu nodded slightly and then opened his eyes to scrutinize Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang before saying indifferently, “Judging by your looks, are you from a noble family?”","“No!” Jian Wushuang replied before Xiang Yang could speak.","“Heh, still unwilling to tell the truth even here?” Master Liu sneered.","He was a dominant figure at the Chishui Wharf, akin to a local emperor. He had been to Yong City and seen the big world. With a glance, he could tell that Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were wealthy escapees from some merchant ship. Recently, with unrest in Yong City, many nobles were fleeing to the sea. So, he mistook Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang for rich escapees. In peaceful times, he might have been wary, but now, with those nobles fleeing towards the Chiling Sea, he had no concerns. He immediately signaled Hu San to search them.","“How dare you touch me!” Xiang Yang almost jumped up at this, unable to bear Master Liu’s gaze. In the past, not even Universe Masters would dare scold him like this, let alone a mere mortal."]},{"number":6243,"title":"Chapter 6243: Mortal’s Suffering","paragraphs":["Chapter 6243: Mortal’s Suffering","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hu San frowned and hesitated to act, but seeing Liu Ye’s unyielding gaze, he could only say coldly, “Behave yourselves, hand over everything you have, or you won’t leave Chiling Wharf alive!”","“Xiang Yang, listen to him!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","If it came to a fight, although he wasn’t as strong as Hu San, his martial arts skills would make it easy to take him down.","But that would be too messy.","He could tell that Hu San wasn’t a bad person. At most, he could give him some of his accessories.","After all, these things held no value to him now.","He handed them over without hesitation.","Casually, he took off the diamond-encrusted hat and bracelet from his wrist.","However, he kept the mustard seed.","In case his spiritual power returned, there were still things inside that he could use.","Luckily, he wasn’t his true self. Otherwise, he would have had to give the Beast God Weapon and the Myriad Tribulation Sword to mere mortals.","“Tsk tsk, you’re quite cooperative. Hu San, get them some new clothes and let them settle down at the wharf.”","“Alright, I’ll arrange it right away!” Hu San seemed to breathe a sigh of relief and quickly called Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang to leave.","After descending the wooden building, Hu San let out a long breath, glanced at Jian Wushuang, and praised, “Not bad, kid. You know how to bend and stretch. If you had dared to resist just now, you’d be feeding the fish by now!”","“Cut the crap, what do you want?” Xiang Yang couldn’t help but question.","Hu San touched his chin and said indifferently, “I won’t do anything to you, but Liu Ye might not be so kind!”","With that, he ignored Xiang Yang and walked straight to a row of thatched huts, pointing to an empty one, “Get in there. From now on, you two are porters at Chiling Wharf. If you have any problems, come to me!”","“Porters?” Xiang Yang was taken aback at first, then looked at the emaciated men who were neither human nor ghost, his eye twitching, and he burst into laughter.","Jian Wushuang shrugged. Without saying a word, he pulled Xiang Yang into the hut.","Still somewhat defiant, Xiang Yang shouted, “Jian Wushuang, you’re a Universe God, and you’re just going to let mortals treat you like this?”","“What else can I do?” Jian Wushuang spread his hands helplessly, “Let them chop us up to feed the fish?”","“That would be less humiliating than this!” Xiang Yang was still dissatisfied.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold. He raised his hand and slapped Xiang Yang across the face.","As a mortal, Xiang Yang immediately felt a burning pain on his cheek. Without his powers, he was nothing now.","Even ordinary physical pain was unbearable for him.","The only thing he had left was his identity as a young master.","“You hit me?” Xiang Yang touched his cheek, his eyes widening as he prepared to fight Jian Wushuang.","Though Jian Wushuang was now a mortal, his martial arts skills were exceptional. He lifted his leg and kicked Xiang Yang out the door.","The kick was so strong that even the sturdy Hu San would have struggled to withstand it.","Let alone the frail Xiang Yang, who had spent the entire day soaking in the sea. The kick rendered him unable to move, clutching his stomach and unable to make a sound.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, walked over to Xiang Yang, squatted down, and said coldly, “Let me tell you, we are both mortals now. Drop your young master act. In this world, we are lower than ants. If you want to survive, you must endure. If you want to return to your former glory, you must listen to me, understand?”","Curled up on the ground, Xiang Yang couldn’t speak, but it was clear he understood the message, nodding heavily.","Seeing that the other party had calmed down, Jian Wushuang helped Xiang Yang up, supporting him to lie down on the bed. Unexpectedly, Xiang Yang started to cry at this moment.","Although it seemed somewhat ridiculous, thinking about it, it also seemed normal.","He had become a mere mortal; wasn’t crying normal?","After a moment of easing the tension, Jian Wushuang finally got to the point.","“What exactly is going on with Xing Luo?”","Upon hearing the name Xing Luo, Xiang Yang coughed dryly, his eyes reddening as he spoke, “She was a little beggar my elder brother and I picked up in Giant Deer City. You should have heard what happened later. My elder brother and I became enemies because of her, and Xing Luo chose an elder from the family and became his concubine. At that time, my strength was still weak. I begged my elder brother to rescue Xing Luo because I didn’t believe she went willingly, but he refused!”","“I’m not interested in that. Just tell me what Xing Luo has to do with this world, if your Xiang family knows about her powers, and why you keep targeting Twilight Plains!”","A series of questions left Xiang Yang dumbfounded.","He looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","Jian Wushuang then realized that Xiang Yang was just a pawn used by his family or perhaps even by Xing Luo.","How could he know the actual situation?","Seeing his bewildered expression, Jian Wushuang could only sigh helplessly.","“Spent a lifetime hunting eagles, and now...”","He never expected that the trap he set would end up ensnaring himself.","Falling into this great world.","Losing everything from the outside.","Even being subjected to a tribulation by mortals, nearly stripped of his clothes.","Just as he thought of this, footsteps sounded outside the door.","The person who came in was Hu San, holding two sets of black hemp clothes. He casually threw one set to Xiang Yang on the bed and turned to Jian Wushuang, saying, “Don’t just stand there; take off your clothes. These are better for working!”","Speak of the devil.","Jian Wushuang could only comply helplessly.","In fact, he could have escaped with Xiang Yang or even on his own.","But as a mortal now, where could he go?","The priority now was to find Xing Luo.","However, upon reaching the dock, he couldn’t find a trace of Xing Luo. Most likely, he had been tricked by the other side.","But Jian Wushuang still held a sliver of hope, hoping that Xing Luo would appear and, for Xiang Yang’s sake, tell him the secrets of this world or a way out.","As long as he got out, he swore to shatter this place.","He vowed to use all his divine power.","To elevate his divine power to perfection and break this place, to quell the hatred in his heart.","But for now, he had to face reality.","After changing clothes, Hu San took away their original uniforms, leaving them with two hard and stale corn cakes.","Neither of them could eat it.","But their mortal bodies had already started protesting.","They could only choke down the corn cakes with ice-cold water.","Having been exhausted all day, the two went to sleep early.","The next morning, before dawn, Hu San’s shouting woke them up.","Opening his eyes, Jian Wushuang felt his whole body ache, worse than any life-and-death battle he had ever fought.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang’s willpower remained. He forced himself to stand up.","Xiang Yang, however, was much worse off and couldn’t get up at all."]},{"number":6244,"title":"Chapter 6244: Integration","paragraphs":["In the end, it was he who helped the other person up.","They walked out of the small hut.","Only then did they notice that a group of twenty to thirty porters had lined up, waiting to receive food in a small shed.","The so-called food was actually a joke.","A bowl of vegetable porridge with straw mixed in, and a black bun.","Having experienced it yesterday, neither of them held back, gobbling it down in a frenzy.","Tiger Three, seeing this, smiled slightly, thinking that the two were quite adaptable and quick to blend in.","All the arrogance from the previous day was gone.","Their newfound humility amused him.","The work of these porters in the morning was to carry sacks from the merchant ships docked at the pier.","Each sack weighed at least a hundred pounds.","Despite Jian Wushuang's endurance, after several trips, he found it unbearable.","He even regretted not escaping the previous night.","Xiang Yang was in an even worse state; after only two trips, he was completely exhausted and now hid in the ship, refusing to come out no matter what.","It didn't take long for the overseer to notice.","This person was not as easygoing as Tiger Three. He entered the ship, dragged Xiang Yang out, and gave him a whipping.","None of the other porters who were coming and going stepped forward to help, nor did they even spare a glance.","Jian Wushuang was no exception, observing coldly.","However, his eyes occasionally swept around the surroundings.","In truth, he rather enjoyed watching Xiang Yang get beaten, hoping it might draw out Xing Luo.","After all, the two of them did have some history together.","The Xiang brothers had found her on the streets.","He couldn't be so heartless as to let him die, could he?","Just as Jian Wushuang was searching for Xing Luo's figure, a reprimanding voice stopped the overseer.","It was a clear voice, sounding quite pleasant amidst the noisy dock.","A young woman in green appeared at the foot of the stairs, walking towards the deck below with a frown. She complained, \"Why are you hitting him?\"","\"Miss Liu, this guy was slacking off in the cabin instead of carrying goods. If I hadn't found him, he would have slept till dark!\" the overseer said, kicking Xiang Yang again.","Lying on the ground, Xiang Yang felt dizzy, and when he turned over, his eyes were muddled.","Miss Liu, who had a kind heart, was the adopted daughter of Liu Ye, the dock's boss. She had also suffered through hardships growing up and couldn't stand to see poor people being bullied.","She immediately had Xiang Yang carried into her own room, asked someone to fetch medicine, and personally tended to his wounds.","This beating wasn't in vain after all.","For the next few days, Xiang Yang didn't have to carry sacks anymore.","However, Jian Wushuang had completely lost hope.","Xing Luo didn't appear.","Xiang Yang sat dazed on the doorstep all day, as if he had gone mad.","With only Jian Wushuang left, it became even harder to endure.","One night!","The wounds on Xiang Yang's body had healed, but he still went to find Liu Susu every day to avoid the work of a porter.","He only returned to the shack at night.","Jian Wushuang was completely speechless and ignored him.","He planned to escape in the next few days.","After several days of research, he discovered that after the merchant ships finished loading,","they would stay at the dock for a day and leave early the next morning.","He could easily sneak onto those merchant ships leaving the dock the next morning.","It didn't matter where the destination was.","He couldn't stay here any longer.","Even if he starved to death outside, he couldn't stay here doing pointless work.","Sooner or later, the environment here would erode his will.","When Xing Luo entered this world, she still retained a certain power, which meant that this world was cultivatable.","It wasn't a completely mundane world.","As long as he could cultivate, he could return to his peak.","With his talent and perseverance from the outside world, he would leave this wretched place sooner or later.","But before he could execute his plan, Xiang Yang, unusually, returned to the shack early that","night.","Seeing Jian Wushuang lying on the wooden bed, looking at the moonlight through the window, Xiang Yang first sighed, then said emotionally, \"Jian Wushuang, did you ever think there would be such a day?\"","This sentence seemed to open the floodgates for their conversation.","After all, Jian Wushuang was determined to escape tomorrow, so he spoke freely.","They talked about past experiences.","It wasn't as if he had never experienced the mundane world.","He had been to countless magical worlds.","In the Consciousness Realm, he had even seen the ultimate mysteries of the Starry Sky.","His vast knowledge was far beyond what Xiang Yang could compare.","He said a lot, making Xiang Yang's eyes more resolute.","\"I figured out long ago that you're not an ordinary person. When you hid in my Xiang family, you must have had an agenda. But there's one thing I don't understand. Why choose the Xiang family? If I'm not mistaken, your true strength should be that of a four-star Universe God, or","even stronger!\"","Xiang Yang's guess wasn't wrong; he had deduced it from the Zhu family.","Jian Wushuang was able to kill many strong Zhu family members, definitely possessing the combat power of a four-star Universe God.","But why would such a powerful super expert hide in the Xiang family and be brotherly with him for so many years?","Jian Wushuang was silent for a while and then said calmly, \"For the Divine Tribulation, do","you believe it?\"","\"Tsk, this is the funniest joke I've ever heard!\" Xiang Yang couldn't help but burst into","laughter.","Jian Wushuang himself laughed out loud too.","It was indeed ridiculous.","With his ability to shatter spacetime at will, no one would believe he wasn't a Universe God.","But he really wasn't a Universe God. If he were, he wouldn't have come to such a remote place in the Wild Ancient Domain.","But then again, if he became a Universe God, or a Spacetime God, or an unprecedented deity.","Perhaps he should go to the Starry Sky.","\"Sigh!\"","Jian Wushuang sighed deeply in his heart.","In the Northern Spacetime, he thought he was omnipotent, seeing the future of time and","everything in the past.","Yet he couldn't find his own timeline.","He wanted to see his past self or his future self.","The future!","Speaking of which, this was the path pointed out by Master Xuan Yi.","But how long would he have to wait for the ultimate?","The future is very long.","It could be infinite.","At this moment, he didn't know how far he was from that time.","But Jian Wushuang could feel that after entering this great world, he felt closer.","A great world hidden in the Wild Ancient Domain.","Hiding from an eight-star Universe God was easy.","Even a nine-star Universe God couldn't discover it, which was normal.","The only thing beyond his comprehension was that this world shielded his consciousness.","It isolated his true self.","Moreover, his true self was sealed, so he could only watch.","His true self even lost consciousness.","If he were trapped here and couldn't get out, it would be equivalent to falling.","That was the most terrifying thing.","And since this great world had such special rules, it must be the work of a super existence.","The Realm King couldn't do this.","It was either the Great Realm King or some super existence in the Starry Sky.","Plus, the aura on Xing Luo.","He quickly thought of Zamasu.","Could it be Zamasu's doing?","But then he thought again and found it unnecessary.","Why create this world?","At least he couldn't see its purpose now.","He still needed to explore slowly.","And exploration required strength. If he were just a mortal, with a short lifespan of a hundred","years, he wouldn't be able to traverse this world.","After entering this world, he felt his physical body aging.","His chin had grown stubble, a sign of life passing."]},{"number":6245,"title":"Chapter 6245: The Figure in the Dream","paragraphs":["Chapter 6245: The Figure in the Dream","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Lying on the wooden bed, both of them fell into silence.","Jian Wushuang recalled his own experiences and then turned to look at Xiang Yang.","He couldn’t be sure if the other person was still of any use.","If not, he would leave alone tomorrow.","But he was also worried that if Xing Luo came back to look for Xiang Yang, he would miss a great opportunity.","On the path of cultivation, he had never been afraid. As long as someone guided him, with his talent and determination, he could quickly become the pinnacle of this great world.","There was no way he would lead an unremarkable life.","After hesitating for a long time, he finally spoke, “Xiang Yang, do you plan to stay at this dock for the rest of your life?”","“What else?” Xiang Yang replied in a resigned tone, with a piece of straw in his mouth and a vacant look in his eyes.","He had no choice; he had experienced too little.","As a scion of a family, he had never gone through the mundane times.","Nor had he faced many setbacks.","All along, he had cultivated to become immortal, seeking to become a god.","He had endless opportunities given to him.","Now encountering such a situation, having some awareness was already good enough.","But what Jian Wushuang did not expect was that Xiang Yang suddenly sat up, his eyes focused, staring at him heavily, and said, “Jian Wushuang, are you planning to escape?”","This question made Jian Wushuang frown, but he did not deny it and nodded silently.","“Really?”","“Heh, Xiang Yang, do you think I enjoy carrying sacks?” Jian Wushuang shook his head and smiled bitterly.","He suddenly felt that the other party was too naive, thinking that his lack of resistance and daily labor meant he had integrated into this place.","But how could that be?","He had cultivated for so long, with countless people’s expectations. How could he degrade himself to carry sacks?","If this got out, it would be a laughingstock for many.","Whether on the Realm God Continent or in the Northern Spacetime, many people looked up to him.","With such blessings, Jian Wushuang could not possibly bow down in this small place.","Hearing his firm voice, Xiang Yang’s tone lowered significantly.","“Actually, I’ve been thinking about how to escape for a long time, just afraid you wouldn’t dare!”","“Not dare? Let me tell you, I’ve been through many of these mundane worlds, but every time I win. This time won’t be an exception. I swear that once I leave this world, I will smash it to pieces!” Jian Wushuang said through gritted teeth.","This wretched place that shielded his mind was definitely not simple.","But no matter whose scheme it was, if it was against him, he would not hold back.","“Haha, I thought you were giving up. Didn’t expect you to think the same as me. Sooner or later, we’ll leave this damned place. And before I go, I plan to destroy this dock!” Xiang Yang said excitedly.","Destroy the dock?","This revealed the difference between the two. Jian Wushuang wanted to destroy this world.","Xiang Yang wanted to destroy the dock that had caused him so much pain to vent his resentment.","“The plan, then. With so many people at the dock, we can’t do it alone!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and advised, “As long as the green hills remain, there will be no shortage of firewood. Our top priority is to leave here first!”","“No, I can’t just sneak away. You don’t know how that madman Yang tortured me. I won’t leave just like this; I must kill him!” Xiang Yang clenched his fists.","Yang Madman was the supervisor of the dock.","He was different from Hu San.","Hu San was the leader of the dock workers. Although he didn’t have to do manual labor, his power wasn’t as great as Yang Madman’s.","Currently, this dock was led by Master Liu, with his two capable assistants being Yang Madman and Hu San.","Hu San was simple-minded and kind-hearted, earning the respect of many dock workers.","But Yang Madman was different.","He often tormented some of the workers.","Even if they weren’t slacking off, if he didn’t like the look of someone, they would still get whipped.","After the whipping, it was best to act normal and continue carrying sacks; otherwise, he would hit even harder until the worker was severely injured.","Then he would throw them into the shed to fend for themselves.","So all the workers at the dock feared him, but they dared not speak out against him.","If they were lucky, Liu Susu would intervene; if not, they would be thrown into the sea to feed the fish.","Jian Wushuang had also suffered under him, but fortunately, he had strong willpower.","Unlike Xiang Yang, who was beaten until he curled up on the ground.","No matter what, Jian Wushuang had once been a super strong person and could not be frightened by mere mortals.","“Destroying the dock is difficult, but if you want revenge, I can help you kill Yang Madman!” Jian Wushuang’s voice carried a hint of murderous intent.","Yang Madman’s body wasn’t particularly burly.","He was only seven feet tall.","Both Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were eight feet tall. Although not as tall as the nine-foot Hu San, dealing with a Yang Madman was easy.","Especially with a sneak attack.","Upon hearing this, Xiang Yang’s eyes showed unwillingness. He also wanted to kill Master Liu.","The greatest demon of this dock.","He regarded human lives as nothing.","He was also Liu Susu’s adoptive father.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected Xiang Yang to have such a heavy killing intent and was a bit worried that he might go astray even before starting his path of cultivation.","After all, it took great courage to cultivate again.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t afraid because he had experienced it and was very experienced.","But Xiang Yang was different!","In the future, he would certainly be a burden.","But now he was still useful, and he might attract Xing Luo.","So he couldn’t give up.","For now, Jian Wushuang agreed to give it a try.","As for escaping tomorrow, he hadn’t mentioned it.","Because he wasn’t planning to escape alone.","That night, the two discussed their next steps.","They decided to find an opportunity within three days to kill Yang Madman and then force Master Liu.","As long as they dealt with these two, the dock workers wouldn’t resist because they were already numb; to them, it would just be a change of rulers.","But before doing all this, they needed to deal with one person.","And that was Hu San.","Because even if they killed Master Liu, the dock workers would just turn to Hu San.","If Hu San didn’t let them go, they would still be besieged and killed.","Jian Wushuang, with his mortal body, could handle seven or eight, but more than that, he couldn’t manage.","So with Hu San, they had to use their wits.","It was laughable.","Once upon a time, he could break through the Nine Provinces with a single sword, traverse the universe with one breath.","The man with the sword could shatter the skies and charge through the cosmos.","But now!","He had to use his brain against a mere mortal brute.","Thinking of this, a wave of drowsiness hit, and Jian Wushuang fell into a deep sleep.","In his dreams, he saw scenes from the past.","But when he woke up, it was a living hell for him.","In his daze, he saw a figure in his dream.","The figure had its back to him, but it had a thousand attracting powers, making him want to go forward.","But at this moment, he felt his legs twisting uncontrollably into a knot, no matter how he tried to walk forward, he couldn’t break free.","He wanted to shout but couldn’t make a sound.","He could only stare at the figure.","“Who is that?”","The more Jian Wushuang looked, the more familiar it seemed, but he couldn’t remember the person’s name.","In his daze, someone woke him up.","He opened his eyes.","He saw Xiang Yang, who frowned and said in surprise, “Jian Wushuang, did you have a nightmare? Don’t be too tense; they are just some mortals!”"]},{"number":6246,"title":"Chapter 6246: Murderous Intent","paragraphs":["Chapter 6246: Murderous Intent","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang didn’t pay attention to him. He suddenly stood up and wiped the sweat from his forehead.","After taking a few deep breaths, he said firmly, “Proceed as planned!”","Then, someone walked out of the shack.","The sky outside hadn’t fully brightened yet. He walked familiarly to a well, drew a bucket of ice-cold water, drank two big mouthfuls with a ladle, and, still unsatisfied, poured some over his head.","Only then did he feel a bit more awake.","He washed his face, finally regaining his spirit.","At this time, when he tried to recall the dream, it had already become blurry.","He didn’t pay it much mind, just thinking he was overthinking.","By now, people were already lining up for food at the shack.","He stepped to the back of the line. Just as he steadied himself, someone kicked him from behind.","“You bastard, your food has already been taken, and you’re still lining up!”","Although Jian Wushuang had some basic martial skills, his current body wasn’t very resistant to blows.","That kick sent him sprawling to the ground. He struggled to get up from the muddy ground and turned to see the furious Yang Madman.","And the thorny short whip at his waist.","With eyes full of killing intent, Jian Wushuang didn’t waste words. He picked up the broken bowl from the ground, and while bending down, a subtle killing intent flashed in his eyes.","Let him jump around for a few more days!","He only had a few days left to live anyway.","Now, he also understood Xiang Yang’s thoughts.","Being bullied by Yang Madman for so long, it was really impossible to let go of this grudge without killing him.","He threw the bowl back into the shack and saw the mud on Xiang Yang’s body, knowing that this guy had also been beaten.","Their food had just been taken away.","But both of them smiled slightly, proving their suspicions were correct.","Recently, because Xiang Yang had been taken care of by Liu Susu, Yang Madman got jealous.","In fact, everyone at the dock had some resentment toward Xiang Yang.","There was no helping it. There were over a hundred people at Chishui Dock, but only two women.","One was monopolized by Liu Ye, and the other was Liu Ye’s adopted daughter.","Usually, just seeing Liu Susu’s face could make the porters, who had never touched a woman, feel delighted.","But when they saw Liu Susu getting close to Xiang Yang and even being gentle with him, their hatred intensified.","Especially Yang Madman, who repeatedly went to Hu San to argue.","He wanted Xiang Yang to rejoin the porters’ ranks.","But Hu San refused every time.","Even without Liu Susu’s inquiry, he directly refused.","This left Xiang Yang and Jian Wushuang somewhat puzzled.","Logically, Hu San and Liu Susu were childhood friends. Hu San should have been the angriest.","But not only was Hu San not angry, he even protected Xiang Yang.","This made Jian Wushuang touch his chin and think to himself, “Could it be that Hu San doesn’t like women?”","He then dismissed this thought.","Morning work was the most exhausting.","This was because three merchant ships had arrived last night.","They had already unloaded two ships by noon.","The afternoon would be a bit easier.","During the unloading process, some of the crew members on the merchant ships were discussing matters concerning Yongcheng. Jian Wushuang intentionally slowed his steps and perked up his ears to listen.","“Sigh, I didn’t expect even the nobles of Yongcheng to start withdrawing. Could it be that the Jiang Kingdom really can’t withstand the annexation by the Yue Kingdom?”","“You don’t know, do you? The young prince of the Yue Kingdom married a princess. This time, the young prince is personally leading troops to attack the Jiang Kingdom. It’s bound to be unstoppable!”","“That’s right. The legendary young prince is a master capable of ascending to the heavens and diving into the earth. He can capture a city in a night and a province in ten days. He’s practically a war god!”","Hearing their conversation made Jian Wushuang raise his eyebrows.","Jian Wushuang had no interest in the battles and killings of mortal kingdoms, but hearing about the young prince’s extraordinary abilities piqued his curiosity.","He couldn’t ask directly, so he carried a sack and intentionally walked past the two men, muttering to himself, “Heh, ascending to the heavens and diving into the earth? What a load of nonsense!”","Provoking them was the best way to get them to talk.","It worked everywhere.","Sure enough, the two crew members immediately glared at him.","Although they were all from the Jiang Kingdom, they genuinely admired the young prince, and they immediately retorted, “You, a mere dock worker, know nothing. Just carry your sack!”","“You could never understand someone like the young prince!” the other crew member also retorted.","Seeing they took the bait, Jian Wushuang intentionally sneered, “What, have you seen him with your own eyes?”","“You really are a stubborn fool. Let me tell you, when my brother and I traveled around, you were still hiding in some hole. Although we haven’t seen the young prince in action, we’ve seen plenty of soldiers fleeing from the front lines in panic. They all say the same thing. Do you think they’re all lying?”","“Alright, alright, don’t waste time with him. The ship captain is treating us to drinks in Qingshan Town later. Let’s get ready and go!”","One of the crew members said in a mocking tone, “That’s right, let’s go enjoy ourselves. No need to waste time with a laborer who will never taste wine in his life!”","After saying that, the two turned and left.","Jian Wushuang stood still for a moment with the sack on his back.","Wine!","He hadn’t had any in a long time.","But soon, very soon, he would leave this wretched place.","At noon.","Xiang Yang was inside with Liu Susu, whispering sweet nothings, looking every bit the part of a nobleman.","In fact, he truly was.","He was skilled in the zither, chess, calligraphy, painting, astronomy, and geography.","Especially after enduring hardship, his fawning manner was even more laughable.","He kept trying to make Liu Susu happy.","Jian Wushuang, holding a cornbread, stood outside the door and coughed lightly, then walked towards his shack.","After a while, Xiang Yang returned to the shack alone.","Entering the room, he took out a piece of pastry from his pocket.","“Made with lard, it smells great!”","Although Jian Wushuang felt disdain, his stomach was honest, and he quickly accepted it.","“So, did you find Hu San?” More than the food, he cared about this.","Xiang Yang sat on the bed and sighed, “I did, but that guy is like a block of wood. I hinted, but he didn’t understand a word. I can’t just directly say we need to kill Yang Madman!”","“I forgot about that!” Jian Wushuang slapped his forehead.","He had forgotten something important.","This was the mortal world.","And this dock was the lowest of the mortal world.","Most people here probably couldn’t even recognize ten characters, let alone write their own names.","Not to mention understanding hidden hints, they likely wouldn’t comprehend them.","“Forget it, I’ll handle this!” Jian Wushuang said helplessly.","Hu San was a decent person and wasn’t on their assassination list.","But dealing with him wouldn’t be easy.","People like him valued loyalty and righteousness.","He was practically Liu Ye’s adopted son."]},{"number":6247,"title":"Chapter 6247: Unforeseen Change","paragraphs":["Chapter 6247: Unforeseen Change","It was not easy to make him betray Master Liu; the only breakthrough was Liu Susu.","In the afternoon.","When most of the work was done, Jian Wushuang found Hu San on a merchant ship.","However, Master Liu was also there.","He couldn’t approach, so he pretended to clean the deck nearby.","After a while, Yang Madman also arrived.","At this moment, Yang Madman was dressed neatly.","Wearing a black suit, he came before Master Liu, didn’t even glance at Hu San, and cupped his","hands towards Master Liu, saying, “Liu Dangtou, the matters in Qingshan Town are almost settled. Tomorrow, I can accompany Susu there!”","This sentence made Hu San’s eyebrows twitch, and his emotions showed on his face.","Obviously, he had some concerns about this decision.","“Master Liu, Susu is doing well at the dock. Why go to Qingshan Town? You know the boss has always had an eye on Susu. Isn’t this sending a sheep into the tiger’s mouth?”","“Forgot to tell you, the boss no longer has any thoughts about Susu. Master Liu is sending me to Qingshan Town to prepare a house because I’m going to marry Susu!” Yang Madman said proudly.","Master Liu nodded in satisfaction and said, “The boss has already been handled by Xiao Yang. This dock is still under my control, and Susu following Xiao Yang is not a bad thing. Hu San, you should be happy about this!”","“But...” Hu San wanted to say more, but Master Liu interrupted him.","“No buts. Susu is not young anymore. This matter is settled!”","After Master Liu finished speaking, he suddenly remembered something and reminded, “Oh, right. Hu San, tonight you go with Xiao Yang and kill the kid who’s been pestering Susu!”","The command left no room for Hu San to argue.","Yang Madman followed Master Liu off the merchant ship with a smug expression. Leaving Hu San alone on the deck.","Jian Wushuang listened carefully and walked out from the other side of the deck.","Seeing his appearance, Hu San was taken aback, then helplessly said, “Did you hear everything just now?”","“Not a word missed!”","Jian Wushuang rolled up his sleeves, wrapped the dirty rag around his hand, and his eyes were icy cold.","He believed that to deal with such brutes, he should knock them down first.","“What, you want to fight?”","Before Hu San finished speaking, Jian Wushuang already made a move.","It was almost a sneak attack.","A kick landed on Hu San’s thigh.","The kick caught Hu San off guard.","Moreover, he didn’t expect that the usually weak-looking Jian Wushuang would be so clean and swift in his moves.","Caught off balance, he almost fell. Fortunately, he was robust and raised his hand to subdue Jian Wushuang.","But Jian Wushuang wouldn’t use brute force; he dodged the attack and landed a solid punch on Hu San’s jaw.","This punch was heavier, and Hu San felt the world spinning.","Jian Wushuang struck again, targeting Hu San’s unstable lower body, sweeping him down hard.","Then he pounced, punching Hu San’s chest several times.","Then he wrapped his hands around Hu San’s neck, choking him until Hu San’s face turned red,","his eyes rolled up, and his hands clawed and pulled, but he couldn’t break free.","In the end, with both hands slapping the floor, Jian Wushuang finally released his grip.","The two of them lay on the deck, gasping for breath.","“Hu San, I could have killed you just now!”","“You...you’re ruthless enough!”","Jian Wushuang slowly got up, squatted on the ground, looked at Hu San, and said, “Hu San, have you thought about your future? Staying on this dock forever? Or being ordered around for the rest of your life?”","The string of questions left the already dazed Hu San unsure of how to respond.","“Now, I give you a way out!”","Smack!","Jian Wushuang took out a sharpened iron piece, wrapped with cloth strips around his hand,","very sharp.","“Help me kill Yang Madman!”","“What if I don’t agree?”","“If you don’t agree, I’ll kill you. By then, Yang Madman will take Liu Susu away, and you will also die. Do you think Master Liu can suppress me?”","The previous threats hadn’t moved Hu San at all.","But hearing that Liu Susu would be taken away by Yang Madman, he immediately woke up","and sprang to his feet.","“You can kill me, but you can’t kill Master Liu. If Master Liu dies, Yang Madman will","definitely bully Susu!”","These were his true feelings.","In fact, Hu San didn’t care much about Master Liu’s life or death.","But as long as Master Liu was alive, he could suppress Yang Madman.","If Master Liu died, no one would protect Liu Susu. With Yang Madman’s personality, he might","even sell Susu.","“Hu San, you wouldn’t happen to like Liu Susu, would you!” Jian Wushuang held the iron piece and took half a step back.","Hu San’s face turned even redder, and he quickly shook his head, saying, “Susu doesn’t like people like me. She...she likes those pretty boys like you and Xiang Yang!”","This inevitably made Jian Wushuang touch his own sunburnt face.","Thinking of the once luxurious life, now reduced to this state of misery.","Having fallen to this point, he had nothing left to consider.","“If you really care about Liu Susu, then do me a favor. You don’t need to do it yourself. Tomorrow, help me and Xiang Yang leave this dock. Then, I’ll kill Yang Madman and give Liu","Susu to you!”","This condition was very tempting.","Hu San didn’t have to do it himself, and it would help him get Liu Susu.","This time, Hu San was clearly moved.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang continued, “Actually, Liu Susu already has feelings for you. This is what Xiang Yang told me. He said Liu Susu likes people like you who are down-to-earth. You should also know that Xiang Yang and I are not ordinary people, and there’s no future between us and Liu Susu. By then, I’ll let you elope with Liu Susu, and you’ll never see us","again!”","He wasn’t deceiving him.","Xiang Yang couldn’t possibly be interested in an ordinary girl.","Even if he was, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t let Xiang Yang succeed.","Otherwise, Xing Luo would ignore them even more.","If Xing Luo was watching nearby, wouldn’t that be even worse?","So, he came up with this plan.","“Give me some time!” Hu San started to hesitate.","Jian Wushuang didn’t push further, putting away the iron piece, and said calmly, “Give me an answer by tomorrow morning. If you’re late, Liu Susu will be taken away by that pervert Yang","Madman. Think it over carefully!”","With that, he left the merchant ship directly.","The first step was already done.","He didn’t believe Hu San would dare to expose this matter.","If he did, both he and Xiang Yang would be finished.","Although he wasn’t worried, he still needed to be cautious.","At night, while everyone was asleep, he and Xiang Yang took turns keeping watch.","They kept an eye on Hu San, fearing he would go to snitch, and also afraid that Hu San would","join Yang Madman to take down Xiang Yang.","Fortunately, Hu San was genuinely honest, or perhaps he was considering what Jian Wushuang had said, and stayed inside his house the whole time.","Yang Madman, however, went to Hu San’s shack once, probably to discuss taking down Xiang","Yang, but was put off by Hu San, who said he would handle it himself after Yang Madman left.","Yang Madman, although hating Xiang Yang, was also hesitant to act alone. He feared Liu Susu would resent him for it."]},{"number":6248,"title":"Chapter 6248: Unchanged Operation","paragraphs":["Chapter 6248: Unchanged Operation","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Stepping out of the shack, he continued to keep an eye on Liu Susu’s room.","He was clearly getting impatient.","This made Xiang Yang grind his teeth in hatred.","“Just wait, tomorrow will be your death day!”","Early the next morning.","As soon as the porters started their work, Yang Madman got ready and prepared to leave the dock with Liu Susu.","Of course, he didn’t mention why they were going to Qingshan Town this time.","He simply said that Master Liu had instructed them to go purchase some supplies.","Liu Susu, being simple-minded, believed him.","Before leaving, she said goodbye to Xiang Yang and advised Hu San to treat him better.","Jian Wushuang, standing nearby, nudged Xiang Yang with his elbow, teasing, “That girl is quite fond of you!”","“Well, she was trained by none other than me!” Xiang Yang boasted.","Not long after, Master Liu also came downstairs.","He called out to Yang Madman.","“Xiao Yang, no need to rush off. News came from the town last night; the Liu family’s commercial ship will arrive here today. You and Susu can take the carriage back, save you from walking!” Coming downstairs, he continued, “I don’t know what the owner is thinking, insisting that the third young master also guard this dock. I might have to go to Qingshan Town myself; we can go together then!”","Hearing this, Yang Madman’s face immediately darkened.","With this change, his trip would be less enjoyable.","Moreover, if Master Liu went back to Qingshan Town and didn’t return, Liu Susu, the prize within his grasp, might slip away.","Faced with this sudden change, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were a bit caught off guard.","But for now, they could only take things one step at a time.","Because Liu Susu was about to leave soon.","With no one to protect Xiang Yang this time.","He could only follow Jian Wushuang to carry sacks.","By the time the sun was high in the sky.","Master Liu and the others showed no signs of leaving.","At this point, Hu San approached them and whispered, “Master Liu is waiting for the Liu family’s young master’s commercial ship, which might not arrive until noon!”","“Plans have changed, but the action remains the same!”","After saying this, the three of them went about their work.","During these days, Xiang Yang’s body had recovered quite well; he no longer panted when carrying sacks.","By noon.","A warship, larger than the other commercial ships, arrived from the sea, and everyone stopped their work.","Master Liu ordered everyone to line up properly.","To welcome the third young master of the Liu family.","The warship docked.","Master Liu stood at the front of the dock with Yang Madman and Liu Susu.","“Young Master Liu!”","At this moment, Master Liu was extremely humble, completely different from the dock’s tyrant.","On the deck of the warship, a young man with a tall figure dressed in standard armor slowly walked down the gangplank.","Behind him, dozens of soldiers disembarked as well.","These people carried an aura of sternness.","Clearly, they had come straight from the battlefield.","Hu San whispered a brief introduction from the side, “This is the third young master of the dock owner’s family and also a colonel in Jiang Country. He commands two thousand soldiers in Yongcheng. The Liu family can dominate Qingshan Town because of this third young master, so Boss Liu is very polite to him!”","“Yongcheng!” Jian Wushuang frowned. He hadn’t escaped yet.","Why had the guard of Yongcheng started to flee?","He looked menacing but turned out to be a coward.","“Alright, don’t worry about these people. Let’s focus on ourselves. Once Boss Liu leaves the dock, we’ll slip away too!”","“Understood!” Hu San nodded.","This time, he had truly made up his mind.","On the other side, Boss Liu brought the third young master of the Liu family into the small building, vacating Liu Susu’s room to specially entertain him.","During the banquet, Liu Susu and Yang Madman were both present.","The third young master of the Liu family, who appeared proper, lost his facade at the wine table.","He was just a wine sack and rice bag.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have fled from Yongcheng.","Given the current situation, the Yue Country was about to attack Yongcheng.","Throughout the banquet, Young Master Liu kept staring at Liu Susu.","His intentions were so obvious that Boss Liu and Yang Madman both understood what he meant.","But Liu Susu was very resistant.","She kept finding excuses to leave, but Boss Liu stopped her each time.","Hu San frowned every time he delivered wine.","By the afternoon, Boss Liu showed no signs of leaving.","According to Hu San, this time, Young Master Liu came here to leave an escape route for some noble in Yongcheng.","Although Jian Wushuang hadn’t seen the map of their location, he could deduce it.","Jiang Country was near the sea.","Among the six prefectures under its jurisdiction, four were close to the coastline.","Once the Yue Country fully attacked, Jiang Country would only have one escape route, which was to flee toward the sea.","On the other side of the sea, there was also a continent.","In fact, the two continents were connected.","This was considered an inland sea, with only one outlet leading to the vast ocean.","On the other side of the sea, there was another dynasty, which was much stronger than Jiang Country and even Yue Country.","These nobles could enjoy themselves wherever they fled, provided they could escape and carry enough wealth with them.","Thus, Young Master Liu had come.","He brought news good for Boss Liu but bad for Jiang Country.","The Yue Country would soon reach Binhai Prefecture.","At that time, it would likely flee without a fight.","Yongcheng wouldn’t even attempt to defend, and small towns like Qingshan Town without stationed troops would naturally be doomed.","So, the properties Boss Liu wanted to set up in Qingshan Town would become worthless.","The Liu family would escape by then.","And they were Boss Liu’s backing.","Naturally, he had to follow his backers.","After learning this, he desperately fawned over the third young master of the Liu family.","Yang Madman, seeing the situation, immediately distanced himself from Liu Susu.","Knowing that Young Master Liu was interested in Liu Susu, he even deliberately pushed her towards him at the wine table.","This angered Boss Liu.","If someone were to give her away, it should be him, not Yang Madman, that lackey.","But there was nothing he could do; Yang Madman was originally from the Liu family, which was why he arranged Liu Susu to marry him.","But now, with a new, more powerful backer, he naturally had to switch sides.","Both men had the same idea but both wanted that leverage!","Unlike their rivalry, Young Master Liu enjoyed the situation.","He ate and drank heartily.","However, Hu San, squatting outside the door, had an exceptionally cold gaze.","He never expected Boss Liu to be so heartless and unfeeling towards his adopted daughter.","Boss Liu was a traveling bodyguard in his early years.","But after suffering an internal injury, he settled in Qingshan Town.","He had picked up both him and Liu Susu from the street.","Later, for unknown reasons, he became attached to the Liu family and became even colder, especially after Yang Madman arrived.","But to repay his kindness, he always obeyed Boss Liu.","This time, for Liu Susu, he chose to resist.","Listening to the noise inside the room, he stood up and walked towards the shack where Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were.","“It’s time to act. Those soldiers are almost drunk!”","“Now?” Xiang Yang hesitated.","Jian Wushuang, however, remained calm. He had done this sort of thing many times and naturally wouldn’t be nervous."]},{"number":6249,"title":"Chapter 6249: You Strike First, You Finish","paragraphs":["Chapter 6249: You Strike First, You Finish","“Alright, but we still need to wait a little longer!” He looked at Hu San. Currently, Hu San was very anxious, but he was still missing one thing.","That was anger.","Hu San needed to get angry; only then would he be able to unleash his full potential.","Moreover, there were still four soldiers guarding the warship.","The few inside the cabin were all drunk.","They posed little threat.","But these four were different.","Their murderous aura was even stronger.","They were men who had seen blood.","Not easy to deal with.","Moreover, the four of them had been staying in the cabin, and it seemed like they were guarding something when meals were delivered.","If his guess was correct.","The items these men were guarding were likely the property of a certain noble in Yongcheng.","They couldn’t escape empty-handed!","These items would be useful to them as well.","Even if they didn’t attack them, once they made a move against Master Liu and Yang Madman, Young Master Liu wouldn’t just stand by.","Since they had to face them sooner or later, they might as well ambush and kill these four first.","After making up his mind, Jian Wushuang asked Xiang Yang to keep an eye on the people in the bamboo building.","He and Hu San then headed to the warship.","Although Hu San looked like a bear with his massive, powerful build, when it came to actually killing people.","He was as timid as a maiden, hesitant and shaky.","The stick in his hand was trembling.","Jian Wushuang patted his back and comforted him, “Stay behind me. I’ll make the first move, and you just follow up with a strike. Make it as quick as possible!”","“Got it!!” Hu San nodded heavily.","He was completely on this thieving ship now. Yesterday he didn’t dare to kill Yang Madman, but today he dared to kill government soldiers.","That’s the effect of anger.","Jian Wushuang walked in front, holding a long knife behind his back.","“Soldiers, enjoying your meal?”","Jian Wushuang quietly entered the cabin, causing the soldiers who were sitting inside to become vigilant and shout, “Who let you in here? Get out immediately!”","“Young Master Liu sent me. He said he wanted to reward you!”","This sentence made the four of them visibly relax.","They let go of their grips on their swords.","But Jian Wushuang’s knife was already in action.","The knife!","Known for its ruthlessness.","Unlike the sword.","But Jian Wushuang was equally fast with a knife.","He suddenly struck, slashing the throat of one soldier, blood spurting out instantly.","But Jian Wushuang’s knife did not stop, it went straight for the next one.","Giving them no chance to draw their swords.","Several slashes, instantly killing two, and the remaining two were severely injured and fell, also taken down by the stick-wielding Hu San who followed.","Whether they were dead or alive was unknown.","Jian Wushuang wiped the blood off his face and said calmly, “Let’s go, time to find the main target!”","As the two of them exited the cabin, from a distance they saw someone being thrown out of the bamboo building.","It was Xiang Yang.","Jian Wushuang’s lips curved into a smile; this was part of his plan too.","Jian Wushuang planned to send Xiang Yang to cause trouble and provoke Young Master Liu.","That way, Liu Susu would risk her life to save him.","As a result, the enraged Third Young Master Liu would surely act out.","After all, he had been mingling in Yong City for so long that getting women was as easy as beckoning them over.","A village girl daring to resist-how could she have a good outcome?","Just as Jian Wushuang expected, the moment Liu Susu tried to intervene, Third Young Master Liu slapped her aside.","“You wretch, dare to think of other men while drinking with me? Today, I’ll make sure you learn your lesson!”","Clang!","Third Young Master Liu drew his sword, intending to slash Xiang Yang, but Liu Susu threw herself in the way to block him!","At that moment, Jian Wushuang and Hu San rushed in.","Especially Hu San, who erupted with an unstoppable momentum, and his long staff no longer trembled as he swung it toward Third Young Master Liu’s head.","Old Master Liu and Yang Madman, who hadn’t drunk much and were the most sober, originally intended to stop Third Young Master Liu. But upon seeing Hu San’s furious charge,","they were stunned.","Seeing the blood-covered Jian Wushuang was like witnessing a demon.","Thud!","Before Third Young Master Liu could react, there was a muffled sound.","Hu San’s staff struck Third Young Master Liu.","The slightly drunk soldiers sobered up instantly but found their knives had already been","taken.","Jian Wushuang then drew his sword again, cutting down the unsteady soldiers to the ground.","The commotion attracted all the porters, who quickly gathered around.","But seeing the blood-soaked ground, they turned pale and dared not approach.","Jian Wushuang, holding his sword, stood at the threshold and declared loudly, “These defeated and fleeing soldiers came to the docks to commit evil, randomly beating and killing porters, forcibly taking women, and even laying hands on Miss Liu. They deserve to die!”","His righteous words immediately established his stance.","Yang Madman, however, couldn’t accept this. In his eyes, the Liu family was supreme.","Especially this Third Young Master Liu.","He roared angrily, “Jian Wushuang, you dare kill a court officer on your own! Men, help me tie","him up and take him to the authorities for a reward!”","He wasn’t foolish, but unfortunately, no one moved at his command.","If Hu San had said it, perhaps some might have acted.","Old Master Liu wasn’t foolish either. He could see Jian Wushuang had incited Hu San and knew","resisting now meant certain death.","Xiang Yang climbed up from the ground, dusted off his clothes, ignored the frightened Liu","Susu beside him, walked to Jian Wushuang, and motioned for his sword.","Jian Wushuang casually tossed it over.","He then picked up Third Young Master Liu’s sword from the ground.","The moment he grasped the hilt, he felt a surge of confidence.","Even if faced with a thousand enemies, he could cut them all down.","That was the confidence of a swordsman.","Even if reduced to an ordinary person, as long as there was a sword in hand, they could stand","undefeated through the ages.","Xiang Yang’s confidence wasn’t as strong. Holding the knife, he walked toward Yang","Madman.","Yang Madman, seeing this, hurriedly retreated.","“You... what are you doing?” Xiang Yang, gripping the knife, spoke word by word, “What am I doing? Of course, I’m killing","you!”","With that, he stepped forward and slashed.","Thud!","The knife struck Yang Madman’s face.","Blood flowed down his face.","Yang Madman, who was used to bullying others, couldn’t bear this and immediately","screamed.","The mix of pain and fear overwhelmed him.","But Xiang Yang showed no mercy.","“Scream, keep screaming!”","Xiang Yang seemed like a different person, slashing down again and again.","This scene terrified the porters and Liu Susu.","And even Old Master Liu.","The old rogue, who had roamed the jianghu for decades, couldn’t help but tremble.","Compared to Xiang Yang, he feared Jian Wushuang more.","He didn’t know when Jian Wushuang had incited Hu San and could kill so many while","remaining calm.","Especially after killing Third Young Master Liu, which meant no way out in the future!","Unfortunately, he didn’t know Jian Wushuang had many paths.","At worst, he could flee.","Killing an officer?","Even if the Emperor of Jiang came, he would kill without hesitation.","It wouldn’t even make Jian Wushuang hesitate."]},{"number":6250,"title":"Chapter 6250: Mistake","paragraphs":["Chapter 6250: Mistake","“Enough!” Jian Wushuang shouted angrily.","He stopped Xiang Yang from venting his anger.","It was almost enough; there was no need to keep flogging the corpse.","Releasing the resentment was sufficient.","Otherwise, excessive anger would harm the body and be detrimental to future cultivation.","One had to learn to remain calm.","“No, there’s still one more!” Xiang Yang said, raising his blade and walking towards Master Liu.","“You old bastard, you enjoyed stripping me naked back then, didn’t you?”","In fact, Master Liu never said much to them.","It was always Yang Madman who tortured Xiang Yang and Jian Wushuang.","That was because Xiang Yang had initially gotten close to Liu Susu.","Killing Master Liu depended on the situation.","If it were in the wilderness with no one around, killing him would be inconsequential.","But now, killing Master Liu in front of Liu Susu and Hu San seemed unnecessary.","It would be better to appease these people and make use of them.","Then they could divide the treasures and escape.","Otherwise, with so much gold, silver, and jewels, he and Xiang Yang wouldn’t be able to take it all.","Although the path of cultivation didn’t require these things, to embark on it, one needed to first accumulate wealth.","Two stinky beggars weren’t even qualified to ask for directions.","But Xiang Yang didn’t care about any of this at the moment and was about to chop Master Liu with his blade.","Liu Susu, being kind-hearted, certainly didn’t want her foster father to be killed by her beloved, so she rushed over to seize the blade.","“Get lost!”","At this moment, Xiang Yang was particularly scummy. He pushed Liu Susu away, just like Liu San Gongzi.","Hu San couldn’t stand this and immediately kicked Xiang Yang over.","The knife in Xiang Yang’s hand fell at that moment.","Master Liu, with quick hands and sharp eyes, immediately reached for the knife to counterattack.","But Jian Wushuang wasn’t just standing around. He drew his sword, and the tip pierced Master Liu’s wrist.","“Old man, you better behave!”","He didn’t harbor much hatred towards Master Liu and didn’t go for the kill, thinking the old man might be useful later.","However, Hu San thought Jian Wushuang intended to kill them all and angrily shouted, “Jian Wushuang, you promised me...”","“Don’t worry, I won’t break my word,” he replied indifferently.","It was just a woman.","He wasn’t as shameless as Xiang Yang, and wouldn’t kill the donkey after it had done its work.","But at that moment, Xiang Yang angrily got up.","He picked up the knife and slashed at Master Liu.","Hu San was distracted and couldn’t stop him in time.","But Liu Susu stepped in to block it.","The blade directly struck Liu Susu’s neck.","Blood spurted instantly.","Hot blood poured out, splashing onto Xiang Yang’s face.","Hu San’s pupils suddenly contracted.","“Xiang Yang!!!!!!”","He almost roared.","Lifting the wooden stick, he charged straight at Xiang Yang without any hesitation.","If this blow landed, Xiang Yang would be done for.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to intervene. Before the stick could strike Xiang Yang’s head,","he slashed off Hu San’s arm with his sword.","The stick, along with the severed arm, fell to the ground.","Hu San howled in despair.","Liu Susu died with her eyes open.","Master Liu sat paralyzed on the ground, holding the deceased Liu Susu. Though he had always been an opportunist with a heart of stone, at this moment, tears flowed from his eyes.","Xiang Yang, however, acted as if nothing had happened. He nodded at Jian Wushuang and said, “Nice swordsmanship!”","With that, he was ready to strike again.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t stand it anymore.","“That’s enough!”","Because the porters were starting to stir.","He feared that if Xiang Yang continued killing, it would incite a riot among the porters. Someone muttered that if Liu San Gongzi died here, they would all be doomed.","Now, all eyes were on him and Xiang Yang.","It wasn’t for anything else.","It was simply to save their own lives, and they wanted to hand the two of them over to the","authorities.","These people had been weak since childhood, otherwise, they wouldn’t have endured being bullied by Yang Madman without daring to resist.","At this moment, their hostility towards them was entirely driven by the desire to survive.","It was indeed a sad situation!","Jian Wushuang casually wiped the blood off his sword.","In reality, these porters no longer posed a threat to the two of them.","With a sword in hand, killing these people was no difficult task.","But there was no need to do so.","“Listen up, everyone. I offer you a path to wealth. On that warship, there are treasures you can enjoy for a lifetime. You can take the money and start a new life on the other side of the sea!” Jian Wushuang hit the key point. With his analysis, all the porters were tempted. “You are all unfortunate people, with no parents, working here for meager wages. Why not","just leave!”","Changing their situation was the greatest form of resistance.","These people needed someone to guide them.","With just a few words, Jian Wushuang convinced them.","The key was that Jian Wushuang wasn’t lying to them.","He asked Xiang Yang to watch over the paralyzed Master Liu and the severely injured Hu San.","Then, he led the porters to divide the gold and silver treasures.","Jian Wushuang didn’t take much, just a small boat, a hundred taels of gold, and some valuable","jade.","The rest was distributed among the porters.","With no one guarding, and with the gold and silver in hand, the porters became more active.","They moved all the usable goods from the dock onto the ships quickly.","They cleaned out the warehouse, for this was their profession after all.","With these supplies, they wouldn’t starve for two years at sea.","And having worked at the docks for years, they naturally knew how to sail.","Speaking of sailing.","All the crew members on the ships were killed.","These people posed no threat.","They posed no threat to Jian Wushuang, so they wouldn’t die.","But the porters had become ruthless.","They killed all the crew members.","They prepared seven or eight merchant ships and one warship.","About a hundred people set sail just like that.","Watching the ships leave the dock, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel happy for these people.","Instead, he felt sorrow for those who would soon be oppressed by them.","The sky gradually darkened.","Inside the bamboo building.","Jian Wushuang bandaged Hu San’s wounds.","As for Master Liu, he was tied upstairs by Xiang Yang, along with the ugly woman.","“Jian Wushuang, look at this!”","Xiang Yang ran into the house with a cheerful expression, holding two robes.","These were the clothes they wore when they arrived.","Jian Wushuang didn’t even lift his eyelids, and said calmly, “What’s the use of these things!”","“Tsk tsk, although we are down and out, this outfit represents our past and future. We can’t","let these people ruin it!”","With that, he threw Jian Wushuang’s clothes over.","“Guess whose room these clothes were in?”","“Hu San’s!”","“How did you know?” Xiang Yang was surprised!","Jian Wushuang shrugged and said calmly, “I guessed.”","In fact, he had seen it.","Hu San had told him before that he would return the clothes when they left.","Hu San was honest and thick-skinned but actually meticulous.","He thought Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang’s identities were not simple.","He didn’t want them to stay at the dock.","To avoid bringing trouble to Master Liu.","He intended to find an opportunity to let them go.","But unexpectedly, the trouble didn’t come from outside, but from within.","“Xiang Yang, pack up. Let’s leave tonight!”","“Alright!” Xiang Yang nodded heavily.","After venting during the day, Xiang Yang had regained some sanity.","He also had ambitions now.","But this ambition might bring great changes to this world.","Perhaps in the future, this world would see the rise of a demon.","Bringing endless destruction.","Watching Xiang Yang’s back.","Jian Wushuang turned to look at the lying Hu San and said sincerely, “Hu San, I’m sorry this","time!”"]},{"number":6251,"title":"Chapter 6251: Promise","paragraphs":["Chapter 6251: Promise","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang had originally thought his plan was perfect, but unforeseen changes had resulted in the current situation.","He had forgotten how long it had been since he last apologized to anyone.","The last time seemed to have been in the Northern Spacetime.","At the Qishen Temple!","Years had passed in the blink of an eye.","And now, he was apologizing to a mere mortal.","Hu San, lying on the ground, believed his end was near. He spoke coldly, “Jian Wushuang, I don’t blame you. Just kill me!”","“You’re overthinking it. If I wanted to kill you, I wouldn’t have bandaged your wounds,” Jian Wushuang replied with a faint smile.","He casually took out a money pouch from his bosom.","“There’s fifty taels of gold inside. Once we leave, you can take Liu Ye and find a place to retire, or you can choose to roam the martial world alone,” Jian Wushuang said, then took a jade pendant from his honorific robe and solemnly added, “I owe you a debt, which I will repay. If you die, give this pendant to your closest kin. I will repay my debt eventually!”","Hu San was stunned by these words.","Jian Wushuang then took his clothes and left the bamboo house.","He went back to the well, removed his bloodstained clothes, and washed off the blood with the cold well water.","After changing into his honorific robe, he tore off the excess parts to make it more practical.","Once he was ready, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang left the Chishui Wharf that night.","They boarded a small boat but didn’t head to the other side of the sea.","The so-called paradise of the Tang Dynasty was not their destination.","Instead, they traveled upstream towards Yong City.","The small boat entered the canal from the coast.","After paying some tolls along the way, they smoothly entered the inland via the canal.","Binhai Prefecture was vast.","It had four county cities.","Yong City was one of them.","It was also the forefront of Binhai Prefecture’s defense.","Three thousand soldiers were stationed here.","Young Master Liu San was originally one of the three major captains.","However, he lost himself while trying to secure a future with the nobility.","At this time, the nobles were likely unaware.","Jian Wushuang’s destination was Yong City.","According to his plan, he would first integrate with some local nobles to gather information about the true nature of this world, at least to get a large map.","However, when they went ashore and reached a small town, they discovered that maps were controlled items.","Ordinary people couldn’t obtain them.","With no other choice, Jian Wushuang bought two fast horses and decided to enter Yong City with Xiang Yang.","Although the canal could take them directly to Yong City, Jian Wushuang chose to travel by land to be safe.","However, this route led them into an encounter with mountain bandits.","While passing through a bamboo forest, they were stopped by a group of bandits.","“This road was opened by me, this tree...”","“No need to say more. We’re all travelers in the martial world. Here is some silver, consider it a treat for you all!” Jian Wushuang interrupted, tossing a money pouch.","There were twenty taels of silver inside, which they had exchanged at the bank.","After all, gold was too valuable and could attract unwanted attention.","So they exchanged it for silver notes and silver.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s straightforward manner, the bandit leader cupped his hands and politely said, “Brother, you’re generous. If this place weren’t so desolate, I’d surely invite you for a drink. Since you’re in a hurry, let’s leave it for next time!”","Jian Wushuang finished speaking and made way for them.","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were just about to pass through.","Suddenly, a cold arrow came flying toward them.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang’s reaction was quick enough; he dodged it.","However, Xiang Yang, behind him, wasn’t as agile.","Luckily, the arrow hit the horse’s leg instead.","The startled horse reared, and Xiang Yang, unsteady in his seat, fell off.","Then more arrows came flying toward them.","The bandits were immediately thrown into a panic.","“Oh no, it’s the authorities! Everyone, scatter!”","But as they fled, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were left in a tight spot.","To avoid the arrows, both of their swift horses were shot down.","Jian Wushuang signaled to Xiang Yang to escape with the bandits. They couldn’t stay where they were, for even if they weren’t bandits, they might be mistaken for them and get killed.","They had to evade.","Never assume those in the government are all good people.","These were chaotic times.","Bandits were everywhere.","It was peculiar that these bandits here were being eradicated.","Moreover, the archers shooting indiscriminately were definitely not ordinary enforcers; they must have been soldiers sent specifically.","If they stayed put, they’d be either shot or interrogated.","If they couldn’t explain themselves, they’d end up in trouble anyway.","Both men had no clear identity.","So, they had no choice but to flee up the mountain with the bandits.","Ironically, they ran faster than the bandits.","Seeing this, the bandit leader, who had previously blocked their way, exclaimed in surprise, “So, you two are also from the underworld!”","“Heh, just trying to survive. Besides, there’s no good people among the authorities. If we stayed, who knows what false charges they’d put on us!”","Hearing this, the bandit leader admired Jian Wushuang even more and invited, “If you two don’t have a place to go, why not come with us to the small dock?”","A dock?","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang felt uneasy.","But they had no better options.","They reluctantly agreed.","The bandits were familiar with the mountain paths.","They led them through twists and turns, quickly losing the pursuers.","After another hour’s walk, they reached the small dock the bandit leader had mentioned.","Only then did Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang understand why it was called a small dock.","Because it was really small!","There was only one large warehouse and a dock that could only accommodate three boats.","It was a riverside dock.","Nothing compared to the Chishui Dock where they had been.","But in one aspect, it was much better than Chishui Dock.","When the bandits returned, they called the porters and laborers brothers, and some bandits even put down their weapons to help at the dock.","It seemed they were just laborers.","“Don’t laugh at us, brothers. We’re not truly ruthless bandits, just some poor workers trying to make a living!”","“Of course not!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","This was much better than those so-called legitimate docks.","At least these laborers weren’t being whipped or bullied.","It was somewhat ironic.","However, upon hearing that the goods on these merchant ships were all looted, Jian Wushuang withdrew his earlier thoughts.","But seeing these people working so happily was still better than the previous dock.","After chatting a bit with the bandit leader, they introduced themselves.","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang claimed to be “Pirates of the High Seas.”","They said they had come from the Eastern Sea of the Tang Dynasty, hoping to survive in Yue Country.","Hearing they were from the Tang Dynasty, the bandit leader, Scarred Xuan, got excited.","“Brothers from the Tang Dynasty, that’s great!” Scarred Xuan quickly led them to the warehouse.","Apart from storing goods, there was a long table inside, about seven or eight zhang long, capable of seating dozens of people."]},{"number":6252,"title":"Chapter 6252: Entering the Bandits’ Nest","paragraphs":["Chapter 6252: Entering the Bandits’ Nest","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","They arrived at the warehouse.","Scar Sui greeted everyone one by one.","“Second Leader!”","“Brother Dao!”","“Scarred Xui!”","Each title made Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang suppress their laughter.","From the introductions, they learned that not only were there bandits here, but also their families.","There were only about a hundred skilled robbers, but they had to take care of a total of six hundred family members.","There was no other way; in this era, if you didn’t engage in this trade, even surviving was a problem.","Moreover, they could be considered honorable thieves, robbing only merchant ships or government ships.","Ordinary folks had nothing worth stealing anyway.","Scar Sui led them to a small, partitioned living room and invited them to sit down.","“Rest here for a bit. I’ll go get my big brother. Today, we must have a good drink together!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang couldn’t help but swallow.","They hadn’t had a proper meal at a tavern since they were on the road.","They had planned to eat and drink heartily once they reached Yong City.","Unexpectedly, they were robbed by bandits.","If getting robbed wasn’t bad enough, they also encountered soldiers suppressing bandits.","By sheer luck, they ended up in this bandit den.","As Scar Sui left, Xiang Yang licked his lips and teased, “Who would’ve thought our first meal and drink would be here!”","The two of them hadn’t eaten meat in over a month, and they were drooling over the pork pastries. They couldn’t wait any longer.","They momentarily forgot they were in a bandit den.","They didn’t even worry about the bandits potentially killing them.","This time, they didn’t overthink it.","The other side didn’t think too much either.","Before long, Scar Sui returned with the big brother he had mentioned.","“I am Wang Lun. Greetings, brothers!”","“I am Jian Wushuang, and this is Xiang Yang!” the two replied in unison.","Engaging in a chivalrous exchange, they talked for quite a while.","In truth, they didn’t discuss much of substance.","Mainly because Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang knew nothing about the Great Tang.","They had to make things up as they went along.","Fortunately, this was the mundane world. These bandits had never even left Bin Hai Prefecture, let alone knew what the Great Tang was like.","So Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang started bragging.","By the end, they forgot what they had said earlier, resulting in many inconsistencies.","Thankfully, everyone had drunk a lot, so the details were glossed over.","They had a long, enjoyable conversation that night.","They exchanged a pile of lies for genuine camaraderie.","Caught up in the excitement, Scar Sui and Wang Lun pulled them into a brotherhood pledge.","From then on, this small dock had four leaders.","Big Leader “Wang Lun”","Second Leader “Jian Wushuang”","Third Leader “Scar Sui”","Fourth Leader “Xiang Yang”","The hundred or so bandits cheered enthusiastically.","This made Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang feel a long-lost sense of respect.","It seemed like they had regained some of their initial momentum.","Besides these matters, they also understood some things about the current Binhai Prefecture.","For instance, of the four major cities, only Yongcheng had stationed troops.","The other three major cities had long been emptied.","They had all fled along the sea to the Tang Dynasty.","To take enough treasures with them before they left, the canal was busy transporting the belongings of the dignitaries day and night.","That’s how they were able to make a fortune and support hundreds of people.","The reason there were officials and soldiers suppressing bandits during the day was because they had robbed the dignitaries of their gold and silver.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang used his eloquence to restore some confidence in these people.","“Brother Wang Lun, you can’t say that. Think about it, this gold and silver is the fat and marrow of the people, plundered by the dignitaries from the common folk. It’s only right for us to rob it back. In the future, not only should we rob, but we should rob more, build ourselves bigger and stronger. How can a hundred or so people be enough? We need to expand our team, make the small dock into a big dock. Didn’t you mention that blood port upstream? Let’s rob it the same way!”","His words ignited a fiery passion in everyone.","A vast blueprint also unfolded from his mouth.","“First, rob Sha Family Town, then seize Sha Family Port, and then go north to take the entire blood port. By then, the entire canal will be ours. With money, we can recruit troops, and the big brother can become the emperor. Wouldn’t that be satisfying?”","It sounded satisfying indeed.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t consider that he had drunk alcohol.","Now that he was a mortal, after drinking, he too would become muddleheaded.","But the others believed it.","Especially Xiang Yang, who had lost interest in cultivation altogether.","“Become the emperor!”","“Become the emperor!”","In the chants of “become the emperor,” Wang Lun lost himself.","Even Scarred Zhuan was the same, shaking Jian Wushuang’s arm and saying, “Brother Wushuang, what about me? Can I become the crown prince?”","“Uh....”","The drinking continued until the next morning.","Jian Wushuang woke up groggily.","He found himself lying in a large room.","Beneath him was soft animal skin.","Climbing up, he felt his throat burning with thirst.","Hurriedly, he stood up, ran to the table, picked up a pot of tea, and gulped it down.","After drinking several big gulps, he finally felt better.","He didn’t know how much he drank yesterday, but he woke up with a headache.","Shaking his head, he leaned against the animal skin.","Only then did he remember the words he said yesterday.","He felt embarrassed and somewhat regretful.","However, he also learned about the world outside Jiang Kingdom from Wang Lun.","The place they were in was called the Seven Profound States.","The Seven Profound States were near the sea.","There were seven major countries within its jurisdiction.","Jiang Kingdom and Yue Kingdom were among them.","As for the Tang Dynasty, it was another continent called “Central Divine State.”","It was rumored to be a continent inhabited by immortals.","It was many times larger than the Seven Profound States.","Yesterday, he had forgotten about the path of cultivation because he was too happy at the wine table.","Now, thinking about it, he felt a bit regretful. Knowing that the Central Divine State had immortals, why was he still waiting here?","Growing big and strong was not his goal.","Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but knock on his head.","At this moment, the door opened.","A simple-looking maid walked in carrying a basin of water.","“Second Master, you’re awake?”","The maid was very obedient and a bit shy. She walked up to Jian Wushuang, put down the basin, took out a towel, and was about to wipe Jian Wushuang’s face.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly stopped her.","“No need, I’ll do it myself!” He took the towel and wiped his face, feeling a bit more awake, and said, “You are... Tu... family member?”","The maid shook her head and said, “No, I was a maid rescued by Brother Zhuan from a landlord’s house. Brother Zhuan asked me to serve Second Master.”","“What’s your name?”","“Second Master can call me Qing’er.”","The maid said, stepping forward. Jian Wushuang, having seen big scenes, still felt a bit resistant to a little maid, quickly waved her off, and asked her to call Xiang Yang over.","Without needing to ask, Xiang Yang had also become the fourth master in their mouths.","One drink had surprisingly elevated his status.","But on second thought, he had lived countless eras.","It wouldn’t be a loss even if they called him an ancestor.","Qing’er left, and after a short while, the door opened again."]},{"number":6253,"title":"Chapter 6253: Did You Take It Seriously?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6253: Did You Take It Seriously?","Jian Wushuang saw Xiang Yang swaggering over, supporting his waist, with a maid helping him.","He had the appearance of an old wealthy landlord.","“You can go out first. I need to discuss something with Xiang... Fourth Master!”","The little maid obediently nodded softly and left.","Xiang Yang felt a bit distant and was somewhat displeased, saying, “Brother Wushuang, there’s no need for this formality. We’re all on the same side now!”","He took a sip from the teacup as he spoke.","Jian Wushuang found the scene both infuriating and amusing.","“Xiang Yang, are you planning to become a bandit in the mountains?”","“Of course not!” Xiang Yang quickly shook his head, but what he said next almost made Jian Wushuang’s jaw drop.","“Our ambition is to establish a dynasty. Didn’t you arrange everything yesterday? Wang Lun is the emperor, Scarred Shuan is the crown prince, you’re the great general, and I’m the prince!”","“I...” Jian Wushuang pointed at Xiang Yang, exasperated. “Couldn’t you stop me a bit?”","“I tried, but I couldn’t stop you!”","There was no way around it; they had indeed drunk a bit too much.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t blame Xiang Yang any further and could only shake his head with a bitter smile before taking another large gulp of tea.","Seeing this, Xiang Yang sighed, “You drank too much yesterday. I kept signaling you, but you didn’t notice. I have no objection to making Brother Wang Lun the emperor, but we can’t make Scarred Shuan the crown prince!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang spat out the tea he hadn’t swallowed yet.","It turned out Xiang Yang was trying to stop that.","“Why are we here?” Jian Wushuang said seriously. “Not to become powerful or to gain some ridiculous title. We’re here to embark on the path of cultivation!”","“Uh, but isn’t that still far off?” Xiang Yang replied with a resigned attitude.","While they were arguing, hearty laughter came from outside.","Judging by the sound, it was Wang Lun.","“Brothers, are you sober yet?”","Wang Lun strode in, followed by Scarred Shuan, who looked groggy, clearly just pulled out of bed.","“Big brother!”","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang quickly stood up.","“Sit down, we’re all family!” Wang Lun gestured, displaying an air of authority.","The four of them sat down.","Wang Lun personally poured tea for everyone.","After serving everyone, he said, “We were a bit reckless yesterday!”","“It’s my fault. I was a bit too abrupt!” Jian Wushuang started to say something, thinking that yesterday’s wild talk made him seem unreliable.","Unexpectedly, Wang Lun lowered his voice and said, “Brother Wushuang, it’s not your fault. We just shouldn’t discuss such things in front of so many people. We need to close the doors and talk among ourselves!”","Hearing this, Xiang Yang and Scarred Shuan were no longer sleepy.","Especially Scarred Shuan, who was still concerned about his position as the crown prince.","“I’ve already sent brothers to scout out Shajia Town. The authorities there don’t have many people, but Shajia Town is indeed a strategic location. If we can take it, we can control twenty percent of the merchant ships passing through, which is enough to expand our forces by three thousand men!”","Wang Lun spoke confidently.","It was clear that yesterday’s discussion had also spurred him into action.","He genuinely believed they could accomplish something great.","His charisma was undeniable, and his subordinates at the small port greatly admired him.","Yesterday, when Wang Lun declared Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang as the new leaders, everyone had no objections.","Of course, some people might feel dissatisfied, and it would be up to Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang to resolve this.","Hearing the discussion about Shajia Town, Jian Wushuang began to ponder.","They had passed by that area.","Their boat was also left there, although they hadn’t stayed long, but Shajia Port was one of the six ports on the canal.","After taking control, they could indeed seize twenty percent of the merchant ships.","But there was also a problem.","There were still five other ports.","If merchant ships used the other ports, they would essentially be guarding an empty port.","Moreover, the nearby official roads could be used to dispatch troops at any time, allowing them to be taken down easily.","The greatest benefit was that Shajia Port connected to the downstream Chishui Dock.","From there, they could prepare and then head to the sea.","In other words, if they took Shajia Port, the goods they seized would all belong to the","powerful and wealthy.","These influential people would never let them off.","They would definitely send troops to exterminate the bandits.","Not to mention Shajia Port, even a small dock doing such things would attract the extermination of bandits by official troops.","If they took Shajia Port, they might be surrounded and exterminated by elite troops dispatched by the bigwigs of Yongcheng.","This was truly a risky endeavor.","After outlining the benefits, Wang Lun confidently said, “I forgot to mention, the reason why we always manage to rob the noble’s ships at the small dock is because I have someone inside","helping us!”","“Inside?”","Xiang Yang, intrigued, began to think, his eyes lighting up with surprise, “Big brother, you must have bribed a significant figure in Yongcheng, right!”","“To be honest, indeed, a major figure is supporting me. Otherwise, with all the gold and silver we’ve robbed, I could have expanded, but I feared this big figure’s suspicion, so I didn’t dare to expand. But with two brothers here, I can go all out!” Wang Lun’s eyes revealed madness","and a grand ambition.","Wang Lun was not very old, just over thirty.","He had attended private school for a few days and knew when to make his move.","Actually, without Jian Wushuang’s remarks, he had been contemplating whether to expand","his forces and secure wealth during the chaos.","How long could a bandit remain one?","He had a family to look after and couldn’t keep hiding forever!","Moreover, the Yue Kingdom was about to invade.","Pacifying the world was only a matter of time, and then they would have no place to survive.","To secure a future, they had to prepare early.","Initially, when he heard Scarred Shuan say Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang came from the","Great Tang, he was very excited.","Because he could arrange for his family to go to the Great Tang and use the money from their","raids to buy property.","When the Yue Kingdom invaded, he could leave without any worries.","But now, he changed his mind.","If he could do well in his hometown, who would want to leave?","If he could establish himself at home, there would be no need to go elsewhere.","“Establishing a dynasty is indeed a bit abrupt, but in this chaotic world, don’t you two brothers want to secure a status and some wealth for yourselves?”","Wang Lun’s words could stimulate any ordinary person, but they did not affect Jian","Wushuang.","However, there was a possibility for cooperation.","He and Xiang Yang entered Binhai Prefecture and headed to Yongcheng to find a path to","cultivation.","But to embark on the path of cultivation, they first had to meet cultivators.","Or be able to help cultivators.","To get noticed by them. Currently, the only notable cultivator he had heard of was the Little Liang King.","As for the so-called Tang Immortals Wang Lun mentioned, he didn’t even know their names,","and would have no idea where to find them if he went to the Great Tang.","It was better to try to meet the Little Liang King here.","The Little Liang King represented the Yue Kingdom in the campaign against the Jiang","Kingdom.","If he helped Wang Lun raise an army, he would naturally encounter the Little Liang King."]},{"number":6254,"title":"Chapter 6254: Just Do It","paragraphs":["Chapter 6254: Just Do It","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Upon thinking about this, he slowly nodded and said, “I was serious about what I said yesterday. However, I did underestimate the situation at Sha Family Pass. But since big brother has support within the yamen, Sha Family Pass is indeed our best choice!”","The four of them agreed unanimously.","They immediately decided to take down Sha Family Town and seize Sha Family Pass.","However, they currently only had about a hundred people.","Manpower was an issue.","Seeing this, Scarred Xuan patted his chest and said, “That’s easy. We have plenty of captives; we can recruit them into our ranks!”","“I’ll handle this!” Xiang Yang stood up.","Although he still had the aura of a noble, he had a knack for winning people’s hearts.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to recruit so many retainers in the Xiang family back then.","Speaking of which, Jian Wushuang was someone he had managed to recruit.","Unfortunately, this recruitment had brought disaster to the Xiang family.","Everyone had clear assignments.","Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun went to the Loyalty Hall to analyze the details of their next steps.","Scarred Xuan began preparing equipment, specifically military arms.","There were indeed quite a few in the warehouse.","These were military arms that the nobles had embezzled and planned to sell in the Tang Dynasty.","With such corruption, it was no wonder the Jiang Kingdom had fallen.","By the afternoon.","The sun was still high in the sky.","The manpower had already been arranged.","Xiang Yang’s eloquence had gathered fifty people.","Scarred Xuan had also brought in those who had been chopping wood in the mountains from among the families.","They had managed to gather another fifty people.","This made a total of one hundred people.","Including the original one hundred experienced individuals.","A two hundred-strong team appeared in the large Loyalty Hall.","Wang Lun was the first to speak.","“Brothers, in these chaotic times, our lives are worth less than ants. Our families are displaced, without a place to call home. Now there’s an opportunity right before us. Are you willing to fight for it?”","“Yes!” everyone shouted in unison.","But those captives among them didn’t sound as confident.","Because their families were still scattered everywhere.","Next, it was Jian Wushuang’s turn.","He looked at everyone and continued, “We fight for the future. You may not see the great prospects ahead, so let me explain them clearly. Everyone here today can receive ten taels of silver each. And that’s not all. If something happens, the money will go to your families, including yours!”","Jian Wushuang pointed at the captives.","He took out a piece of paper.","On it, each address was written clearly.","This was also a threat.","If they dared to betray, their families would be finished.","“Your families will receive twenty taels of silver. If you survive tonight, you can go home tomorrow. You can choose to bring your families to the small dock or continue living like pigs and dogs in these chaotic times. The choice is yours!”","But when they heard they could immediately receive ten taels of silver, they all became so excited their faces turned red.","In the mundane world:","A tael of gold was equivalent to ten taels of silver, which was worth a hundred strings of coins, or ten thousand copper coins.","A single copper coin could buy a steamed bun.","Ten copper coins could buy a pound of meat.","For a family of five, even if they ate meat at every meal, they wouldn’t spend more than five strings of coins in a month.","Ten taels of silver could last two to three years of good eating and drinking.","Or ten years of being well-fed.","How could these people not be excited?","Furthermore, Jian Wushuang issued a bounty.","Killing an enemy would earn one tael of silver.","To prevent them from killing innocents, he also issued a military order.","This immediately united these people into a cohesive group.","Each one was filled with murderous intent.","This set of rules made Wang Lun highly admire Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was akin to a military strategist, effortlessly forming a formal army with just a few words.","And they were full of killing intent.","After finishing these arrangements,","Jian Wushuang had Xiang Yang and Scar lead a hundred people each to wait in the bamboo forest near Sha Family Town for his signal.","He and Wang Lun then rushed to Sha Family Town.","They didn’t bring anyone with them.","When they arrived in Sha Family Town, night had already fallen.","There were few people on the streets.","Sha Family Town had a small port called Sha Family Port.","Normally, passing ships would pay port fees, and some merchant ships would unload goods.","They needed many laborers.","So most of the young and strong in Sha Family Town worked at the dock.","There were more than five hundred laborers at the dock.","However, these laborers were much better than those at the Chishui Dock.","The laborers at Chishui Dock worked day and night, and one person could do the work of seven or eight here.","Although the pay was decent, the wages were heavily deducted.","These laborers were full of grievances but didn’t dare to vent.","At this moment, each one left the dock, passed through the street, bought some grain, oil, and salt, and their pockets were cleaner than their faces.","And all of this was due to a bully at the dock.","The bully “Chen Mazi.”","This man was ruthless and had dozens of thugs under him.","He also had connections with the yamen.","The yamen stationed in Sha Family Town had ten constables, and the head constable was Chen Mazi’s brother-in-law.","So he could act arrogantly.","Not only did he deduct wages, but he also held power at Sha Family Port, easing the court’s pressure.","Usually, no bandits dared to rob.","“The total usable force in Sha Family Town doesn’t exceed fifty people, and most of them have no weapons. It’s not a threat!”","Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun surveyed the area and entered a tavern following the light.","The port of Sha Family Town was right next to them.","Usually, Chen Mazi came here to drink.","The two found a seat by the window.","After sitting down, Wang Lun lowered his voice and asked, “Brother Wushuang, you didn’t bring me here just to scout, did you?”","The scouting had long been done.","The yamen people would drink here with Chen Mazi today, a perfect opportunity to catch them all in one net.","Two hundred men against fifty was not a casual fight!","But Jian Wushuang didn’t think so.","He wanted to be thorough.","The real threat was not the drunkards and small-time thugs of Sha Family Town.","The greatest threat was still over in Yong City.","Among the nearby towns of Yong City, only Qingshu Town had three hundred soldiers.","Including a team of light cavalry, at least fifty men.","The archers from that day were soldiers from Qingshu Town.","These soldiers could reach Sha Family Town in an hour at the fastest speed.","The cavalry could arrive even quicker, in just half an hour.","If they acted rashly and took Sha Family Town, it would be easy.","But finding respite would be difficult.","They might have just taken the town when the soldiers from Qingshu Town arrived.","At that time, facing a regular army, they would be unable to resist.","Especially the cavalry.","Even with his motivation, the conscripts had the will to kill.","But having the will without experience was useless!","Facing the cavalry, they would be sending themselves to their deaths.","So he didn’t plan to let the two hundred men directly enter Sha Family Town to act but had them ambush the paths leading into Sha Family Town.","“Brother, don’t worry. I’ve already arranged for Xiang Yang to lead a team to dig traps. Our opponents are the soldiers from Qingshu Town, not these small fry!”","Wang Lun smiled upon hearing this, “I knew you had a thorough plan. I was worried at first...”"]},{"number":6255,"title":"Chapter 6255: Clearing the Area","paragraphs":["Chapter 6255: Clearing the Area","Before he could finish speaking, a shout came from outside.","“Shopkeeper, clear the place!”","With those words, the originally drowsy innkeeper instantly became alert. He quickly ran to the door with a smile on his face.","“Brother Zhang, where is Master Ma? I heard early this morning that Master Ma was going to visit our little shop. The food and wine are all ready and fresh!”","“Master Ma went to invite Head Constable Wang. He’ll be here soon. Clear the place first. There are a lot of people today, so clear all six private rooms upstairs and a few tables in the main hall to make sure there’s enough space for our brothers!”","“Alright, rest assured, I’ll take care of it!”","The innkeeper immediately shouted, “Waiter, clear those tables! And for those who just arrived, I’m sorry, but today is Master Ma’s treat. Apologies for any inconvenience!”","The innkeeper, being a clever man, directly shifted the blame to Chen Mazi.","Those eating, knowing who Chen Mazi was, quickly packed up their food and drinks and left the inn.","Even those who weren’t being chased away got up and left to avoid any trouble later.","As a result, Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun were spared from being driven out.","They continued to eat and drink at their leisure.","After about the time it takes to burn a stick of incense, they heard a commotion outside.","Chen Mazi swaggered into the inn with his brother-in-law, Head Constable Wang.","At this moment, the inn was a mix of various types of people.","There were those who had returned from ancestral lands, like Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun, who were bandits and robbers.","Along with the oppressive figure of Head Constable Wang and the bully Chen Mazi, the inn had suddenly become the power center of Sha Family Town.","Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow as he glanced at Chen Mazi. He wasn’t very tall, standing in front of Head Constable Wang, he seemed quite small and unimpressive.","He looked like a weakling, not much of a threat.","But the men behind him were not so simple.","There were two burly men as sturdy as towers and two lean men with sharp eyes, their gazes like knives.","They even had knives strapped to their waists.","As for Head Constable Wang, he was said to have bought his position, so there was no need to worry about him.","Most of the other constables were useless, but one of them had a cold expression and seemed very displeased with being in such a place.","Only this person was considered an outlier among the constables.","From his walking posture, Jian Wushuang could tell that the man was a practitioner.","He definitely had some skills.","Moreover, among the constables, only this person carried a steel knife.","The knife never left his side.","He was a ruthless person!","Noticing his attention to that man, Wang Lun lowered his voice and introduced, “This guy is the only upright constable in the entire Shajia Town. He doesn’t even give face to Chen Mazi. I heard that a few days ago, he confiscated a batch of military weapons that Chen Mazi had privately obtained from upstream. They are still under his custody. I guess today’s banquet is because of this matter!”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and continued, “Isn’t Chen Mazi’s brother- in-law a constable? How can a mere small constable not be dealt with?”","“You don’t know, Liang Chen, nicknamed Iron Face, doesn’t give face to anyone!” Wang Lun nodded in admiration.","Jian Wushuang was even more puzzled. Such an impartial person without a background would not survive; there were no big shots in Shajia Town to back such a person.","Seeing his disbelief, Wang Lun added, “I forgot to mention, this guy’s father-in-law is an instructor from Qingshan Town, who has trained many formidable soldiers in the army. That’s why no one dares to touch him!”","“So that’s it!” Jian Wushuang took a sip of wine and began to ponder.","Meanwhile, Chen Mazi and his group had already gone upstairs.","Seven or eight tables were set up in the hall.","About forty to fifty people had arrived.","Only half of them could go to the private rooms.","The remaining half stayed in the hall.","As soon as these people sat down, they began shouting for wine.","Behind them was a table of Chen Mazi’s thugs.","“Waiter, where’s the wine? We’ve been calling you for ages, damn it!”","The black-faced man at the back table, with a fierce look, scared the waiter into trembling as","he brought two jugs of burning wine.","Seeing that they were jugs and not wine jars, the black-faced man became even angrier.","He flung the jugs to the ground and angrily shouted, “Is this little wine enough for anyone? Bring wine jars, one for each!”","“Yes, yes!!” The waiter nodded frantically in fear.","The black-faced man was satisfied with this, but when he saw Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun drinking, he became displeased.","Seeing someone drinking before them, he stood up and angrily scolded, “Wait a minute, why are they drinking before us? Do you think grandpa is inferior to these two brats?”","He then wanted to cause trouble for Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun.","At this moment, the shopkeeper came over to apologize, “Master Hei, these two are drinking wine from the jugs. Didn’t you say it’s unsatisfying to drink like this? We’ll change it right","away.”","“Hmph, jugs? Chamber pots more like! Only sissies use jugs to drink!” he said, laughing with the others beside him.","These words didn’t affect Jian Wushuang, but for Wang Lun, a bandit leader, it was an insult. His hand moved to the handle of his knife, and his eyes showed killing intent.","Jian Wushuang gave Wang Lun a signal to stay calm and not to act rashly.","Seeing this, Wang Lun nodded and retracted his hand from his waist.","If they had to act, it wouldn’t just be the two of them; they needed more people!","He casually took out a fire fold and threw it out the window.","Soon, flames shot up outside the inn, more than a zhang high.","In the bamboo forest not far away, seeing the signal, Scarred Xuan counted his men and","quickly rushed over.","He brought with him skilled fighters, at least those who had seen blood, each with a strong","upper body and long knives hanging from their waists.","There were not many such men.","Only 20 in total.","Scarred Xuan didn’t know the entire plan.","Only Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun knew.","Even now, Wang Lun couldn’t see Jian Wushuang’s entire plan.","These 20 men quickly sneaked into Shajia Town.","Entering the town, they headed straight for the watchtower.","After killing the guards there, they headed towards the inn without stopping.","At the entrance of the inn, Scarred Xuan, a ruthless person himself, drew his long knife and","was the first to rush in.","Jian Wushuang’s order to him was to kill anyone he saw.","There were not many scruples.","Moreover, those dock thugs who had been drinking were now groggy, feeling that today’s","wine was particularly strong.","In fact, they had been drugged.","Knowing in advance that Chen Mazi would come to this inn today, they had made","arrangements.","Wang Lun’s brother-in-law worked as a waiter in the inn’s kitchen.","He had taken the opportunity to drug them.","From the beginning, he had not planned for everyone to attack Shajia Town.","Instead, he had people ambush the reinforcements from Qingshan Town on the road.","This was also what Wang Lun admired.","As soon as Scarred Xuan acted, Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun also drew their knives.","However, Jian Wushuang drew his sword.","With a sword in hand, almost no one around could withstand a single strike from him.","Even an ordinary iron sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand seemed like a divine sword. Especially when dealing with the people at the table behind them, the big black man who had","previously scolded Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun stared in disbelief as Jian Wushuang slashed his throat with one strike.","At that moment, he fell to the ground, blood spraying everywhere."]},{"number":6256,"title":"Chapter 6256: Iron-Faced Liang Chen","paragraphs":["Chapter 6256: Iron-Faced Liang Chen","Wang Lun charged forward, slashing twice more, and cursed angrily, “Damn it, weren’t you acting all high and mighty just now?”","He then swiftly turned and cut down another who was paralyzed with fear, finally feeling relieved.","Turning his gaze towards Jian Wushuang, his eyes revealed admiration.","“Brother Wushuang, your swordsmanship is truly ruthless. If it had been me facing this Hei Si, I would have been entangled in a fight for a while!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head indifferently, “This is nothing. The real opponents are upstairs.”","At this moment, Scarred Xuan also ran over, covered in blood, and reported to the two of them, “We’ve taken care of everyone downstairs. Let’s head upstairs!”","Just then, a loud crash came from upstairs.","The reason why those guys hadn’t reacted earlier when they started the fight was because, firstly, they acted too quickly, secondly, there was something wrong with the wine, and thirdly, the door was locked.","They had just kicked it open now.","But having drunk the tainted wine, they might have been able to kick the door open, but they couldn’t fight back!","As soon as they broke through the door, they were immediately cut down by a few axe- wielding men who had been lying in ambush.","However, Chen Mazi had a few good men on his side too.","And they all had knives, but unfortunately, they were too drunk.","They couldn’t stop them at all.","One man, however, managed to cut down three skilled fighters in a row and broke through the siege.","Moreover, after breaking out, he ran madly towards the outside of the tavern.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but smile.","Running away, huh!","The one running was Iron Face, the only one who hadn’t drunk. He pulled out a firestick from his waist.","A streak of light shot into the sky.","Then a deafening sound followed.","There was no need to ask; it was obvious this guy was calling for reinforcements.","As for Wang Putou, he was being dragged out by Scarred Xuan’s men, along with Chen Mazi.","“Keep these two, I need them tomorrow!” Jian Wushuang reminded, then walked out of the tavern.","Five or six skilled fighters followed him.","Naturally, they needed to capture that Iron Face “Liang Chen.”","A thunderclap exploded in the sky.","Three hundred officers and soldiers stationed in Qingshan Town immediately set out.","Fifty light cavalry took the lead.","With well-trained soldiers and horses, they were far superior to bandits.","Even five hundred bandits couldn’t stop these light cavalry.","Moreover, there were two hundred axemen following behind the cavalry.","If Jian Wushuang had chosen to forcibly take down Shajia Town, the outcome would have been disastrous.","Crucially, Wang Lun wouldn’t have agreed with such a decision.","But now, they had set up numerous traps along the route, just waiting for the fish to take the bait.","In Shajia Town, Jian Wushuang, with a few men, cornered the iron-faced constable “Liang Chen” in a dead end.","Seeing no escape, Liang Chen cursed angrily, “I’ve already sent for reinforcements. Even if you kill me, you won’t escape. Prepare to be beheaded!”","“It seems you intend to repay kindness with enmity!” Jian Wushuang wiped the blood off his sword and said leisurely, “I thought you were a smart man?”","“Hmph, I’m a constable of the court. What kindness do I owe to you petty bandits? Only hatred!”","The iron face truly lived up to its name, speaking righteously without surrender.","If Jian Wushuang really wanted to kill Liang Chen, he would have done it long ago.","But this man, like Captain Wang and Chen Mazi, couldn’t be killed.","The former was notorious; killing him so easily would be too cheap and worthless. The latter was a respected iron-faced constable in Shajia Town, with high prestige. Moreover, he had a significant relationship with an instructor in Qingshan Town. Jian Wushuang naturally wanted to make good use of this.","So, he started to reason with Liang Chen.","“Brother Liang, I respect you as a good official, which is why I’m being polite. But how can you not appreciate it?”","The more Jian Wushuang spoke like this, the more Liang Chen felt something was wrong.","Jian Wushuang didn’t seem like an ordinary bandit but rather had an indescribable aura.","This aura didn’t belong to ordinary people or mortals.","It was more like that of a high-ranking official.","“Is there any bond between us?” Liang Chen tentatively asked.","Seeing Liang Chen take the bait, Jian Wushuang answered cheerfully, “Of course there’s a","bond, but it’s you who owe me a favor!”","“Where does this come from?” Liang Chen raised an eyebrow, having a premonition.","If it was as he thought, then Jian Wushuang was terrifying.","“The Hongmen Banquet!”","The reason Chen Mazi hosted a banquet today and dragged his brother-in-law along, even forcibly bringing iron-faced Liang Chen to the restaurant, was to eliminate him.","Because a few days ago, Liang Chen had confiscated an important batch of goods from Chen","Mazi.","So, Chen Mazi was willing to go to great lengths to get rid of Liang Chen.","This was something Jian Wushuang had learned from the boatmen.","Thinking about how Chen Mazi ostentatiously hosted the banquet today, he guessed there","were ill intentions.","The goods had just been seized, and now there was a hypocritical invitation.","Either it was a reconciliation attempt, but trying to reconcile with the iron face was like","playing music to a cow.","So, there was only one possibility left: silencing him.","Jian Wushuang explained the whole situation clearly.","Liang Chen had also sensed the killing intent at the banquet today and was planning to find an","opportunity to leave.","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang and his men stormed into Shajia Town, allowing him to escape. “So, Brother Liang, don’t you owe me a favor!” Jian Wushuang smiled at him.","Clearly trying to build a relationship.","But iron-faced Liang Chen was known for only seeing right and wrong, never considering","personal feelings.","In Shajia Town, he never gave face to anyone.","That was his principle.","“Let’s say I owe you a favor. Now you can kill me and take this favor. I promise not to resist, but in an hour, the soldiers from Qingshan Town will come, and you’ll still be doomed!” Although Liang Chen admired Jian Wushuang’s planning, he was not willing to collude with","him.","Besides, he had never thought of colluding with a petty bandit.","At this time, after finishing off the dock thugs at the restaurant, Wang Lun also walked over.","“Brother Wushuang, no need to waste words with him. Just kill him. Everything is set up on the main road. Those soldiers can’t get in, and they’ll still meet their end!” Wang Lun seemed very excited at this moment. He had heard from Scarred Xuan that Jian Wushuang had set up horse traps and bamboo blade pits on the main road.","Fifty light cavalry would surely have no return.","The infantry behind them would be even easier to deal with.","Using the time difference, they could set another trap on the main road where the light cavalry","had been ambushed.","It would also be easy to take down.","These soldiers looked down on bandits and couldn’t have imagined that these petty bandits","would dare ambush them halfway.","First, they needed someone to plan, and second, sufficient benefits.","Lastly, it required courage.","Courage could be forced out.","Liang Chen was first surprised that Jian Wushuang could foresee that Chen Mazi and Captain","Wang intended to harm him and could set this up in advance.","The second surprise was hearing Wang Lun say they were going to attack the soldiers."]},{"number":6257,"title":"Chapter 6257: Ambush","paragraphs":["Chapter 6257: Ambush","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, despite Iron-faced Liang Chen’s tough talk, he had to marvel at Jian Wushuang’s audacity.","Just with such a small group, he dared to attack hundreds of organized soldiers.","This was outright rebellion!","Seeing that he had said enough, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “Take Brother Liang Chen down to rest first. After I deal with those soldiers, we can continue our conversation!”","To him, these people were merely stepping stones.","Of course, he would also give them certain benefits.","After taking over the entire Shajia Town and Shajiakou, Jian Wushuang left Wang Lun to guard and oversee the place.","He also left behind twenty axemen.","This was enough to secure the rear.","He then took Scarred Xuan and a dozen other axemen to the official road.","At this moment, the light cavalry from Qingshan Town had already reached their ambush point.","The first round was the horse-tripping rope.","This military equipment was something Wang Lun had robbed.","Originally, obtaining such things felt like a loss, as they couldn’t be sold and had offended the bigwigs in Yongcheng.","But this time, it played a crucial role.","Horse-tripping ropes didn’t require much skill; the main issue was that they were troublesome to make.","Now, it only took a few strong men to topple over a dozen cavalrymen.","Clang!","As the horse-tripping ropes were raised, the horses neighed.","“Not good, it’s an ambush!”","These people, being elite cavalry of the court, reacted quickly.","They immediately prepared to turn around.","But behind them were more horse-tripping ropes.","They had already fallen into the full trap set by Jian Wushuang.","“Dismount and fight these bandits to the death!”","Being attacked from both sides, the cavalry lost their advantage and had to dismount to fight.","Though a bit chaotic, dozens of cavalrymen dismounted, still wearing soft armor and wielding curved blades.","They could still fight their way out.","But as they charged to both sides, their feet sank, and they fell into the pre-dug traps.","Below were sharp bamboo knives.","Even with soft armor, they were still pierced through when they fell.","The panicked horses and the dismounted, confused cavalry were all quickly dealt with by Jian Wushuang’s men in less than a quarter of an hour.","There weren’t actually many people here.","Initially, Jian Wushuang had planned to bring in a group of archers.","This would have been faster.","They had good bows and sharp arrows, but unfortunately, not many knew how to use them.","It was easier to set traps instead.","“Leave ten people to send the horses to Shajia Town. The rest, follow me!”","After giving his instructions, Jian Wushuang led over fifty men towards the back mountain.","The cavalry seemed to pose the greatest threat to them, but their small numbers made them the easiest to deal with.","The infantry was a real trouble.","Once detected, they would all rush into the mountains and forests. Even with the advantage of the terrain, they would still lose a lot of men.","Moreover, most of these people were porters, laborers, or boatmen.","Losing one or two was acceptable, but if too many died and the rest got scared, it would be a disaster.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang dared not be careless.","After crossing the back mountain, it was still an official road.","This official road encircled half of the mountain. The ambushes on both sides seemed far away on the official road, but relying on the terrain, Jian Wushuang and his team found Xiang Yang and the others after crossing the mountain.","“How is it? Is it resolved over there?” Xiang Yang was still a bit worried.","Scarred Xuan, hearing this, beamed with joy and said, “It’s resolved, we’ve taken them all down. Not a single one of us got injured. It was like hunting tigers in the mountains; no matter how fierce they were, they couldn’t touch us in the traps!”","With this statement, the hearts of the surrounding ambushers relaxed.","Their biggest fear was failure.","Now, the good news undoubtedly boosted their confidence tremendously.","Especially the axemen who had acted with Jian Wushuang twice, they were filled with confidence, thinking these government soldiers were not as terrifying as the rumors claimed.","But the real test of life and death was yet to come.","Taking down Shajia Town was mostly about gang fights.","But the government soldiers lying in ambush here would be engaged in battlefield slaughter once they resisted.","Jian Wushuang lowered his breath, quietly waiting for the soldiers to arrive, not wasting words with the others.","They waited for about the time it takes to burn a stick of incense.","Then they heard the heavy footsteps.","This sound made Jian Wushuang frown.","“Heavy infantry?”","A thought flashed in his mind about heavy infantry.","If that were true, their traps might not be as effective against these heavy infantry.","Moreover, in close combat, they wouldn’t be a match even against lightly armored infantry, let alone heavy infantry.","It would take at least three to fight one, and their numbers were already much fewer.","Now, with heavy infantry, it would take five to fight one.","The only advantage was that the opponents were not very agile, each wearing thirty pounds of armor, making their movements cumbersome.","They could only rely on this advantage.","“The plan has changed. Team one and team two, step back ten steps and dig deeper trenches. Team three, spearmen, hold the counterattack. Once teams one and two are free, split and escape to both sides!”","After arranging everything, Jian Wushuang’s figure silently disappeared into the night.","He had his own task to complete.","That was to take down the leader of the opposing side.","The cavalry just now did not include the officer from Qingshan Town he was looking for.","However, the officer must have come.","At the forefront of the soldiers, there were several tall horses.","Among them, a middle-aged man with a long beard caught Jian Wushuang’s eye.","No need to ask, this man was the officer of Qingshan Town.","He was also a proud student of the instructor in Qingshan Town.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t understand why heavy infantry was deployed this time.","This puzzled him. Logically, they had nothing to fear from the opponents!","Fifty cavalry were enough to kill those mountain bandits.","Why bring two hundred heavy infantry?","Wasn’t this redundant?","Jian Wushuang wasn’t a god now and couldn’t figure it out. He could only capture the man and ask.","“Positions in place, start the operation!”","Following Xiang Yang’s order.","The spearmen ambushed on both sides instantly charged out.","Along with them, several jars of strong liquor were thrown into the crowd. The smell of the liquor made the soldiers frown.","Then came the torches, thrown at them.","This wasn’t Jian Wushuang’s idea. He thought it unnecessary to be so ruthless. It was best to keep some alive.","By using their superior knowledge and persuasive skills, he and Xiang Yang could win these people over to their side.","But doing it this way would likely leave no one to surrender.","However, it worked out well.","Using fire, they quickly overwhelmed a large number of soldiers.","As the spears thrust out uniformly, they had little effect.","Because of the heavy armor, and since few on Jian Wushuang’s side knew how to use spears properly, they just charged forward, trying to take advantage of the weapon’s length.","But they didn’t pierce the armor, causing them to stumble instead."]},{"number":6258,"title":"Chapter 6258: Capturing the Big One First","paragraphs":["Chapter 6258: Capturing the Big One First","This wasn’t the worst; there were still people who saw the dead unable to stand.","Seeing this, Xiang Yang could only order a retreat.","He led those soldiers into a trap.","The leading captain saw them retreating but did not issue a pursuit order. Instead, he also retreated.","Even those who were burned weren’t brought along; they just retreated directly.","Extremely cautiously.","But such a good opportunity, how could Jian Wushuang let it go?","If he let these people escape, they would definitely choose to attack in broad daylight next time and would send out scouts, making it much more difficult.","“We can’t let them escape. Flank them and block their way!” Jian Wushuang commanded.","Although Xiang Yang didn’t understand strategy, he knew this was their best chance. He personally led over fifty men to flank them from behind.","This also demonstrated their flexibility.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang also began to act.","He moved stealthily in the dark, gripping the short sword he had prepared long ago, and headed towards the commanding captain.","At this time, the captain was loudly directing his troops.","“Use shields, advance in a dispersed formation, don’t approach the sides, stick to the main road!”","This was the role of a commander, clear-headed and aware of the ambush on both sides. If they rashly entered the woods on either side, they would certainly suffer heavy losses.","They had to stick together and slowly fight their way out.","Even if they were burned to death, they had to endure it.","Xiang Yang thought if only they had brought more strong wine, the best way now would be to use fire, but unfortunately, they didn’t have any.","They could only use spears to barely block them.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had already reached the main road, but faced with a circle of shields, it was too difficult for him to get close to the commanding captain.","Holding the short sword in his hand, his thoughts raced.","He hadn’t expected this to be so troublesome.","It was far different from what he had anticipated.","Now he couldn’t even get close to that captain.","After thinking for a moment, he flanked to the left.","This time he got much closer.","But there were still ten heavy infantrymen.","With their heavy armor, it was simply wishful thinking to pierce through with the ordinary iron sword in his hand.","He had the technique, but not the ability.","Unless he could unleash sword energy.","But with his mortal body now, being able to wield a sword was already impressive.","Holding the sword in his hand, Jian Wushuang held his breath and suddenly moved, instantly charging forward.","With a sword in hand, he had an incomparably strong confidence.","This confidence was granted by the sword.","In the darkness, the cold light flashed.","Those heavy infantrymen holding shields were startled and before they could react, they felt a draft at their throats.","This was the precision of Jian Wushuang’s sword, even if it was just a slit, he could seal the throat.","But once these people reacted, they raised their shields and used their left-hand weapons to surround and attack him.","Jian Wushuang didn’t panic, he tapped his toes, leaped into the air, and charged straight at the commanding captain.","Because if he fought with these iron lumps, his sword blade would get damaged sooner or later, which wasn’t worth it.","It was better to charge directly.","At worst, he would get injured, but he wouldn’t die here.","It was just a pity he didn’t have a handy sharp blade, otherwise, these iron lumps would have long been chopped into scrap metal.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","Stepping over the iron tortoises in three steps, Jian Wushuang instantly arrived in front of the","man.","At this moment, the officer finally reacted, but Jian Wushuang was already standing on his horse’s back, one hand removing the officer’s helmet and the other holding a sword against","his neck.","“Everyone, stop, or I’ll kill him!”","Jian Wushuang’s angry roar from the top made everyone stop.","The officer on the horse didn’t dare to take a deep breath, not because he was afraid of death, but because the cold blade was at his throat, making him unable to move. Even a deep breath might cause his throat to be slit.","“Xiang Yang, Scarred Xuan, go get them!”","Jian Wushuang kicked over the officer, knocking him off his horse.","As the officer fell to the ground, over a hundred people rushed out of the surrounding forest, directly encircling the group of soldiers.","At this moment, if the officer gave an order, he could completely turn the situation around, but Jian Wushuang would end his life. He was unwilling to take that gamble. He wasn’t afraid of death; he just didn’t want to die like this.","The state of Jiang was in chaos now, and in such times, it wasn’t the heroes who died; the real heroes were those who quelled the chaos. So, he was unwilling to die so senselessly.","He could only be captured by Xiang Yang with resentment.","Once he was bound and captured, he realized that his captors were a group of bandits. Moreover, these people were in ragged clothes; although their weapons were new, their eyes couldn’t deceive him. They were just ordinary people who couldn’t handle weapons properly.","“This... how is this possible?”","He looked around in disbelief.","Scarred Xuan stepped forward and slapped the officer on the head, shouting angrily, “What’s impossible? I’ll tell you, those cavalry are done for, too. Shajia Town and Sand Family Mouth have been taken by my big brother. Once we are ready, your Qingtown will also be finished!” “Stop wasting words with him. Confiscate their weapons and head back to Qingtown first!” Jian Wushuang sat on the horse, looking like a general, which made everyone admire him","greatly.","Today’s battle had firmly established their foothold at the small dock. Not only had they taken Shajia Town and Sand Family Mouth, but they had also dealt with Qingtown. Qingtown was a significant town with three hundred elite soldiers stationed there, and it was the most threatening military town among the nearby major towns of Sand Family Mouth.","Now that they had removed its sharp teeth, their only remaining worry was Yongcheng. Among the four coastal cities, Yongcheng was the only one with a large army stationed there, but it didn’t appear as strong as outsiders thought.","In Jian Wushuang’s view, Yongcheng wouldn’t trouble them now; it might even seek peace because it wasn’t prepared to fight the Yue Kingdom. Yongcheng had been selling military equipment and amassing gold and silver, which flowed overseas, with plans to escape to the Tang Dynasty and enjoy life.","Now that their escape route was cut off, they couldn’t move their troops recklessly and could only seek peace. Essentially, they would be asking for a truce.","So Jian Wushuang wasn’t worried about this. He had many other things to do. Returning to Shajia Town, he had all the captives moved to a merchant ship and sent to the small dock upstream, including the officer.","Jian Wushuang didn’t waste his breath trying to persuade the officer. Words couldn’t sway him, and Jian Wushuang hadn’t intended to persuade these people. The morale at the small dock was high, and trying to convince these elite soldiers to surrender would only dampen their spirits. Even if they did surrender, it could backfire because Jian Wushuang didn’t have enough leverage to keep them under control.","He needed to secure Shajia Town first. Once he had a firm hold there, it would be much easier to deal with the captured soldiers later and would serve to humble them. So, he deliberately let Scarred Xuan handle this escort.","Naturally, the captives would suffer along the way. They had captured over two hundred soldiers and kept two hundred alive."]},{"number":6259,"title":"Chapter 6259","paragraphs":["Chapter 6259","Chapter 6259: Coast Guard","They could afford to raise them; the only difficult part was detaining them.","Scarred Xuan arranged for a mountain cave to detain these people.","He had fifty axe-wielding guards watching over them, with iron bars for separation, which gave Jian Wushuang peace of mind.","He had been busy until dawn, without a moment of rest.","Early in the morning, at the entrance of the market, he gathered all the townsfolk of Shajia Town to witness an execution.","Who were they beheading?","“Chen Mazi!”","“Wang Xian!”","One was a head constable, and the other was a local tyrant of Shajia Town.","Both had oppressed the people of Shajia Town frequently.","When they suddenly heard about the execution, they could hardly believe it.","They all came to watch.","When they saw who was being executed, they were not surprised at all.","Sitting behind the long table on the high platform, the overseer was Iron-Face Liang Chen. At this moment, his eyes were filled with both excitement and unease.","Jian Wushuang stood behind him, his hands behind his back, and whispered, “Brother Liang Chen, you are doing a great service by eliminating these scoundrels. You should be happier!”","“Happy?” Liang Chen frowned and shook his head, saying, “I really don’t know who should be happy!”","He knew what Jian Wushuang was trying to do.","It was nothing more than using his reputation to stabilize Shajia Town.","He indeed gained a good reputation, but what about Jian Wushuang?","He gained control over the entire Shajia Town.","This bandit was becoming more and more unpredictable, and his emerging ambition was somewhat frightening.","“What, regretting it?” Jian Wushuang asked indifferently, “If you’re scared, you can leave anytime. I can personally handle these two tyrants and still control the entire Shajia Town. As for your reputation, Iron-Face Liang Chen, it might be ruined in the future. But don’t worry, I won’t kill you. You can go to Qingshan Town and continue being a constable. You might even become a head constable with your connections!”","Iron-Face Liang Chen’s face twitched. He felt cornered.","He couldn’t leave.","Leaving would betray his aspirations.","Not leaving meant privately killing a head constable, which was a serious crime.","And mingling with bandits like Jian Wushuang to kill a head constable would completely bind him to Jian Wushuang’s ship.","According to what Jian Wushuang said, if he left now, it wouldn’t be a big deal, at most arousing some suspicion.","But his reputation would be lost.","It wasn’t that he valued his reputation, but it would go against his aspirations.","He was unwilling.","So sitting there felt like sitting on pins and needles.","There were many things he wanted to say but couldn’t.","Seeing his expression, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but laugh.","“Don’t worry, I’ll handle the dirty work. You just need to watch. From now on, you will be in charge of the security of Shajia Town, and I won’t interfere. I won’t protect anyone either. You can do whatever you need to!”","Patting Liang Chen on the shoulder, Jian Wushuang walked up the high platform.","Chen Mazi and Head Constable Wang Xian were tied up.","Their mouths were stuffed with rags.","Jian Wushuang walked up, holding a cold steel knife.","He didn’t rush to take action. He patted Chen Mazi’s big head, looked at the townsfolk below the platform, and spoke eloquently.","First, he introduced himself briefly.","He was not rebelling but acting in accordance with the will of heaven.","The court was now corrupt, with bullies and corrupt officials colluding.","The court did not care, so he would.","However, he made Iron-Face Liang Chen the leader.","Initially, everyone had faces full of fear or confusion, but when they heard that Iron-Face Liang Chen was the mastermind, they excitedly jumped up.","Of course, most of these people were planted by Jian Wushuang to stir up the atmosphere. Some even took the opportunity to shout, “Kill the bullies, eliminate the corrupt officials!” The atmosphere reached a climax.","When the time was ripe, Jian Wushuang raised his steel knife and swiftly dealt with the two bullies and corrupt officials who had been entrenched in Shajia Town for decades.","“From today onwards, the yamen of Shajia Town will be headed by Iron-Face Liang Chen. Shajiakou will no longer have bullies, only the Coastal Guard Army!”","The crowd cheered once again.","Jian Wushuang was very satisfied and casually tossed the steel knife to Xiang Yang, walking towards Iron-Face Liang Chen, who had carried out the executions.","“Brother Liang Chen, at a time like this, wouldn’t you say a few words?”","Another wave of cheers erupted below.","The will of the people was clear.","Iron-Face Liang Chen, though somewhat awkward, was very happy to have gotten rid of the two bullies. However, he feared Jian Wushuang might become the next Chen Mazi.","But when he heard about the Coastal Guard Army, his worries were dispelled. He had attended","private school and was knowledgeable about history.","He knew what kind of person Jian Wushuang was.","He wouldn’t just fixate on Shajia Town.","Without any more concerns, he accepted everything and even made a promise to all the","people of Shajia Town that he would serve them diligently.","Jian Wushuang stood at the back, watching all this.","Unbeknownst to them, Shajia Town had already fallen into his hands.","With Iron-Face Liang Chen as his guarantor, the people’s trust in him would greatly increase,","allowing him to gradually implement his subsequent plans.","The words he once spoke at the wine table were no longer just empty boasts.","After stabilizing Shajia Town, Jian Wushuang began to make significant moves at Shajiakou.","All merchant ships coming from upstream were intercepted.","Both people and goods were taken away.","He even openly displayed some of the smuggled military supplies.","Iron-Face Liang Chen hated this the most.","So he personally took the military supplies to the market in Shajia Town for display.","He denounced the incompetence of the court and the cunning of the corrupt officials.","This made him admire Jian Wushuang more and more, thinking he must be someone who could accomplish great things.","In just ten days, Shajia Town had taken on a completely new look.","Shajiakou had dozens of merchant ships docked.","Countless gold, silver, jewels, and military supplies.","Enough to recruit thousands of troops.","In just a few days, Jian Wushuang had turned a small pier into a major one.","Having acquired so much, the next step was to expand his manpower.","The laborers used these days were all strong young men from Shajia Town.","The two hundred men they had initially recruited had already been organized into an army.","Xiang Yang was appointed as the Grand General of the Coastal Guard.","Among the two hundred men, one hundred were heavy infantry, responsible for guarding","Shajiakou.","Another fifty were taken by Iron-Face Liang Chen to ensure the security of Shajia Town.","The remaining fifty were cavalry.","They currently had no combat ability and had just learned the basics. But they would soon be well-trained, personally commanded by Xiang Yang.","Jian Wushuang himself had not a single soldier under his command. Wang Lun, who was responsible for Shajiakou, commanded another hundred men.","These men were also Wang Lun’s trusted aides. Jian Wushuang did this intentionally to prevent any of these men from speaking ill of him and causing Wang Lun to have second","thoughts.","During the early stages of consolidation, everyone needed to be united.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang had not a single soldier under his command.","On this day, he sent someone to bring Scarred Xuan from the small pier to Shajiakou.","He also sent someone to invite Iron-Face Liang Chen.","In the evening.","In the bamboo tower at Shajiakou.","A simple dinner, accompanied by several jars of strong wine.","Only their own people were present.","After sitting down, there was no unnecessary politeness.","Jian Wushuang was the first to speak, “Shajia Town is now stable. It’s time to expand our","forces. Those military supplies the court doesn’t use, we will use. They dare not resist the Yue Kingdom, so we will resist the Yue Kingdom ourselves!”",": Coast Guard"]},{"number":6260,"title":"Chapter 6260: Dream of Chasing Deer","paragraphs":["Chapter 6260: Dream of Chasing Deer","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This boast left Wang Lun stunned. He didn’t speak, but his eyes showed concern.","He felt that Jian Wushuang was being somewhat overambitious.","Wang Lun’s highest aspiration was to be recruited, but he wanted to be recruited by the Yue Kingdom.","Therefore, he didn’t dare speak ill of the Yue Kingdom at this time. However, he had no qualms about targeting the Jiang Kingdom.","Iron-Face Liang Chen was different. He would work for anyone, as long as it aligned with his own ambitions. Hence, the two didn’t get along well.","But Wang Lun knew that while he could be dispensed with, Iron-Face Liang Chen was indispensable. The entire town of Shajia, with its thousands of households, relied on Iron-Face Liang Chen for governance. Wang Lun was merely responsible for raiding some merchant ships at the docks.","Jian Wushuang aimed for this kind of balance, making them understand their positions.","“Jian Wushuang is right. Currently, few merchant ships pass through Shajia Port. Those porters have lost their income, and trouble will eventually arise. We might as well start recruiting from those porters!” Iron-Face Liang Chen voiced his intention.","In fact, everyone had this in mind, so no one opposed it.","Seeing this point mentioned, Jian Wushuang pretended to frown and said, “Expanding manpower isn’t the only issue. Just having people isn’t enough; we lack instructors and managers. There’s a talent shortage!”","As he spoke, he sighed and shook his head.","Seeing this, Liang Chen immediately suggested, “That’s simple. Didn’t we capture some court officials and soldiers earlier? Why not recruit them?”","“That’s a good idea!” Wang Lun nodded, but he looked at Jian Wushuang.","He knew that this matter still needed Jian Wushuang’s approval. After all, the captives were caught by Jian Wushuang, and he had remained silent about this matter for days, suggesting he had already considered it.","He had already thought it through. However, he needed someone to persuade others. He had to send Iron Face Liang Chen and also needed to take over the entire Qingshan Town. That was a military town with quite a few young prospects. Properly utilized, it would be easy to pull together a team of five thousand. Moreover, with established systems, they could train elite troops in batches.","Wang Lun and Scarred Xuan both looked at Jian Wushuang, while Jian Wushuang looked at Iron Face Liang Chen. As for Xiang Yang, he drank alone, unconcerned with these matters. Iron Face Liang Chen felt a bit embarrassed being stared at and spread his hands, saying, “If there’s any place you need help, just say it. That Tiger Head Captain, I don’t know him very well!”","“Let’s not talk about that for now. A few days ago, I heard from a merchant ship’s crew member that the situation in Jiang Country is not very good!” Currently, Yue Country had stationed troops in Wolf Mountain County, and Jiang Country’s main force was also there. The prince consort of Jiang Country, Zhou Chong, commanded an army of one hundred thousand and was determined to have a decisive battle in Wolf Mountain County. Considering the timeline, there might be conflicts in early autumn. The great battle would either be in the cold winter or the early spring of next year. The opponent was the Little Liang King of Yue Country, whose vanguard alone consisted of fifteen thousand elite iron cavalry. This battle could not be blocked at all!","Anyone who paid attention to this aspect knew that to win, they could only seek aid. However, Jiang Country had very few bargaining chips left. Seeking aid could only be done through wit. For example, persuading the surrounding Bohai Country, using the concept of “when the lips are cold, the teeth perish.” Once Yue Country annexed Jiang Country, they could devour two large countries, Bohai Country and Ninghai Country.","If, at this time, both sides sent troops to help Jiang Country resist, they could at least delay their demise.","Talking about this, Wang Lun and Iron Face Liang Chen were no longer sleepy and began to talk enthusiastically, either criticizing or pointing out problems. Jian Wushuang, sitting in the middle, nodded frequently. Finally, he pointed to the topic. “Have the two of you never thought about raising a fifth army?”","Jiang Country, Ninghai Country, Bohai Country, and Yue Country. This was a war between four behemoths. If a fifth force appeared, what would happen? Jian Wushuang’s question brought them back to the original point—their recruitment plans. However, with the previous buildup, Wang Lun and Iron Face Liang Chen both began to dream of vying for supremacy.","Regardless of their ambitions, the most important thing was having power in their hands. This further united them. At this moment, Jian Wushuang made his request. Iron Face Liang Chen did not hesitate too much and agreed firmly. Persuading Qingshan Town was akin to the current situation of Jiang Country, persuading Bohai Country. However, they had a natural advantage. On one hand, Jian Wushuang had pulled Qingshan Town’s teeth, and on the other, Iron Face Liang Chen had prestige and connections with an old instructor. This gave him a natural advantage. Once they seized this advantage, they would rise swiftly.","Iron Face Liang Chen was determined this time, taking his wife with him to Qingshan Town. Jian Wushuang also made preparations, instructing Scarred Xuan to release all the captured soldiers and let Iron Face Liang Chen take them back. As for the military equipment, it would not be returned. Although they had thousands of sets of equipment piled up in their warehouse and did not lack those few, each had a significant purpose. Expansion plans were already in place. Jian Wushuang had high hopes for Iron Face Liang Chen, confident he would not disappoint. With these days of persuasion, his eloquence had also improved significantly. As long as he convinced his father-in-law, everything would be ready.","The next morning, Jian Wushuang personally saw Iron Face Liang Chen off. After making all arrangements, he watched Liang Chen’s departing figure without turning back for a long time. “Everything depends on this time!”","“Brother Wushuang, aren’t you afraid of failure?” Xiang Yang asked beside him. Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “I judge people accurately. Brother Liang Chen is not an ordinary person. Sooner or later, we will leave here or Jiang Country, but Liang Chen cannot. He has many things he cannot let go of and will give his all!”","“Then let’s wait and see!”","The two returned to Sha Family Port.","Currently, no merchant ships passed through. Everyone knew they had formed a Coastal Guard, which had subdued the local aristocrats in Yong City.","They were still discussing whether to recruit or eliminate them!","However, they would not resort to force for the time being. Jian Wushuang and his group would not be idle either. After seeing off Iron Face Liang Chen, Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun began discussing manpower expansion.","There were few people to recruit at the small dock.","Now, having released those soldiers, Scarred Xuan did not return.","However, the position was crucial, both for attack and retreat.","Jian Wushuang did not give up and gathered some boatmen and merchant ship crew members, moving the captured warships to the small dock.","He selected two skilled veterans who had been roaming the canal for years to form a navy.","This would be used to transport trained elites upstream.","To bind the two Ruan brothers, Jian Wushuang even promised Scarred Xuan’s two sisters to them. Although Scarred Xuan was somewhat displeased, he was happy to hear that his future brothers-in-law would be commanders.","Then there were the porters at Sha Family Port. Although no merchant ships had come these days, Jian Wushuang still treated them well.","However, these porters, who had suffered hardships all their lives, felt a bit embarrassed and were worried Jian Wushuang might dismiss them.","Since Jian Wushuang had taken down Chen Mazi, the porters at Sha Family Port had doubled their daily earnings.","Now, seeing the good days might end at any moment, they were even more anxious than Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":6261,"title":"Chapter 6261: Extending to the Extreme","paragraphs":["Chapter 6261: Extending to the Extreme","Noon.","The kitchen had slaughtered a pig and two sheep.","This surprised the idle porters even more, and they all felt it was a farewell meal. Although they ate heartily, they felt a deep sense of sadness.","Their eyes were filled with reluctance.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang and Wang Lun stood on the second floor, watching the scene.","“It’s about time. Announce it after the meal,” Jian Wushuang said.","Wang Lun nodded and replied, “Your method is indeed effective. After two days of waiting, they’ll realize how good this meal is.”","This was similar to dealing with the Iron-faced Liang Chen.","If these porters were asked to join the rebel army right from the start, hardly anyone would have agreed. After all, exerting effort was better than risking their lives.","Moreover, these past few days they had eaten well, drunk well, and earned twice as much money as before. They were already imagining a bright future.","But now, suddenly losing their livelihood, combined with the rich food they had recently eaten, made it hard for them to return to eating coarse grains.","At this time, if they were asked to join the army with double the pay, they would have no -choice but to agree.","Jian Wushuang had already prepared a thousand taels of silver.","He didn’t stop there.","Since he wanted to expand, he would expand to the fullest.","Weapons couldn’t rely on looting; they had to be self-produced.","For instance, bows, horses, and forging swords could all be done in Shajia Town.","He had already taken over some blacksmith shops in the town.","All of this had started after the departure of Iron-faced Liang Chen.","The blacksmiths had secure jobs and didn’t need to take risks with them, lest they be held accountable later.","Jian Wushuang didn’t have time to waste words with these people, so he used coercion.","He directly had their wives and children held.","Either they worked together, or they sank together.","Of course, all this was done in secret. Outsiders couldn’t know, and Iron-faced Liang Chen definitely couldn’t know.","Although these people were innocent, as long as they worked hard, Jian Wushuang would still pay them.","They had looted the silver warehouse and Chen Mazi’s family wealth.","They obtained over ten thousand taels of silver and several hundred taels of gold.","Plus the supplies and gold and silver looted from merchant ships.","Now, Jian Wushuang was incredibly wealthy, with the only shortage being provisions.","These were strictly controlled and transported upwards, bypassing this area.","After all, the nobles were transporting gold, silver, and military supplies, each ship capable of purchasing hundreds of thousands of dan of provisions.","There was no need to steal food; it wasn’t worthwhile or profitable.","However, the first thing Jian Wushuang needed for military expansion was provisions.","But this couldn’t be implemented yet; he had to gather enough manpower first.","After the porters had eaten their fill, they found a cool place to squat, their eyes vacant as they waited for orders.","Jian Wushuang gestured with his hand.","A servant below immediately shouted out.","He gathered the hundreds of porters downstairs.","Hearing the summons, their hearts sank.","What was inevitable had come; they were all worried about being dismissed.","But Jian Wushuang’s next words made their eyes light up.","“Here is a thousand taels of silver, all taken from corrupt officials. This money rightfully belongs to you. Today, I will distribute it all!” he said, and then had people carry it down.","There were more than three hundred people here, each able to receive three taels of silver. That amounted to thirty strings of cash.","This money was enough for a family of seven or eight to live well for several years.","As long as they didn’t eat meat, that is.","But this was money they received for free!","Even if they were dismissed now, they could live off this money.","Soon, another thousand taels of silver were brought out.","This time, their eyes became even more fervent.","“Could it be, there’s more to distribute?”","“My goodness, this is the first time I’ve received so much money. So, Chen Mazi was this greedy back then, he truly deserved to die!”","Many couldn’t help but curse Chen Mazi’s greed, as they had never seen so much silver before.","In fact, this silver was all taken by Jian Wushuang from the silver warehouse; Chen Mazi’s family assets were all in silver notes, with little actual silver.","However, the silver notes couldn’t be exchanged for so much silver at the silver warehouse.","To prevent these silver notes from becoming worthless paper, Jian Wushuang had Xiang Yang personally go to the neighboring Shunshui Town to exchange them.","He had to ensure they were all exchanged.","To support people, it had to be cash.","As the discussion below grew louder, Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","Someone immediately silenced the noise.","At this time, Jian Wushuang spoke again, “Brothers, there’s another thousand taels of silver here. I know some people have also been bullied by corrupt officials and extorted by tyrants. Now you must help me distribute this thousand taels of silver, one tael per person, but there’s","a condition!”","At this point, he paused.","His goal was to recruit soldiers, not the old, young, or women.","So, he set a rule.","The recipient had to be the eldest son or the head of the household, aged between eighteen","and thirty-five.","These rules didn’t concern the porters at all; they immediately turned around to call people.","Jian Wushuang gave a time limit.","They had to gather by noon tomorrow, or the money would be gone.","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone rushed back home like the wind.","They either brought relatives or friends.","If there weren’t enough people in Shajia Town, they would go to other towns.","Because they also had benefits.","For each person they brought, they would get five strings of cash.","This rule made them even more frenzied.","“The first step of distributing money is done, we can find a place to have some tea and look at the people you brought!” Jian Wushuang walked down the stairs with his hands behind his","back.","Wang Lun, recovering from his shock, quickly followed down the stairs.","“They are all bandits, people I used to know on the road. I arranged them at the tavern, but each one is like a bandit, hard to manage!” Wang Lun reminded worriedly.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care and said, “In chaotic times, what we need most are arrogant and","fierce generals!”","In the tavern, the noise was loud.","Several of Wang Lun’s confidants were entertaining these bandits from around Yongcheng.","They had already explained their purpose to avoid Jian Wushuang wasting his breath.","These bandits were the most informed, knowing that the small dock was rising, and all","wanted a piece of the action.","They could eat.","But it couldn’t be just for the meat.","Jian Wushuang loved to paint grand visions for others. If these people only wanted to grab","some money, he wouldn’t bother using them.","Theft!","It could be stealing gold and silver, or stealing people and affairs.","But to become bigger and stronger, it meant stealing a country and the world.","Jian Wushuang wanted people with grand ambitions.","Of course, he would give them some benefits first.","However, these people would make Iron-faced Liang uncomfortable, so he chose this time to","invite them.","Inviting guests, giving money, recruiting!","All in one go.","At the wine table.","Jian Wushuang first probed lightly.","Among them, a few introduced by Wang Lun were indeed not bad.","They were all skilled.","But he also had to see their character.","If they were purely troublemakers, he would give them money and send them away, to avoid","cleaning up the mess later.","Fortunately, the people at his table were all leaders or skilled individuals with trump cards, not short-sighted people."]},{"number":6262,"title":"Chapter 6262: Spending Money","paragraphs":["Chapter 6262: Spending Money","If it were a few short-sighted people, they wouldn’t be worthy of sharing a table with him. After Wang Lun’s introduction and his own probing, Jian Wushuang quickly made up his mind.","“You are all lords of your own hills, but my small temple cannot accommodate all of you!” Jian Wushuang pursed his lips and showed a bitter smile.","This statement left the lords at the table stunned. They had come to cooperate, or to put it bluntly, to seek refuge.","Why were they being rejected now?","And so decisively, without even giving them a chance to negotiate.","When they came, Wang Lun had said Jian Wushuang was a great talent, so they should be more reserved at the drinking table.","Each of them was very cautious, without their usual rough demeanor.","They were nothing like the people in the downstairs hall.","Yet, Jian Wushuang still looked down on them. It wasn’t their fault.","Seeing everyone’s dark expressions, Wang Lun also felt that Jian Wushuang was being a bit too arrogant and quickly gave him a look.","It was about enough; these were all bosses of various hills. Not giving them any face could easily backfire.","Moreover, their current chips weren’t many.","It was just that Jian Wushuang had exaggerated too much.","The territory only had a force of five thousand people.","But he had boasted it to be thirty thousand.","And now there weren’t even three hundred.","It was only the patrol team outside and the hundred heavy infantry that had intimidated these hill lords.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have come to negotiate with him.","Seeing everyone looking at him, Jian Wushuang chuckled and changed his tone, saying, “Brothers, you must have misunderstood me. My meaning is simple. Shajia Town is too small to accommodate me, but other towns can accommodate all of you. I will provide money and manpower to help you build your own forces. The goal is not big, one thousand men for each hill. If you lack money, I’ll give money. If you lack men, I’ll provide men. Military equipment and trainers will be supplied as well!”","This statement left everyone, especially Wang Lun, stunned.","He looked at Jian Wushuang with an inscrutable expression, perhaps seeing him as a fool. Giving money and men to these bandits wouldn’t ruin his own reputation?","And if the other party grew too big, what would they do if they stopped listening to him?","For a moment, Wang Lun’s face turned dark with anger.","Jian Wushuang had never discussed this with him, but he held back, not wanting to erupt on the spot.","The key was that erupting now wouldn’t help!","The big bosses at the table were all greedily eyeing Jian Wushuang.","And the people in Shajia Town, even though some were his trusted followers, would still belong to Jian Wushuang once they grew stronger.","His influence would become less and less.","Jian Wushuang noticed Wang Lun’s concern, stood up, patted his shoulder, and looked at everyone. He said, “I know you all have doubts about why I am doing this. It’s actually quite simple. I’ve been growing rapidly recently, and I don’t lack people under me. Moreover, I think it’s not necessarily a good thing for everyone to work with me. It’s better to develop independently. I’ll provide whatever is needed. The only requirement is that when we encounter officials in the future, we must unite. Anyone who betrays will be the first to be eliminated by me!”","The blatant benefits and threats shocked everyone.","They all stood up, drank the wine in their bowls, and swore their oaths.","This was considered forming an alliance.","The hill bosses called by Wang Lun each had over a hundred men, but with small territories, no money, and no people, they couldn’t grow stronger.","Now, hearing that Jian Wushuang was planning territory for them, they all pricked up their ears to listen to the detailed plan.","Jian Wushuang took out a map and marked out the sixteen towns of Yongcheng.","He detailed the division for the five hill lords.","Each would take two towns.","Which meant ten towns were divided, leaving six towns.","Jian Wushuang now had plans for three towns.","Sha Family Town had already been taken, Qingzhu Town was in the process of being conquered, and Shunshui Town, known as the granary by the sea, was also within reach.","The last three towns were the closest to Yong City.","Among them was Qingshan Town, which Jian Wushuang had long heard about.","This town’s specialty was iron ore.","Once it was taken, the supply of military equipment would be secured.","There were also two major towns, which served as the barriers to Yong City, but they couldn’t","be taken down at the moment and had to be put aside for now.","Jian Wushuang didn’t disclose all the details but instead instructed them to return with money to recruit more soldiers.","After arranging matters with the mountain lords, there were a few infamous bandits at the table. They had no subordinates and made a living purely through their skills.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s grand ambitions, their eyes were now glowing with excitement.","Stealing a country!","That was the greatest benefit they could ever imagine.","Jian Wushuang was very polite to the remaining individuals, especially to a young man with","one ear.","This person was short but very strong, with eyes that sparkled with intelligence.","He was known in the underworld as “One Ear.”","He had a unique way of collecting information and intelligence from the entire coastal area.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang valued him highly.","Naturally, he offered a high price.","Money and resources were provided without limit.","Upon hearing this, One Ear was very excited.","He usually survived by selling bits of information and didn’t hold a particularly high status.","Now, he was suddenly on equal footing with the mountain lords and was considered a","confidant by Jian Wushuang.","This had a significant impact on him.","He felt both grateful and excited, finally seeing hope.","“Brother Wang Lun, first arrange for him twenty good men. When our people return, gather a","hundred. As for gold and silver, let them have their fill, and everyone gets a horse to form","their own scouts!”","Wang Lun, who was beside him, just nodded woodenly.","Just a rough calculation showed that they had already spent over ten thousand taels of silver.","He was stunned.","Never before had they spent so much money in a single day.","The key was that the money spent was almost like giving it away, and of course, he felt the","pain.","“Brother Wang Lun?” Jian Wushuang called out again, seeing that he was still in a daze.","Only then did Wang Lun react, hurriedly nodding, “Yes, yes, just do as you see fit!”","He could no longer understand what Jian Wushuang was up to.","He simply waved his hand, indicating that Jian Wushuang could do as he pleased.","The main reason was that he had witnessed Jian Wushuang’s capabilities in recent days.","He couldn’t match Jian Wushuang in martial prowess or strategy.","He could only stay by Jian Wushuang’s side and assist him. Jian Wushuang was very satisfied with Wang Lun’s lack of opposition.","Otherwise, he would have had to find a good position for him.","The intelligence and scouting were entrusted to One Ear.","Jian Wushuang was still considering finding some talented individuals, especially those","skilled in martial arts.","However, looking at the remaining people, none seemed fit for key positions.","But some among them were not entirely useless, so he took them in and had them balance the","mountain lords.","They were supposed to assist, but in reality, it was to monitor and make the two sides","compete against each other.","Jian Wushuang was only responsible for using and dispatching people.","With the main table settled, Wang Lun thought of taking him to other private rooms to show","his face, at least to have a look before deciding."]},{"number":6263,"title":"Chapter 6263: Not a Single One Can Fight","paragraphs":["Chapter 6263: Not a Single One Can Fight","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, Jian Wushuang felt it was unnecessary and directly declined.","Just as he was about to go downstairs, he heard a commotion in the lobby.","“Can’t take a loss, can you?” he heard someone shout. A group of men was arm-wrestling at a scattered table in the lobby.","One of them, having lost, flushed red with anger and almost started a fight.","Upon seeing this, Wang Lun frowned and immediately went downstairs to intervene.","He addressed the burly man who had shouted, “Brother, please forgive our poor hospitality today. It was my subordinate’s fault for being petty!”","After speaking, he glared at his trusted aide.","The burly man, with a black face, quickly waved his hand and said, “Forget it, forget it. I came this time just to see your small dock’s strength. I don’t care about this!”","“Oh!” Wang Lun’s interest was piqued by the man’s words. So, this burly man was here to gauge their strength!","But to say it so bluntly, his nature seemed too straightforward.","Soon, a gentleman in white clothes stopped the burly man, politely cupped his fists at Wang Lun, and said, “My brother is a bit simple-minded. I hope Master Wang won’t take offense.”","The term “Master” referred to the head of the dock.","The leader of the small dock was naturally the Master.","Wang Lun, with his broad-minded nature, naturally did not get angry, but he also did not pay much attention to the two men. After a few polite words, he prepared to leave.","“There aren’t many good fighters at this small dock, not a single one who can fight!” the burly man muttered under his breath, causing the atmosphere to tense up again.","“What did you say, you black-faced fool?” The men from the small dock immediately stood up, their eyes filled with hostility.","The gentleman in white frowned, stepped forward, and covered the burly man’s mouth.","But it was too late.","At this point, even with Wang Lun’s broad-mindedness, he couldn’t let the burly man leave like this.","He had to find a good fighter to challenge the man.","Otherwise, they would lose face today.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang also became interested.","Especially in the duo.","The gentleman in white looked like a cunning strategist, while the burly man seemed like a bodyguard, simple-minded but with great strength.","“Master Wang, please don’t take my brother’s drunken words seriously. I’ll have him apologize with a drink!” The gentleman in white seemed angry, but his eyes held an inscrutable look.","Jian Wushuang was very perceptive.","He hadn’t paid much attention to the small fries that came today.","So, he sent most of them away.","Leaving behind some brutes to conquer cities for him was also a good way to maintain control.","But after seeing the gentleman in white’s eyes, he felt that today’s main event was in the lobby!","Before Wang Lun could speak, Jian Wushuang, standing on the stairs, shouted, “As the saying goes, ‘In literature, there’s no first place; in martial arts, there’s no second place.’ How can we know if our small dock has any experts without a test?”","“Second Master!”","The people in the lobby immediately paid their respects.","Jian Wushuang’s prestige had greatly increased these days.","These people genuinely admired him.","Hearing that Jian Wushuang had spoken, everyone was eager to try their skills against the black-faced burly man.","Although this black-faced man seemed strong and intimidating, the people at the small dock were all skilled, and having had some drinks, none of them were willing to back down.","The man in white brocade looked at Jian Wushuang, guessing his identity, and said nervously, “Although my brother here has some strength, he might not be a match for the brothers of the small dock. Let’s forget about it.”","“No, we can’t just forget about it!” The black-faced burly man waved his hand and said quickly, “Let’s make it quick, all of you come at me!”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and said, “Let’s go outside, find a spacious place, so you can show your skills.”","“That’s better, so no one can say they can’t use their full strength!” The black-faced burly man said and strode outside.","Wang Lun nodded in agreement, and several skilled fighters from the small dock followed immediately.","As for the man in white brocade, he looked a bit hesitant but couldn’t hide his curiosity.","Jian Wushuang followed them, wanting to see what the other party was planning.","Outside the tavern, a crowd stood in a circle on the open ground.","The first to step forward was a strong man from the small dock, bare-chested. Although he wasn’t as burly as the black-faced man, his muscles were quite impressive.","One was over nine feet tall, the other slightly shorter.","They were evenly matched.","“Begin!” Jian Wushuang’s voice was indifferent.","At the signal, both men made their move.","They both extended their hands to grab each other’s waist.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang felt it was just ordinary.","There was no skill involved.","It was just wrestling, a contest of strength.","The strong man from the small dock tried to pull the black-faced man, but the difference in strength was too great, and he was thrown to the ground in one swift move.","“You black...!”","Being thrown to the ground, the man was clearly unwilling to accept defeat and tried to get up again, but Wang Lun called him back.","A loss was a loss, no need to be a sore loser, otherwise, it would be even more embarrassing.","One failed, so they switched to another.","But none of the skilled fighters from the small dock were a match for the black-faced burly man.","This made Wang Lun feel a bit humiliated.","A man with a single ear stood beside Jian Wushuang and said softly, “Second in command, I have a few brothers who are quite good. Should we let them try?”","“No need, this must be handled by our own people at the small dock!” Jian Wushuang didn’t mean to say that Single Ear’s men weren’t part of the small dock; he just felt that letting newcomers handle it would tarnish their own reputation.","He had already noticed that this black-faced man was no ordinary person.","In terms of martial arts, even he was no match.","“Sir, you are truly skilled. I, Wang, am impressed!” Although Wang Lun felt humiliated, he knew it was time to end it. Continuing would only further embarrass them.","Some people who were considering joining the small dock also had strange looks in their eyes.","Even though the small dock now had its own territory and influence, with plenty of money and men, the quality wasn’t impressive.","“Stopping so soon? I haven’t even warmed up yet!” The black-faced man raised his head disdainfully.","At this moment, the man in white brocade only smiled silently, not attempting to stop him.","Jian Wushuang, standing at the back, took a deep breath. It was almost his turn to step in.","Both the black-faced man and the man in white brocade were not simple. He either had to recruit them or eliminate them early; he couldn’t let them go.","Moreover, they were definitely not just two people; there had to be accomplices who hadn’t revealed themselves yet.","“If you haven’t warmed up yet, how about a few moves with me?” Jian Wushuang said, stepping forward with his sword.","Everyone was taken aback, but soon understood.","Last time, Jian Wushuang had defeated the Tiger Head Captain, and the news had spread widely. Now, he was well-known in the martial world.","He was known as the Sword God of Shajiakou!"]},{"number":6264,"title":"Chapter 6264: Seized With One Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 6264: Seized With One Sword","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The white-clad gentleman saw Jian Wushuang approaching with his sword and was taken aback. He kindly advised, “Second boss, if you use a weapon, my dark-faced brother here wields a giant battle-axe. I think we should just spar lightly; there’s no need to be so serious!”","“As a guest, how can I be negligent? Since you’re not satisfied, I’ll accompany this brother for a proper match!” Jian Wushuang replied, drawing his sword directly.","The dark-faced man also took out a pair of terrifying battle-axes from his back.","With his strong arms, he swung the massive axes with ease, though his technique was lacking.","Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was based on the unparalleled technique he mastered as a mortal.","This sword technique was flawless, leaving no openings.","The axes couldn’t even touch him.","The sword light flashed, forcing the crowd to retreat repeatedly, and even the white-clad gentleman frowned deeply.","He was also a swordsman, but compared to Jian Wushuang, his skills were child’s play.","The dark-faced man was continuously forced back by Jian Wushuang’s attacks, his axes always striking empty air, unable to touch Jian Wushuang.","Meanwhile, the cold sword tip was always aimed at his throat.","With no room to retreat, he had to raise his axes to protect his face.","“We surrender!” the white-clad gentleman shouted loudly.","Jian Wushuang then placed the sword tip against the dark-faced man’s throat, just moments away from knocking him down.","The dark-faced man took a deep breath, put down his axes, and saw that the sword tip was less than an inch from his neck, instantly breaking into a cold sweat.","He wasn’t one to fear death, but the chill of the sword tip against his throat made him break out in a cold sweat, not daring to move.","Another reason was that this match was not a life-and-death battle.","A light touch was enough.","Jian Wushuang calmly sheathed his sword, cupped his hands, and said, “Brother, you have great strength, but your technique with the battle-axes needs improvement. If you had a suitable axe technique, I wouldn’t be your match!”","“Second boss, you’re too modest. Not only do you have exceptional strategy, but your martial prowess is also outstanding. Truly a hero of both pen and sword!” The white-clad gentleman quickly stepped forward, no longer testing Jian Wushuang’s patience.","The dark-faced man felt the same; he only respected strength.","Jian Wushuang’s victory earned his respect.","At this moment, he looked at Jian Wushuang with admiration.","“You’re exaggerating. I’m just a small wave in this chaotic world. You two are also extraordinary. How about we discuss this further by the canal?” Jian Wushuang modestly offered, giving them ample face before extending the olive branch.","The white-clad gentleman was now completely convinced and cupped his hands, “It would be my pleasure!”","With the issue resolved, the small dock’s reputation was maintained.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang earned even more admiration from these people.","Regardless of strategy or martial skill, he excelled, making him a valuable person to follow in this chaotic world.","This made Wang Lun somewhat embarrassed. He couldn’t beat Jian Wushuang, and now he wasn’t as popular as Jian Wushuang.","Although he had many loyal followers, only about a hundred people, if Jian Wushuang raised his arm, half might leave with him.","Moreover, any new recruits would inevitably join Jian Wushuang’s ranks.","Luckily, Jian Wushuang didn’t care about these things.","In the wooden building at Shajiakou.","Jian Wushuang personally entertained the white-clad gentleman and the dark-faced man.","During the banquet, he learned their names.","Although he hadn’t been in Binhai County for long, he had learned about some of the county’s notable figures and scholars.","These two were not scholars but notorious villains.","Speaking of the black-faced burly man “Black Bull,” he was a notorious bandit within the county, known for his brute strength. He once single-handedly took on a group of constables at a yamen and held his ground. Jian Wushuang had experienced his prowess firsthand. Black Bull’s nickname was also quite prominent; he was known in the martial world as the “Mad Bull.”","As for the white-robed gentleman, one could not judge him solely based on his appearance. This person was even more feared by the authorities than Black Bull. Behind him stood a gang of eight hundred ruthless bandits. He was the chief strategist of Qingshui Mountain, known by the nickname “Finger Zen Star” Wu Xing. Wu Xing was both brave and cunning, making him a leading figure in the coastal county.","Understanding the identity of the two, Jian Wushuang began to ponder their intentions. Compared to these two, he was far less experienced and powerful. The eight hundred men on Qingshui Mountain were not just porters but real bandits who killed without hesitation. Now that these two had come to Sha Family Town, what were they planning?","After three rounds of drinks, Jian Wushuang began to probe. “Brother Wu, you didn’t come here just to test me, did you?”","Hearing this, Wu Xing slowly put down his wine cup, his expression becoming more serious. He then lowered his voice and said, “To be honest, I came here with a mission from our mountain lord.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang pretended to be puzzled. “What mission? If I can help, just say the word!”","In fact, there was no need to ask to know what they were thinking. They were likely wary of his rapid development and had come to test him. If his strength was mediocre, they could easily annex him. If his strength was comparable to or even greater than Qingshui Mountain, they would consider cooperation.","Now was a good time for Wu Xing’s visit, as Jian Wushuang’s forces had not yet fully developed. They only had a preliminary plan. Even if Jian Wushuang was brave and resourceful, he was not worth Qingshui Mountain’s full effort. Wu Xing’s opening words confirmed Jian Wushuang’s suspicion. The mission from Qingshui Mountain was versatile, essentially to adapt their message based on the situation.","From Wu Xing’s words, Jian Wushuang understood his worth—they considered him a potential threat. “Cooperation!”","“Yes!” Wu Xing nodded slowly and continued, “Our Qingshui Mountain is in the southwest. Although not near the canal, it is the lifeline of Yong City’s land routes. If Brother Wushuang can secure the lifeline of the waterways, the next time we drink, it will be in Yong City!”","“Haha!” Jian Wushuang laughed loudly but did not respond.","There was only one Yong City, which could not be shared.","However, Wu Xing’s words also carried a veiled threat.","The land routes were indeed controlled by Qingshui Mountain.","If they wanted to take Yong City, navigating upstream by water was too dangerous, and their small boats would be useless.","The best way was to take the land route, but it was currently in the hands of Qingshui Mountain.","Cooperation was imminent, but future conflicts were likely.","Deciding who would control Yong City was a significant issue.","Jian Wushuang’s hesitation was justified, as Wu Xing also had reservations.","Qingshui Mountain’s intention was clear: cooperate to take Yong City, but who would be in charge would depend on strength.","“This matter is of great importance. I need to discuss it with Brother Wang Lun. Also, my recent development has been rapid, and I haven’t fully assimilated it yet. There’s no rush!”"]},{"number":6265,"title":"Chapter 6265: I Heard There’s an Immortal in the North Sea","paragraphs":["Chapter 6265: I Heard There’s an Immortal in the North Sea","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang did not agree directly and used Wang Lun to dodge the question.","“Wang Helmsman!” Wu Xing murmured, his tone somewhat strange when calling Wang Lun’s name.","If an ordinary person were to listen, they would definitely sense something off.","He was practically saying it directly.","What was Wang Lun to him?","Wouldn’t it be more satisfying to kill and establish himself as king, rather than working under a small-time crook?","But Wu Xing was smart; he didn’t say it outright but hinted subtly instead.","He started talking about the ranking order of Qingshui Mountain.","“Brother Wushuang, you are a man of both literary and martial talents. Even in our Qingshui Mountain, you have the demeanor of a mountain lord. Moreover, my brother has always trusted people without a doubt, and those capable always have more work without a second word. To be honest, we currently lack someone like you in Qingshui Mountain, and the position of deputy mountain lord has been vacant for a long time!”","Jian Wushuang feigned interest and said, “Really? That’s not what I heard. Everyone in Binhai County knows that Qingshui Mountain has no shortage of capable heroes, how could they lack talent!”","Such probing and temptation were of little use to him.","An ordinary person might be tempted at this moment and, even if they didn’t join Qingshui Mountain, would at least get rid of Wang Lun.","But Jian Wushuang wouldn’t do that.","Who the boss was didn’t matter to him; what mattered were the chips in his hand.","The meal was rich in flavor.","Aside from trying to win him over, they also discussed their worldview.","Although there were some conspiracies at the beginning, they ended up chatting like kindred spirits.","From the situation in Jiang Country, they talked about the structure of this world.","Before drinking, they were just a bunch of petty thieves in Binhai County, Jiang Country.","But after drinking, the entire South Seven Countries were nothing to them.","Their conversation extended to the other side of the sea.","The prosperous Tang Dynasty!","That was the pinnacle of a nation.","Having finally met a well-read and talented person, Jian Wushuang asked many questions about how vast this world was.","He only knew that the Tang Dynasty was large.","But he didn’t know more details.","Wu Xing not only understood geography but also knew astronomy.","After hearing his words, he pondered for a while and, after a slight pause, said, “Don’t laugh, what I say might be subjective, but besides these scattered continents, I guess there is definitely a supercontinent deep in the ocean, and on that continent, there are definitely the rumored immortals!”","“Immortals?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened.","Even though it was just speculation, he wanted to hear more about such things.","“That’s right. I studied under Yannan Mountain. My master once had the fortune to travel to the South Sea Immortal Island. It was called an immortal island because there were some Daoist priests on the island. However, one of the islands did have a Qi cultivator who could control a sword with Qi. It was extremely mysterious. It was said that he learned his immortal techniques from that supercontinent!” Wu Xing spoke eloquently.","Jian Wushuang asked a few more questions.","Unfortunately, it was all based on his master’s early experiences, which had now turned to dust, at least a whole cycle of 60 years ago.","It was impossible to find it now.","But this gave Jian Wushuang confidence.","It showed that there were indeed immortals in this world.","Although he didn’t know how strong they were, as long as he could cultivate, it was enough.","From these fragmentary pieces of information, Jian Wushuang also found a clue.","That was, all these rumors were related to Qi cultivation.","Whether it was the Qi cultivators of the Tang Dynasty, the Qi cultivators of the Immortal Island, or the Qigong of King Xiaoliang.","It seemed that everything was related to energy.","This was different from the cultivation systems in the outside world.","But there were still traces to follow.","He had been to many worlds and could even create worlds, forging new cultivation systems.","Night fell.","He arranged for Wu Xing and the other to stay at an inn, as they had to leave early the next morning.","He decided to stay at the inn himself.","In the room.","Without a trace of sleepiness, he came to the window, gazing at the bright moon, his mind filled with thoughts.","He wasn’t thinking about the day’s events but pondering over this world.","When he first entered, demons surrounded him, desperately trying to escape.","He remembered that beneath the black fog was a vast ocean.","Initially, he thought that ocean was where they had come from.","But now he no longer thought so.","This world couldn’t contain those demons.","Back then, the monsters in the black fog were all incredibly powerful, reaching the level of Universe Gods, with some even at the six-star Universe God level.","Such powerful beings could shatter his current world with a single move.","“This world is probably a multiverse, with an upper and lower realm, and this place is most likely the lower realm!” Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","If that was the case, it would be even harder for him to leave.","He had been brought here, his consciousness cut off.","He didn’t know how long it would take for someone to discover him.","Although Huiqing and the others often contacted him, the intervals were too long for his current mortal body.","The last contact was a hundred thousand epochs ago.","If he had to wait another hundred thousand epochs, he didn’t know how many times he would reincarnate.","Even if he contacted them early and they discovered his isolated consciousness and came to rescue him, where would they start?","Finding the Realm King or even the Great Realm King might be useless.","His true strength in the outside world, at his peak, was stronger than the Realm King God.","He could be considered the number one person under spacetime.","Even he could be isolated.","This world was far from simple.","Moreover, the girl named Xing Luo carried the aura of Wanliu.","Her name had the word “star,” reminding him of Star Spirit.","The Wanliu Divine Tree had been taken away long ago.","Yet its aura appeared in this world.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t figure it out and fell into a deep sleep on the reclining chair.","In his dream.","He saw that figure again.","Facing away from him.","This time he was calm, just watching.","Suddenly, a name appeared in his mind.","“Prophet!!!”","Just as he remembered this name, he was awakened by someone.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit helpless, shaking his head, trying to reconnect his consciousness to that scene, but it didn’t reappear in his mind. He even muttered “Prophet” a few times to himself.","The surrounding world remained unchanged.","In the end, he gave up.","Outside the door, Xiang Yang knocked a few times, and seeing no response, he pushed the door open.","“We’re rich, this time we’ve hit it big!”","Xiang Yang strode into the room, holding a cloth bag.","Clatter!","He poured out the contents of the bag, revealing gold and silver jewels.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t care at all; he was still brooding over the dream.","Xiang Yang lowered his voice and said, “This is just a small part. I exchanged the silver notes this time, and on the way, I robbed ten carts worth ten thousand taels!”","“Oh!” Jian Wushuang still didn’t care, merely giving a slight response.","This puzzled Xiang Yang, who asked in surprise, “What’s wrong with you? Aren’t you curious whose hands I took all this money from?”","“Who?” Jian Wushuang asked cooperatively.","“Qingshui Mountain!”","Upon hearing this, he immediately widened his eyes in astonishment, “What did you say, this is from Qingshui Mountain?”","“No, no, it’s that Qingshui Mountain didn’t get it; I intercepted it!” Xiang Yang said proudly, “You don’t know, I only had a dozen men with me, and we snatched the food from the tiger’s mouth...”"]},{"number":6266,"title":"Chapter 6266: Tang Erhu","paragraphs":["Chapter 6266: Tang Erhu","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Trouble!” Jian Wushuang said, frowning. “I forgot to tell you, the White Paper Fan of Qingshan Mountain is staying at this inn!”","“Wu Xing?” Xiang Yang was also somewhat surprised.","He hadn’t expected people from Qingshan Mountain to appear here.","But since the tribulation had already occurred, it could only be said that their opponents were not as capable as them.","A hundred thousand taels of silver!","This was a fortune.","The entire Qingshan Mountain probably didn’t have that much silver.","“What do we do now?” Xiang Yang asked in astonishment.","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and said, “Qingshan Mountain will eventually clash with us. Since we’ve already taken it, we might as well keep it. But let’s allow them to leave for now. If we hold them hostage, it would be a bit embarrassing for us!”","Currently, they were still bandits, not yet considered a rebel army.","After all, they hadn’t done anything good.","Being a bandit wasn’t just about fighting and killing, but also about dealing with people.","Otherwise, who would come to join you?","Just yesterday, he had recruited a group of various bandit leaders.","If they now did something against their credibility, the money spent would be wasted.","As for snatching food from a tiger’s mouth, it wasn’t quite accurate.","Qingshan Mountain lacked the capability, and they couldn’t be blamed for that.","Moreover, if this incident got out, it would damage Qingshan Mountain’s reputation instead.","Currently, Qingshan Mountain was still the top bandit group in Binhai County.","If outsiders learned that Qingshan Mountain had been humiliated by the people at the small pier, it would enhance the reputation of the small pier instead.","So Jian Wushuang decided to stay calm and do nothing.","From what he understood yesterday, Wu Xing was also a prominent figure in these chaotic times.","He definitely wouldn’t dare take risks, nor would he actively make an enemy of the small pier.","After a brief discussion, Jian Wushuang sent Xiang Yang to Shajia Port, as they had to distribute money today.","He still needed to see off Wu Xing and Black Ox.","Outside the inn.","Two swift horses were already prepared. After exchanging a few pleasantries with Wu Xing, Jian Wushuang watched their figures disappear from sight before turning back to the inn.","Currently, there were multiple fronts to manage.","He had entrusted Xiang Yang with gathering people.","Wang Lun and others were responsible for detailed planning.","He was waiting for Iron-Faced Liang Chen.","This was crucial. Once they gained the support of his father-in-law, they would shed their bandit status and become a rebel army, making the subsequent attack on Yongcheng much smoother.","Since the Jiang Kingdom did not dare resist the invasion of the Yue Kingdom, they would take up this banner.","Jian Wushuang stood by the window on the second floor of the inn, staring at the distant path.","By mid-morning, a group of people finally appeared on the path.","The sound of hoofbeats was scattered, and the number of people was not many.","Jian Wushuang hurried downstairs, and by then the group had arrived.","Leading them was the Tiger-Head Captain, Tang Erhu.","The rest were all lightly armored cavalry.","“You must be Jian Wushuang!” Tang Erhu glanced at him, his gaze lofty and filled with arrogance.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t understand why the other party was so arrogant, especially after being captured by him. Despite his situation, he still put on airs.","However, Jian Wushuang was broad-minded and didn’t care about it. He calmly replied, “Yes, it’s me!”","“Hmph, if it weren’t for the instructor’s order, I would settle the score with you today for ambushing me last time!” Tang Erhu shouted angrily.","Hearing the word “instructor,” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Things were indeed more complicated than he had imagined.","The instructor of Qingshan Town was a worldly-wise man. It was impossible for him to join a group of bandits based on his son-in-law’s words alone.","But Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected that Ironface Liangchen would be detained.","And now Tang Erhu was taking him to Qingshan Town without explaining why.","Jian Wushuang could tolerate previous matters, but this was too much for him.","He didn’t give a clear answer, being ordered around in such a high-handed manner.","A whistle escaped his lips, startling the horses into motion.","Before long, a team of cavalry charged over.","It was the fifty light cavalry newly formed at the small dock.","Leading them was Scarred Xuan.","Upon seeing Tang Erhu, he couldn’t help but mock, “Oh, who do we have here? It’s you, the defeated one!”","After his taunt, he dismounted without glancing at Tang Erhu’s expression and walked toward Jian Wushuang.","“Ironface Liangchen has been detained. Just now, someone from Qingshan Town received the news!” Scarred Xuan said, handing a bamboo tube to Jian Wushuang.","This statement left Tang Erhu stunned. He had just left Qingshan Town and knew the situation there better than anyone. He was astonished by how quickly Jian Wushuang had received the information.","In truth, Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected the news to come so swiftly either.","The people he had deployed yesterday had already started sending information today.","Moreover, they delivered the information he wanted without needing his instructions.","He casually opened the bamboo tube, revealing a piece of paper.","“Come, we can talk!”","A simple four-word message in Ironface Liangchen’s handwriting.","Jian Wushuang crumpled the paper. He had already intended to visit Qingshan Town to meet the instructor.","But Tang Erhu’s intimidation had left him feeling uncomfortable.","He needed to keep these people as leverage.","If he got detained there, it would be a wasted effort.","“Detain them and prepare a fast horse for me!” Jian Wushuang ordered, signaling for action.","Tang Erhu glared and shouted, “Jian Wushuang, how dare you!”","“Why wouldn’t I dare!” Jian Wushuang quickly drew his sword, striking Tang Erhu off his horse, then stepping onto Tang Erhu’s shoulder to mount the horse. He calmly said, “No need to prepare a horse, this one will do just fine!”","“Understood!”","Taking down this Tiger Lieutenant was just like last time.","The others didn’t dare to act further.","Tang Erhu had come to invite Jian Wushuang to Qingshan Town, but as a defeated general, he was too embarrassed to speak directly.","He had wanted to regain some dignity but was once again defeated by Jian Wushuang.","“No need to take them to the small dock, just entertain them well at the inn!”","After his orders, Jian Wushuang tightened the reins and prepared to leave. Scarred Xuan, worried, asked, “Shouldn’t we take some men with us? There are still officials in Qingshan Town!”","“No need!”","Without looking back, he spurred his horse straight to Qingshan Town.","Fortunately, the road was wide and unobstructed, and he reached Qingshan Town within an hour.","From the outside, Qingshan Town was much larger than Shajia Town.","It was once the base of the most elite “Qing Lei Battalion” of the Jiang Kingdom. Over time, it became a military town due to the large number of military families.","If it weren’t for the invasion of the Yue Kingdom, there would be more than two hundred people stationed here.","Entering Qingshan Town, he inquired about the legendary old instructor’s residence and dismounted to walk towards a small alley.","This legendary instructor, “Yang Zaixing,” had once been the chief instructor of the hundred thousand Qing Lei Army.","Yet he lived in such a humble alley.","After walking a few steps, he saw an old-fashioned large gate with a gold-edged plaque above it that read “Yang Mansion.”"]},{"number":6267,"title":"Chapter 6267: Undefeated in Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 6267: Undefeated in Life","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang tied his horse to the post and walked to the door, knocking gently a few times.","Before long, someone opened the door. It was a young girl with freckles on her face. When she saw him, she shyly lowered her head and then turned around, calling into the courtyard, “Dad, we have a guest!”","Jian Wushuang remained calm. He had seen countless shy girls from Northern Spacetime to Realm God Continent.","After the girl finished calling out, she said softly, “Come in first. My dad is drinking with my brother-in-law!”","She led Jian Wushuang inside.","Entering the small courtyard, Jian Wushuang realized it was more spacious than it appeared from the outside. Despite the alley’s narrowness, the yard was quite large, with various standard weapons hanging on the walls, including swords, spears, and staffs.","This fit with what he knew about Instructor Yang.","While he was observing the courtyard, an energetic old man with an aquiline nose and piercing eyes stood at the doorway of the main house, exuding vigor.","Feeling the gaze from those sharp eyes, Jian Wushuang turned to look towards the doorway.","“I am Jian Wushuang, greetings to Instructor Yang!” His voice was steady, and he only cupped his hands in salute, without bowing.","For a mortal to receive such respect from him was quite remarkable.","He mainly admired the old man’s experiences.","Though a mortal, his life was extraordinary.","Instructor Yang stepped out of the main house, his sharp eyes scrutinizing Jian Wushuang, especially noting the sword at his side, with a peculiar gleam in his eyes.","“How skilled is your swordsmanship?”","“In my life, I have never been defeated!”","Jian Wushuang’s arrogant words left Tie Mian Liangchen, who was inside the main house, stunned.","This was different from the Jian Wushuang he knew!","The Jian Wushuang he knew was modest and reserved. How could he be so provocative and boastful upon meeting his father-in-law, unlike the ambitious Jian Wushuang he remembered?","What he didn’t know was that Jian Wushuang was simply speaking the truth.","“Coincidentally, I too have never met an adversary in my life, though I use a spear!”","Instructor Yang suddenly pushed off his back leg, charging towards him, a long spear appearing in his hand at some point.","The spearhead spun, causing Jian Wushuang’s eyes to blur.","The speed was extremely fast, leaving Jian Wushuang no room for carelessness. He sidestepped narrowly, drawing his sword from his waist.","Though he no longer had divine power, he was still well-versed in mortal techniques. The opponent’s spear technique was fierce, not the orderly thrust, sweep, and cut of military training, but a wild and untamed style.","This style was unsuitable for the military but perfect for the martial world.","Jian Wushuang parried the ferocious attacks with his sword. Despite the intricacies of the opponent’s spear technique, he was a master of weapons in this world.","Seizing an opportunity, he kicked the spearhead away and, with a move Instructor Yang had never seen, sliced through the spear, the sword’s edge hovering at his throat.","Everything happened quickly; their duel, from start to finish, took only a few breaths.","Defeating an elderly man in such a short time was nothing to be proud of.","But Instructor Yang, with his unyielding spirit, was captivated by Jian Wushuang’s technique.","He felt that even in his younger days, he couldn’t have defeated Jian Wushuang.","The swordsmanship just displayed was not something a mortal like him could counter.","“Brother Wushuang, please give me some face. My father-in-law didn’t come here to make things difficult for you!” Tie Mian Liangchen came out to mediate the situation.","This also allowed the freckled little girl, who was scared stiff, to realize that her father was still being held at sword point by Jian Wushuang. She stood there, dumbfounded, staring at Jian Wushuang, which was a bit unreasonable.","“Apologies!” Jian Wushuang sheathed his sword, his tone indifferent.","However, Coach Yang didn’t mind at all. He pointed towards the inner room and said solemnly, “A hero truly emerges from the youth. Liangchen’s assessment of you was not overestimated, but rather underestimated!”","Indeed, someone like Tie Mian Liangchen would never truly understand Jian Wushuang.","It was his father-in-law who had a keen eye for people.","Jian Wushuang did not feign modesty. He sheathed his sword and walked proudly towards the inner room.","Since he had already used tactics to subdue the other party, there was no need to act as if he were desperate for talent. That was appropriate for scholars, not for seasoned veterans like these.","This legendary coach was not a good person in his youth. He just happened to serve the court by chance.","If it had been the older Tie Mian Liangchen, Jian Wushuang would have had to spend more effort in persuasion.","Entering the house, Tie Mian Liangchen served as an introduction, and the subsequent discussion was between Jian Wushuang and Coach Yang.","They talked until evening.","It was simple and quick.","Although it seemed like an entire afternoon, to settle such a matter of rebellion in half a day was already very fast.","It was merely a division of interests and the probability of future success.","Dealing with these ordinary people, Jian Wushuang could be said to be a dimensional reduction strike.","He went straight to the point.","He knew that Coach Yang had a son in Yong City, but his son was a scholar and did not follow in his father’s footsteps.","This made things even simpler. Jian Wushuang directly promised that if his son had the ability, he would surely be a man of great power.","Moreover, Qingshan Town would remain unchanged, and all that was required was for him to train the soldiers.","The matters of going to the battlefield did not need to involve his family.","Tie Mian Liangchen couldn’t do this either.","As for his two daughters, one was already married, and there was nothing more to arrange for her. The benefits could only be given to Tie Mian Liangchen.","The other daughter was even simpler. To bind this old man to his warship completely, he offered a perfect arrangement.","This made Coach Yang very happy.","After dark, Jian Wushuang left with Tie Mian Liangchen.","They agreed to return to Qingshan Town in three days with men and various military supplies.","One important matter among them was the proposal of marriage.","Leaving Qingshan Town, they hurried back to Shajiakou.","At this time, a continuous stretch of tents had already been set up here, extending along the river for ten miles.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Tie Mian Liangchen, on the other hand, was very calm.","“In times of chaos, there are too many people just for a mouthful of food!”","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had offered high prices to expand his manpower.","Unexpectedly, so many people had been attracted.","These tents were all military supplies they had looted, and they didn’t expect to use them at this time.","Outside the camp, the hundred or so people from earlier were now patrolling the camp in an orderly manner.","As soon as he walked into Shajiakou, One Ear came running to report.","Before heading to Qingshan Town, he had arranged for One Ear to go to Yong City to pick someone up.","As for who he was picking up, it was naturally Tie Mian Liangchen’s brother-in-law, the son of Coach Yang.","Seeing his brother-in-law, Tie Mian Liangchen was surprised by Jian Wushuang’s thorough preparation.","It was too comprehensive. This was not like recruiting a coach but rather like recruiting a general."]},{"number":6268,"title":"Chapter 6268: Shunshui Town","paragraphs":["Chapter 6268: Shunshui Town","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang didn’t say much, just patted him on the shoulder, telling him to have a good talk with his brother-in-law.","He himself went to the headquarters at the pier.","At this time, Wang Lun was talking with a few unfamiliar faces. Seeing him return, he hurriedly stepped forward with concern, “Wushuang, are you okay? I heard from Scarred Xuan that you went to Qingshan Town alone. I was worried sick!”","“No worries, it’s all settled over there. Now we just need our people to move in!”","After saying this, he looked at those unfamiliar faces and then at Wang Lun.","“By the way, let me introduce you. These are brothers from Langshan County, and they brought hundreds of skilled hands!” Wang Lun introduced them one by one.","It turned out these people had come as refugees. They said there were hundreds of them, but in fact, they also brought along thousands of family members.","Refugees!","Providing them with food could solve the problem, but if not, it could backfire at any time.","This was not as easy to arrange as those who had homes, but there was one benefit—they would work very hard.","So the most important thing now was not to give them money, but to settle them down.","The entire Binhai County appeared in his mind.","They all pointed to one place.","“Shunshui Town!”","Jian Wushuang stood up, pointing to the town by the canal on the map and said, “Brother Wang, the most urgent thing now is to take Shunshui Town. In the future, it will serve as our granary and also provide a place for these brothers!”","“There’s no rush. Our grain supplies...” Wang Lun hesitated a bit.","It wasn’t that he didn’t trust Jian Wushuang’s judgment.","But Shunshui Town was not something they could covet at this time. If they needed grain, they could buy it from Shunshui Town.","But to take Shunshui Town seemed a bit too ambitious.","Although Shunshui Town didn’t have imperial soldiers, it did have a tyrant.","Master Huang!","No one in the entire Yongcheng, even Binhai County, didn’t know this man.","He had eight hundred retainers, ruthless men who could settle a mountain dispute with ease.","He had money and men.","If they attacked Shunshui Town, they couldn’t avoid this Master Huang.","Wang Lun waved his hand, signaling those people to leave. Only Jian Wushuang and he remained in the room, then he spoke, “Making a move now would be very unfavorable for us. It’s better to settle these brothers in Shajia Town first, and wait for our manpower to increase before taking Shunshui Town. It’s not too late then!”","This was actually understandable, most people would think this way.","But Jian Wushuang saw further.","He could use money and grain to win people over now, but couldn’t Master Huang do the same?","If your lips are gone, your teeth will feel the cold.","If your neighbor amasses troops, you would be forced to recruit soldiers too.","The current imperial court was almost a puppet.","He had taken Shajia Town for so many days, and there was little reaction from Yongcheng.","Once this door was opened, countless people would follow.","Why did Wu Xing from Qingshui Mountain come?","Wasn’t it just to test the ambition of the little pier?","Once ambition began to manifest, it couldn’t be hidden.","He didn’t even need to say anything; others could guess just by watching what he did.","So he couldn’t wait.","He had to take Shunshui Town quickly, even Qingshui Mountain.","By taking these two tough spots, he could integrate Binhai County.","Build his own power and use the stakes of mortals to meet the little King Liang.","Or rather, to approach the little King Liang.","As for these stakes, they could be let go at any time.","The first choice, the first target, was still the path of cultivation.","Or rather, a way to leave here.","That was the most important thing.","Seeing him so persistent, Wang Lun felt a bit helpless.","There was no way; there would always be a clash.","“Brother Wang, what you said is actually very true. We don’t have enough manpower to deal with Master Huang right now, but we have to give it a try. Born in chaotic times, we don’t have much time!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Xiang Yang walked in from outside.","Seeing him return, there was no surprise. He took a sip of water first, then slowly said, “So, how did it go over there in Qingshu Town?”","Xiang Yang changed the subject, and Wang Lun didn’t continue talking about the matters in Shunshui Town.","Gathered together, Jian Wushuang began to recount the affairs of Qingshu Town.","“What? You want me to marry Coach Yang’s daughter?” Xiang Yang’s eyes widened in disbelief.","Jian Wushuang nodded, tapped the table, signaling for him to calm down, then glanced at Wang Lun before continuing, “Coach Yang is crucial to us. If you marry his daughter, he will take charge of training our troops. Within three months, we can form a team of five thousand men. You’ve seen the people outside; more will keep coming. By next spring, we could have a force of thirty to fifty thousand. Making a small sacrifice now is not a bad thing for the greater cause.”","Actually, this was meant for Wang Lun to hear.","But Xiang Yang didn’t know that!","He was still thinking about Xing Luo. Whether it was due to his feelings outside or his desire to leave here, he needed Xing Luo’s help.","Although they had been tricked by her once, they couldn’t give up!","If he got married and had children here, it would be over for him.","What if Xing Luo was secretly watching them?","Jian Wushuang patted Xiang Yang on the shoulder, understanding what he was thinking.","He was just worried about Xing Luo seeing.","But Jian Wushuang hoped Xing Luo would see, perhaps prompting her to act.","It might save them from being buried here.","It was all a gamble.","If it succeeded, maybe he wouldn’t have to waste his efforts fighting with mortals here.","After convincing Xiang Yang, they began preparing to send people to Qingshu Town.","But in the meantime, they still needed these people to take over Shunshui Town.","Late at night, he summoned Yi Zhi Er.","“How much do you know about Master Huang of Shunshui Town?” Jian Wushuang got straight to the point.","He didn’t want to drag things out. If feasible, he could act by noon the next day.","Yi Zhi Er didn’t expect this question. Smart as he was, he quickly deduced Jian Wushuang’s intentions and immediately shared everything he knew, including some analysis.","Master Huang, named “Huang Jiulang,” was the ninth in the Huang family. He killed his eight brothers to seize control of the family. Although ruthless, he was quite capable, keeping Shunshui Town firmly in his grasp for years. Now over fifty, he had just married his eighteenth concubine, living a life of luxury.","“This man is extremely cold-hearted but very loyal to his subordinates. Of his eight hundred retainers, not all are fighters. Only about five hundred can actually fight; the rest are involved in various side activities like managing Shunshui Town’s fertile lands...” Yi Zhi Er detailed meticulously.","Jian Wushuang nodded silently.","He wasn’t worried about the retainers, but their loyalty concerned him.","Hearing Yi Zhi Er’s analysis, he felt even less confident.","Being very loyal to subordinates meant there would be people willing to sacrifice their lives."]},{"number":6269,"title":"Chapter 6269: Buying People’s Hearts","paragraphs":["Chapter 6269: Buying People’s Hearts","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was quite difficult to handle.","Initially, he thought the other party was a miser and planned to find a few good hands, sneak into the Huang family at night, and capture Master Huang first. Then he would persuade him, and it would be an easy task.","Now, it seemed that this plan was not feasible.","However, he did not have enough manpower, so the decapitation operation could still be preserved.","He then asked about Huang Jiulang’s hobbies and weaknesses.","“The brothel!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes slightly.","Sure enough, neither heroes nor tyrants could resist the allure of a beautiful woman!","Based on this weakness, he could devise his plan.","“One Ear, find a few clever fellows and come with me to Shunshui Town tomorrow!” Jian Wushuang said with his hands behind his back.","“Yes!”","One Ear agreed without hesitation, but he was puzzled in his heart.","If they only brought a few people to Shunshui Town, it would be fine for reconnaissance, but if they made a move, they wouldn’t get close. Although he knew Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was extraordinary, he didn’t think Jian Wushuang could fight a hundred on his own.","After sending One Ear away, only Jian Wushuang was left alone.","Now everyone was busy with their own affairs.","Shajia Town was becoming more stable and prosperous.","The next morning.","Jian Wushuang had just stepped out of the Ju Sha Tower when he noticed that yesterday’s tents had all disappeared.","Outside, it was unusually quiet.","He pulled someone over and asked, only to learn that everyone had been taken by Xiang Yang to the warehouse to move the military supplies.","All the supplies taken from the small pier and Sha Family Mouth were being moved out.","These things had to be sent to Qingshu Town in advance.","People could arrive later, but the goods had to be faster.","Otherwise, the process would be delayed.","Suddenly, Shajia Town had an influx of more than ten thousand people, and all the expenses were pressed on the small pier.","Every day when they opened their eyes, they needed to spend thousands of silver taels.","This made Wang Lun very distressed.","So he handed the accounts to Iron-faced Liang Chen’s brother-in-law to manage.","Out of sight, out of mind.","As for personnel arrangements, Jian Wushuang had no strong opinions; his matters were more important now.","Without eating, he went straight to the inn.","There was still an important guest here.","“Jian Wushuang, when are you going to let us go?”","The guest seemed unhappy, glaring at Jian Wushuang.","This guest was none other than Tang Erhu, whom he had knocked off his horse yesterday.","“We’re all on the same side now, why still act so distant!” Jian Wushuang walked towards him indifferently, found a seat, sat down, and looked at the table full of good food, pretending to be concerned, “How is it? Is the food to your taste?”","“Hmph, stop trying to cozy up to me. It’s useless unless I see Coach Yang!” Tang Erhu turned his head away.","At this moment, Iron-faced Liang Chen happened to bring in Coach Yang’s youngest son, Yang Sheng.","Upon seeing Coach Yang’s son, Tang Erhu couldn’t sit still.","“Junior Yang, what are you doing here?”","Before the scholarly Yang Sheng could speak, Jian Wushuang explained in advance, “I brought him over. From now on, Brother Yang will also be stationed at the small dock... No, at the Coastal Guard. Also, your eldest brother Tang Daqian will come today, along with your sister. They will all be working in the Coastal Guard in the future. Your mother is getting old, so I couldn’t arrange anything for her, but I have found two clever young girls to take care of her. By now, they should have already left Yongcheng.”","Such detailed arrangements were made by him as soon as he returned from Qingshan Town.","Tang Erhu was also stunned by his meticulous planning, his mouth agape.","Now he had no choice but to comply.","Having been captured twice by Jian Wushuang, Tang Erhu took a deep breath, stood up, and clasped his fists toward Jian Wushuang, saying, “Subordinate Tang Erhu, pays respect to the Second Leader!”","As he stood up, the dozen or so confidants he had brought with him also stood up and bowed to Jian Wushuang.","This made Yang Sheng, who had just met him, very impressed, and even the iron-faced Liang Chen was full of admiration for Jian Wushuang’s methods, though they were ultimately mere mortals.","Capturing a military brute was too easy for Jian Wushuang.","He just needed to cater to their interests.","“We’re all on the same side, no need to be so formal. Come, let’s have breakfast together. There are still things to do later!”","Jian Wushuang casually gestured for everyone to sit down.","“If there’s anything you need me to do, just let me know. Don’t mention just a meal, even going to the battlefield is nothing!” At this moment, Tang Erhu no longer had his previous arrogance.","He had no choice as Jian Wushuang had arranged everything for his entire family so perfectly that he had no reason to resist.","Besides, he was not valued in Yongcheng before. If it weren’t for Instructor Yang, he wouldn’t even have made it to a captain in Qingshan Town.","Being a captain was just a nominal title.","In Yongcheng, the four major captains each held significant power, while he had only about two hundred men.","Now, they had all been summoned by Jian Wushuang.","“No rush, let’s eat first!” Jian Wushuang pressed his wrist down.","He was not in a hurry at all.","After breakfast, Iron-faced Liang Chen took his brother-in-law to continue familiarizing himself with Shajia Town.","This would be their base in the future.","The rear base would be Qingshan Town.","Now, they still lacked a granary.","He wasn’t the only one taking action.","The mountain lords he had arranged a few days ago were also expanding their influence.","The Coastal County, located at the rear of Jiang Country, was becoming unstable.","Originally, it was a retreat route for the powerful families of Jiang Country.","Now it was chaotic, and they were the most anxious.","Especially in Yongcheng, which was in a state of turmoil.","But all this had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang.","He had blocked the waterway, so they had to take the land route.","And the land route was blocked by Qingshui Mountain.","Even if Qingshui Mountain allowed the government troops to come in and suppress them, once he resisted, it was possible to join forces with Qingshui Mountain to counter the government troops.","Even if Qingshui Mountain chose to sit on the mountain and watch the tigers fight because of Xiangyang’s previous encroachments, the people in Yongcheng wouldn’t believe it.","Moreover, Qingshui Mountain wouldn’t just sit back and watch.","The current situation was very favorable for Jian Wushuang and his people.","Even Tang Erhu, a military brute, could see that.","“Captain Tang, let me ask you a question. What do you think is the most needed thing for cultivating an army?”","Upon hearing this, Tang Erhu, having eaten his fill, immediately responded, “First, we need people. The Coastal Guard doesn’t lack people now. Second, we need money. I don’t know about this. Third, we need food. I’m guessing we are short on that!”","“Haha, your analysis is spot on!” Jian Wushuang praised generously.","This was something anyone would know.","He was just using this question to bring up Shunshui Town.","Hearing him mention Shunshui Town, Tang Erhu’s eyes immediately showed a murderous intent as he angrily said, “I know Shunshui Town, it’s controlled by Huang Jiulang. When I was marginalized in Yongcheng, it was because of his son. This old guy has been accumulating money and food in Shunshui Town over the years, and he has many men. Even the four major captains of Yongcheng treat him with respect!”"]},{"number":6270,"title":"Chapter 6270: Jackal","paragraphs":["Chapter 6270: Jackal","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“He’s not making it through tonight!” Jian Wushuang stood up, touched the hilt of his sword, and continued, “Dare you bring your men and follow me to Shunshui Town?”","“Why not? I’m still a lieutenant, and the people in Yongcheng don’t yet know about the incident in Qingzhu Town. We can go openly and justifiably. But killing Huang Jiulang might be challenging!” Tang Erhu, though a brute, wasn’t foolish.","Going with just a few men was akin to courting death.","“What, are you scared?” Jian Wushuang taunted. “It’s only a mere eight hundred retainers. If I say he dies today, no one can stop it!”","Tang Erhu slapped his thigh and stood up abruptly. “Of course, I’m not scared. I’m just worried about your safety!”","“Don’t worry about that. If everything goes smoothly, you might not even need to lift a finger. I can handle Huang Jiulang on my own!” Jian Wushuang shrugged.","With that, he gestured for Yizhi Er, who was waiting outside the door, to come in.","“Is everything ready?”","“All set!”","Jian Wushuang’s tone was relaxed. “Then let’s move out!”","A group of dozens mounted their swift horses and headed straight for Shunshui Town.","Along the way, they encountered many refugees from Langshan County, all dragging their families and heading towards Shajia Town.","Jian Wushuang smiled at these people.","With the smile came pressure.","He had to move faster.","The little money he had wasn’t enough to support so many people.","If it weren’t for Xiang Yang’s opportunistic moves, his money wouldn’t have lasted three months.","Now, he needed income urgently.","Spurring their horses for four continuous hours, they finally reached Shunshui Town.","But they didn’t enter directly.","“Tang Erhu, take two good men and change into plain clothes. The rest will rest here. Someone will come later to tell you what to do!” Jian Wushuang ordered. Tang Erhu, without a word, took off his armor.","Yizhi Er was well-prepared, handing them plain clothes.","Thus, a group of five disguised themselves as merchants and entered Shunshui Town.","Shajia Town was a dock town, Qingzhu Town was a military town, while Shunshui Town was purely an agricultural town.","The town had 30,000 households and a population of over 100,000.","Its core area was as prosperous as Yongcheng.","Moreover, being by the canal, there were many inns and brothels along the riverbank.","“Let’s find a place to stay first!”","“It’s already arranged!”","Yizhi Er led them to an inn located on the riverbank.","This inn was several times better than the one in Shajia Town.","Even the staff looked energetic.","Seeing these horseback guests, they greeted them with smiles and helped with the horses.","Jian Wushuang dismounted, casually threw out a silver ingot, and said indifferently, “Arrange two rooms and prepare a good meal and drinks!”","“No problem at all!” The innkeeper, never having seen such a generous guest, smiled even more warmly and led Jian Wushuang and his men to the best private room.","“Wait a moment. The rooms are ready, and the food and drinks will be served shortly!”","The innkeeper then thoughtfully closed the door and went downstairs lightly.","Sitting by the window, Jian Wushuang looked at the calm riverbank, planning the night’s actions in his mind.","Soon, the food and drinks were served, but none of them drank or ate.","Because Jian Wushuang hadn’t moved.","After a while, footsteps were heard outside, and Jian Wushuang finally turned his head, signaling Yizhi Er to open the door.","Two robust men, dressed like martial artists, entered.","Yizhi Er greeted them, introduced them to Jian Wushuang, and said, “These two are brothers from Langshan County, highly skilled and efficient!”","These two were assassins Jian Wushuang had previously asked Yizhi Er to find.","Known in the martial world as “Jackals!”","The taller one was Jackal, and the shorter one was Wolf. Both exuded a chilling aura that warned strangers to keep away—definitely not ordinary folks!","Having them was part of Jian Wushuang’s plan.","Through his investigation, he found that although Huang Jiulang valued loyalty and treated his retainers well, he was indifferent to his own sons.","Perhaps due to past fratricides, he never relinquished power to his sons.","Yet, each of his sons aspired to emulate their father and seize power by killing their brothers.","But with no power, they could only bide their time.","So, if Huang Jiulang died, the Huang family would descend into infighting.","Then, they wouldn’t care how others developed and wouldn’t worry about mutual destruction.","He could retreat and hold Shunshui Town or advance to support a puppet.","This was his plan.","To achieve his goal of support, he first had to ensure that he did not personally kill Huang Jiulang; he needed to find others to do it.","So, he had One Ear find two men from the martial world.","Jian Wushuang stood up, personally poured wine for the two men, and said politely, “I must trouble you two brothers this time. I’ve already arranged your escape route, so just proceed without any worries!”","“No need to be so polite. As long as the payment is sufficient, the two of us will never fail, and you don’t need to worry about our escape!” The voice of the man called Chai was extremely cold, with no hint of emotion.","Seeing this, One Ear quickly tried to smooth things over, “Please don’t take offense; these two brothers have always been like this, and they conduct their business this way too!”","“Good, I will await your good news tonight!” Jian Wushuang didn’t mind at all.","The brothers Chai and Lang drank their wine and then got up to leave.","One Ear followed them.","He explained the specifics once more before returning to the private room.","“Everything is arranged!”","“Good!” Jian Wushuang nodded lightly, then called out, “Don’t just stand there, eat and drink as you please. Tonight, we’ll go relax at the Cuixiang Pavilion!”","Tang Erhu, however, had lost his appetite. He had thought Jian Wushuang would handle it himself, but it turned out he had hired two assassins from the martial world.","He found Jian Wushuang increasingly inscrutable, so he decided not to think too much and focused on drinking and eating. It wasn’t enjoyable anymore!","After everyone had eaten and drunk their fill, darkness fell.","But the water reflected the lights.","The good show was about to begin.","Leading everyone, Jian Wushuang went next door to the Cuixiang Pavilion. Despite its elegant name, it was actually a brothel.","However, this brothel was somewhat reserved. It didn’t have the kind of women who would accost every passerby; instead, it had demure ladies who hid their smiles behind flowers.","The group entered the Cuixiang Pavilion, crossed an exquisite wooden bridge, and arrived in front of the building.","No one came to greet them. Only after they entered did a still-charming woman emerge. Her face suggested that she had been a beauty in her youth.","Upon seeing Jian Wushuang’s group, she glanced at them and then approached Jian Wushuang.","“Honored guest, are you here to listen to music or to enjoy the scenery?”","“What’s the difference between the two?”","“Hehe, there’s a big difference!” the beautiful woman said shyly. “One you can only listen to, the other you can only see!”"]},{"number":6271,"title":"Chapter 6271: Huang Jiulang","paragraphs":["Chapter 6271: Huang Jiulang","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Being a hypocrite and pretending to be virtuous, the first of its kind!” Tang Erhu sneered disdainfully.","The beautiful woman was not annoyed by this; instead, she responded with poise, “A song doesn’t match the person, and a scene doesn’t entice anyone. How could there be a plaque?”","“Interesting!” Jian Wushuang smiled lightly and nodded. This wasn’t his first time visiting a brothel, but it was his first encounter with such an intriguing madam.","He recalled his previous visit to the Great Xia, where he and Bai Junwang had visited brothels together, which were far more lively and less bound by such rigid rules.","Cultivators seemed less reserved than these mortals, who were extraordinarily conventional.","One Ear, preoccupied with tonight’s major event, couldn’t be bothered to discuss with this beautiful woman and stepped forward directly. “Alright, take my master to the riverside in the backyard. Money is no issue!”","Upon hearing this, the beautiful woman knew it was a recommendation from a regular customer. Without further ado, she quoted the price.","Entering the riverside in the backyard cost thirty taels of silver per person.","For the five of them, it was a total of one hundred and fifty taels.","Upon hearing the price, Jian Wushuang thought they were quite reserved.","The asking price was simply too steep.","He also admired Huang Jiulang’s capabilities, not just because of the Huang family’s one hundred thousand good fields, but also the many brothels and inns, which were mostly Huang Jiulang’s businesses.","In the vast Shunshui Town, apart from the poor commoners, the profitable industries were all owned by the Huang family.","No wonder Shunshui Town was so firmly controlled by the Huang family.","After paying the silver, the beautiful woman led them to the riverside in the backyard.","Here, there was already music and dancing, with young girls of excellent appearance dancing gracefully, their enchanting sounds stirring the heart.","Jian Wushuang and his companions found a place to sit but did not see Huang Jiulang in the backyard.","According to the intelligence, Huang Jiulang would come tonight and always sat in the foremost position.","This position was reserved for Huang Jiulang.","Perhaps because it was still early, Jian Wushuang didn’t mind and joined in, patiently waiting for the fish to bite.","After about a quarter of an hour, a commotion was heard outside.","Jian Wushuang turned his head and looked in the direction of the noise, seeing a middle-aged man in a yellow mandarin jacket striding in.","Several people behind him were scanning the surroundings.","This was within Jian Wushuang’s expectations, but two of them made him frown.","Wu Xing and Hei Niu.","These two were from Qingshui Mountain and were here too.","It was evident that after that day, they came straight to Shunshui Town.","The courtyard was not large, making it impossible for him to avoid their gaze.","So he stood up and greeted them.","“Brother Wu, what a coincidence!”","Wu Xing was also surprised to see him here. After glancing at Huang Jiulang, he quickly walked towards Jian Wushuang.","“What a coincidence indeed! I didn’t expect to meet you here, Second in Command!” Wu Xing greeted politely before turning to introduce Jian Wushuang to Huang Jiulang. “Master Huang, this is Jian Wushuang, the Second in Command of the small dock I mentioned to you!”","Huang Jiulang, as rumored, appeared modest but was deeply shrewd.","“I’ve heard that a great figure emerged from Shajia Town. I never expected to meet you on my territory. It’s a great honor!” Huang Jiulang’s words were courteous.","However, both he and Wu Xing were puzzled about why Jian Wushuang was in Shunshui Town.","Jian Wushuang was also curious about why Wu Xing was in Shunshui Town.","But it wasn’t hard to guess.","It was likely because his ambition was too great, leading to a collaboration between Qingshui Mountain and Shunshui Town.","Fortunately, he was ruthless enough to plan to eliminate Huang Jiulang in advance.","Otherwise, once he was free, the other party would have assembled a team of thousands.","At that time, without money or food, he couldn’t compete with these people.","He was also worried about today’s plan.","It would undoubtedly arouse the other party’s suspicion.","Why would a small dock’s Second in Command come to Shunshui Town now?","Moreover, to visit a brothel frequented by Huang Jiulang and coincidentally meet here.","No one would believe it was just a coincidence.","Everyone knew Shajia Town was bustling, and Jian Wushuang, a key figure, wouldn’t have the leisure to come here for entertainment, especially since Shajia Town was more than a hundred miles away.","Even if he rode here, the journey would exhaust his enthusiasm for play.","Both sides had their suspicions.","But none guessed too far.","They all stopped at the surface.","Actually, this collaboration between Qingshui Mountain and Master Huang was to take down Jian Wushuang.","They were simultaneously preparing to send people to attack Sha Family Town. As long as they took down Sha Family Town, Jian Wushuang would be cornered. No matter how great Jian Wushuang’s schemes were, without Sha Family Town, they would be mere words on paper.","A single move to defeat the enemy came from Wu Xing.","Even Jian Wushuang thought this person had some skill and was by no means an ordinary person.","However, seeing Jian Wushuang here at this moment made Wu Xing’s mind race. He was also afraid that Jian Wushuang might collaborate with Old Master Huang to deal with Qingshui Mountain.","After a brief greeting, Huang Jiulang did not invite Jian Wushuang to the same table. Instead, he took Wu Xing and Hei Niu to the main seat.","He had learned from Wu Xing that Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was exceptional and that he carried a sword. Getting too close made him uneasy.","As soon as Huang Jiulang sat down, he signaled to his subordinate to go back and call more people.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang also gave One Ear a look, signaling to act quickly.","They couldn’t delay.","Otherwise, they would lose the chance to act.","He didn’t know much about the martial artists of this world and was unaware of the opponent’s strength.","If they failed, it would be difficult for him to escape today.","Although on the surface it had nothing to do with him, a ruthless person like Huang Jiulang would never let a tiger return to the mountain.","If he got surrounded, even though he was confident in breaking through, the subsequent plan would fail.","At this moment, both sides acted simultaneously.","However, Jian Wushuang’s side was quicker.","The two brothers, Wolf and Coyote, had already sneaked into the Cui Xiang Pavilion and were now waiting for an opportunity.","To make the other side act faster, Jian Wushuang personally created this opportunity for them.","He raised his eyes and signaled to Tang Erhu.","Unfortunately, this blockhead was not as perceptive as One Ear. If he had this ability, he wouldn’t have ended up as a miscellaneous captain.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit helpless and had to attract attention himself.","He took a gulp of strong liquor, staggered to his feet, and rushed towards a dancing young woman.","“Beauty, aren’t you cold wearing so little?” Jian Wushuang teased the brothel woman with extreme disdain.","If word of this got out, he wouldn’t be able to live it down.","But he had no choice but to do this now.","Not only did he use words, but he also used his hands.","With this commotion, he intended to cause the other side to panic and attract the attention of Huang Jiulang and others, making it easier for the Wolf brothers to act.","Unexpectedly, when he grabbed the girl in the thin veil, she did not resist. Instead, she fell into his arms, her cheeks blushing shyly.","“Why is this different from what I expected?”","Jian Wushuang felt a bit panicked inside. He had thought the girl would resist or at least scream."]},{"number":6272,"title":"Chapter 6272: Framing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6272: Framing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He was careless and made a mistake because he forgot that he was bearing a face that could make any ordinary woman fall for him.","Fortunately, it wasn’t his fault.","He could only awkwardly hold the beauty in his arms and return to his seat. As soon as he sat down, his expression darkened.","“If you can’t relax here, you can go upstairs,” the girl leaning against Jian Wushuang’s chest whispered in a voice as soft as a mosquito.","Jian Wushuang wiped his face, wondering what kind of mess he had gotten himself into.","Just then, a sudden thunderclap exploded in the sky.","Everyone looked up in unison to see a firework blooming.","But what they didn’t know was that at the same moment, Huang Jiulang, who was sitting in the main seat, also blossomed—except his flower was blood-red.","“Murder!”","A startled cry drew everyone’s attention to Huang Jiulang.","They saw Huang Jiulang clutching his neck, blood pouring out.","This scene terrified the young girls, and some guests turned pale with fright, wanting to flee the courtyard.","Chaos ensued.","Jian Wushuang and the others stood up as well.","The real show was about to begin.","And they already had a scapegoat.","Someone shouted to catch the assassin, prompting Huang Jiulang’s retainers to draw their swords and surround everyone.","At this moment, One Ear shouted, “I just saw it! That big black guy did it! Avenge Ninth Master quickly!”","“Kill him for me!” Among Huang Jiulang’s retainers, a slender middle-aged man drew his knife and charged.","Where there was one leader, there would be others.","One Ear’s accusation, combined with the retainers’ identification, immediately put Wu Xing and Black Bull in the middle of the siege.","“You’re full of crap!” Black Bull erupted.","Wu Xing, beside him, turned pale as well. He clearly hadn’t anticipated such a turn of events.","It was obvious even without thinking—they had been framed by Jian Wushuang and his group.","But he had no way to defend himself now. If they left immediately, they would be hunted by the Huang family. Even if they escaped, it would bring trouble to Qingshui Mountain.","If they stayed, they would fall right into Jian Wushuang’s trap.","While Wu Xing hesitated, the Huang family’s retainers had already surrounded the courtyard.","As for the real culprits, they had long left.","The Wolf Brothers were quick in their actions.","They didn’t give the Huang family’s retainers a chance. Now, only Jian Wushuang’s group and Wu Xing’s pair were left.","“Brother Fang, listen to me. Someone is framing us. Don’t forget that I’m here representing Qingshui Mountain today!” Wu Xing remained calm, knowing they couldn’t resort to violence, and quickly tried to stop the confrontation.","The Huang family’s top retainer, Fang Chengxin, drew his gleaming blade, his eyes filled with anger and sorrow.","“How can I believe you?”","He hadn’t clearly seen who made the move, but his own people claimed it was Black Bull. He couldn’t just ignore it.","Soon, several of Huang Jiulang’s sons arrived.","Seeing their father dead, they were at a loss whether to be sad or not. Each was caught off guard.","But they quickly understood one thing: whoever avenged their father could take over the Huang family.","Hearing it was Qingshui Mountain, they rushed at Wu Xing and Black Bull without considering the consequences.","Fang Chengxin, being an experienced retainer, knew something was off and hurried to stop the young masters.","But at this moment, the sons of Huang Jiulang couldn’t care less and ignored Fang Chengxin.","Previously suppressed by these retainers, they now didn’t want to heed them since their father was gone.","“Fang Chengxin, our family has treated you well. Now the murderer of our father stands there, and you not only refuse to avenge him but also stop us!”","“Could it be that you’re colluding with them?”","The younger generation of the Huang family had eyes full of suspicion.","Some even thought it might have been done by one of their own brothers.","To them, the truth was irrelevant. Killing the enemy and rising to power was the clear choice.","Seeing the chaotic scene, Jian Wushuang waved his hand, signaling the others to leave first to avoid drawing more suspicion and being falsely accused.","Only Tang Erhu stayed with him.","Wu Xing and Hei Niu stood back-to-back, now forced into action.","Among the crowd, he glanced at Jian Wushuang with a look of fury and apprehension.","If he threw dirt on Jian Wushuang now, he could drag him into the fray.","But he didn’t do that.","Because he knew if Jian Wushuang dared to act this way, he must have a backup plan.","The only chance for survival now was to cooperate with Jian Wushuang.","Wu Xing immediately shouted, “Brother Wushuang, everything’s done. It’s not good to just stand by and watch the joke, right?”","By saying this, he was both cooperating with Jian Wushuang and pulling him into the fray.","It all depended on what Jian Wushuang would do.","In fact, Jian Wushuang had anticipated this, so he let One Ear take the others and leave first.","He had come today to take over Shunshui Town, merely watching the show wasn’t enough.","“It seems I’ll have to make a move!”","Jian Wushuang raised his hand, drew his sword, and charged out, first killing Fang Chengxin.","This guy was deeply rooted in the Huang family and was on the list to be eliminated.","Seeing him take action, Wu Xing and Hei Niu also took the opportunity to strike back.","Anyway, they were already tainted, so they didn’t mind more blood.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s men, who had been set up outside, also rushed in.","They hacked at the Huang family’s guests indiscriminately.","After one incense stick’s worth of time.","The backyard had turned into hell.","Corpses and blood mixed together on the ground.","Jian Wushuang and Tang Erhu were covered in blood, as were Wu Xing and Hei Niu.","These two had considerable martial prowess, especially Hei Niu, whom Jian Wushuang had experienced firsthand.","“Second-in-command, the cavalry has also arrived, we can head to the Huang family anytime!” One Ear said as he walked in after everyone had fallen.","“Okay, let Wang take charge!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","Now, although the Huang family still had hundreds of guests.","Huang Jiulang was dead, Fang Chengxin was dead too.","The younger generation competing for power in the Huang family were also dead.","Those guests had no master to serve, Wang Lun was just right to go.","As for the scapegoat, Qingshui Mountain would take the blame.","“Brother Wu, are you going back to Qingshui Mountain now, or coming with me to Sha Family Town to form the Coastal Guard?”","“I have no choice!” Wu Xing smiled bitterly.","Now that he was implicated in cooperating with Jian Wushuang to kill Huang Jiulang, returning to Qingshui Mountain would surely arouse suspicion.","Hei Niu beside him hadn’t reacted yet.","He was the most confused right now.","How did they suddenly join the small dock?","But things had come to this point, and since he had been following Wu Xing, it wasn’t appropriate to ask openly.","Jian Wushuang left the subsequent matters for Wang Lun to handle.","This was also a time to build prestige.","It was useless to him, but extremely beneficial to Wang Lun.","So he had to do it personally.","Jian Wushuang then took Wu Xing and Hei Niu back to Sha Family Dock.","They began preparing for the training at Qingshu Town in two days."]},{"number":6273,"title":"Chapter 6273: Candle Dragon Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 6273: Candle Dragon Mountain","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With Wu Xing’s addition, Jian Wushuang no longer needed to handle the smaller details.","He only needed to stay stationed at the rear.","All other matters were entrusted to Wu Xing and Wang Lun.","Two days passed in a flash.","Shunshui Town was taken, and Wu Xing even wrote to Qingshui Mountain to persuade them to surrender.","With Qingshui Mountain captured, the entire Binhai County would essentially be under their control.","This was the escape route for the Jiang Kingdom.","If they controlled it, the first to panic would be the aristocrats of Jiang Kingdom.","But at this moment, they had yet to realize this.","Even Yongcheng’s reaction was minimal.","But soon, they would witness a new force rising.","Two days later, Jian Wushuang personally led five thousand carefully selected young men to Qingzhu Town, bringing Xiang Yang along as well.","He still wanted to see if Xing Luo was in this place. If so, there might be a chance to draw him out.","Unfortunately, it was wishful thinking.","Even the grand wedding a month later couldn’t lure Xing Luo out.","Jian Wushuang completely abandoned the thought, and even Xiang Yang gave up hope.","Binding closely with Instructor Yang, he was especially attentive to training the troops, as this could be considered his own force now.","In just one month, the five thousand young men became five thousand guards.","Although they hadn’t yet developed much combat power, the reported number was quite impressive.","Qingshui Mountain, which had been hesitant, directly switched sides.","Henceforth, the small dock no longer existed.","It was replaced by the Binhai Guards.","Successfully taking over the bandits from Qingshui Mountain bolstered their ranks again.","Now, whether it was military affairs or the plan to capture Yongcheng, Jian Wushuang didn’t need to personally handle anything.","This allowed him to enjoy some leisure.","In the past, he might have been in seclusion, but now he could only stay indoors reading.","He read various ancient books collected from all over.","Particularly, he didn’t miss any strange and mysterious stories.","Among them, he found many interesting things.","“Candle Dragon Mountain!”","A towering mountain a hundred miles west of Binhai County, rumored to have had a Candle Dragon appear there.","Candle Dragon, a Beast God that appeared in every material world, was considered a clan with extremely powerful bloodlines.","The appearance of a Candle Dragon indicated that this place had some treasure attracting it.","With nothing better to do, Jian Wushuang decided to go and see.","Now the Binhai Guards were on the right track.","With Shunshui Town as a major granary, they could continuously gather people.","They had already taken in over thirty thousand refugees, and the second batch of young men gathered over eight thousand people.","Every month, they would send a batch of people.","By the end of the year, it might really be possible to have thirty to fifty thousand troops, though it was unfortunate they had no warhorses, otherwise, they could form a cavalry unit.","Unfortunately, Binhai County was mostly surrounded by mountains, unsuitable for raising horses, making cavalry difficult to deploy.","So they didn’t bother further; all they wanted was an impressive number.","Using this as leverage to approach that Little Liang King.","As for Xiang Yang, he had now integrated into the mortal world.","Jian Wushuang didn’t remind him. Being able to blend into the mortal world was quite good.","Perhaps it was thanks to that mortal woman.","The next morning.","Jian Wushuang had a batch of fast horses prepared and left Qingzhu Town alone.","He galloped all the way toward Candle Dragon Mountain.","A journey of a hundred miles took him nearly five hours, arriving at the range of Candle Dragon Mountain in the late afternoon.","Today, he couldn’t explore the mountain, so he looked for a nearby village to rest for the night.","However, after searching for a long time, he couldn’t find a place to stay.","The surroundings were overgrown with weeds and intertwined with shrubs.","With no other option and the sky darkening, he found a flat ground to rest for the night.","As night fell, there were frequent sounds from the bushes.","Jian Wushuang lit a fire. Though the weather wasn’t cold, it was a bit chilly, and the campfire was mainly to ward off wild animals and satisfy his hunger.","He had hurriedly left without bringing any rations, and his stomach growled painfully in the middle of the night.","Fortunately, in the still of the night, he heard the sound of flowing water, likely from a small stream running down the mountain. Jian Wushuang grabbed a torch and followed the sound.","He intended to catch some fish to fill his stomach.","But as he prepared to put the torch down and enter the water, he saw a white figure floating in the stream.","Seeing this at night gave Jian Wushuang quite a scare.","Despite having experienced quite a lot, now as a mere mortal, accompanied by the howling of wild beasts in this desolate stream, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel a tremor in his heart upon seeing a pale human figure.","Shivering, he quickly returned to the shore.","The body floating in the water drifted downstream with the current.","Taking a deep breath, his hunger dissipated.","“It seems, she’s not dead!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, and he went back into the water to pull the body ashore.","When he dragged it to the shore, he realized it was a woman.","However, she was dressed in men’s clothing.","Without thinking too much about it, he carried her on his shoulder and returned to the campfire.","Seeing her swollen belly, he knew she had swallowed a lot of water.","There is an old saying among mortals: “Saving a life is more meritorious than building a seven-story pagoda.”","Jian Wushuang, now a mortal, could not escape this belief.","Saving her life was something he could do without much loss to himself.","Placing the woman flat on the grass, he pressed her chest a few times. The woman in white immediately coughed, spitting out water and grass.","Spitting out the water was a good sign for survival.","By the light of the campfire, Jian Wushuang looked at her pale face, feeling a sense of familiarity but unable to recall her name. Her appearance was pleasing to his eye.","After repeating the process several times, her swollen belly finally subsided.","Jian Wushuang moved her closer to the campfire to keep her warm, then leaned against a rock, holding his sword and half-closing his eyes, waiting for dawn.","The long night was peaceful.","At dawn.","Jian Wushuang went to the stream early to wash up and caught a few grass carp hiding in the crevices of the rocks, planning to grill them for breakfast.","When he returned to the still-smoldering campfire with the fish, he found that the woman in white had woken up.","Moreover, she had just taken off her top and was drying her clothes by the remaining fire.","Seeing her exposed back, Jian Wushuang was momentarily stunned, dropping the fish in his hand.","Hearing the noise, the woman quickly turned her head. Seeing him, she widened her eyes and hastily covered her chest with her clothes, a sharp look in her eyes.","Seeing the man in front of her staring at her foolishly, the woman in white became furious. She immediately stood up and shouted angrily, “If you dare look again, I’ll gouge out your eyes!”","She clenched her hands, and the stones on the ground flew into her hands. She casually threw one, hitting Jian Wushuang in the chest.","Jian Wushuang didn’t have time to react and was knocked to the ground.","Yet he still wanted to lift his head to look."]},{"number":6274,"title":"Chapter 6274: Reappearance of Wanliu","paragraphs":["Chapter 6274: Reappearance of Wanliu","Because on the other person’s back, Jian Wushuang saw a totem.","It was a tree that had been awe-inspiring for ages!","The Wanliu Divine Tree!","He would never forget it.","That was why he was so surprised and kept staring.","The woman in white had no idea and thought Jian Wushuang was lustful.","“So, is this all you’re capable of?” The woman in white sneered.","Jian Wushuang, clutching his chest with one hand, ignored the pain and asked urgently, “How did you get the Wanliu Divine Tree on your back?”","Given her methods, she was no ordinary person and must have some connection to the divine tree.","“You recognize it?”","The woman in white raised her eyebrows. She hadn’t expected the man in front of her to recognize the mysterious willow on her back.","“Answer my question first!” Jian Wushuang demanded.","This took the woman in white by surprise. An ordinary mortal dared to speak to her this way, eliciting a sneer.","“You have no say here!” The woman in white pulled a small wooden tube from her waist and shot a red beam into the sky.","Soon, hoofbeats sounded from afar.","Jian Wushuang, now recovering, didn’t know the woman’s identity, but he knew if he fell into her hands, he would likely be tortured.","Taking advantage of the fact that the group hadn’t arrived yet, he rolled into the shrubbery.","The woman in white wanted to pursue him but was struck in the chest, spitting blood, revealing she was also injured.","The hoofbeats drew nearer.","Upon seeing the woman in white, the riders quickly dismounted, respectfully saying, “Your Majesty!”","“Search the area. Find him!”","“Yes!”","“Remember, we need him alive!”","“Understood!”","The group abandoned their horses and, armed with swords, charged into the bushes.","The woman in white’s eyes flickered with suspicion and surprise.","Clearly, the man was an ordinary mortal, yet he recognized the mysterious willow on her back, undoubtedly connected to her origins.","She had to capture Jian Wushuang.","After giving orders to her subordinates, she mounted a fast horse and left Candle Dragon Mountain with a few others.","She had more important matters to attend to.","Jian Wushuang, meanwhile, was in trouble.","He ran through the shrubs deep into Candle Dragon Mountain but couldn’t shake off his pursuers.","These people were formidable, not like bandits or ruffians, and definitely not martial artists from the underworld.","Jian Wushuang was curious about their identity, so he intentionally left flaws for them to split up in their pursuit.","He then seized the opportunity to capture one of them.","Pressing the blade against the captive’s neck, Jian Wushuang asked in a low voice, “Who is that woman in white? Tell me, and I might spare your life!”","“Dream on!”","The captive slit his own throat, catching Jian Wushuang off guard.","Fearless of death!","And such martial prowess.","Jian Wushuang’s curiosity about their identity deepened, but he couldn’t investigate now and had to hide in Candle Dragon Mountain alone.","By nightfall, he finally shook them off.","He entered the desolate Candle Dragon Mountain, which was easy to get lost in due to its complex terrain. Fortunately, his sense of direction was good, and he moved slowly up the mountain.","His stomach growled, but he couldn’t find any food.","After enduring the night, he descended the mountain and left the Candle Dragon Mountain range from another direction.","He headed towards Qingshui Mountain.","Though his journey to Candle Dragon Mountain yielded no tangible results, seeing the Wanliu Divine Tree on the woman’s back confirmed that this world was connected to Wanliu, and possibly to the Prophet.","Recalling his previous dream, he became even more certain.","This world was connected to the Wanliu Divine Tree, the Prophet, and him.","He knew the Prophet, who had helped him many times, and the Wanliu Divine Tree, which had been taken by Weiss but now appeared here.","He had entered the Wanliu Divine Tree and obtained his path to enlightenment there. Its appearance in this world was likely related to him.","But now, as a mortal, he couldn’t explore its mysteries.","This made him even more eager to return to his path of cultivation.","Only by regaining his strength could he uncover the secrets here.","So, when he arrived at Qingshui Mountain, he remained mysterious.","Hei Niu guarded this place.","There were also three thousand newly trained soldiers.","All of them were under the command of Hei Niu.","These 3,000 men, each wielding a mountain-splitting axe.","They were most suited for close combat.","They were also prepared to resist the troops from Yong City.","Right now, there were still thousands of government soldiers in Yong City, so they couldn’t be","careless.","Seeing him alone and looking mysterious, Hei Niu approached and asked, “I heard you went","to Candle Dragon Mountain. What’s going on? Why are you so down? Did someone bully","you?”","“You wouldn’t understand!” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly and changed the topic, “How have things been lately? What’s the situation on Yong City’s side? Are they just watching us","grow?”","Currently, in Binhai County, almost every town had their people.","The mountain lords from before had now taken over the major towns in their respective territories, each commanding their own troops.","If all the Binhai Guards were counted, they had already exceeded ten thousand men.","Moreover, the official roads between the towns had also been taken over.","Yong City had now become an isolated city.","Although the people below hadn’t spoken of rebellion, they all practiced passive resistance,","not obeying commands.","They were probably as anxious as ants on a hot pan right now.","“Don’t even mention it. A few days ago, some dignitaries from Yong City came to offer","money, saying that in the future, they would make it easier for us on the waterways and official roads. As long as their merchant ships could sail smoothly, they wouldn’t care how","Binhai County was being tossed around!”","Hearing Hei Niu’s answer, Jian Wushuang also laughed.","It was just as he had guessed, only faster than he had imagined.","He had initially thought the other side would offer to surrender and pacify them, certainly not","send troops to suppress them.","Now it seemed they had skipped the surrendering part and went straight to negotiating","cooperation.","But now that they wanted to talk, they were no longer willing to.","They continued to seize the passing merchant ships.","Forcing Yong City to have to change their route.","But changing routes made the journey slow, and the waves were big, making it easy for ships","to sink.","But these matters had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang, and he couldn’t be bothered to deal","with them.","At noon, Qingshui Mountain killed chickens and sheep, giving Jian Wushuang a good feast.","Having starved on the mountain for several days, Jian Wushuang did not hold back, eating","meat and drinking wine with gusto .","The matters weighing on his mind were also put aside.","He felt that those issues couldn’t be rushed.","Delaying a day or two was nothing. In the outside world, a single retreat could last millions of","epochs.","He could afford to wait for this short time; what he was anxious about was his cultivation.","In the gathering hall of Qingshui Mountain, while he was drinking with Hei Niu, an urgent report suddenly came from outside."]},{"number":6275,"title":"Chapter 6275: Taking a Step Further","paragraphs":["Chapter 6275: Taking a Step Further","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The nearby official road had people passing by.","A group of them had killed quite a few of their brothers.","Moreover, their actions were ruthless, showing no mercy.","When Hei Niu heard this, he immediately glared and swung his axe angrily, saying, “Lead the way. I will personally meet these people. How dare they come to Qingshui Mountain and act wild; they must be tired of living!”","“Wait a moment!”","Jian Wushuang grabbed Hei Niu, turned to the scout who reported, and asked, “From which direction did they come?”","Those who dared to kill people from Qingshui Mountain so recklessly could not be from Binhai County.","Everyone in Binhai County knew that Qingshui Mountain was the territory of the Binhai Guards.","Even the nobility of Yongcheng didn’t dare to offend them.","They feared a direct attack on their city.","Who would dare to kill them?","So the attackers must be outsiders.","This place was not close to the waterways; the outsiders must have come by water. Most people who traveled by land came from Yongcheng.","It was impossible for the people from Yongcheng to make a move against those from Qingshui Mountain.","So there was only one possibility:","the group that had been chasing him earlier at Candle Dragon Mountain.","When he heard they came from the direction of Candle Dragon Mountain, he was even more certain.","“I’ll go with you!”","Hei Niu waved his hand and said, “No need. This is a small matter; I can handle it myself!”","“You won’t be able to deal with them!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Immediately, the two of them set off together, taking five hundred axemen and 200 cavalry to give chase.","To be on the safe side, he also sent word to notify some nearby allies.","These were the mountain lords they had pacified earlier.","All of them went out in full force.","A thousand men went to encircle that group.","Unfortunately, by the time they reached the official road, the group had long disappeared.","After asking around, they found out that one of the white-clothed experts had slaughtered an entire mountain of people and then traveled by water to Yongcheng.","There was no need to ask to know that this white-clothed person was the woman he had rescued, the one with the Wanliu Divine Tree behind her.","This person was not ordinary; she had a unique way of using qi.","He had personally seen her use her palm to attract a stone from the ground into her hand.","Actually, this had nothing to do with cultivation, because in Jian Wushuang’s view, unless one became a Dao Ancestor, they weren’t considered a cultivator.","He didn’t understand the cultivation rules of this world yet, so he thought this way.","If what he said was true, that one must become a Dao Ancestor to be considered a cultivator, then perhaps there were no cultivators in this world yet.","After the failed attempt to encircle the mysterious group, Jian Wushuang returned to Qingshan Town.","He didn’t tell Xiang Yang about what had happened because Xiang Yang didn’t know about the Wanliu Divine Tree, so telling him would be useless.","He stayed indoors by himself.","Anyway, now there were people to handle both major and minor matters.","He wasn’t worried about being marginalized.","After all, Xiang Yang was keeping an eye on things.","Time flew by, and it was already the New Year.","On the first day of the new year, many people came to visit.","Jian Wushuang greeted each one of them.","By evening, when only he and Xiang Yang were left, they talked about the recent events.","In a blink, they had been in this world for more than half a year.","Now, the Binhai Guards had developed rapidly, already numbering 50,000 men.","Their combat power wasn’t exceptionally high, but this number alone was enough to intimidate people.","As for the current nobility of Yongcheng, most of them had already fled.","They feared they wouldn’t be able to escape if there was an attack on Yongcheng.","As for the stationed officials and soldiers, they had almost all become their people.","Whenever there was an order from the court, it was delivered to Qingshan Town immediately.","This also saved Jian Wushuang and his group the trouble of sending people to attack; they directly let Wu Xing lead his men to take over Yong City.","After the New Year, everyone discussed moving into Yong City together, effectively taking control of the entire Binhai County.","However, these matters weren’t very important to Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang.","“Shouldn’t we take the next step?” Xiang Yang said calmly while sipping tea. “I know your plan. We use our current leverage to cooperate with the Little Liang King and learn his cultivation methods!”","Jian Wushuang was initially a bit surprised, then teased, “You seem to be living quite comfortably these days. I thought you’d forgotten about this matter. Why not just live in this world? Why go out? With your aptitude, becoming a Universe God is a long shot. Even if you become one, you’d only be a three-star at most, which isn’t a super strong figure on the Realm God Continent. In this world, things are different. You might even become an emperor!”","“Give me a break. The life of a mortal starts with passion but turns into torment over time!” Xiang Yang shook his head helplessly.","Indeed, the life of a mortal is like this—starting full of passion but eventually becoming mundane, facing death directly.","You bring nothing at birth, and take nothing at death.","Everything is an illusion.","They understood this when they became Celestial Beings.","How could they fall into the trap of mortal life?","The two chatted for a long time.","Both had a burning determination in their hearts.","A few days later, everyone moved to Yong City with their families.","They stayed there for almost half a year.","As summer arrived, the situation in Wolf Mountain County became increasingly tense.","Meanwhile, they focused on their own development, ignoring worldly affairs.","Their forces had grown to a hundred thousand troops, well-rested and eager for action.","The Jiang Kingdom’s court could no longer ignore their presence and started probing Wang Lun’s intentions.","An imperial edict of amnesty!","Besides the Jiang Kingdom’s amnesty, there was also a letter from the Little Liang King of the Yue Kingdom.","This wasn’t an amnesty; it was a demand for surrender.","And it had a commanding tone.","In the main hall of Yong City, Jian Wushuang’s group sat in two rows.","It resembled a royal court.","At this moment, they were in a heated argument.","According to Jian Wushuang’s initial strategy, they were to surrender to the Little Liang King.","But now, with their military strength, their ambitions couldn’t be suppressed.","Led by Wu Xing, the radical faction believed they could conquer the world and didn’t need to rely on anyone.","Tie Mian Liang Chen advocated surrendering to the Little Liang King.","Currently, they could only maintain a force of one hundred thousand. Any more, and they couldn’t afford it.","They didn’t have the strength.","Conquering the world required resources.","Once Jiang Kingdom fell, they wouldn’t be able to withstand the Yue Kingdom’s army.","Wang Lun believed they should rely on Jiang Kingdom to resist the Yue Kingdom, thus becoming a minister of the dragon.","His ambition was the smallest, yet the most prudent.","Relying on the Yue Kingdom would be fruitless.","But relying on the Jiang Kingdom was different; the Jiang Kingdom needed their forces now.","Seeing the argument going nowhere, the silent Xiang Yang spoke to Jian Wushuang.","“Brother Wushuang, I think you should make the decision!”","Everyone fell silent and turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","The Binhai Guards’ current scale was largely due to Jian Wushuang’s early planning and bold actions.","The initial strategy was also set by Jian Wushuang.","So naturally, they wanted to hear Jian Wushuang’s opinion.","Xiang Yang’s suggestion was also to let Jian Wushuang decide."]},{"number":6276,"title":"Chapter 6276: Recruitment","paragraphs":["Chapter 6276: Recruitment","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The first choice was naturally Little Liang King.","The other party was likely a practitioner, and taking refuge with them could lead both of them onto the path of cultivation.","However, it seemed that the other party didn’t take them seriously at all.","Even if they sought refuge, now was not the time.","They needed to increase their bargaining chips first.","But now, they had reached a bottleneck in their development, and to progress further, they had to go to Langshan County.","First, they would submit to the Jiang Kingdom, demonstrate their usefulness, increase their bargaining chips, and then negotiate conditions with Little Liang King.","This was the only plan Jian Wushuang could think of.","He couldn’t openly share this with everyone.","Once he did, morale would plummet.","He knew that once these people learned the truth, they would undoubtedly become complacent, and if they failed to deliver results, they would squander their existing bargaining chips, resulting in a loss.","At that point, he and Xiang Yang would be left dumbfounded.","However, they had also planned a backup route, which was to head to the Eastern Tang Dynasty.","That was the pinnacle of the dynasty and a place frequented by practitioners.","If all else failed, they would simply abandon their posts and flee.","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang said, “Some things change over time. Initially, I suggested allying with Little Liang King because I believed we were useful to the Yue Kingdom, but now, as you all have seen, they don’t take us seriously. Moreover, we are all from Jiang Kingdom. Even if surrendering could bring peace, what use would it be? Eventually, we would face retribution!”","“What do you suggest?” Iron-Face Liangchen looked at Jian Wushuang.","Everyone else was watching as well.","Except for Iron-Face Liangchen, everyone else was concerned with their own interests.","Whether it was the mountain lords, the people of Qingshui Mountain, or Wang Lun and Yang Zaixing, they were all concerned about their own futures.","Who won or lost was irrelevant.","“Collaborate with the Jiang Kingdom and send troops to Langshan County. I will personally go to the royal city of the Jiang Kingdom to negotiate with them!”","This statement left everyone stunned; they hadn’t expected him to be so decisive.","“Sending troops directly, isn’t that a bit too fast?” Wang Lun hesitated.","The others were even more reluctant.","Especially Iron-Face Liangchen, who advocated taking refuge with Little Liang King, exclaimed, “Brother Wushuang, have you considered how many people will die if we ally with the Jiang Kingdom?”","“Die?”","Jian Wushuang sneered, “There’s no war without casualties. Moreover, we are doing this to resist the Yue Kingdom, which is understandable. If we’re afraid of death, we might as well disband early!”","These words left everyone speechless.","He realized that these people had grown complacent after some stability and had become somewhat timid.","Fortunately, most people agreed with this proposal.","Finally, a vote was held, and most people sided with Jian Wushuang.","The matter of recruitment was finally settled.","The next step was to integrate personnel and march on Langshan County.","In doing so, they put pressure on both the Jiang Kingdom and Little Liang King.","Jian Wushuang was preparing to take Xiang Yang to the royal city.","There was no need for people from the royal city to come; he would personally meet the current emperor of the Jiang Kingdom.","Three days later.","He and Xiang Yang, with the farewell of the crowd, set sail for the Jiang Kingdom.","This time, they didn’t bring many people.","Only One Ear and a few skilled individuals were responsible for protecting them, while the others stayed behind to prepare for the army’s departure.","After all, this hadn’t been discussed with the Jiang Kingdom yet.","They needed to wait.","Once Jian Wushuang negotiated with the Jiang Kingdom, they could make a decision.","Otherwise, if they went ahead, they would starve. The logistics and transport of provisions would require an enormous amount of manpower.","Binhai County didn’t have that many people available.","Therefore, he needed the Jiang Kingdom to send people to assist, at least to handle the logistics.","These were essential conditions.","This time, he came to negotiate.","After sailing for three to five days.","They arrived at Jiangning County, the wealthiest county in the heart of the Jiang Kingdom.","The royal city was also situated next to Jiangning.","As soon as Jian Wushuang and his companions disembarked from the ship, they were greeted by a squad of elite cavalry.","His name had already spread throughout the royal city.","A bandit with an army of a hundred thousand was no longer just a bandit.","Even if he didn’t call himself the Coastal Defense Army, others would bestow him with a title.","The official in charge of welcoming them, a second-rank officer, personally attended to them.","Jian Wushuang and his companions were accommodated in a luxurious courtyard designated for foreign emissaries.","That evening, the official brought along various high-ranking officials to host a banquet in their honor.","Jian Wushuang did not stand on ceremony; he accepted their flattery and received the gifts that were offered to him.","He had to do so in order to gain more advantages.","After the banquet, they finally got down to business.","After bidding farewell to the other high-ranking officials, the second-rank officer, Li Mi, stayed behind.","The two of them leisurely drank tea in the pavilion, and Jian Wushuang changed the topic to inquire about the thoughts of the one in the imperial palace.","Seeing him initiate the serious conversation, Li Mi’s expression became solemn.","“There are some things I must speak frankly about. This time, regarding the emperor’s edict to pacify your Coastal Defense Army, there have been some voices of opposition!” Li Mi said calmly.","Upon hearing about the opposition, Jian Wushuang laughed.","Looking at Li Mi, he found the other quite amusing.","“Opposition? Could it be that some are advocating surrender to the Yue Kingdom?”","The Yue Kingdom had invaded the State of Jiang with the claim of annihilating it.","What benefit would surrender bring?","None at all, only exile overseas.","Li Mi spoke bluntly, “Yes, and there are quite a few, though they can’t be killed off completely!”","“Then they must oppose the conditions I proposed, right?” Jian Wushuang found the man somewhat untruthful.","He hadn’t even made any excessive demands yet, but it seemed like he was already making enemies. The key issue was whether these people were genuinely intent on surrendering or just using this as leverage against him.","That’s why he spoke this way.","“There will indeed be voices of opposition, but you don’t need to worry. The matter of the pacification will be decided by the Protectorate Office. Tomorrow, you will meet the Emperor, receive your title, and the conditions you propose will also be agreed upon by the Protectorate Office. However, there is one thing you need to do!”","Hearing the straightforwardness of the other party, he couldn’t help but furrow his brows and asked, “What thing?”","“Killing!” Li Mi raised his head, his eyes deep and penetrating.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang became even more puzzled.","He had just entered the royal city and was being asked to kill.","This was...","He frowned, pondering whether there was a trap.","He couldn’t let himself be fooled by the other party!","“My strength, you should know, and I only brought a few people this time. I really don’t understand what you mean!” Jian Wushuang didn’t respond directly but subtly indicated his inability to perform the task.","Li Mi wasn’t in a hurry and continued, “I’ve already investigated your influence. In the Coastal Prefecture, you can practically cover the sky with one hand, and you’ve made great contributions, so there’s no need to be so modest!”","“But that’s in the Coastal Prefecture; this is the royal city!”","“Precisely because of that, you need to do it. Once you do, the Emperor will be assured, and you will become one of us!” Li Mi’s justified words left Jian Wushuang silent once again.","Finally, he asked, “Who should I kill?”"]},{"number":6277,"title":"Chapter 6277: A Woman","paragraphs":["Chapter 6277: A Woman","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Princess!”","Li Mi stood up immediately after speaking.","Jian Wushuang did not see him off; he remained seated in the pavilion.","He finally understood now.","The imperial edict was not to resist the Yue Kingdom but to use his strength to eliminate dissent within the court.","The Jiang Kingdom was truly finished.","Luckily, he hadn’t genuinely pledged allegiance to the Jiang Kingdom, or he would have been doomed alongside these people sooner or later.","The next day, Jian Wushuang got up early to enter the palace.","He went alone, with no one accompanying him.","Today’s visit to the palace was merely for a conferment of rewards.","The real matters needed to be discussed privately.","Upon entering the palace, a eunuch guided him to the court hall.","Today’s morning assembly had most people discussing him.","When he entered, they all looked at him.","Jian Wushuang felt no pressure as he stepped into the hall, bowing neither humbly nor arrogantly.","He did not kneel.","This was seized upon by those opposed to the imperial edict as a handle against him, immediately rebuking him and assigning him a string of charges.","Jian Wushuang snorted with a sneer, retorting, “I am here to protect the Jiang Kingdom, but what about you? You wish to see the Jiang Kingdom perish!”","Though none of them were truly virtuous.","At least he cared about his reputation!","These people didn’t even care about that.","They advocated surrendering to the Yue Kingdom with pompous arguments, which was simply laughable.","Being confronted like this, the faces of many court officials turned red.","At this moment, the Emperor of Jiang, seated on high, spoke.","It was just a word of appeasement.","But it made Jian Wushuang frown.","He directly raised his head to look at the young Emperor of Jiang.","He was shocked at what he saw.","In his mind, he instantly thought of the woman in white he had encountered at Candle Dragon Mountain.","Although he hadn’t noticed anything initially.","But voices don’t lie.","Due to the rules of the court, he couldn’t directly gaze at the Emperor at first glance. Now, taking a closer look, he recognized her.","The other party certainly recognized him too.","But she did not speak.","Jian Wushuang was thrown into chaos.","He even ignored his own conferment of rewards.","Until the words “dismiss the court” were spoken, and Li Mi pulled him, did he come to his senses.","Leaving the palace, he got into Li Mi’s carriage.","Only then did he calm down.","“Lord Li, there is something I wish to ask!”","“Speak freely!” Li Mi responded straightforwardly.","Jian Wushuang was even more straightforward. He asked a question that would cause those ministers to panic.","“Is the Emperor of Jiang actually a woman!”","As soon as he said this.","Li Mi was stunned.","He hurriedly reached out to cover Jian Wushuang’s mouth.","It was evident that he knew the inside story. Otherwise, such an important matter as the imperial edict would not have been entrusted to Li Mi to handle. He must have been a confidant of the young Emperor.","“Discuss this at my residence!” Li Mi’s tone was uncharacteristically stern at this moment.","When he looked at Jian Wushuang, there was a hint of killing intent.","Jian Wushuang could feel this killing intent.","Once inside the residence, Li Mi said nothing, taking him directly to a secluded courtyard.","In the courtyard, there was a bamboo grove, creating a tranquil atmosphere.","Li Mi then turned his head to look at him.","“How did you discover this matter?”","“You should ask that young emperor!” Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back, a soft sword hanging at his waist.","If the other party dared to turn hostile, he would take Li Mi’s head first and then lead his men back to Binhai County.","Li Mi wasn’t angered by his reference to the current emperor and said sternly, “You’d better keep this matter to yourself, or you’ll surely die!”","His words didn’t sound like a threat, but more like a statement of fact.","Yet, the situation was quite amusing.","An emperor on the brink of losing his country turned out to be a woman.","Jian Wushuang looked up at Li Mi and calmly said, “Even if I keep it a secret, that young emperor won’t spare me!”","“Hmm?” Li Mi was somewhat surprised by his statement.","But before he could ask further, someone outside reported that the emperor had summoned Jian Wushuang to the palace.","“You know the emperor?”","“I’ve met once!”","“No wonder you know the emperor’s identity. But don’t worry, as long as you keep this secret and kill the Eldest Princess, you’ll be one of us, and the emperor won’t trouble you!” Li Mi spoke with confidence, thinking this was merely a power struggle.","However, Jian Wushuang saw further.","This wasn’t just a feud within the royal family.","It was a conspiracy among cultivators.","The enmity between the current emperor and the Eldest Princess wasn’t as simple as a fight for the throne.","Jian Wushuang patted Li Mi’s shoulder and said, “Help me pass a message to Xiang Yang, tell him not to wait for me, and if I die, spare him!”","“Is it that serious?” Li Mi became somewhat flustered.","If the emperor truly killed Jian Wushuang, the hundred thousand troops in Binhai County would rebel.","At that time, the collapse of the dynasty would be disastrous for the royal family.","Jian Wushuang didn’t bother explaining anything further and simply left the small courtyard.","He followed the eunuch who delivered the decree and re-entered the imperial palace.","However, this time, they didn’t use the main gate but a side entrance.","From there, they headed directly into the depths of the palace.","Jian Wushuang followed behind the eunuch, lost in thought.","He was taking a gamble.","Actually, once he recognized the other’s identity, he couldn’t leave anymore.","He could only face it head-on.","He wasn’t sure if his luck was good or bad.","He wanted to see the other person but feared that person wouldn’t trust him.","Thus, he was torn.","After walking for a while, they stopped in front of a large hall.","The palace eunuch turned to Jian Wushuang and said, “Please wait here for a moment. I will go and announce your arrival!”","“Thank you, Steward,” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","The chief eunuch went inside to report, and then led him in.","However, the eunuch did not follow inside.","Only Jian Wushuang walked in alone.","The entire hall had a unique fragrance, evoking a sense of reverie.","Standing at the center, Jian Wushuang glanced around but did not see the emperor of the Jiang Kingdom.","He didn’t rush to speak, just stood there waiting.","After a while, the screen automatically folded, revealing the emperor of the Jiang Kingdom behind it.","Jian Wushuang turned his head to look and met the other’s gaze.","“We meet again!” The young emperor smiled faintly.","No one would have expected such a coincidence.","Initially, with a tentative attitude, he went to Candle Dragon Mountain and ended up encountering the emperor of the Jiang Kingdom.","A coincidence or intentional?","Jian Wushuang couldn’t be sure it was accidental.","Because this world was controllable.","“If you have something to say, just say it directly!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","He didn’t want to waste words and wanted to be straightforward.","After all, this was a mortal world, and there was nothing that couldn’t be said.","The Wanliu Divine Wood was once a precious treasure to him, but now, it was no longer important.","He only wanted to leave, and once he was out, it would be easy to find out why the Wanliu Divine Wood appeared here.","But now, he had no choice but to speak.","The emperor of the Jiang Kingdom was writing something at the moment, not in a hurry, and said in a calm tone, “I’m quite curious. You went from a dock worker to conquering the entire Binhai County and even formed some Coastal Guards, all in just half a year. That’s not something an ordinary person can achieve!”"]},{"number":6278,"title":"Chapter 6278: Please Don’t Call Me Sir","paragraphs":["Chapter 6278: Please Don’t Call Me Sir","Indeed, Jian Wushuang had no identity in this mortal world. He was just an ordinary person. However, he was able to create an army of hundreds of thousands in a short period of time.","This indeed made people doubt his ability.","Moreover, he was very young at this time. He looked to be only in his early twenties.","He was not even as big as the Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom in front of him.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat as he guessed the other party’s thoughts.","“You’re right, I’m not an ordinary person!”","Upon hearing this, the Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom was stunned. He stopped writing and looked at Jian Wushuang with deep eyes.","“But you’re not a Shangxian!”","Jian Wushuang smiled indifferently,” Would you believe me if I said that my power was taken away?”","“Yes!”","The Emperor of Jiang Kingdom answered with a serious face, which made Jian Wushuang solemn.","This was a little different from what he had imagined. He felt that he would be treated like a carrot and would be squeezed dry by the other party. However, now, he felt that the other party seemed to be a mortal who had not been born for long.","Perhaps he was too sensitive, seeing all cultivators as evil people.","He had no choice. After cultivating for so long, he had seen too much.","He had done it before.","Not to mention this.","In order to cultivate, many people had fallen into the demonic path.","After carefully recalling the history of the current Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom, he felt a little relieved.","A little girl in her early twenties might not be that bad.","They could even work together.","“Can you tell me now?”","The Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang.","His eyes were like stars.","The answer he wanted was the mysterious willow tree on him.","Jian Wushuang knew this very well.","It could be said that no other human understood the Wanliu Divine Tree better than him. Of course, Weiss was not human.","“Actually, I don’t know much. I’ve only seen this totem by chance. There are some records on it that this tree is a divine item!” Jian Wushuang’s words were ambiguous and aroused the other party’s interest. In this way, he could know more and gain more bargaining chips.","He wasn’t trying to fool the other party, but the other party definitely wouldn’t believe him if he told the truth.","He was now a mortal, but he told the other party that the Wanliu Divine Tree had once appeared in the northern spacetime, a spacetime that was many times larger than this world.","Moreover, this Wanliu Willow had once come from the Starry Sky.","It was later taken away by a super existence.","If he said this, the other party probably wouldn’t believe him.","It was even more troublesome to explain.","It was better to throw out a simple bait first and let the other party understand that the Wanliu Divine Tree was very unique and an opportunity.","Instead, it would make the other party feel at ease.","Sure enough, as he had expected, the little Emperor’s interest was immediately piqued.","“May I ask where you saw this totem?” he asked.","“The Great Tang of the East!” Jian Wushuang raised his head and said.","After hearing this, the Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom seemed to have received affirmation in","his eyes.","Because her mother came from the Tang Dynasty.","He had long since begun to yearn for it, but he also suspected that the totem on his back was related to his mother, so he naturally thought of the Great Tang.","Now that she had received Jian Wushuang’s confirmation, she was even more certain.","“Sir, can you still find that place?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied,” It’s an island on the sea. It’s hard to find!”","He didn’t say it in a definite manner and gave the other party some expressions that could only be encountered by luck.","He had said so much to the little Emperor, but he had yet to open his mouth to ask, so he naturally had to hang on.","The Emperor of Jiang took a deep breath and said respectfully,” I know what I want to know. You may ask now, sir!”","“First, don’t call me Mister. You can call me Jian Wushuang, Senior, or Fellow Cultivator!” “Secondly, is the totem on your back something you were born with, or did it appear for some reason?”","“Thirdly, what’s your current realm?”","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to ask a lot of questions. He had already figured out that the other party was a little girl who had not been born for a long time. He had to grasp the","situation.","It would be best if he could not be led by the nose.","Actually, these questions were normal.","Needless to say, the first one was just to test if the other party had any ulterior motives.","The latter two involved some of the other party’s secrets.","“I can answer Senior’s question, but please keep it a secret for me, including the fact that I’m","a girl!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and agreed.","As long as the other party was not hostile, he would not provoke them for no reason. “The totem on my back started to appear after I turned sixteen. Actually, I didn’t always live in the capital. When I was young, I traveled with my mother in the Seven Southern Nations. When I returned to the capital at sixteen, I was told that I would inherit the throne. My mother also left me from then on. This totem also appeared on my back. As for my current realm, I’m not too sure either!”","However, she changed the topic and told him about the cultivation rules of this world.","Qi!","It was a type of energy that could be condensed. It could not be compared to divine power, but","it was still a type of power.","The first step, the Qi-gathering stage, was also known as the acquired stage.","The second step, Qi Refinement, could be called Xiantian.","After that, he condensed his Golden Core, and the cyclone was like an ocean.","Next was the Nascent Soul realm. At this level, one was almost invincible in the world.","Further up was the illusory Divine Phase.","Heavenly law phenomena, the descent of the divine form, a true Immortal Dao technique.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","This was the first time he had heard of the cultivation rules of this world.","It could be considered the first step.","He tried his best to restrain his excitement and was not even that curious about the Wanliu","Divine Tree.","“Can I take a look at your cultivation method?” he asked tentatively.","The Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom was a little hesitant when he heard that he wanted to see","her cultivation method.","Jian Wushuang knew that his words might have been a little abrupt. He quickly explained, “I’m just curious. Your cultivation method is a little special. There is no stable realm. Perhaps I can tell your current realm from your cultivation method!” “That’s not what I meant. There’s nothing to hide about cultivation methods. It’s just that I don’t know my own cultivation method. Back then, my mother only left me an ordinary cultivation secret manual. If Senior wants to see it, I can get someone to take it!”","“That’s good too!” Jian Wushuang pretended to feel sorry for her.","However, she was already overjoyed.","The other party did not know that he did not know the cultivation method.","In this way, he did not need to curry favor with Prince Liang and directly embarked on the path","of cultivation.","This was simply effortless, and he had also dealt with the little Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom","who hid the secret of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Jian Wushuang suppressed his joy.","After waiting for a while, a black-robed figure appeared in the hall and handed a secret book","to Jian Wushuang respectfully.","Jian Wushuang opened it casually and looked at it casually. In fact, his mind was working quickly and he memorized everything without missing a word.","Combined with the cultivation realm mentioned by the Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom."]},{"number":6279,"title":"Chapter 6279: Cultivation Method","paragraphs":["Chapter 6279: Cultivation Method","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He quickly deduced that this secret manual could directly lead one to the Divine Phase.","The content above was actually very simple.","However, for someone with no cultivation experience, it was like a heavenly book. Even the young emperor of the Jiang Kingdom felt the same; she could only understand the content related to the Houtian phase at most.","After flipping through the manual, Jian Wushuang casually tossed it onto the table and said calmly, “It is indeed an ordinary secret manual, but the contents are enough to cultivate you to the Divine Phase. It seems your mother was quite a powerful figure!”","The more he marveled at it, the more it impressed the other person with his abilities.","“Before my mother left, she told me that if I fully understood this secret manual, I would be able to see her. Does it mean I have to reach the Divine Phase?”","The young emperor of the Jiang Kingdom had a look of longing in her eyes.","After all, when her mother left, she was only sixteen years old.","She had to handle the mess of the Jiang Kingdom all by herself.","“With your talent, combined with the totem of the Wanliu Divine Tree, reaching the Divine Phase is only a matter of time!” Jian Wushuang reassured her.","In his view, possessing the totem of the Wanliu Divine Tree meant that reaching the Divine Phase, or even becoming a Universe Master, was not a problem.","Moreover, the Wanliu totem on the young emperor of Jiang Kingdom was left by her mother, suggesting that her mother likely had connections with the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Jian Wushuang licked his lips.","He had formed a plan in his mind.","“For today, let’s leave it at this. If you have any questions about your cultivation, feel free to ask me anytime!”","“Senior, why are you being so kind to me?” the young emperor of the Jiang Kingdom asked curiously.","She felt that Jian Wushuang was a bit too attentive, or rather too good to her, sharing everything without reservation.","Initially, she thought Jian Wushuang was a cunning old fox who would definitely be evasive with her.","But the situation turned out to be quite different.","Jian Wushuang was taken aback by her question and could only explain, “When I saw this totem, a senior once told me that someone bearing this totem is destined to be a chosen one. I guess I’m just trying to secure a powerful ally in advance!”","He made up a lie casually to cover it up, then wanted to leave directly.","Now that he had obtained the cultivation method, he naturally wanted to go back and try it out.","He couldn’t talk too much with her, or she might discover something suspicious.","“Thank you, senior. If I achieve anything in the future, I will not forget your guidance!” The young emperor of the Jiang Kingdom expressed her genuine gratitude this time.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and prepared to leave. But just as he turned around, he looked back at the young emperor and asked curiously, “We’ve talked for so long, but I still don’t know your name...”","He only knew that she was the sixteenth emperor of the Jiang Kingdom and did not know her real name.","Actually, there weren’t many people who knew the emperor’s real name, so it was normal that he didn’t know either.","“Well... senior can just call me Jiang Shang!”","Jiang Shang!","Jiang Shang?","Hearing this name, Jian Wushuang was stunned for a moment before he reacted.","“Good, a good name!”","After speaking, he didn’t want to stay there any longer. He held his breath and quickly left the great hall.","Following the eunuch, he left the palace and finally exhaled a long breath.","“How could I forget, she also has the surname Jiang!” Jian Wushuang closed his eyes slightly, and after a moment, he boarded the carriage.","In an instant, his thoughts pulled him back to the Northern Spacetime.","The Qishen Temple of the past.","The Great Xia Dynasty.","There was also a little girl who had a connection with the Wanliu Divine Tree, her name was “Jiang Shang.”","She was Hui Qing’s disciple.","There shouldn’t be such coincidences in the world.","“Perhaps, this is destiny!”","Jian Wushuang sighed.","The mistake he made back then, he thought it ended with Jiang Shang’s fall.","Unexpectedly, he encountered another girl with a similar name, also connected to the Wanliu Divine Tree.","He now suspected that she was the reincarnation of Jiang Shang.","There couldn’t be so many coincidences in the world.","Jian Wushuang firmly believed.","Returning to his residence.","He didn’t hurry to tell Xiang Yang about today’s events but instead closed his room door and began to cultivate alone.","Houtian Qi Gathering.","It emphasized sinking the Qi into the dantian, something he had achieved in the mortal world.","This helped him avoid many detours.","Qi entered the dantian, and the next step was to open the meridians.","To clear 108 meridians.","Once the Qi flowed throughout the body, he could fully master the use of Qi and become a master of innate abilities.","At that point, he could attempt to practice Qi cultivation, condensing and elevating the level of Qi, ultimately forming a golden core.","The Golden Core stage was considered the first step of becoming a cultivator, at least enabling him to soar through the air, giving him some means of self-protection.","Moreover, only by reaching the Golden Core stage could one’s aura manifest externally.","This was why only those at the Golden Core stage could use magical treasures.","In other words, before reaching the Golden Core stage, he couldn’t use a sword.","But without a sword, it was a huge loss for Jian Wushuang.","It was a real loss of combat power.","Without a sword, he couldn’t even defeat mortals now.","However, the most important thing now was to clear the meridians.","With his breath sinking into the dantian, he began to use Qi to form a vortex to clear the meridians.","This process was very painful for a mortal body.","Jian Wushuang persisted for almost an entire night and finally cleared the first meridian.","With the first experience and the skillful use of Qi, he could clear the meridians faster in the future.","“It’s time to find Xiang Yang!”","Jian Wushuang stopped at this point.","He hadn’t forgotten Xiang Yang.","If one achieves wealth, they must not forget their friends!","Besides, Xiang Yang had great potential.","His relationship with Xing Luo was worth helping.","Now in this world, only the two of them knew each other’s backgrounds, so they couldn’t just give up.","Benefits should be shared, naturally.","He walked out of the room, asked a maid, and found Xiang Yang in the bamboo forest.","At that moment, Xiang Yang was leisurely drinking tea and reading letters from Binhai County.","These were delivered by One Ear.","Seeing Jian Wushuang approaching, he quickly waved and said, “You’re just in time, there are a few things to confirm with you. The Langshan County has given us a position that needs us to guard!”","“Let’s not talk about that now!” Jian Wushuang pressed down the letters and said solemnly, “I have something important to tell you.”","“What could be more important than this!” Xiang Yang was a little surprised.","“I have found the path of cultivation!”","Upon hearing this, Xiang Yang held his breath, more excited than he was.","This was something the two had dreamed of.","“Are you sure we can cultivate?”","“Watch this!” Jian Wushuang raised his hand, veins bulging on his arm, and with one hand, he crushed a stone inkstand.","This demonstrated the use of some Qi, also known as inner strength.","It was difficult for ordinary people to achieve this.","Xiang Yang knew it.","Seeing it with his own eyes, he was completely convinced and immediately asked about the method of cultivation.","Jian Wushuang picked up a brush and wrote down the cultivation method he remembered.","However, he only wrote the specifics up to the Golden Core stage.","He had to keep some secrets for himself.","To prevent the friendship from breaking halfway."]},{"number":6280,"title":"Chapter 6280: Mountain Spirit Land Spirit","paragraphs":["Chapter 6280: Mountain Spirit Land Spirit","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Xiang Yang obtained the cultivation technique, he immediately threw everything else to the back of his mind and began to cultivate alone in the bamboo forest.","The more he cultivated, the more addicted he became.","However, they had clearly lost their powers for less than a year. Perhaps this was the charm of cultivation.","Jian Wushuang went to deal with some tricky matters.","For example, the Coast Guard.","He had originally planned to fake join the Jiang Kingdom and really join the Prince of Liang.","But now, he could only make it real.","After making all the arrangements, Li Mi personally paid a visit.","It was about the Eldest Princess.","He had a pretty good understanding of this matter.","The Eldest Princess knew about Jiang Shang’s identity as a woman.","Moreover, Jiang Shang’s mother was not the Empress or the Consort Bin. She was just an ordinary woman that the Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom had met outside.","But in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, it was not a big deal.","The former emperor of the Jiang Kingdom had no other children except for his daughter, Jiang Shang.","There was no consort, only an empress on the surface, and it was still a decoration.","That was why the throne had fallen into Jiang Shang’s hands.","If Jiang Shang wasn’t a woman, it would be fine. However, she was a woman and was the emperor. Naturally, the Eldest Princess would be jealous.","This explained everything.","The only thing he couldn’t figure out was that the Jiang Kingdom was in trouble both internally and externally. How could they still have the mood to fight among themselves?","Li Mi, an outsider, was even more involved and wanted to kill the Eldest Princess.","Jian Wushuang was even more confused.","Li Mi had come today for the Eldest Princess.","He had already laid his cards on the table with Jiang Shang, and the other party still wanted him to help her kill the Eldest Princess.","Then there must be some kind of secret, but he didn’t say it before.","Now, he had dragged Li Mi over to discuss with him.","Inside the secret chamber.","The two sat opposite each other.","“His Majesty has already told me about your situation. This way, it saves me the trouble of explaining. Let me be direct. The Eldest Princess is not an ordinary person. Her threat is greater than you think!” Li Mi calmly took a sip of tea and told the truth.","Jian Wushuang was prepared but he wasn’t too surprised. In the dark room, he couldn’t see Li Mi’s face clearly. He followed the voice and asked,” To be honest, Jiang Shang is only a few days away from becoming the king of the fallen country. Even if the Eldest Princess is a threat, could it be that the threat is greater than that of Little Liang King?”","“Much better. Little Liang King’s strength is actually not as good as His Majesty’s, but the Eldest Princess is different. Or rather, she’s not the Eldest Princess at all. Instead, she’s a mountain spirit who killed the original Eldest Princess and took over her appearance. She came to the capital to cause trouble. Even if the Jiang Kingdom is going to perish, we have to kill this scourge. Otherwise, she will attack His Majesty!” Li Mi’s voice was a little vicious.","Mountain spirits and land spirits were actually spiritual creatures.","To put it simply, they were similar to demons and ghosts.","If this world could cultivate, it was naturally not just the human race who could cultivate.","He wasn’t too surprised to hear that the other party was a mountain spirit land spirit.","“I can agree, but you have to tell me the other party’s strength. I haven’t recovered yet, so I’m afraid that dealing with this mountain spirit land spirit...” Jian Wushuang had some misgivings.","He must have just opened one of his meridians. If he fought with his bare hands, he would not have an advantage even if he fought with Li Mi.","The other party probably felt that his sword technique was divine and had great divine powers.","If that was the case, then he was overestimating him.","In the past, he could even exterminate a mountain god or an earth demon with a single breath, let alone a mountain spirit or an earth spirit.","But now, he more or less didn’t have that confidence.","Li Mi could also tell that he was worried, so he took the initiative to explain.” Don’t worry, you won’t go alone. I’ve prepared a group of killers. They will cooperate with you. The Princess Royal’s actual strength should be on par with His Majesty. If she was very strong, she wouldn’t have endured until now!”","“When are we going to do it?” Jian Wushuang knew that he couldn’t avoid this matter and could only face it.","“Ten days later!”","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. Ten days was enough for him to improve his strength.","To be on the safe side, he asked Li Mi to find a sword that he could use.","The previous move was still fine against mortals, but it was a little lacking against mountain spirits and land spirits.","Li Mi naturally agreed.","He sent the other party away.","Jian Wushuang began to open his Meridians in seclusion.","He did not have much time left.","The battle situation in Langshan County was also very tragic.","The final battle could start at any time.","He was still considering whether he should help.","Three days later, Li Mi sent someone to deliver a top-notch mortal divine sword.","It was extremely sharp and could cut through steel.","Jian Wushuang was quite satisfied with it.","He didn’t dare to waste any more time.","The further one’s meridians progressed, the harder it was to open them up.","However, he was different. The later it was, the easier it was to clear it.","The first one took him a day.","The second one only took him six hours.","It was shortened by one-third.","Towards the end, he opened one meridian every two hours.","In less than ten days, he had opened up all the meridians in his body.","Inner Qi gathered in his body and began to condense into a Treasure Pill.","However, it had yet to take shape.","Just by relying on pure cultivation, his speed had also slowed down.","Cultivation was inseparable from natural treasures.","It was also inseparable from the guidance of a famous teacher.","Jian Wushuang didn’t lack the guidance of a master teacher, but he couldn’t do without treasures.","No matter who it was, they were no exception.","“Xiantian Qi Cultivation!”","Jian Wushuang held the long sword in his hand and waved it again and again, trying to find some resonance from the aura circulation.","Ten slashes in one breath!","The only thing missing from a flawless sword technique was strength.","In the remaining two days, he mastered the sword technique.","The ten-day agreement had arrived.","However, the time set was to take action at night.","At noon, he went to the bamboo forest and told Xiang Yang about it.","After hearing the whole story, Xiang Yang is somewhat dissatisfied.","“Brother Wushuang, what are we here for?”","” The cultivation method!” Jian Wushuang replied leisurely.","“That’s right!” Xiang Yang slapped his thigh and said,” We have already obtained the cultivation method. Why are we still staying? Why are we still taking risks? Let’s just run!”","In his opinion, only a fool would stay.","At this moment, he could even abandon his wife and son.","In any case, he would not stay.","He even went to help the little Emperor kill the Eldest Princess.","Most importantly, this Eldest Princess was a mountain spirit.","He did not know the other party’s strength or background.","There would definitely be risks if they acted rashly.","Jian Wushuang listened quietly. He understood Xiang Yang’s thoughts.","From Xiang Yang’s point of view, they could kick Jiang Shang aside and run away together. They could go to the Great Tang or any of the Seven Southern Nations to cultivate in seclusion. When they reached a bottleneck, they could go out and find some sects to continue cultivating until they reached the peak of this world.","This was the path they had to take.","However, Jian Wushuang was different. He saw the Myriad Willows Divine Wood behind Jiang Shang and there was a high chance that Jiang Shang was the reincarnation of Jiang Shang.","It was fate that they had met each other. No matter what, they shouldn’t have left just like that. What if the exit had something to do with Jiang Shang?"]},{"number":6281,"title":"Chapter 6281: Preposterous","paragraphs":["Chapter 6281: Preposterous","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Otherwise, why would he encounter this situation out of nowhere?","There must be someone orchestrating this.","Perhaps it was the prophet he dreamed about.","However, Jian Wushuang couldn’t directly tell Xiang Yang, as saying it would be pointless.","At his peak, Xiang Yang was merely a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master. Although he was on the same level, there was a significant difference in their combat power and realm.","Jian Wushuang was at the peak of the nine-star Universe God.","He had visited the Realm King’s divine realm, met the Great Realm King, and was even connected to the Star Spirit.","In terms of knowledge and strength, they were on completely different levels.","They also had different perspectives on things.","Before entering this world, there were demons that rushed out.","They were all Universe Gods, and their strength was quite good.","These demon gods found it difficult to escape, which meant they had to re-cultivate to the level of Universe Gods. At the very least, they needed to be six-star Universe Gods to get out.","If that was the case, even Jian Wushuang lacked confidence.","In the outside world, he had the guidance of his teacher, Xuan Yi, various fortuitous encounters, and later the help of Qishen Temple, Realm King, and even the Star Spirit, which gave him the combat power of a Universe God.","But in this world, who would help him?","The Prophet?","That was an unknown factor.","The only thing that might be able to help him was Wanliu Divine Tree behind Jiang Shang.","Perhaps a Star Spirit was also in this place.","This was Jian Wushuang’s thought.","So, he wanted to take Jiang Shang with him, or rather, follow Jiang Shang, helping her become a super strong practitioner.","In the future, he could take her out.","For now, this was the best plan he could think of.","After thinking for a moment, he patted Xiang Yang on the shoulder and said, “Some things aren’t as simple as you think. We’ve lost more than just our strength; we’ve lost our aptitude. With our current aptitude, how far do you think we can go? On the other hand, Jiang Shang has good talent. Perhaps training her might be much faster than cultivating ourselves!”","“Is that really what you think?” Xiang Yang was somewhat incredulous.","Training a mortal.","It indeed sounded a bit absurd.","No!","It was very absurd.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said to Xiang Yang, “Really!”","Having received confirmation, Xiang Yang didn’t say anything more, just secretly sighed.","He felt that Jian Wushuang had lost confidence.","“Forget it, let’s not talk about this. How is your cultivation going? I have already reached the innate realm. This world’s cultivation system is indeed different from the outside world. Clearly, there is power in cultivation, yet it remains hidden within the body, and you have to condense some ridiculous golden core to let your aura leak out!” Xiang Yang couldn’t help but complain.","In the outside world, just relying on the power of bloodline could make one’s aura soar to the heavens.","This allowed one to skip the initial stages of cultivation.","Of course, things were different here.","They were now ordinary people.","“About the same as you, but just reaching the Golden Core stage would take about half a year of cultivation. We can’t waste that much time. Once the matter with the Jiang Kingdom is settled, we’ll head to the Tang Dynasty to seek natural treasures and quickly improve our realms!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fist.","He was no longer the chosen one, so he had to bring Jiang Shang along.","However, he also had to quell Jiang Shang’s attachment to the Jiang Kingdom.","This was quite troublesome.","With past lessons in mind, he didn’t dare to act rashly.","He could only go with the flow.","After a short chat, someone came to report from outside, saying that Li Mi had invited them.","“Let’s go, we’ll act tonight!”","Jian Wushuang got up and led Xiang Yang straight to the Li residence.","As they entered the gate, the two of them could feel a chilling aura.","In the backyard.","Three hundred death warriors had already assembled.","They were waiting for nightfall.","Li Mi invited the two into the house and introduced, “This is my son, Li Fu. He will accompany you on this mission!”","“Greetings to both of you!” Li Fu was thin and looked unwell, but his tone was polite.","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang both nodded in acknowledgment, exchanging greetings.","“Lord Li, openly assassinating the eldest princess like this, won’t it attract some people’s...” Jian Wushuang went straight to the point.","He still felt it was somewhat abrupt.","At the very least, there should be some pretext, like announcing that the eldest princess had colluded with enemies and betrayed the country; that would be more justifiable.","Charging into the eldest princess’s residence so recklessly seemed a bit hard to justify.","“The situation is urgent, there’s no time for that. A decisive battle could break out at any time in Wolf Mountain County. If we don’t clear the internal issues now, the Jiang Kingdom will truly be finished!” Li Mi was a bit sad.","He had deep feelings for the old emperor and was one of the entrusted ministers.","He couldn’t just watch the Jiang royal family fall to such a state.","Even if the Jiang Kingdom fell, he wanted to protect the last legitimate heir.","“Alright then!”","Jian Wushuang said no more, waiting with Li Mi for the night to fall.","An hour later.","The sky was completely dark.","Li Mi led them out of the room, his gaze sweeping over the three hundred neatly arranged death warriors in the courtyard, like an icy mountain. He shouted with a voice that had been suppressed in his chest for a long time.","“Start the operation!”","Swish!","The three hundred death warriors drew their swords in unison, led personally by Li Fu, and climbed over the wall.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang exchanged glances but said nothing, nodding to Li Mi before following.","The northwest gate of the imperial palace was wide open, with no guards in sight.","Li Fu led the three hundred death warriors, entering in single file.","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang followed behind, not rushing in immediately.","The two were the last to enter the palace.","But just as they entered, Jian Wushuang felt a cold wind blowing.","The wind carried a chill and a sharp killing intent.","Clang!","The clash of metal made Jian Wushuang frown. He immediately shouted to the death warriors rushing ahead, “Beware of ambush!”","But it was too late.","Arrows soared through the sky, humming as they descended upon them.","Jian Wushuang drew his sword to deflect them, while Xiang Yang pulled out a short sword, knocking the arrows aside.","But the death warriors weren’t so lucky.","Even though they were well-trained, such a large group was hard-pressed to fend off the arrows.","In an instant, most were killed or wounded.","As the second wave of arrows came, everyone scrambled for cover.","Jian Wushuang also pulled Xiang Yang behind a stone lion for shelter.","“What’s happening?” Xiang Yang was stunned.","Their plan was supposed to be secretive.","They had even informed the palace, with Jiang Shang’s approval.","How could there be an ambush?","Jian Wushuang didn’t know either and could only take things one step at a time.","After several waves of arrows, out of the three hundred, more than half were dead or injured and no longer able to fight.","At that moment, a squad of heavily armored infantry advanced along the city wall.","The leader, wielding a halberd and tugging the reins, shouted angrily:","“Li Fu, come out!”","Hiding behind a stone staircase, Li Fu stood up upon hearing this.","“Yu Wencheng, are you planning to betray us?” Li Fu glared fiercely at him.","He knew this man, the leader of the palace’s imperial guards, Yu Wencheng.","“Stop the sophistry! Leading troops to storm the palace, you’re the one committing treason!”"]},{"number":6282,"title":"Chapter 6282: Mountain Spirit","paragraphs":["Chapter 6282: Mountain Spirit","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Yu Wencheng threw down a bundle with a wave of his hand and scolded angrily, “Li Mi is dead, and today, you will die too!”","A head rolled out of the bundle; it was Li Mi, who had just parted ways with Jian Wushuang and his companions.","Now, however, they were separated by life and death.","Seeing his father’s head, Li Fu was instantly enraged.","“Yu Wencheng, you damned traitor, I will fight you to the death!”","Li Fu charged forward, breaking through the heavy encirclement.","The loyal guards behind him followed suit, charging into the fray without regard for their own safety.","However, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang did not follow.","Instead, they took a detour, seizing the opportunity to escape deeper into the palace.","As for Li Fu, he had already perished under the blades.","Yu Wencheng personally pursued Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang.","Clearly, word of this plan had leaked out. Although it seemed flawless, they had overlooked a crucial detail.","Visiting the palace at night, they only informed the imperial guards and never considered that there might be people loyal to the princess among them?","Jian Wushuang was somewhat regretful now. He shouldn’t have listened to Li Mi.","He should have gone alone to meet the princess.","Or openly fought against them.","That would have been better than sneaking around.","Now, they had instead become traitors.","To prove their innocence, they had to find Jiang Shang.","Fortunately, it was just a mundane palace, so Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang scaled two walls and entered the harem.","Along the way, they captured a young eunuch to inquire about Jiang Shang’s residence, and then made their way there.","Zhenqian Palace.","Two dark figures slipped past the guards and arrived at the main hall.","As soon as they entered, a presence came toward them.","“It’s me!” Jian Wushuang said coldly, pulling aside the screen.","Jiang Shang, dressed in a white robe, stood on the dragon bed.","There was no one else around.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, Jiang Shang asked in surprise, “Weren’t you supposed to go to the Eastern Palace with Li Fu today? Why are you here? Have you already dealt with that monster?”","“The Yu Wencheng from the palace guards has likely betrayed us. We must leave now, or it will be too late!” Jian Wushuang urged anxiously.","They had fallen into a trap.","The princess must have detected their plan in advance and was going to tear down the façade today.","If they didn’t leave now, they would be captured by the enemy.","“Impossible, Yu Wencheng is the prime minister’s son, how could he...” Jiang Shang shook his head in disbelief, trying to refute.","But a sudden demonic wind gave her no time for doubt.","A red silhouette swept in from outside the hall.","Her sleeves blotted out the sky, demonic aura pervasive.","“This is trouble!”","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang quickly retreated.","The mountain spirit had arrived.","“Tsk tsk, little girl, is this your technique?” The princess stepped in, dressed in red, her voice haunting.","As she entered the main hall, the doors behind her closed automatically.","Clearly, she wasn’t planning to let them go.","“So, you’re a flower demon!”","Seeing the mark on the opponent’s forehead, Xiang Yang mocked, “A flower demon like you, I wouldn’t even keep as a guard dog in the past, yet here you are acting all high and mighty!”","“Impudent!” The flower demon shouted angrily, sending a long sleeve flying toward Xiang Yang.","Jian Wushuang leaped over, slicing the long sleeve with his sword.","Beneath the sleeve was a root-like appendage, akin to grass or wood.","After being severed, dark red blood oozed out.","Holding his divine sword, Jian Wushuang said coldly, “You’re a flower demon, why not cultivate peacefully in the mountains? Why do you persist in haunting Jiang Country? Besides, Jiang Shang doesn’t have much inner energy for you to siphon. What are you thinking?”","He knew that she had practiced some demonic art, but a spirit of flora, even with demonic cultivation, shouldn’t be able to absorb human blood!","Of course, there were techniques that allowed it, but those required at least an immortal level of cultivation.","That was far beyond the reach of a demon who had only just transcended the mundane. If such a technique did exist, it would be extremely unlucky for them.","As expected, after hearing his question, the flower demon hesitated and said in surprise, “You two little ones in the innate stage actually know quite a bit, but I don’t have time to explain to you two ants!”","“Heh, aren’t you also in the innate stage, without even forming a golden core, yet you’re pretending to be a master?” Jian Wushuang sneered.","The Flower Demon had not yet condensed a Golden Core and was still in the Innate Stage.","If she and Xiang Yang were in the early Innate Stage, then the opponent was at the peak of the Innate Stage.","Of course, aside from the two of them, there was also Jiang Shang.","According to Jian Wushuang’s judgment, Jiang Shang also possessed the strength of the peak Innate Stage.","Three against one, the advantage was on their side.","Jiang Shang stepped down from the dragon bed and boldly removed her long robe, leaving only her inner garments, revealing her fragrant shoulders.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but blush and awkwardly said, “Jiang Shang, what are you doing?”","“What you’re interested in should be this!”","Jiang Shang didn’t answer Jian Wushuang but instead looked at the Flower Demon.","She revealed the Wanliu totem on her back.","The originally unremarkable totem suddenly burst into a bright light due to the Flower Demon’s presence.","The Flower Demon glanced at it and instantly her eyes turned pitch black, blinding her.","“Ah!”","Her painful wails echoed throughout the entire palace.","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were both stunned.","With just one glance, the Flower Demon had been reduced to this state.","Jiang Shang was also somewhat surprised. She merely wanted to know why the other party was interested in the totem on her back.","The totem depicted a willow tree, considered a spirit of plants, which was why she asked.","But she didn’t expect it would blind the Flower Demon’s eyes.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t anticipated that the Wanliu Divine Wood totem would have such an effect. Xiang Yang, however, felt that the moment the bright light burst out, it contained the aura of Xingluo.","After a moment of shock, Jian Wushuang reacted quickly, immediately launching a sword attack on the Flower Demon.","“Don’t just stand there. Strike while she’s down!”","“I’ll help you!” Xiang Yang also drew his sword and charged.","The two of them began hacking at the Flower Demon’s spreading vines.","Blood splattered everywhere.","Jiang Shang formed a hand seal, utilizing a unique technique that surrounded her with a green aura.","She was in the Innate Stage, unable to let her aura leak out, yet she managed to encircle herself with it.","She leapt forward, striking the Flower Demon on the chest with a palm.","Delivering the fatal blow.","The Flower Demon was still in the Innate Stage, not yet possessing mental power strong enough to sense opponents without her eyes.","This allowed the three of them to easily kill the Flower Demon.","They had expected a fierce battle, but were surprised by how effortlessly they resolved the situation.","At this moment, the sound of hurried footsteps came from outside.","Then, a voice was heard.","“Yu Wencheng, reporting to capture the assassins. I request His Majesty to open the door!”","Inside the hall, Xiang Yang cracked his neck, ready to open the door and kill his way out, but Jian Wushuang stopped him.","Killing their way out would be easy.","But there was no need for that.","Jiang Shang was still the Emperor of the Jiang Kingdom.","No need to throw caution to the wind.","“Let him in first!” Jiang Shang sat on the dragon throne, her tone somber.","Jian Wushuang gestured for Xiang Yang to open the door.","Click!","The hall doors opened.","Yu Wencheng, wielding a halberd, charged in with the imperial guards.","He paid no attention to Xiang Yang or Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":6283,"title":"Chapter 6283: Heading to the Great Tang","paragraphs":["Chapter 6283: Heading to the Great Tang","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He looked at Jiang Shang.","The corpse of the long princess was still on the ground.","He didn’t spare it a glance.","At this moment, Yu Wencheng’s expression was very complicated. He stared at Jiang Shang for a long time before speaking:","“Your Majesty!”","“The assassin you mentioned, could it be me?” Jiang Shang looked at Yu Wencheng, who was kneeling on one knee. She knew the great situation of the Jiang Kingdom had long vanished.","It was evident from today’s plan.","Even the prime minister had betrayed her.","It should be known that it was the prime minister who personally appointed the defense against the invading army of Yue in Langshan County.","Now even her close confidant, “Li Mi,” was dead.","She had truly become a solitary ruler.","This Jiang Kingdom had nothing left to hold onto.","Yu Wencheng, kneeling on the ground, suddenly raised his head and glanced at Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang.","“It must be my poor eyesight!”","His eyesight failed him, but Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang’s eyes were fine.","Outside the hall, thousands of elite imperial guards had gathered. With just one order, under the pretense of capturing an assassin, they could flatten this hall.","This was outright rebellion.","Originally, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were prepared to fight their way out, but after hearing this, they paused.","Jiang Shang did the same.","She had been an emperor for several years, and it was impossible for her to be completely ignorant.","She had previously glimpsed the prime minister’s wolfish ambition but couldn’t suppress it.","Initially, Li Mi helped her, but now Li Mi was dead, and the prime minister had taken complete control, directly forcing the palace.","Yet, at this moment, Yu Wencheng unexpectedly held back.","He actually turned and walked away.","Jiang Shang was somewhat surprised but said nothing.","At the threshold, Yu Wencheng paused again, speaking indifferently, “The wind is strong tonight; Your Majesty should be careful!”","With that, he walked out of the hall.","The imperial guards withdrew as well.","Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang finally breathed a sigh of relief.","“Let’s go!”","Jiang Shang sat wearily on the dragon throne, ultimately unable to protect the great enterprise of the Jiang Kingdom.","Such a decisive departure pleased Jian Wushuang.","If they stayed in Jiang Kingdom, it would not be conducive to their cultivation.","Jiang Shang leaving voluntarily was undoubtedly for the best.","“Wait a moment!” Jian Wushuang licked his lips and walked toward the transformed bloodied flower demon.","Beneath the opponent’s red clothes was a dark green token.","A string of ancient characters was inscribed on it, and upon seeing the words, Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed.","At this time, Xiang Yang leaned in and asked, “What’s wrong?”","“Nothing, just an ancient token. We should go first!” Jian Wushuang pocketed the token, looked up at Jiang Shang, and asked, “Where are we going?”","“The Eastern Land, Great Tang!” Jiang Shang’s eyes were filled with longing.","Jian Wushuang had once told her that the place where the Wanliu Totem was discovered was in the East Sea.","Before her mother left, she also mentioned the Eastern Land.","She had been thinking about when to visit the Eastern Land of Great Tang.","Whether for her own cultivation or to search for her mother.","She had to go.","Hearing the destination, Jian Wushuang was delighted, nodding quickly, “Alright, I’ll go prepare!”","To head to Great Tang, they naturally needed to travel by ship.","They couldn’t fly through the air yet.","Jiang Shang raised her hand, resolutely saying, “No need to prepare; let’s go together!”","She had made up her mind to abandon the Jiang Kingdom.","Or rather, the Jiang Kingdom had abandoned her.","At the same time, within the palace.","The Prime Minister, Yu Wen Du, personally reported that the army in the city had already cleansed all dissenters and had come to the palace to meet with him.","“Cheng’er, have you captured the young emperor?”","Yu Wencheng knelt on one knee and said without reservation, “I am a minister of His Majesty, how could I have treasonous intentions?”","“Eh?” Yu Wen Du was immediately furious upon hearing these words and said, “Do you know what you are saying?”","He knew that ever since he discovered Jiang Shang was a woman, his son had been infatuated with her.","He never expected this infatuation to hinder his grand plan.","After snorting coldly in frustration, Yu Wen Du personally led the soldiers to the harem.","However, by this time, Jiang Shang and Jian Wushuang had already left the royal city.","They headed eastward.","Following the canal, they traveled all the way to Shajiakou.","After several days of traveling, they arrived at Shajiakou, where the treasure ship to the sea was ready.","Standing at the bow, Jian Wushuang did not disembark to bid farewell.","He only wrote two letters, which he handed over to Wang Lun and Iron-faced Liangchen.","In these few days, the entire Jiang Kingdom had descended into chaos.","The royal city experienced a sudden shift overnight.","Prime Minister Yu Wen Du had someone impersonate Jiang Shang, then remotely controlled the entire court.","Unfortunately, the Wolf Mountain County was no longer able to hold.","Little Liang Wang had defeated the army of Wolf Mountain County.","Now, only the Coastal Guards remained on the right flank, but they were not moving.","This was because they had received news from Jian Wushuang.","There was no need to resist any longer.","Although he was leaving, he would not harm those people.","It would be best if they could find a good future, but even if not, retreating to Coastal County and relying on the canal would not make life too difficult.","After taking care of these matters.","Jian Wushuang personally steered the treasure ship with Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang, heading out to sea.","Their steps had already surpassed the mundane world behind them.","They had one foot in the world of cultivation.","Months later.","On the deep blue sea, a treasure ship ten zhang high was sailing slowly.","Originally, there were only three people on the treasure ship, but now there were over a hundred crew members.","They worked in an orderly manner, taking advantage of the good weather to clean the deck.","Some were cooking, fishing, and sailing below the deck.","However, Jian Wushuang and the other two hadn’t been on the deck for a month.","At this moment, on the deck, a middle-aged man with one ear was directing a few new crew members to clean the deck.","“Move faster! Don’t think I saved you out of the goodness of my heart. Let me tell you, until the ship docks, your lives are mine. Do what I tell you, and don’t argue with me!”","This man was One Ear. He wore a cool vest, sat on a high platform on the deck, leisurely sipping tea, watching the crew work below.","Originally, before going to sea, Jian Wushuang had not intended to take One Ear along.","However, this guy insisted on coming along.","He thought Jian Wushuang was fleeing, but that was not the case.","After a month at sea, he realized the ship barely had enough food, and there were no treasures. Only then did he realize he had followed the wrong person.","And Jian Wushuang and the other two had gone into seclusion.","Being a mortal, he still needed to eat.","He also had to steer the ship.","After eating fish for a month, he finally saw a small island, where he went to procure fresh water and food, and recruited a group of crew members, stabilizing the situation.","Later, he rescued a group of shipwrecked sailors at sea, and life gradually improved.","He even started to enjoy this lifestyle.","Just as he was feeling comfortable, a sailor on the deck suddenly dropped his rag, pointed at the sea, and said, “Look! We’ve reached the Great Tang!”","Splash!","One Ear put down his teacup and stood up.","In the distance across the sea, a continuous coastline had already appeared in front of them.","There lay the Great Tang.","One Ear was momentarily dazed, then immediately rushed from the deck to the cabin.","Earlier, Jian Wushuang had instructed him to remind the three of them as soon as they reached the Great Tang.","Bursting into the cabin, One Ear arrived at the bottommost level with three hidden rooms and banged on the door.","“Masters, we’ve reached the Great Tang!”"]},{"number":6284,"title":"Chapter 6284: Shanhai County","paragraphs":["Chapter 6284: Shanhai County","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Great Tang, the most notable place in the North Sea.","This was the famous “Shanhai County” of the Great Tang.","As the name suggests, it had both mountains and sea.","The county city lay within the mountains, while the sea was beyond them.","As a result, most of the coastline was deserted.","There were only a few small docks scattered around.","These docks were built by nearby fishing villages.","However, one of these docks had recently become bustling due to the turmoil in the Southern Seven Nations.","It even attracted many nobles from within the county city.","This was because the merchant ships sailing from the Southern Seven Nations carried large quantities of gold, silver, and jewels. However, transporting these treasures was always troublesome, and arriving in a foreign land like the Great Tang could invite even more trouble.","Thus, as soon as the merchant ships docked, they would sell off the treasures that were inconvenient to carry at low prices to the nobles of the Great Tang, who would ensure their safety and escort the people from the ships to the county city.","This was essentially a form of under-the-table transaction.","The place for these transactions, a place for bargains, was right beside the dock.","Countless treasures were moved from the merchant ships, and most were sold cheaply. Aside from the readily usable gold and silver, the rest were sold to the county city nobles, with even the ships themselves being sold.","Some merchants even sold their maidservants to these nobles.","After all, with the silver notes from the Great Tang, they could still buy some local maidservants.","Typically, these transactions were conducted by the frivolous young nobles.","To the south of the dock was a military town, and after transactions, soldiers would personally escort these self-proclaimed envoys from the fallen Southern Nations.","Such a seamless operation was common, but this kind of incredibly profitable trade was rare.","As soon as a merchant ship docked, a group of people would immediately approach to discuss business.","At this moment, beside the dock, a group of workers was busy, unloading various boxes from a merchant ship.","The boxes naturally contained treasures that were inconvenient to carry.","Such as paintings, antiques, artifacts, tea leaves, and silk.","In fact, the Great Tang dynasty didn’t lack these things; it was all about getting a bargain.","They bought these items only to resell them quickly.","“Young lady, please make way!”","Amidst the bustling crowd stood a young woman dressed in rough clothing.","She didn’t mind the smell of sweat from the laborers, standing on the dock’s deck, her eyes gazing out at the calm sea, as if waiting for someone.","When others spoke to her, she didn’t reply but silently stepped aside.","Her presence was quite abrupt in the crowd.","Yet no one found it strange because she had been at this dock for three years, almost every day standing on the deck, her eyes always fixed on the sea.","Therefore, everyone nearby recognized her.","As people passed by, they would joke:","“Ah Zi, are you still waiting for that young man of yours? I advise you to stop waiting. He’s probably found another girl in Tai’an City. You should just go home!”","“Come on, what do you know? This is what we call unrequited love!”","The group of porters teased her one after another.","The young woman named Ah Zi didn’t mind at all and didn’t even bother to argue.","But deep down, she was convinced that he would definitely come back.","And he would marry her!","So she didn’t care what others said.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have waited for three years.","To others, she seemed foolish.","But no one knew how kind he was to her back then.","So she was willing to wait!","Even if it meant waiting until the seas dried up and the rocks crumbled!","Buzz!","At that moment, a loud horn sounded from the sea.","It was from a merchant ship about to dock.","The sound signaled that it was approaching the pier.","After the horn, the pier naturally had to respond.","A worker on the lookout tower shouted down, “We have a big one coming in, it’s a treasure ship from the Southern Seven Kingdoms, at least seventy zhang long. My heavens, there must be someone important on board!”","This shout immediately attracted the attention of the dignitaries and aristocrats from the city of Shanhai County.","They craned their necks to look toward the sea and saw the enormous treasure ship.","Each of them was excitedly rubbing their hands, ready to negotiate a big deal once the ship docked.","This was all money to them!","Before long, the ship docked, but the deck of the treasure ship was too high, so they had to lower a ladder.","The crowd below eagerly awaited.","But what came down was a ragged old man, who looked worse than a beggar on the street.","The boatman was also taken aback when he came down. He was from the Southern Seven Kingdoms and had never been to the Tang Dynasty. He thought the Tang people were very hospitable, which made him feel a bit embarrassed. He looked up and shouted to the ship, “Helmsman, come down, these people mean no harm!”","“I can see that!”","A person on the deck looked down, it was One Ear, who was following Jian Wushuang.","He glanced at the people on the pier and then turned back to Jian Wushuang with a fawning smile, “Master, why don’t we disembark here? These people seem quite hospitable and mean no harm!”","“Let’s go down and take a look!”","Jian Wushuang gestured for One Ear to lead the way down first.","Then he looked at Xiang Yang and Jiang Shang behind him.","The three of them had been in seclusion.","Now they had all reached the level of Great Completion in the Innate Realm.","Especially Jiang Shang, who was just a hair’s breadth away from forming his Golden Core.","This was all due to his careful guidance.","In his previous life, she was his master Hui Qing, but this time it was Jian Wushuang’s turn to teach her.","If Jiang Shang regained his memories and became Jiang Shang, who knows what he would think.","After One Ear went down, he conversed with some locals and then returned to the deck to report:","“Master, I’ve found out that this is Shanhai County of the Tang Dynasty, and it’s quite far from Tai’an City!”","Jian Wushuang said calmly, “Then let’s rest here for a few days before moving on.”","Before coming here, he had already familiarized himself with the map of the Tang Dynasty.","Shanhai County was quite far from Tai’an City, at least ten thousand miles away.","Traveling by land would take more than a month and the journey would be exhausting, affecting their cultivation.","Traveling by sea was much more convenient; they only needed to switch to a smaller merchant ship and sail along the canal inland.","So Jian Wushuang decided to stay locally for a few days to gather information about the Tang Dynasty.","He knew very little about this powerful dynasty.","All he knew was that there were thirty-six counties in the north and south.","It was culturally prosperous.","Neighboring mundane kingdoms highly revered the Tang Dynasty.","He knew nothing more, especially regarding matters concerning cultivators.","Once everyone disembarked, the merchants who had come to do business left disappointed after realizing there were no treasures on the ship.","Some particularly wanton young nobles, however, were interested in buying the treasure ship.","Such a massive treasure ship was rare even in the Tang Dynasty.","Although Shanhai County was by the sea, it was remote, and no one had the capability to build such a large treasure ship. Now, seeing this slightly damaged treasure ship, they all wanted to buy it from Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was indeed considering selling it but did not rush to do so. He had One Ear send the people away and then headed toward the small town by the pier.","There were crew members on board to keep watch, so there was nothing to worry about."]},{"number":6285,"title":"Chapter 6285: I’ll Go ahead and Scout the Way","paragraphs":["Chapter 6285: I’ll Go ahead and Scout the Way","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang had only taken a few steps when he suddenly frowned.","He turned to look at the lady in linen clothes on the deck. With just a glance, his pupils constricted slightly.","A strange aura seemed to have appeared on the girl.","However, it disappeared in an instant.","That aura was not familiar, but it was related to his Psyche Power.","Ever since he embarked on the path of cultivation, his Psyche Power had expanded greatly.","Now, he could already detect everything within a five-kilometer radius, especially his sensitivity to aura.","Just now, he felt a sense of oppression from that girl.","It was a wonderful feeling.","Many people had given him this kind of pressure in the past, so it was both familiar and unfamiliar.","What was familiar was the feeling, but what was unfamiliar was the aura.","However, after he took a look at the other party’s appearance and used his Thought power to investigate, the aura disappeared again.","This was very strange.","Seeing that he stood rooted to the spot, one ear followed his gaze and looked at the lady in hemp clothes, its eyes darting around.","“What’s wrong?” Jiang Shang was curious.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said,” Nothing. I haven’t been on land for a long time. I’m not used to it. Let’s find a place to stay first!”","“Alright, I’ll go ahead and scout the way!” One Ear said as he ran towards the town.","When Jian Wushuang and the others arrived at the town, One Ear had already arranged the rooms.","Jian Wushuang was very satisfied.","When she entered the room, she nodded at him meaningfully.","This confirmed One Ear’s guess.","After settling Jian Wushuang down, he returned to the dock with his subordinates.","Jian Wushuang went into the room to wash up.","Thus, he summoned Xiang Yang over to chat about his experiences in cultivation.","He had been in seclusion for more than a month.","Now, they had all condensed their aura into their dantians. It was urgent to form their Golden Cores.","However, in order to form a Golden Core, apart from cultivating in seclusion, he also needed the assistance of treasures.","Law, wealth, and land were indispensable.","They already had the cultivation method. They could snatch wealth, but they didn’t need a cultivation partner for the time being. Land was crucial.","Even if they had experience in cultivation, they couldn’t block the dense aura.","Xiang Yang thought for a moment and said,” The Thunder Temple of the Tang Empire is a treasure land. It’s said that Shangxian often appear. I guess they are Golden Core Stage self-cultivators. As for this auxiliary treasure, we have to go to the World’s First Tower of the Tang Empire to find out!”","World’s First Pavilion.","It was not a restaurant, but an organization that gathered information from all over the world.","Even Shangxian frequented this place.","Thus, many mortals who dreamed of entering the world of cultivation yearned for the Great Tang, the Paramount World, and the Celestial Sect.","It was the same for Jian Wushuang and the others.","“I once heard my mother say that outside Great Peace City in the Great Tang, there is a Baoguang Temple that worships a True Immortal!”","Jiang Shang’s words stunned Jian Wushuang.","He really didn’t know about this. He gave Xiang Yang a look, but Xiang Yang didn’t say anything either. Clearly, he didn’t know either.","Jian Wushuang coughed dryly and said indifferently,” There is such a thing. As you know, there are many Exalted Immortals in the Tang Empire. Some of them are willing to guard the human world, such as the monk in Thunder Sound Temple!”","“Senior, do you know that True Immortal?” When Jiang Shang heard this, his interest was piqued.","Jian Wushuang, who had also come to the Tang Empire for the first time, could only vaguely say that he had heard of the so-called Genuine Immortals a few times.","After chatting with the two of them for a while, the three of them returned to their rooms.","Jian Wushuang began to think about their respective benefits.","Now, he had to follow Jiang Shang’s lead and assist him to become a super expert.","And he had the potential.","He only needed his guidance.","The first step was to enter the cultivation world.","At the moment, they were at most itinerant cultivators and could not achieve anything.","Heading to Great Peace City became the most important matter.","Jian Wushuang was thinking about the Great Tang and wanted to find an ear to ask about the situation in Great Peace City so that he wouldn’t have to travel in a bad light.","However, before he could find an ear, the other party covered his eyes and came to him.","“This is...What happened?” Jian Wushuang stared at One Ear in surprise.","His head was swollen like a pig’s.","If Jian Wushuang didn’t have Psyche Power to detect his aura, he wouldn’t have recognized him.","One Ear covered his left eye and said in grievance,” You don’t know. I just returned to the dock and saw a few rich playboys bullying a weak woman. I went up to stop them. Who knew that they would punch and kick me? I almost killed them!”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and looked at One Ear thoughtfully.","What kind of person was One-Ear? How could he do such a stupid thing? He even got beaten up for nothing.","There were definitely some things that couldn’t be said.","“Is it the girl who was at the dock earlier?” he asked directly.","“Uh... Yes, yes!” One Ear nodded repeatedly.","Jian Wushuang sighed and said,” Well, you don’t have to worry about this matter anymore. Find a doctor to bandage your wound. We won’t stay here for a few days!”","After sending one ear away, he closed the door and walked to the windowsill, looking at the dock.","Although he was a few thousand feet away, after reaching the Connate Realm, his eyes and ears were completely different. He could even see things thousands of feet away clearly.","“There is indeed a problem!” Jian Wushuang looked at it.","They weren’t looking at bullies!","It was the fluctuating aura.","That aura was hidden on the woman’s body.","Or rather, it was the aura that he had been contaminated with.","It did not belong to that woman.","The reason why he had stopped earlier was because he was a little suspicious, but he was also worried that the other party was related to the local self-cultivators. It was better to avoid trouble.","He didn’t have any intention of attacking the other party.","But now, he saw a group of mortal playboys bullying this woman at will. There was probably no cultivator behind her. She was just a lucky mortal woman.","Jian Wushuang was lucky to have met such a benefactor.","He immediately left the room and called out to One Ear, who hadn’t gone far.","“Wait a moment, call your men and follow me to meet those rich playboys!”","Jian Wushuang’s words irritated one ear and he immediately agreed. He called a few experts and prepared to get back at them.","Jiang Shang did not know about this, but the busybody Xiang Yang also came over.","The group of people went straight to the dock.","Jian Wushuang had planned to go alone, but now that the woman was being pestered, it would be suspicious if he went alone and beat away so many people.","It was better to take the opportunity to find trouble with the other party and save an ignorant girl. At that time, even if the other party had a cultivator behind him, he would not be able to find any fault.","Arriving at the dock, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and One Ear stood up immediately. But before he could say anything, he heard One Ear laugh."]},{"number":6286,"title":"Chapter 6286: A Letter","paragraphs":["Chapter 6286: A Letter","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Aiyo, you one-eared guy, do you really not understand words? I told you to scram, did you get lost?”","The young master at the head of the group stepped forward, intending to grab One Ear’s ear.","This time, there were many of them, but One Ear was not about to be caught without a fight. He lifted his foot and kicked out, sending the young master sprawling to the ground.","“Earlier, it was just because you had more people. Did you really think you could bully me?” One Ear cursed as he kicked the young master a couple more times.","The other young masters wanted to intervene but were stopped by several boatmen.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang had more people, the young master who had been kicked was smart enough to get up, dust off his clothes, and said arrogantly, “Fine, you have more people now. Just you wait!”","“Wait we will. Whoever doesn’t come is a grandson!” One Ear retorted, not backing down.","Who were they?","They were the ones who had played a significant role in the rebellion against the Jiang Kingdom. How could they be bullied by a local ruffian?","Unfortunately, they hadn’t considered that even a powerful dragon can’t suppress a local snake.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have forgotten this saying and didn’t take the threat seriously, which led to a major mistake later on.","They drove away that group of spoiled young masters.","The linen-clad young lady who had been harassed quickly bowed to thank Jian Wushuang and the others.","“It was nothing, no need to be so polite,” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and then asked, “Miss, are you a local?”","“Yes, my family lives in the fishing village to the east,” the linen-clad girl replied softly with her head down.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang curiously asked, “Then you must be waiting for your family’s fishing boat. Do you know if there are any routes nearby that lead to Tai’an City?”","After asking, he regretted it a bit. No matter how he looked at it, the other person was a weak girl who had never seen the world. How would she know about navigation routes?","To his surprise, she did know.","Especially when she heard they were going to Tai’an City, her eyes were filled with longing.","It was the same kind of look people from Jiang Kingdom had when they longed for the Tang Empire.","“You are going to Tai’an City? If you go by sea, you need to bypass Dongshan Island and enter the inland canal, which will take about a month,” the linen-clad girl explained the route to Tai’an City skillfully, as if she had calculated it countless times in her mind.","Jian Wushuang paused for a moment and then said truthfully, “Thank you for telling us. One Ear, give this young lady some silver as a token of appreciation.”","Seeing this, One Ear took out two silver ingots from his pocket, totaling twenty taels, which was a huge sum for ordinary fishermen.","However, the linen-clad girl repeatedly declined, saying, “No, no, I don’t want the money. I just want to ask you benefactors to inquire about someone for me when you reach Tai’an City. If you find him, just give him a message.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, thinking that she was indeed not simple.","Perhaps that person was related to the aura she carried, so he agreed immediately.","“No problem, just tell me his address and name.”","The linen-clad girl hesitated and said, “I don’t know where he lives; I only know his name. But he should be very famous, and the people of Tai’an City might all know him.”","This amused Xiang Yang, who said with a smile:","“Miss, Tai’an City has a population of over ten million. Are you sure the person you mentioned is so famous that the entire city would know him? Is he the Emperor of Tang?”","Everyone burst into laughter upon hearing those words.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but glare at them.","This finally silenced them.","“Ten million people?” The woman in a hemp robe seemed a bit dazed.","Perhaps she didn’t even know how many ten million was or what it represented.","But she still argued, “Even if not everyone, at least half the people should know him!”","“What’s his name?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were burning with curiosity.","“Chen Yuan!”","“His name is Chen Yuan, and he’s a scholar!”","“If you ever encounter him, please help me deliver this letter to him!”","After speaking, the woman in the hemp robe took out a letter wrapped in hemp oil paper from her sleeve.","Jian Wushuang reached out to take it. As soon as he touched it, he saw the contents of the envelope, and for a moment, he was at a loss for words, feeling both curious and surprised.","“Alright, once I reach Tai’an City, I will definitely deliver the letter for you!”","“Thank you so much!” The woman in the hemp robe bowed deeply to everyone.","After bidding farewell to the group, she returned to the ship’s deck, gazing alone at the calm sea.","By then, everything on the merchant ship had been unloaded, and the dock was empty.","The setting sun fell, and the sea looked like a sea of fire.","A solitary figure stood amidst it, looking rather desolate.","Jian Wushuang only took one glance before leading his people back to the inn.","Returning to the inn, he didn’t disturb Jiang Shang or inform Xiang Yang. Instead, he quietly left the inn by the window under the cover of night.","In the darkness, Jian Wushuang moved like a ghost. Although he couldn’t yet walk on air, he covered three feet with each step, moving with great speed.","“Still hasn’t gone back?”","He was surprised to see that the figure was still standing at the dock.","From when they left until now, two hours had passed.","Could it be a deep infatuation?","“Forget it, I’ll go take a look myself!”","Jian Wushuang initially intended to follow the woman in the hemp robe and visit her fishing village.","Perhaps he could find the source of the aura.","The fishing village was not far from the dock, only three to five miles away, and Jian Wushuang reached it in less than the time it takes to burn a stick of incense.","The village was quiet at night, with few lights.","It was very silent.","Even the wild dogs in the village made no sound.","Walking down the silent street, Jian Wushuang expanded his mental power, carefully searching every corner nearby.","When he reached a small courtyard, he stopped.","In this courtyard was the aura of the woman in the hemp robe.","This must have been her residence.","But there was no one there at the moment.","The courtyard gate was merely a fence made of several wooden boards. He jumped into the yard.","Although the courtyard was rather modest, it was very clean.","“The aura is in the well?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed as he walked toward the well in the courtyard. As he approached, the aura became faintly visible, similar to the aura on the woman in the hemp robe.","He looked down the well, which seemed no different from an ordinary well, dark and unclear.","But the aura flickered, sometimes strong, sometimes weak.","Just like the ripples on the water’s surface.","“It seems I need to go down and take a look!”","Since no one was in the courtyard, and the woman in the hemp robe probably wouldn’t return for a while, even if she did, he could easily avoid her.","Moreover, she was just an ordinary person, posing no threat to him.","He descended into the well.","Supporting himself with his feet, he descended step by step.","The well opening was narrow, but it widened as he went down.","Jian Wushuang could no longer support himself with his legs and had to cling to the stone wall, using his fingers to grip the crevices and cautiously explore downward."]},{"number":6287,"title":"Chapter 6287: Left Protector?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6287: Left Protector?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was with great difficulty that he reached the water’s surface, only for that aura to suddenly disappear again.","Feeling somewhat unwilling to give up, he immediately jumped back into the water.","Only then did he realize that the space below the surface was much larger, more like an underground lake, with the wellhead above merely serving as a cover.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and then dove directly into the water.","Although it was pitch black underwater, he could still observe everything around him with his Thought power.","The water was very clear, and as he continued to dive deeper, he could feel the surrounding silence, with not even the sound of flowing water.","Yet, such clear water didn’t seem like stagnant water.","Moreover, after he reached the bottom, he no longer sensed that aura.","“Could it be that the aura is a living creature?”","That was very likely.","It might be some kind of mountain spirit or earth essence.","Being close to the sea, there were indeed many spiritual creatures in the ocean.","However, theoretically, being so near the mundane world, these spiritual creatures rarely came ashore.","Just as he was puzzled, the aura suddenly appeared again.","Before Jian Wushuang could feel happy, he sensed a tremor in the water, and a massive stone detached from the rock wall, hurtling toward his position.","“Sure enough, it’s a living creature!”","Jian Wushuang kicked off with his foot, swiftly moving away to dodge the falling boulder.","The water became turbid in an instant, but Jian Wushuang didn’t rely on his eyes; instead, he locked onto the opponent using his Thought power.","A scene immediately appeared in his mind.","It was a gigantic jellyfish. Every time it contracted its body, the aura would fluctuate between strong and weak.","This was why he could sometimes sense it and sometimes not.","The problem wasn’t with the jellyfish itself but with something residing on it.","Jian Wushuang acted swiftly, capturing the position of the creature and darting toward it.","He didn’t use any weapons; instead, he grabbed the jellyfish’s twitching tentacles with both hands, pulling it toward himself.","Only at such close range did he finally see the object on the creature.","“No wonder, it actually swallowed this thing!”","Jian Wushuang crushed the jellyfish’s massive head with a flick of his hand, retrieving a piece of coral from it.","Above it lingered a dense spiritual energy.","A treasure.","This was a spiritual entity from the seabed.","In fact, the jellyfish’s true form was this piece of coral.","Now, having lost its host, the coral became an inanimate object, but the spiritual energy above could aid Jian Wushuang.","With this coral, he could ascend to the rank of Immortal alongside Xiang Yang and others, reaching the Golden Core stage.","“I didn’t expect to be so lucky this time. It seems the Tang Dynasty is indeed my blessed land!”","Having found the source of the aura, there was no need for him to stay underwater, so he prepared to leave.","However, just as he emerged to the surface, he heard a clamor of footsteps.","Clearly, it came from above.","In no time, a glow from torches illuminated the area.","Someone had arrived at the small courtyard with torches in hand.","Jian Wushuang, with a thought, dove back into the water.","“There are cultivators?”","Moreover, they were heading directly here.","If he could sense the aura on the linen-clad woman, other cultivators likely could too.","Of course, the opponent had to be of a much higher realm than him.","At the very least, they were Golden Core stage cultivators.","Just as his Thought power stirred, he detected a powerful aura above, undoubtedly from a Golden Core stage cultivator.","Fortunately, his reaction was swift. He wrapped his entire body in Thought power, suppressing his aura to the minimum while in the water.","Along with that piece of coral, he carefully protected it.","At this moment, within the small courtyard, a group of mysterious figures dressed in black soft armor were searching every corner of the yard recklessly.","Among them, an old man stood at the center of the courtyard, using his mental power to probe the surroundings. His triangular eyes and sharp, hooked nose gave him a naturally imposing presence.","“Expand the search area. Check within a three-mile radius. Bring everyone here to me and interrogate them thoroughly!”","“Yes!”","The group in black soft armor were all innate experts, moving with incredible speed.","In just one hour, they had gathered all the people from the fishing village, with the houses consumed by flames.","In the distance, the pier remained eerily silent, with no one daring to glance over.","“Left Protector, we’ve searched everywhere and still found nothing!” a black-clad man reported anxiously.","The old man with triangular eyes remained calm, extending his skeletal claw-like hand to play with a pair of iron balls, saying sinisterly, “We arrived too late!”","He then turned around and left without hesitation.","The black-armored men followed suit, leaving the villagers weak and silent on the ground.","This group came and left swiftly, with no one knowing where they came from.","However, Jian Wushuang, lurking at the bottom of the well, heard the words “Left Protector.”","Someone referred to as Protector was certainly not from an ordinary organization; they were likely from a sect or a cult.","Jian Wushuang became extremely cautious, waiting until dawn before climbing out of the well.","As he emerged, it began to rain heavily outside.","The burnt-out houses were extinguished, reduced to charred remains.","Jian Wushuang walked through the mud, with rainwater mixed with blood beneath his feet.","The stench of blood was overwhelming.","When he reached the entrance of the fishing village, he saw the slain villagers.","They died silently, but each had a bowl-sized hole in their chests.","“Their hearts are gone?”","Jian Wushuang glanced at the gruesome scene and could only sigh helplessly.","He hadn’t expected to encounter such a thing right after arriving in the Tang Dynasty.","The cultivators who came yesterday not only sought the coral but also took the hearts of everyone in the village.","This was undoubtedly the work of a demonic cult.","“Time to go!”","Jian Wushuang had only one thought now, which was to leave quickly.","If those people hadn’t gone far and decided to return, it would be troublesome.","At present, his strength was not enough to contend with those people.","Returning to the inn, he took off his soaked clothes and changed into dry ones. Just as he did, there was a knock on the door.","“Come in!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","The door opened, and Jiang Shang entered, politely saying, “I’m sorry to disturb you so early, Senior!”","“It’s fine; I just got up too,” Jian Wushuang replied casually and continued, “By the way, pack up. We’re taking the water route to Tai’an City today!”","“Okay!” Jiang Shang’s face lit up with excitement.","She hadn’t planned to stay in such a small place for long.","So much so that she forgot why she came to find Jian Wushuang in the first place.","As she informed everyone to pack their luggage, Xiang Yang approached mysteriously and whispered, “Did you feel an evil aura last night?”","“You sensed it too?” Jian Wushuang asked, surprised.","After entering the Tang Dynasty, he had Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang conceal their auras.","This Turtle Breathing Technique was easy to create, not particularly difficult.","Fortunately, he was cautious; otherwise, the demonic cultivators would have discovered Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang yesterday."]},{"number":6288,"title":"Chapter 6288: Black Fog","paragraphs":["Chapter 6288: Black Fog","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Xiang Yang nodded and replied, “That aura came crashing from the sea without any restraint. Even a deaf person could sense it!”","“Keep your voice down!” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, glanced out the window, and asked, “How did you know they came from the sea?”","“To be honest, yesterday I saw you sneaking away, and I couldn’t sleep all night. I kept watch outside. After you left for about an hour, a black mist came from the sea, filled with an evil aura. I don’t know how many people there were, but the leader was definitely a cultivator in the Golden Core stage!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised, not because Xiang Yang discovered that the group came from the sea, but because Xiang Yang had been watching him all along.","This made him somewhat displeased. He frowned and said, “Why are you watching me so closely?”","“I was afraid you might run away!” Xiang Yang said, somewhat aggrieved. “To be honest, you’ve always been guarded against me. You haven’t even given me the complete cultivation method. If I don’t keep an eye on you, what if one day you find me useless and run off with Jiang Shang?”","Since Xiang Yang had embarked on the path of cultivation again, his mind had become more active.","He increasingly felt that his presence or absence didn’t seem to make much difference to Jian Wushuang, so he began to worry that Jian Wushuang might abandon him one day.","“You’re overthinking it!” Jian Wushuang patted Xiang Yang on the shoulder.","He didn’t explain further because some things couldn’t be told to him, but he would involve him in the plans.","For instance, the Wanliu Divine Tree on Jiang Shang’s back seemed unrelated to Xiang Yang, but it was actually significant.","The aura of Wanliu Divine Wood was on Xingluo, and it might be possible to use Xiang Yang’s identity to transmit it to Xingluo and lure him out.","Their cultivation speed was still too slow.","If Xingluo were willing to take them, Jian Wushuang would regain his immortality within a hundred years.","The immortality referred to here was not the immortals of the mortal world, but the Immortal of Derivation.","After leaving Xiang Yang, Jian Wushuang found One Ear.","He instructed him to prepare supplies for the ship, buying as much as possible.","After all, they would soon reach the inland of the Great Tang, so there was no need to bring much.","Once the instructions were given, the others had almost finished packing.","They left the inn together.","The rain outside was getting heavier. Everyone held oiled paper umbrellas, but their clothes still got wet.","When they reached the dock, they found that there were still many people there.","They stood at the dock in the heavy rain, not knowing what they were doing.","When Jian Wushuang and the others approached, they heard cries of sorrow.","Pushing through the crowd.","They walked to the dock’s deck and discovered an elderly couple crying over the corpse of a woman in coarse clothes.","The elderly couple had gone fishing at sea yesterday and returned to the dock in the morning, only to find their daughter’s corpse lying on the deck.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised. The demonic cultivator had followed the woman in coarse clothes to the fishing village yesterday.","It wasn’t surprising that she was dead now.","However, Jian Wushuang still felt a bit regretful.","Listening to the old man’s repeated calls of his daughter’s name, Jian Wushuang learned that the woman’s name was “Azi.”","After noting it down, he boarded the ship without looking back.","After One Ear brought the supplies on board, Jian Wushuang asked him to bring A’zi’s parents onto the ship as well.","The fishing village was gone.","The elderly couple probably had no place to stay anymore, which was truly pitiful.","Moreover, since Jian Wushuang had obtained the coral from their well, he felt he had fulfilled a karmic bond.","The treasure ship set sail once more.","After reaching the straits of the Shanhai County, they began heading towards the Grand Tang Canal.","Along the way, A’zi’s body was given a water burial.","Jian Wushuang then began refining the coral.","The spiritual energy above continued to dissipate, and he couldn’t let it go to waste.","Unfortunately, he only had the coral at the moment and no alchemy furnace; otherwise, he could have refined a batch of pills.","Now he could only refine the spiritual energy from the coral, which was quite polite.","Fortunately, the spiritual energy was abundant, enough for the three of them to absorb.","The three surrounded the coral and began their attempt to break through to the Golden Core stage.","They paid no heed to the outside world.","It was unknown how much time had passed when the treasure ship stopped, but Jian Wushuang and the other two were still in closed-door cultivation, and no one dared disturb them, so the ship remained stationary.","In the blink of an eye, half a year had passed.","The treasure ship turned back, but three people disembarked.","It was Jian Wushuang and the other two.","They were now very close to Tai’an City.","Jian Wushuang dismissed One Ear and the others, as it was not suitable to bring a group of ordinary people while seeking opportunities to enter the cultivation world. Therefore, he gave the ship to One Ear, telling him to live well in the Great Tang.","As for the three of them, they bought three fast horses and headed straight for Tai’an City.","They traveled six hundred miles in a day.","By nightfall, they were still in the wilderness.","They thought of finding a small town to rest for the night.","However, when they entered a village, they found it eerily silent.","There was also a stench of decay.","“It’s a corpse!”","Xiang Yang frowned, walking into a courtyard and looking at the rotting corpse inside. His stomach churned, and he almost vomited on the spot.","“Let’s go, find another place,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","But they had already seen several villages like this.","After six months in seclusion, they had all reached the Golden Core stage.","Originally, they could have flown directly to Tai’an City, but to keep a low profile, they decided to enter Tai’an City as ordinary people. However, they hadn’t expected to encounter such strange occurrences on the way.","Some towns had even been slaughtered entirely.","Corpses were piled together, with the same bowl-sized wound on their chests as Jian Wushuang had seen in the fishing village.","It was clearly the work of the same group.","They had removed the hearts of the ordinary people.","“The demonic cult is rampant!”","And not just rampant, but extremely so; they were only a hundred miles from the imperial city!","Such things happened despite the fact that the Emperor of the Great Tang could also cultivate and even had immortals under his command. Didn’t he fear that one day the demonic cult might massacre Tai’an City?","The three decided not to stop and rushed to the outskirts of Tai’an City overnight.","There was a curfew at night.","So when they reached the city gates, they couldn’t enter.","They had to wait until dawn to enter Tai’an City with the crowd.","Jiang Shang, who was initially full of curiosity about the Great Tang, felt somewhat disappointed after the incidents on the way. Especially upon entering Tai’an City, she found it incredibly prosperous but did not see the grandeur she had expected.","In this regard, Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang were quite experienced.","Seeing was believing.","Besides, they had seen many large cities.","In their view, this so-called flourishing Great Tang, boasted by ordinary people, was just that—a large city, somewhat more prosperous.","Ultimately, it could not escape its vulgarity.","After entering the city, the three found a relatively bustling inn to stay in.","Jian Wushuang did not rest for a moment; after a slight disguise, he headed straight for the First Building Under Heaven.","He initially planned to buy some information with gold and silver to understand the Great Tang.","However, upon entering the First Building Under Heaven, he realized he had come to the wrong place."]},{"number":6289,"title":"Chapter 6289: The First Floor","paragraphs":["Chapter 6289: The First Floor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The place was rumored to be magical, but it was just a marketplace bustling with ordinary people, exchanging goods from various places—a paradise for merchants.","Jian Wushuang was quite disappointed.","Just as he was about to leave, a maid blocked his way.","“Young master, my boss invites you to the third floor for tea!”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks, and it was then that he dared to relax his mental focus.","Because his identity had already been exposed.","Otherwise, the maid wouldn’t have stopped him.","He simply released his mental power and sensed multiple auras on the second and third floors above him.","All of them were cultivators.","Even the maid in front of him was an innate expert.","Feigning calm, Jian Wushuang said, “Lead the way!”","He hadn’t expected his cover to be blown so quickly.","Moreover, he was already in the Golden Core stage, even if only at the initial stage, which made him akin to an immortal in the mortal world. He didn’t expect to be recognized so easily in this first-floor establishment.","Fortunately, since it was a place of business, they wouldn’t inquire about his identity.","However, Jian Wushuang faced another awkward issue: he was penniless.","He didn’t have the spiritual stones required in the cultivation world.","But since he had been invited, he had no choice but to follow along.","As he passed the second floor, he noticed it was also bustling, though most were innate cultivators, with some postnatal practitioners as well.","There were only one or two in the Golden Core stage.","On the third floor, almost everyone was a Golden Core expert.","Their attire was indistinguishable from that of ordinary people.","Walking on the street, commoners wouldn’t be able to tell the difference; at most, they might notice something unusual about their demeanor.","In reality, the gap between those in the Golden Core stage and ordinary people wasn’t vast. It was simply a matter of having condensed a force within their bodies, without altering their mortal form.","“Senior, please feel free!” the maid slightly bowed, escorting Jian Wushuang to the third floor before descending.","Jian Wushuang nodded and stepped onto the third floor.","The ceiling rose about seven or eight feet, with various rare fruits and hefty tomes displayed above.","At the counter, many were discussing rare treasures with the shopkeeper.","Jian Wushuang perked up his ears to listen.","But when he heard about spiritual stones, his expression turned somber.","He was utterly broke at the moment, so how could he afford anything?","As a result, he didn’t dare inquire about the purpose of certain treasures, only glancing at them briefly and paying no attention to the shopkeeper’s quotes, merely nodding frequently.","A young shopkeeper, very polite, said, “Senior, is this your first time in the Great Tang?”","“Hmm, I just arrived in Tai’an City. I’ve long heard that this is the world’s first establishment for collecting various treasures, so I came to have a look!” Jian Wushuang spoke modestly.","The young shopkeeper, smiling, replied, “Senior, you give our establishment too much credit. We merely trade in some ordinary treasures. I suspect many of them wouldn’t even catch your eye!”","After exchanging some pleasantries, Jian Wushuang naturally engaged in casual conversation with the other party. Like other cultivators, he didn’t really care about buying anything; his main purpose was to exchange information.","For example, discussing some insights into cultivation, though these were mainly used to elicit more information.","Jian Wushuang could see through the essence of these mundane cultivation methods at a glance, and his remarks left the other party quite astonished.","The young shopkeeper, after hearing his insights, was thoroughly impressed and had an epiphany in his cultivation.","“I am Zhu Quan, grateful for the senior’s guidance!” The young shopkeeper, Zhu Quan, bowed deeply. Although his strength was similar to Jian Wushuang’s, both being in the early Golden Core stage, the insights Jian Wushuang shared warranted such respect.","Jian Wushuang quickly raised his hand to stop him and said calmly, “It’s just some insights. No need for such courtesy, my friend.”","“No, senior, your talent is exceptional. Although our strengths are similar, my understanding lags far behind. I should show my respect!” Zhu Quan continued, “Such a talent as yours, senior, must have come to this First Pavilion for the emperor’s edict issued by the Tang Emperor, right?”","“Emperor’s edict?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He hadn’t heard of this before, but since the other party mentioned it, it was clearly significant. He followed the lead and said, “I’ve only heard a little about it. I came to learn more.”","“Then you have found the right person, senior. The emperor’s edict is still here in the First Pavilion. I’ll fetch it for you to see!” Zhu Quan said, then slightly lifted off the ground to retrieve a decree from the highest shelf.","Jian Wushuang slightly raised his head, searching his mind for information about the emperor’s edict.","He hadn’t heard of any edict issued by the Tang Emperor on his way.","However, considering the mortals harmed by the demonic cult he encountered on the road, he thought it might be related.","As he let his mind wander, Zhu Quan opened the emperor’s edict.","Jian Wushuang, wanting to show respect, adopted a more solemn expression.","“Actually, there’s nothing much to see in this edict; it’s just a handwritten decree by His Majesty, containing some daoist artistic conception that ordinary people cannot perceive. Please have a look, senior!” Zhu Quan said as he pushed the edict toward him.","Jian Wushuang obliged and commented, “The handwriting contains sword intent and an eternal quality that cannot wither. The writer must have surpassed the Golden Core stage!”","This statement wasn’t flattery; the writer truly had this ability.","The handwriting carried sword intent, which Jian Wushuang recognized at a glance. As for the daoist principles Zhu Quan mentioned, that was pure nonsense. For daoist principles to be embedded in handwriting, one would need at least the strength of the Ancestor Realm.","Only a Dao Ancestor could manipulate daoist principles at will.","A mere mortal dared to dabble in daoist principles—that would be absurd.","However, this emperor was indeed much stronger than them, having surpassed the Golden Core stage.","In the mortal cultivation world, he could be considered a top expert.","At least, he was a cultivator at the Nascent Soul stage.","In Jian Wushuang’s view, this mundane world was very peculiar because spiritual energy was absorbed by spiritual objects, and pure cultivation could only lead to consummate innate stage at best; further progress required the aid of rare materials.","Breaking through to the Golden Core stage was already difficult.","Reaching the Nascent Soul stage was practically as hard as ascending to the heavens.","As for the Tang Emperor, according to what he knew, he was still very young, and his cultivation time probably didn’t exceed twenty years, yet he had already become a Nascent Soul stage cultivator.","This also indicated that the Tang royal family had ample resources, and the Tang Emperor had a unique aptitude.","Cultivators emerging from such harsh environments would be considered geniuses in the outside world, though they couldn’t be compared to the descendants of those with powerful bloodlines.","However, Jian Wushuang didn’t expect that his casual remark about the Tang Emperor’s strength would draw a peculiar look from Zhu Quan.","Jian Wushuang didn’t know if he had misspoken and thought perhaps he had inadvertently revealed a hidden strength of the Tang Emperor.","“Senior is indeed extraordinary. Just from the handwriting, you could deduce that the Tang Emperor surpassed the Golden Core stage. I am truly impressed. However, this is no secret. His Majesty surpassed the Golden Core stage three years ago; otherwise, the Tang Dynasty might have changed hands long ago!” Zhu Quan said, seemingly reminiscing."]},{"number":6290,"title":"Chapter 6290: The Four Great Cultivation Worlds","paragraphs":["Chapter 6290: The Four Great Cultivation Worlds","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In fact, he was about the same age as the Tang Emperor, belonging to those who had experienced that era. However, at that time, he was only at the peak of the Innate Realm, and his breakthrough to the Golden Core stage was recent.","On the other hand, Jian Wushuang’s appearance was very youthful, looking only a little over twenty, but he had an extraordinary aura, leading people to speculate that it was because he started cultivating early, allowing him to maintain his youthful appearance.","However, Jian Wushuang’s aura was very weak, not like that of a great cultivator in the Golden Core stage, whose energy cyclone entered the sea.","Yet, the vision and insights Jian Wushuang had just displayed still greatly impressed Zhu Quan. He thought that if it were anyone else, they probably wouldn’t have said so much.","Realizing that Jian Wushuang was truly unfamiliar with the Tang Dynasty, Zhu Quan began to talk about some major events that had occurred in the Tang Dynasty in recent years.","“Senior might be from the Southern Sky Cultivation World and may not know much about the East. It’s actually nothing special. This Eastern Cultivation World mainly revolves around three places: one temple, one law, and one tomb!” Zhu Quan began, first talking about the origin of the Tang Dynasty.","He also briefly summarized the current situation of the cultivation world.","It was first divided into four major cultivation worlds.","The Southern Sky World, which consisted of the seven southern countries.","Jian Wushuang actually didn’t know about this either. Back in Jiang Country, he hadn’t been exposed to the cultivation world.","Then there was the Eastern Land Cultivation World.","Which was the Tang Dynasty.","In fact, in the Human Cultivation World, only the Eastern Land and the Southern Sky World were relatively prosperous.","The other two worlds were different; one was the Northern Glacier, occupied by a group of demonic cultivators known as the Holy Sect. Very few cultivators ventured to the Northern Glacier. It was rumored that ancient demons were sealed there, and the Holy Sect was the legacy left by these ancient demons.","This made Jian Wushuang very curious, but he did not ask about it, planning to learn more in the future when he had time.","He continued to listen.","He initially thought that after the Eastern Land, Southern Sky, and Northern Glacier, the next topic would be about the western side. Unexpectedly, Zhu Quan’s conversation took a turn, saying, “Speaking of which, these first three cultivation worlds, regardless of being righteous or demonic, at least have a legacy and an endless stream of cultivators. But this last cultivation world arose because of one person!”","Jian Wushuang was still completely unaware of such a significant event.","Zhu Quan even suspected that Jian Wushuang might have consumed some rare and precious fruit, directly ascending from a mortal to a Golden Core stage cultivator.","If not for Jian Wushuang’s earlier display of insight and vision, Zhu Quan would have doubted it.","But now, he only thought of Jian Wushuang as a diligent cultivator who didn’t concern himself with worldly affairs, focusing solely on cultivation.","Jian Wushuang was happy to maintain this impression, speaking about the mountains as if that were his life, further convincing Zhu Quan that he was indeed a reclusive cultivator from deep in the mountains.","He was genuinely surprised by Zhu Quan’s words.","Not all of his reaction was feigned, as he was truly curious about who had such great ability, where one person alone could represent an entire cultivation world.","It seemed a bit exaggerated.","In this mundane world, the cultivators were very weak, far from the level of destroying the heavens and the earth.","Zhu Quan saw Jian Wushuang’s disbelief and lowered his voice, saying, “That last cultivation realm was once a vast and powerful realm. But because of one person, it became a legend and was completely erased from this world. Since then, that person has claimed to be a realm unto themselves and is now a mysterious figure in the cultivation world, so powerful that they are likely a Grand Cultivator in the Divine Appearance Realm!”","“There are such extraordinary people?” Jian Wushuang nodded in admiration and then asked, “What is their title?”","Zhu Quan replied, “This person doesn’t have a formal title; they simply claim to be the Prophet of the cultivation world, predicting the future. They even say that a peerless cultivator will emerge in recent years, breaking the chains of the mortal world and leading the entire cultivation realm to ascend to the Spirit World!”","“The Prophet!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes contracted upon hearing the name, and he felt a deep shock in his heart.","He couldn’t forget the figure he had dreamed of before.","It was precisely the figure of the Prophet.","“A coincidence?”","In the past, Jian Wushuang might have believed it was a coincidence, but now he didn’t.","Everything probably had a cause and effect.","Moreover, he suspected there were some schemes behind his being trapped in this world.","Let’s not forget that he had once split himself into countless bodies to pry open the coffin of the Tomb of the Gods.","To find a path to transcend the Tribulation.","His thoughts wandered for a moment.","Zhu Quan saw his silence and thought he was overwhelmed, so he comforted him, “Senior, don’t be too surprised. Many cultivators privately dismiss him. Besides erasing that cultivation realm, he hasn’t taken action again, so there’s no real evidence of his strength. Maybe we’ve overestimated him.”","“Perhaps,” Jian Wushuang nodded quietly.","That’s what he said outwardly, but he didn’t think so inwardly.","If only it were that simple.","“We’ve strayed a bit from the topic. Let’s talk about the origins of the Great Tang, the Eastern Cultivation Realm. Its story is just as captivating as that of the Prophet!” Zhu Quan spoke eloquently, recounting the splendor and past grudges of the Great Tang in the East.","A thousand years ago, there was no Great Tang in the East.","At that time, the East was the weakest of the four major cultivation realms.","Moreover, the East always believed in Buddhism.","The few cultivators that existed were not skilled in combat and were often bullied by cultivators from other realms while seeking opportunities and treasures.","Later, a remarkable figure emerged.","He was originally a prince of a mortal dynasty, who later married a princess of the Great Tang and came to Tai’an City.","Their union was considered a political marriage between dynasties, but they genuinely loved each other.","Even though the prince became a consort, he had no complaints and was deeply in love with the princess, a love story of that era.","However, the good times didn’t last. A few years after their marriage, the princess suddenly fell gravely ill. At that time, although the Tang royal family had immortals among them, they couldn’t cure the princess.","It was rumored that only by going to the Northern Glacier and seeking the inheritance of ancient immortals could her illness be cured.","But at that time, the cultivators of the East couldn’t even defend their territory, let alone venture to the Northern Glacier for opportunities.","Besides, it was just a princess, and the Tang dynasty wasn’t willing to risk sending their venerated immortals.","Moreover, because Buddhism was prevalent at the time, everything emphasized destiny.","In essence, they let things take their course.","But the consort couldn’t accept this!","To save the princess, he ventured to the Northern Glacier as a mere mortal.","He was gone for decades, and when everyone thought he had perished, he miraculously returned.","And he had become a Grand Cultivator in the Nascent Soul stage.","This event shocked the cultivation realm of the East at that time.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but ask, “And then? Did the consort save the princess?”","“No,” Zhu Quan shook his head.","What followed was a tale of regret.","Even after the consort returned as a hero, he couldn’t save the princess.","It seemed that their fates were intertwined, and within a month of the consort’s return, the princess passed away."]},{"number":6291,"title":"Chapter 6291: Treasure Light Temple With Crouching Tigers and Hidden Dragons","paragraphs":["Chapter 6291: Treasure Light Temple With Crouching Tigers and Hidden Dragons","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This marked the beginning of the cultivation world in the Eastern Land.","The Princess Tomb!","The consort built an enormous Princess Tomb.","He also recruited many disciples, training a group of powerful cultivators for the Princess Tomb.","He silently guarded the Princess Tomb for years.","Now, it had become the top cultivation power in the Eastern Land.","Jian Wushuang listened intently, reminded of Baoguang Temple.","One temple, one tomb.","However, he was more curious about what happened to the consort later on!","Zhu Quan sighed with emotion and lamented, “This brings us to the method, the Dao inheritance that the consort found in the Northern Icefields. He left it for the entire Eastern Land, leading to today’s Tang Dynasty. After passing on the Dao, he renounced the secular world and became a monk at Baoguang Temple!”","“Which true immortal was enshrined at Baoguang Temple?”","This reminded Jian Wushuang of what Xiang Yang said about the true immortal enshrined at Baoguang Temple.","Furthermore, that temple was the first cultivation power in the Eastern Land, marking the origin of its cultivation world.","He initially thought that the consort might be the true immortal of Baoguang Temple.","But unexpectedly, it was someone else.","“The true immortal of Baoguang Temple has nothing to do with this matter, and that senior is not the head monk!” Zhu Quan shook his head and sighed lightly, “I only know that the consort became a monk at Baoguang Temple, but his story gradually faded away, and now no one knows if he is still at Baoguang Temple!”","After hearing the origin and history of the rise and fall of the cultivation world in the Eastern Land, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel the reverence that Zhu Quan had for it.","Instead, he pondered some of the causal relationships within.","The consort went to the Northern Icefields because the princess was ill, transforming from an ordinary person to a Nascent Soul cultivator?","A month after he returned, the princess passed away.","Then he built the Princess Tomb out of love.","Later, he became a monk!","There were likely more hidden truths in this story.","He couldn’t believe that an ordinary person could rely on the power of love to become such a figure.","Moreover, to renounce everything at the peak of his power to live as an ordinary person.","If there really were such a person, he would genuinely want to meet him.","Unknowingly, he had stayed at the First Pavilion for an entire day.","Usually, the third floor was a place where cultivators exchanged ideas, with tea served, and no one cared about the passage of time.","However, Jian Wushuang had just arrived, and there were two people waiting for him, so he got up and bid farewell to Zhu Quan.","When he left, he also conveniently asked Zhu Quan to inquire about someone’s whereabouts.","He had already figured out almost everything he wanted to know.","Now, it was up to them to seize their opportunities.","At present, there was such an opportunity.","When he returned to the inn, Xiang Yang and Jiang Shang had both come back.","They each spoke about the events they encountered and the information they gathered.","However, neither of them had as detailed information as Jian Wushuang.","When Jian Wushuang spoke of the four major cultivation realms and some of the hidden matters of the Eastern Land, they both showed expressions of surprise.","Jiang Shang was amazed by the wonders of the cultivation world, while Xiang Yang was a bit disappointed, feeling that this world was too small.","This was quite normal. After all, Jiang Shang was an ordinary person; even though he had become a cultivator, he knew too little and didn’t have the grand perspective that Xiang Yang did.","In the past, Xiang Yang had been a prodigy with a family of Universe Gods.","He had a clear understanding of the entire layout of the Realm God Continent.","Such a material world could hardly catch his eye now.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, was indifferent. He knew that the road had to be traveled step by step.","Not everything could be accomplished in one leap.","The smaller this material world was, the safer it was for them.","Of course, now he and Xiang Yang were still pretending to be cultivators of the Tang Dynasty, but they were just secluded, indifferent to worldly matters.","“Oh, and there’s one more thing I forgot to mention. It’s about the incident three years ago when the Tang Emperor was attacked!” Jian Wushuang paused and then continued, “This might be my entry point into the cultivation world. Three years ago, the Tang Emperor was attacked by foreign tribes and almost lost his life. He fled the palace and later broke through to the Nascent Soul stage to kill the foreign tribes, reclaiming the throne!”","Xiang Yang listened with wide eyes and said in surprise, “Attacked by foreign tribes? Didn’t the Princess Tomb and Baoguang Temple just stand by and watch?”","“The cultivators of the Princess Tomb don’t interfere with the affairs of mortal dynasties, and Baoguang Temple doesn’t like conflicts. They indeed just stood by and watched!” Jian Wushuang analyzed, “I suspect that the identity of the foreign tribe back then was not simple. There must be something suspicious, but there’s too little information to see through it. However, one thing is clear: when the Tang Emperor was attacked, it was an imperial concubine who shielded him from a fatal blow, or else the Tang Emperor would have died long ago!”","Jiang Shang was taken aback and added, “I heard quite a bit about this when I was in the Jiang Kingdom. Back then, the Tang Dynasty underwent great changes. The Tang Emperor fled overseas, and a strong foreign tribe took over the palace for a month. Later, the Tang Emperor returned and killed the foreign tribes, but the imperial concubine didn’t die, though she was severely injured and remained in the palace. The Tang Emperor even issued an imperial edict seeking help to heal the imperial concubine!”","Jian Wushuang also knew about the imperial edict but hadn’t paid it much attention.","Hearing Jiang Shang’s explanation now, he became interested.","A mortal imperial concubine shielding the Tang Emperor from a fatal attack and surviving was already unbelievable. The key point was that when the Tang Emperor left, he didn’t take this concubine with him.","Instead, she was imprisoned or perhaps carefully tended to by the foreign tribe’s strongman as she lingered on the brink of death.","Later, when the Tang Emperor returned and killed the foreign tribes, he announced that the imperial concubine was alive and issued an imperial edict seeking famous doctors to treat her.","The more Jian Wushuang thought about it, the more familiar it seemed.","Wasn’t this the intelligence from the early Tang Dynasty?","Last time, it was to save a princess; this time, it was to save an imperial concubine.","After succeeding with the former, the Tang Dynasty rose to become the first dynasty in the Eastern Land.","“Eastern Land?”","Jian Wushuang stood by the window, silently repeating “Eastern Land Tang Dynasty.”","For a moment, he looked dazed.","“Eastern Land? Tang Dynasty?”","The Slaughter Dynasty!!!","It seemed familiar to him.","“Is it another coincidence?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, no longer believing in coincidences.","The path of mortals seemed like re-cultivation, but it felt remarkably similar to the path he once took to rise in the mortal world.","Even the names were the same.","He had once encountered an Eastern Land Tang Dynasty.","But he couldn’t remember it clearly, only recalling endless slaughter there.","Xiang Yang, seeing his weary expression, approached to console him, saying, “There’s no need to be so anxious about integrating into the Eastern Land cultivation world. Let’s just go with the flow and explore those dangerous places and relics. Once we acquire treasures and become Nascent Soul cultivators, people will naturally come to recruit us, and it won’t take long to break through this world!”","“Hopefully so!” Jian Wushuang nodded silently, then turned to Jiang Shang and said calmly, “Don’t go to Baoguang Temple alone. Call me when you go!”","Jiang Shang was surprised but agreed nonetheless.","The next morning.","The three of them left the inn again, as they could only rest inside due to the nighttime curfew.","Since the foreign tribe’s intrusion three years ago, Tai’an City’s regulations had become extremely strict."]},{"number":6292,"title":"Chapter 6292: Master Fengjue","paragraphs":["Chapter 6292: Master Fengjue","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even immortals could not move freely at night, or else they would be apprehended by the imperial court.","Although the invasion by foreign tribes three years ago had drained the vitality of the Great Tang, the control over the capital was still strong.","Walking on the streets, one could often see patrolling imperial guards, each a consummate martial artist, a group of nine capable of capturing innate experts.","Apart from the imperial guards, there was also the “Immortal Execution Guard,” exclusively loyal to the Tang Emperor.","This was a force belonging exclusively to the Tang Emperor.","Each member was an innate martial artist, working in groups of three to ensure the safety of the imperial city, and they rarely appeared in the outer city.","As fate would have it, Jian Wushuang and Jiang Shang ran right into them.","“Is this the Immortal Execution Guard?” Jiang Shang whispered, “No wonder the Great Tang is so powerful. The patrolling Immortal Execution Guard are all innate martial artists, and I’ve heard there are even immortal scouts in the shadows. It’s unbelievable!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head calmly, “This is nothing. As long as there are resources, even the world’s top figures will willingly bow their heads!”","This was a matter of experience.","Merely relying on worldly knowledge was insufficient to comprehend the cultivation world.","Currently, Jian Wushuang had a rough understanding of this small world.","Based on his experience, he judged this to be a material world, a world where ascension was possible.","However, the resources in this world were currently limited, insufficient for cultivators to break free from the cage.","Even he was no exception.","Without resources, relying solely on experience was just empty talk!","Thus, Jian Wushuang and his companions needed to explore the secrets of this world step by step, seeking some lost treasures of heaven and earth to break free from this cage.","Despite the fact that beyond this world, there were still constraints!","Jian Wushuang knew very well that the entrance he had entered from was not an ordinary small world but a world capable of bearing Universe Gods.","It was important to note that the four great spacetimes could not bear Universe Gods.","Yet, in that world, there were so many Universe God-level monsters trying to escape.","Among them were super-powerful beings within the Universe Gods.","If it were Jian Wushuang’s external body, he would still have confidence.","His external body had the strength of nine stars at its peak.","Breaking this cage would naturally be no problem.","But now, in this world, wanting to regain his peak was too difficult for him.","Thinking of this, he soon arrived outside the Baoguang Temple.","Just as he was about to enter, he noticed Jiang Shang standing still, eyes glazed, hesitating to move forward.","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang asked, puzzled.","Jiang Shang replied blankly, “It’s nothing, just a feeling I can’t describe when I saw the plaque!”","Hearing about the plaque, Jian Wushuang also glanced up.","The three simple large characters were nothing special.","But one thing was very clear: the handwriting was by a cultivator.","The crevices between the lines, containing an aura, were not carved by an ordinary person!","However, for a Great Tang where immortals roamed freely, this was nothing surprising.","If it weren’t for Jiang Shang, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t have paid attention.","But he merely remembered this in his heart and was about to enter Baoguang Temple.","At this moment, a young monk walked out from the temple alone. He was wearing a kasaya and had a delicate face, with eyes that held a sense of Zen wisdom.","“Are you two here looking for someone?” the young monk asked directly.","This surprised both Jian Wushuang and Jiang Shang.","Especially Jian Wushuang.","After entering Tai’an City, the three of them kept a low profile. Although they mingled with some cultivators, they didn’t actively reveal their strength or background.","If there was any exposure, it would be Jian Wushuang, who had a brief conversation with Zhu Quan in the First Tower.","However, Zhu Quan was merely an immortal of the First Tower and likely had little connection to the Baoguang Temple.","Jian Wushuang remained calm and composed. Although he was surprised, his expression didn’t change at all.","Jiang Shang, on the other hand, showed a bewildered expression.","“How did he know?” Jiang Shang thought, her face turning serious.","The young monk seemed to notice Jiang Shang’s surprise, but he couldn’t discern any expression from Jian Wushuang.","“Master Fengjue sent me to welcome you two!”","Master Fengjue?","Upon hearing this name, Jiang Shang became even more puzzled. She didn’t know this person at all.","Jian Wushuang, however, nodded silently and said, “Let’s go. Since we’ve been invited, it’s better than wandering around in the dark.”","Yesterday at the First Tower, they had heard Zhu Quan talk about several eminent monks in Baoguang Temple.","Among them was this Master Fengjue.","Fengjue, a Buddhist Mahayana Vajra!","His strength had already reached the late Jindan stage, and with the Buddhist Vajra Divine Skill, he was invincible below the Nascent Soul stage.","Because Jindan-stage cultivators couldn’t break through his defense.","More than a hundred years ago, this Buddhist Vajra had preached in the Southern Heavens, which are now the Southern Seven Kingdoms.","Coming from the Eastern Lands, his teachings were disrupted by the cultivators of the Southern Heavens. In anger, he defeated nine Jindan-stage cultivators with one palm strike.","It was this battle that made Master Fengjue famous.","Now, more than a hundred years later, his strength had become unfathomable.","However!","This was nothing to Jian Wushuang.","Even if Zhu Quan praised this old monk to the skies, he was just a Jindan-stage cultivator.","He was simply curious as to why it was Master Fengjue.","Although he was one of the top three monks in Baoguang Temple, they had little connection with him!","If it were the founding host of Baoguang Temple, Jian Wushuang might not have been so puzzled.","Or if it were a true immortal!","With questions in their minds, the two followed the young bald monk into Baoguang Temple.","Upon entering the inner courtyard, they occasionally saw devotees coming and going, their expressions solemn.","Among them were devotees with troubled expressions, their eyes seeming vacant.","However, whenever these people encountered the young monk, they respectfully called out, “Master Fancheng.”","This let Jian Wushuang and Jiang Shang learn the Dharma name of the young monk.","They had thought he was just a young monk but didn’t expect him to be a master.","Thinking about it, in the mundane world, anyone in the temple who wasn’t a child or teenager could be considered a master.","Following Fancheng through the bustling front yard, it suddenly became much quieter.","“I will leave you here, and Master Fengjue will come shortly. Please wait a moment,” Fancheng said with a gentle smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded calmly.","After the monk left, the two of them exchanged a glance without speaking, instead, they began observing the backyard.","The yard was very tidy, with no unnecessary furnishings.","Both of their gazes turned to the open hall door in the backyard.","Though they stood outside, they could vaguely make out a figure inside through the door.","“What is that?” Jiang Shang frowned upon seeing the scene inside.","Noticing her unusual expression, Jian Wushuang focused his attention there as well.","Having reached the Jindan stage, both of them had heightened senses. Even from a distance, they could clearly see the scene inside the door.","Especially Jian Wushuang, who could sense the scene inside with his mental power alone, without using his eyes."]},{"number":6293,"title":"Chapter 6293: Statue \"Hu Qing?\"","paragraphs":["Chapter 6293: Statue “Hu Qing?”","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“A statue of a Buddha!”","Jian Wushuang felt a stir in his heart but didn’t think there was anything amiss. However, when he looked more closely, he noticed something peculiar.","Bao Guang Temple!","A sacred place for Buddhists, where paying respects to a Buddha statue was natural.","To outsiders, this was nothing unusual.","However, for Jian Wushuang and Jiang Shang, there was much surprise and confusion regarding the statue.","Jian Wushuang was the first to be surprised.","He was both surprised and puzzled.","What surprised him was that the statue looked very much like a person.","“Hu Qing!”","This was also what surprised and puzzled Jiang Shang.","Because the moment she saw the statue, something in her heart was suddenly stirred, as if she had seen someone who had never existed yet appeared in her life.","Jiang Shang, or rather, Jiang Shang.","In her life, there were indeed many connections with Hu Qing.","Since childhood, she had been adopted by Hu Qing.","The bond between master and disciple may have taken less than half of Hu Qing’s time, but it occupied Jiang Shang’s entire life.","The past memories flashed before Jian Wushuang’s eyes, but the current Jiang Shang remembered nothing.","She only felt an inexplicable feeling toward the statue, like seeing the plaque outside the door.","“Sigh!”","Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","What was meant to happen would happen.","He had long noticed that this small world seemed to have countless connections to his past.","Now seeing the statue of Hu Qing confirmed the suspicions in his heart.","He just didn’t know when all this would end.","Just as both were lost in their thoughts, a voice brought them back to reality.","“You two seem very interested in our Bao Guang Temple’s Tongtian Buddha Master!”","A shadow in a black robe, unnoticed until then, stood behind them.","Upon hearing the voice, they both turned to look.","“I am Monk Feng Jue!” The monk in black robes clasped his hands together and lowered his brow slightly.","A black-robed monk!","This attire was rather strange.","Jian Wushuang, well-traveled and knowledgeable, didn’t find it odd but was rather taken aback by the monk’s words.","“Tongtian Buddha Master?” he asked in surprise, “Is he still alive?”","The black-robed Feng Jue paused, then smiled awkwardly, “You overestimate our Bao Guang Temple. The Tongtian Buddha Master is the Lord of the Heavens; I, a humble monk, do not know!”","Once again, the heavens.","This time Jian Wushuang gave up and speculated inwardly that this statue was likely an inheritance from the prince consort back then, not from this world.","But why use the title Tongtian Buddha Master?","It was clearly Hu Qing’s statue!","He had many questions in his heart, but the black-robed monk before him couldn’t explain them, so he chose not to ask further.","Beside him, Jiang Shang voiced her own doubts.","“Master Feng Jue, how did you know we were coming to Bao Guang Temple and specifically asked Master Fanchen to bring us here?” Jiang Shang’s eyes showed suspicion.","Jian Wushuang was equally curious and wanted to hear the monk’s explanation.","“There’s no rush. First, you two should go pay respects to the Tongtian Buddha Master!” Feng Jue appeared unhurried, disregarding their expressions, as he walked past them towards the main hall where the statue was enshrined.","Jian Wushuang and the others could only follow along.","He wanted to see what exactly the other party was hiding.","Ever since they arrived in Tai’an City, he felt an indescribable presence surrounding them.","Perhaps he could learn something he wanted to know from Hei Yi Fengjue.","Entering the grand hall of the backyard, a gentle incense filled his mind.","Fengjue took out some incense, handed it over, and then proceeded to light it and bow deeply.","Jiang Shang followed suit.","When it was Jian Wushuang’s turn, he stood still and did not bow.","It wasn’t that he was too proud to bow, but he found it odd.","He was now expected to burn incense for Hu Qing’s image.","Thinking back to when he first met Hu Qing in the great wilderness, he couldn’t help but sigh.","“Why, does Benefactor Wushuang not believe in Buddha?” Hei Yi Fengjue was not surprised and looked at Jian Wushuang with a calm expression.","It didn’t matter if he didn’t bow.","However, Jian Wushuang still forced himself to bow and light a stick of incense.","“I once revered him like a god!” Jian Wushuang’s voice suddenly sounded ancient and weary.","But there was another sentence in his heart.","“He once revered me like a god!”","...","The entire morning, Jian Wushuang and Jiang Shang followed the black-robed monk, “Fengjue,” around Baoguang Temple.","They walked and chatted.","Until noon, at the earnest invitation of their host, the two left.","On the way back, Jiang Shang asked with a puzzled expression, “Senior, why were you in such a hurry to leave? I think Master Fengjue had more to say!”","“If we waited for him to finish, we wouldn’t be able to leave!” Jian Wushuang shook his head silently. “Don’t think of him as so mysterious. The things he knows are probably learned from the First Floor, pretending to be mysterious in black robes, but there’s nothing special about him!”","Jiang Shang, who half understood, fell half a step behind him and rolled her eyes.","In her view, Jian Wushuang, this old-fashioned man, had been away from the mundane world for too long. He thought no one was better than him, always with an aloof demeanor.","This was her conclusion after these many days.","Moreover, she often noticed that when Jian Wushuang was with Xiang Yang, he always put on a look of deep bitterness.","But she didn’t know how frustrated Jian Wushuang felt at that moment.","Especially today, seeing Hu Qing’s image.","Back at the inn.","The two went to their respective rooms.","Jiang Shang was still savoring Master Fengjue’s words from today.","Especially when Master Fengjue mentioned the Jiang Kingdom...","Jian Wushuang was the same.","Except his gains were different from Jiang Shang’s.","First, Master Fengjue subtly told them in many words to leave Tai’an City, or rather, to leave the Tang Dynasty.","Thinking it over.","Yesterday, he hadn’t revealed much to Zhu Quan.","“How did they notice us?” Jian Wushuang frowned, puzzled.","It was his first time meeting the black-robed monk, and nothing he said to Zhu Quan was revealing.","Why did a monk from Baoguang Temple take notice of him?","Initially, he was excited, thinking the other party knew his true identity.","Especially when he saw Hu Qing’s image.","And that black robe. At the time, even if Fengjue’s true identity was the Demon Lord Wutian, he would have believed it.","But the words Fengjue said later were completely mundane.","He only knew from Zhu Quan that he was an ascetic.","But Jiang Shang’s background was unknown to the other party.","Considering that he had been investigated, Jiang Shang would certainly not escape either.","After all, it was extremely difficult to erase one’s past identity as a ruler of a country.","It was normal to have her true identity discovered.","“It seems it’s not aimed at me!”","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back.","After pondering for a moment, he reached a conclusion.","Baoguang Temple was not targeting him but Jiang Shang.","Otherwise, he couldn’t think of why Fengjue would investigate them.","And today, subtly tell them to leave Tai’an City.","Jiang Shang might not have noticed, but he understood the meaning behind the words.","“Was he trying to warn Jiang Shang?”","Tai’an City was not peaceful."]},{"number":6294,"title":"Chapter 6294: Yang Xiao","paragraphs":["Chapter 6294: Yang Xiao","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Late at night.","A light rain covered the entire Tai’an City. Due to the curfew, the only sound on the streets was the raindrops hitting the eaves, with no other noise.","The Zhanxian Guards patrolling Tai’an City moved like ghosts, concealed in the darkness without revealing a trace of themselves.","At this moment, a few figures in black faintly appeared on the otherwise empty street.","Through the raindrops, these figures disappeared from the street in the blink of an eye.","Their presence lasted less than a breath before it immediately attracted the attention of the Zhanxian Guards.","This district belonged to the outer city, but a squad of Zhanxian Guards was also responsible for this area.","As the force responsible for the safety of the entire Tai’an City and being directly under the command of His Majesty Emperor Tang, the Zhanxian Guards had extremely exaggerated authority.","At night, they could be considered the rulers of Tai’an City.","If they discovered suspicious individuals, they had the privilege of acting before reporting, and even if a prince was killed, they would not be held accountable.","In the past, Tai’an City was not this strict, but since the intrusion of the Alien King three years ago, the entire city had been on high alert.","Even though Emperor Tang had once again ascended to the throne, the curfew had become increasingly strict.","“Tsk tsk, to act so blatantly at night, are they seeking death?”","On the eaves, a middle-aged man wearing a Flying Snow Robe with a wine jug at his waist exuded a murderous aura.","Behind him, two young men in similar attire quickly appeared, but they only had a single copper coin at their collars.","The middle-aged man with the wine jug at his waist, however, had as many as six copper coins.","These copper coins were not ordinary; they bore an aura from ancient times.","They were also the symbol of the Zhanxian Guards.","“Lord Yang, why are you in the Tong’an District?”","The two Zhanxian Guards respectfully clasped their fists, feeling deeply surprised.","In the Zhanxian Guards, the number of copper coins on the chest represented power and status.","A Zhanxian Guard with six copper coins was at least at the command level.","Their strength could easily sweep through ordinary Zhanxian Guards.","Such a powerful figure would usually only appear in the imperial city.","In the entire outer city, only a few Zhanxian Guards with four copper coins were responsible for its security.","“Hmph!”","The middle-aged man casually touched the six copper coins on his chest, removed the wine jug from his waist, and with a flick of his finger, a wisp of clear air flew out.","“If I were not here, would those people have been able to roam Tai’an City so recklessly?”","Two ordinary Zhanxian Guards shuddered in fear. One of them quickly bowed and said, “Lord Yang, those people just now were from the Holy Sect. The Southern Protector has ordered that they be allowed to move around the outer city!”","“The Southern Protector?” Yang Xiao lowered his eyebrows and sneered.","He was a Zhanxian Guard expert with strength comparable to Yang Xiao.","However, among the Zhanxian Guards, there were two types.","One type was like Yang Xiao, who was powerful and possessed six copper coins but was not part of the Zhanxian Guard’s upper echelon.","The other type was those who were powerful and held high positions within the Zhanxian Guards.","The Southern Protector was a high-ranking member of the Zhanxian Guards.","Although both had the strength of six copper coins, Yang Xiao could do nothing against him.","“Go back and tell Nanshan that imperial authority is not meant for him to misuse, and as for that damn Holy Sect, a mere martial arts sect forcing the imperial authority to bow down is an insult to the prestige of the Zhanxian Guards!”","After speaking, Yang Xiao’s figure flickered and disappeared above the eaves.","The Zhanxian Guard who had spoken earlier immediately breathed a sigh of relief!","They could not withstand the pressure of such a powerful person.","A Zhanxian Guard with one copper coin was an innate expert.","With two copper coins, they were late-stage innate experts.","Three copper coins represented innate perfection.","Every three copper coins marked a threshold.","Six copper coins signified the ultimate in immortality, the pinnacle of the Golden Core.","Comparable to Master Fengjue of Baoguang Temple, such formidable figures naturally made them tremble.","“Luckily, this Yang Xiao doesn’t have much power. Otherwise, just for ignoring the Holy Sect’s experts earlier, he could have beheaded us both!”","“Sigh, we’re just unlucky. Yang Xiao usually patrols the imperial city. Why did he appear in the outer city today?”","“Don’t think about it. It’s not something us Copper Guards can speculate on. Let’s go, report to the Southern Protector on the city wall, and then we can head to the brothel for some drinks!”","“Haha, let’s go...”","The two of them maneuvered swiftly over the eaves and quickly reached the city wall, as they were in the outer city.","Inside a high building on the city wall, flames lit up the sky, making the top floor as bright as day.","In the center was a chessboard, but only one person sat by the board, playing chess alone.","“Report, Protector. Yang Xiao appeared in the Copper Mountain District and discovered traces of the Holy Sect!”","Click!","A chess piece was placed, and the Southern Protector of Nanshan did not lift his head. He merely acknowledged with a calm hum and dismissed the two Copper Guards, continuing his game.","After about the time it takes to burn an incense stick, he took a deep breath, glanced at the chessboard, and slowly stood up.","He turned to look at Tai’an City behind him. The middle-aged man in black regular attire had eyes like torches, as if he could see through the entire Tai’an City at a glance.","“Yang Xiao, even you have noticed something?”","His voice was low, carrying an inexplicable sorrow.","But it quickly vanished.","In the deep night, Tai’an City was like a wild beast, devouring all darkness.","Yet in this darkness, a cold light flashed.","Behind the cold light lurked a terrifying force.","It was precisely the group from the Holy Sect that had been moving around the outer city earlier.","A group of nine, each a Golden Core stage immortal. At this moment, they were concealed at a crossroads.","“Elder, the two who went to Baoguang Temple during the day can be confirmed to be staying in the inn and have not left!”","“Good, keep watching, and wait for my order before taking action!” The leading elder of the Holy Sect waved his hand.","The figure in the black robe then re-entered the inn.","But just as he entered the inn, a man and a woman blocked his way.","Swish!","The figure in the black robe showed no surprise, casually pulling off the robe and saying calmly, “Nine Golden Core stage immortals, with one even being a late-stage Golden Core expert. It seems a battle is inevitable tonight!”","“Fortunately, Wushuang had prepared in advance. Otherwise, tonight would have been troublesome!” Xiang Yang looked at Jian Wushuang, who had shed the black robe, with a smile.","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained stern. After returning from Baoguang Temple, he felt increasingly uneasy, understanding Master Fengjue’s warning, realizing that this matter was targeting Jiang Shang. He had made preparations early, observing the area around the inn and even catching a spy.","The one keeping watch was a Golden Core stage immortal. In the evening, he had acted directly to kill the spy. Using his spiritual power, he altered his aura and disguised himself as a member of the Holy Sect.","This led to the scene just now. Fortunately, his spiritual power was strong; otherwise, tonight would have been fraught with danger. At least now, he was in the dark, and the opponent was in the open, giving him room to breathe."]},{"number":6295,"title":"Chapter 6295: Consciousness Pressure","paragraphs":["Chapter 6295: Consciousness Pressure","“Don’t be careless. The ordinary cultivators in the Golden Core stage are not a big concern, but the elder among them is probably not simple. Even for me to kill him, it would take some time. And this is Tai’an City, where there are the Immortal-Slaying Guards. If a fight breaks out, it will quickly draw their attention. Once we’re surrounded by the Immortal-Slaying Guards, they won’t care who made the first move. Moreover, I suspect these Immortal- Slaying Guards have some connection with the Holy Sect; otherwise, these demon sect cultivators wouldn’t be able to enter the city!”","His suspicions were not unfounded. Ever since they captured a demon sect cultivator, he had attempted to leave the city with Xiang Yang and Jiang Shang at night, but they had barely left the tavern when they sensed a powerful aura.","That aura was at least at the peak of the Golden Core stage.","Feeling threatened, they had no choice but to return to the tavern.","“If I had known, we would have chosen another place!” Xiang Yang said, somewhat regretfully.","Jiang Shang disagreed, frowning as he said, “It wouldn’t matter where we go. Once we’re targeted by these demon sect members, there’s nowhere to hide in Tai’an City!”","“Let’s not think so negatively. At least we’re not completely passive; we still have the initiative!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with cold light.","Just a mere group of Golden Core stage cultivators.","If it had been three days ago, he might have been a bit troubled.","But now, they weren’t much of a threat.","As his Thought power gradually recovered, he had a premonition that this small world couldn’t suppress his powerful thoughts.","In other places, even if his consciousness had returned to a mortal state, his strong Thought power could still allow his avatar to return to his main body.","However, this world constantly bound him.","Combined with the prophet in his dreams, Jiang Shang, and Hu Qing’s Dao image, he increasingly felt that this world might exist because of him, which was why he couldn’t break through it.","Though unable to break through normally, his Thought power continued to grow. Now, his Thought power could cover an area of thirty miles, encompassing the entire Tongshan District.","Such powerful Thought power couldn’t even be achieved by a cultivator in the Nascent Soul stage.","The key was that this immense Thought power could not only survey the surroundings but also exert pressure.","Pressure that surpassed that of a Nascent Soul stage cultivator.","It was enough to sweep through ordinary Golden Core stage cultivators, and even strong late- stage Golden Core experts would be subdued.","This was Jian Wushuang’s confidence.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang frowned, taking out the token obtained from the demon sect cultivator, and warned, “Prepare for battle; those guys are sneaking in!”","“Alright!”","“Understood!”","Xiang Yang and Jiang Shang both leaped onto the beam on the first floor, while Jian Wushuang stood on the second floor, using his Thought power to cover a radius of ten miles.","He didn’t cover the full area because he wanted to concentrate his power to exert enough pressure to overwhelm the Golden Core stage.","He left the rest to Xiang Yang and Jiang Shang.","The two of them were to join forces to ambush the demon sect elder.","This elder was a late-stage Golden Core cultivator with formidable strength. Jian Wushuang’s current Thought power was enough to shatter him.","However, a brief restraint was still achievable.","Outside the tavern.","At a crossroads, a group of nine people in black robes quietly approached the tavern under the cover of rain.","“Be careful, make sure to kill with one strike!” The eyes of the demon sect elder were fierce. But as soon as they entered the tavern, a powerful pressure descended instantly.","Thud.","In an instant, eight of the black-robed men fell to their knees, blood oozing from their orifices, their eyes wide open, dead beyond doubt.","This pressure was completely contained within the tavern; outside, the gentle rain continued, unnoticed by anyone.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s Thought power covered only part of the tavern.","Except for the demon sect elder, everyone else perished.","Jian Wushuang drew his sword and rushed downstairs, shouting angrily, “Attack!”","The three of them began their encirclement and assault from different angles.","At that moment, the elder of the demon cult came to his senses. The pressure he had felt earlier was far stronger than anything he had encountered from any other formidable opponent, but that feeling had only lasted for an instant.","Once he regained his clarity, he noticed that he was being besieged from three sides.","Although he was surprised by the recent oppressive force, he instinctively resisted. With a shake of his sleeves, he pushed Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang back several feet, while Jian Wushuang charged at him head-on.","“Die!”","Jian Wushuang’s brow emitted a powerful pressure once again, but this time it was not as effective as the first. It only instilled some fear in the demon cult elder. However, having just casually pushed Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang away, he regained his confidence.","Facing Jian Wushuang’s sword tip, the elder clasped his hands together and blocked it","directly.","“Hmm?”","The demon cult elder’s aura surged immediately. Initially, he was prepared to escape.","The earlier aura had caused him to feel apprehensive, even suppressing his ability to exert his full combat strength.","However, he easily broke through the siege of the three attackers.","“What is happening?”","The source of that powerful aura made him shiver with fear, yet he was facing three ordinary cultivators at the Golden Core stage.","At this point, Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang charged forward again.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to disengage from the demon cult elder,","rising into the air, and his mental pressure swept over once more.","But mental pressure was only effective the first time; its effectiveness diminished with each subsequent use.","The demon cult elder understood that the oppressive force likely did not originate from a super-strong expert but from some kind of treasure.","Instantly, his eyes heated up. With such a powerful treasure in his possession, he could achieve invincibility at the Golden Core stage and even rival those at the Nascent Soul stage.","What had initially been an ordinary hunting task unexpectedly turned into an encounter with such a great opportunity, igniting greed in his heart.","“Hmph, three insignificant brats!”","He clasped his hands again and struck out with his palms, unleashing a burst of thunder.","The entire tavern shook with the explosion.","“Not good!”","Jian Wushuang raised his sword to cut through the thunderous strike. What threatened him","wasn’t the thunder itself, but the commotion it caused, which would certainly attract the","attention of the Immortal Execution Guards.","This was his real concern.","As for the people inside the tavern, he had already forcibly hypnotized them with his Thought power. Now, they were all sound asleep, and even if the tavern collapsed, they would not wake","up.","“Xiang Yang, you two keep him occupied for just a breath!” Jian Wushuang’s breathing was","slightly heavy.","He couldn’t afford to be arrogant any longer. He needed to burn his Thought power to kill the","opponent.","However, doing so would significantly deplete his Thought power.","This was currently his means of self-preservation. Previously, when he encountered those","strong demon cult members in Shanhai County, he had escaped disaster by relying on his","strong Thought power.","Even though he was much stronger now than he was then, this was Tai’an City!","The core of the entire eastern cultivation world.","Naturally, he did not dare to be careless.","If a super-strong expert was drawn here, he might end up suffering a severe defeat.","Therefore, unless absolutely necessary, he would not burn his Thought power to fight, not even to escape.","His Thought power was strong enough-intangible and colorless-that if he wanted to leave, no one could find him. However, Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang would have to be abandoned."]},{"number":6296,"title":"Chapter 6296: Burning Thought Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 6296: Burning Thought Power","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t give up on the two of them and was determined to give it his all.","“With my divine thought, killing someone at the Golden Core stage is truly a waste!”","He raised one hand, concentrating a beam of light on his fingertip, which pointed directly at his own forehead.","“Open!”","Buzz!","A slit slowly expanded on his forehead, revealing the golden eye hidden there.","“Kill!”","Boom!","The eye on his forehead instantly unleashed a powerful aura.","This aura was invisible and colorless because it was a consciousness attack.","To use this method to attack an enemy, mere personal strength was not enough.","In this small world, even cultivators at the Divine Aspect level couldn’t achieve this because cultivators here didn’t need such advanced techniques.","For example, a Divine Aspect cultivator who wanted to kill a Nascent Soul cultivator only needed a flying sword or a palm strike to annihilate them. There was no need for a consciousness attack, and crucially, they only knew ordinary consciousness pressure, unable to comprehend consciousness attacks.","This was a secret consciousness technique created by Jian Wushuang through countless thought powers.","First, consciousness pressure had to pose a threat to those of the same level. If it didn’t threaten peers, there was no need to cultivate it.","Back when Jian Wushuang was a Dao Master, he became an invincible Dao Master and developed some innate methods for consciousness pressure. Later, he inadvertently created consciousness attacks, but in the outside world, he hadn’t had the opportunity to use them.","Because his strength had broken through too quickly, he hadn’t needed this method. Unexpectedly, he used it in this small world, so his original creation wasn’t in vain, even if killing someone at the Golden Core stage was quite wasteful.","Fortunately, the crisis was resolved.","The consciousness attack extinguished the demonic elder’s spirit, leaving his body standing and performing its previous actions.","“Dead?” Jiang Shang’s eyes were filled with disbelief.","Even Xiang Yang felt the same.","He was originally a Universe Master, and a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master at that.","But even he couldn’t exceed his level with thought power, whereas Jian Wushuang could, and he could even burn thought power to kill that demonic elder.","Xiang Yang was shocked, thinking, “He truly deserves to be a super strong Universe God!”","But he didn’t know that Jian Wushuang hadn’t yet undergone the divine tribulation.","“Don’t just stand there, quickly clean up and deal with those corpses. At dawn, we’ll leave the city!” Jian Wushuang’s voice carried a hint of fatigue.","Originally, he hadn’t planned to leave the city, but now he needed to go out to avoid trouble. Inside Tai’an City, things were somewhat restrictive, and he couldn’t act freely.","So, they needed to leave the city.","In fact, the danger inside the city was less than outside.","Once outside, unless they ran very far, they would still encounter trouble. However, at that time, Jian Wushuang could expand his thought power to probe thirty miles around and even conceal their presence, making it difficult for others to detect them.","It was a pity about the countless treasures in Tai’an City.","He couldn’t manage to obtain them now.","Firstly, he had no money, and secondly, because of his identity.","If he could secure a valid identity, with his methods, he could acquire a batch of treasures to surpass the Golden Core stage within a year.","Then, becoming a Nascent Soul cultivator, he could completely control the Eastern Land Cultivation Realm, directly plundering all heavenly treasures and quickly becoming the strongest in this world.","By then, his thought power might have reached a terrifying level, enough to shatter the void and ascend to the upper realm.","But now, he had to leave!","Jian Wushuang sighed and glanced at Xiang Yang again, feeling a bit annoyed.","Why did his little mistress abandon him?","If Xing Luo were guiding him, he could quickly restore all his strength, and breaking through this world wouldn’t be a problem.","“Alas!”","He sighed slightly in his heart and was about to turn back into the room to rest when his brow furrowed.","A powerful aura was approaching the inn, stronger than the demonic elder, nearly at the level of Master Fengjue, definitely a super expert among Golden Core cultivators who could kill the demonic elder within three moves.","“Quick, hide! There’s an unfamiliar presence approaching!”","Jian Wushuang gave a warning and then immediately withdrew his thought power, retreating into the room. Through the gap under the bed, he observed with his naked eye.","On the street.","A middle-aged man with a wine gourd hanging at his waist and a long sword slung across his shoulder was rapidly approaching the inn.","This person was the very presence Jian Wushuang had sensed earlier.","Yang Xiao!","He was a member of the Golden Crow Guards among the Immortal Slaying Guards, with six copper coins on his chest.","One copper coin signified the Copper Snake Guards.","Three copper coins indicated elite status, belonging to the Silver Snake Guards within the Immortal Slaying Guards. They usually patrolled the inner city in teams of three and could contend with Foundation Establishment cultivators.","Above the Silver Snake Guards were the Gold Snake Guards, each at the Foundation Establishment stage.","Further up were the Golden Crow Guards.","This was the highest-ranking patrol guard within the Immortal Slaying Guards.","Even within the Imperial City, there were only two teams of Golden Crow Guards, one in the open and one in the shadows.","However, there were several scattered Golden Crow Guards within the palace.","They generally only patrolled the Imperial City and the palace.","Yang Xiao’s appearance in the outer city surprised the two Copper Snake Guards, and they hadn’t expected Yang Xiao to remain hidden in the outer city.","He had even secretly followed the group from the Holy Sect.","He pursued them all the way to the inn.","“The presence disappeared here!”","As soon as Yang Xiao landed, he alertly gripped his sword.","Although his strength was formidable, his thought power was still at the Foundation Establishment stage, making it impossible to detect the traces of the earlier battle.","He had to rely on his eyes to observe.","But this left a significant hidden danger for Jian Wushuang.","The gentle wind and rain.","The sound of raindrops hitting the inn’s door didn’t produce the usual rustling noise but instead made a pattering sound against the wood.","The rustling sound came from the rain hitting the paper covering the doors.","But now, that sound was absent.","As a Golden Crow Guard, Yang Xiao’s mind was extremely sharp, and his eyes turned toward the inn’s doors.","The paper on a row of doors was already shattered, so the only sound he heard was raindrops hitting the wooden doors.","With just one glance, he noticed the anomaly.","“This inn was normal during the day...”","Yang Xiao’s heart stirred, and he slowly moved forward.","Standing by the second-floor window, Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected such a small detail to expose him.","The paper had been shattered earlier by the actions of the Demonic Sect elder, which he had forgotten.","“This is bad. It looks like we can only make a run for it!” Jian Wushuang’s expression shifted as he prepared to signal Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang to sneak out the other side.","Even if they encountered other Immortal Slaying Guards, he could avoid them one by one using thought power, and if they couldn’t get past the city gate, they would have to wait until dawn.","There was no choice; Yang Xiao had already entered the inn.","The signs of battle on the ground would expose them, and even if they pretended to be asleep, the entire inn would be captured by the Immortal Slaying Guards by morning.","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang wrapped the two in his thought power and quietly slipped out through the window.","With his thought power, he could evade the patrols of the Foundation Establishment stage."]},{"number":6297,"title":"Chapter 6297: Darkness Under the Lights","paragraphs":["Chapter 6297: Darkness Under the Lights","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, they could not escape the visible and hidden Copper Snake Immortal Slayers.","These Immortal Slayers could still patrol with their naked eyes.","Once discovered, a chain reaction would occur, causing chaos throughout the city, which was not something Jian Wushuang wanted to see.","So he took Jiang Shang and Xiang Yang directly to the inner city.","They even planned to go to the imperial city.","This was because everywhere there were Immortal Slayers in the Jindan stage, and most Jindan cultivators would not foolishly patrol with their naked eyes. Instead, they would sit cross-legged in a place, covering a hundred feet around them with thought power, occasionally walking around to probe with their thought power.","In their view, this method was more efficient.","Jian Wushuang had figured out the loophole in this and took the two of them to the imperial city.","There was no way in the outer city, which was full of fools using their eyes. If he took the two of them around at night, they would easily be discovered.","His thought power was not enough to make the three of them invisible.","So he simply entered the imperial city.","He played the trick of hiding under the lamp.","As for the noble Golden Crow Guard “Yang Xiao” among the Immortal Slayers, he was still checking everyone in the tavern one by one.","But after checking around, he hadn’t drawn his sword even once.","“All ordinary people?”","Yang Xiao frowned. He had rushed over from another place, and it took less than a stick of incense time. He firmly believed that the other party could not have escaped so quickly.","He then went to the backyard to search around and finally only found ten corpses.","Among them was one who had been stalking them earlier, of which he was unaware. The rest were the group he had seen.","The moment he saw these corpses, cold sweat broke out on Yang Xiao’s back.","Although he was stronger than that demonic cult elder, he had no confidence in defeating this group of people, let alone killing them, especially under the eyes of the Immortal Slayers, who could instantly kill so many experts.","“A Nascent Soul?”","This was Yang Xiao’s first thought, and he immediately crushed the highest-level token among the Immortal Slayers.","The headquarters of the Immortal Slayers, set deep in the imperial palace, instantly received Yang Xiao’s call for help.","“Yang Xiao has crushed the token; activate the highest alert in the city!”","Soon, the entire Immortal Slayer force was mobilized.","Because it was a rescue message from the Golden Crow Guard from the six copper coins, it was certainly a threat from a Nascent Soul, which was enough to mobilize the entire Tai’an City Immortal Slayers to respond.","Although there were Nascent Soul experts hidden among the Immortal Slayers,","they knew very well that if a Nascent Soul cultivator went on a rampage in Tai’an City, it would take several Nascent Soul cultivators to stop them.","That was why the highest alert was activated.","Of course, this alert was from the imperial city.","The inner city was secondary, and as for the outer city, it didn’t matter how many died.","Similarly, there was no significant change in the palace, and the eunuchs yawned as usual while standing in front of the palace gate.","It wasn’t until a team of Immortal Slayers arrived that the little eunuch in front of the hall perked up a bit.","“Lord Chang!” The little eunuch just cupped his hands slightly.","Despite his young age, he wore a robe embroidered with pythons and was a close minister of the emperor.","Even the absolute high-level “Chang Feng” among the Immortal Slayers had to treat him with a smile.","“Lord Wang, please inform Lord Han, there is an important matter to report!” Chang Feng lowered his posture considerably, even taking out a gold bar to secretly slip to the little eunuch.","The little eunuch casually tucked it into his sleeve, glanced at Lord Chang, saw he was accompanied by several Golden Snake Guards, and realized it was a matter of great importance that could not be delayed. He nodded and hurried into the hall.","This was the Hall of Mental Cultivation, where Emperor Tang practiced cultivation.","Since the rebellion of the Strange King three years ago, which caused him much suffering, after regaining the throne, he had been immersed in cultivation. Even after reaching the Nascent Soul stage, he had not relaxed. With the support of the entire Tang Dynasty, he broke through three years later and had already reached the mid-Nascent Soul stage, a speed considered a miracle in the cultivation world.","“Hmm?”","Inside the hall, an elderly eunuch, standing with lowered eyes, slowly lifted his head and looked at the entering eunuch, Wang Gonggong.","“Lord Han, Master Chang has urgent business to discuss with you!”","Wang Gonggong kept his head lowered. He could face Chang Feng, who held power over life and death in Tai’an City, without batting an eye, and even gain some benefits. However, in front of Han Gong, Chief Eunuch Han, he didn’t dare to breathe heavily.","In the entire palace, aside from the Emperor, not even the Emperor could exert such pressure on him.","This was a figure of immense power within the palace and throughout the entire Eastern Lands.","He was reputed to be the strongest within the palace.","Even the Zhantian Guard, established within the palace and consisting of many experts, couldn’t compare to this grand eunuch before him.","For a eunuch to reach such heights, granted titles and nobility, spoke volumes.","“Alright, you may go!” Chief Eunuch Han Chongjiu said calmly.","Wang Gonggong didn’t dare to urge him, even if rebels were attacking from outside, he wouldn’t dare to rush Lord Han.","After the young eunuch left, Han Chongjiu turned and entered the inner hall, emerging shortly thereafter and heading straight outside.","Waiting outside the hall, Master Chang Feng showed no hint of complaint, instead greeting him respectfully.","“Lord Han!”","The group of Golden Snake Guards behind him also bowed their heads in salute.","Han Chongjiu didn’t even lift his eyelids, standing with his hands behind his back at the entrance of the hall, and said quietly, “The Emperor is already aware of the specifics. Master Chang, just handle your responsibilities well. There’s no need to worry or ask about the rest.”","“Yes!” Chang Feng replied, lowering his head.","However, his eyes held a sharp glint.","After his departure, Master Chang, accompanied by several subordinates, returned to the Zhantian Guard with a grim expression.","The events of that night left him with a strong sense of crisis.","It wasn’t because of some mysterious Nascent Soul expert, but because of the frequent actions of the Sacred Sect in Tai’an City.","The so-called Sacred Sect was actually a demonic cult.","It was only called a Sacred Sect because the Emperor valued it.","This was their fault years ago when they failed to protect the Emperor, allowing the cultivation sects to invade imperial power.","Originally, this demonic cult only relied on the court for some benefits, but in recent years, they had frequently visited Tai’an City, especially the Saintess of the cult, who often entered the palace.","The current Emperor highly valued people from the demonic cult.","Some matters in Tai’an City were handled by the demonic cult rather than the Zhantian Guard.","That’s why Chang Feng felt a sense of crisis.","It wasn’t because his position was threatened, but because placing value on cultivation sects would eventually lead down a divergent path, especially when valuing a demonic cult.","The Zhantian Guard not only patrolled Tai’an City but also had the role of overseeing the world.","Over the years, so many innocent people had died. Chang Feng wasn’t blind. Despite the Zhantian Guard constantly shrinking, with its scope now reduced to Tai’an City, the things happening outside couldn’t be concealed.","Moreover, with so many deaths, anyone with some capability was well aware.","The headquarters of the Zhantian Guard was a seven-story tower.","The first floor was where the Bronze Snake Guards worked, a place with many people. Those who worked there were responsible for organizing dossiers and information and generally didn’t go out to patrol.","They also wouldn’t go to the second floor."]},{"number":6298,"title":"Chapter 6298: Chief Commander","paragraphs":["Chapter 6298: Chief Commander","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There were seven floors, and each floor was divided into levels.","Chang Feng was the commander of the Golden Crow Guards, and he could directly go to the seventh floor.","This place towered into the clouds, and there were huge floor-to-ceiling windows that allowed one to see the entire Imperial Palace and even Great Peace City.","It was also the tallest building in the entire palace.","From this building, it could be seen how highly the Zhanxian Guards had been regarded by the Emperor.","Unfortunately, these years, the monarch and his subjects were somewhat separated.","Chang Feng arrived at the seventh level. He looked at the tall and sturdy figure in a black cloak standing by the window and sighed.” Commander, His Majesty wants us to leave this matter alone. Do you think we should still investigate this matter?”","The stalwart man by the window didn’t say anything. He kept looking out the window.","After a long while, he said indifferently,”Then don’t bother!”.","“But!” Chang Feng was somewhat unconvinced.","Facing the Han Palace and the Emperor, he did not dare to throw such a small tantrum.","However, the commander who had established the Zhanxian Guards was like the master of all the Zhanxian Guardss. No matter what happened, they did not dare to hide anything, not even their emotions.","Just like now, Chang Feng was acting according to his nature.","” The Devil Cult is wreaking havoc and His Majesty is indulging it. If this continues, the world will probably be in chaos. This goes against the teachings of the previous emperor and our ancestors. Why must we blindly tolerate it? Could it be that three years ago...”","Before Chang Feng could finish, he was interrupted by the commander.” Enough!”","When the calm commander heard the words ‘three years’, his body trembled slightly. He took a deep breath before calming down.","“Call Yang Xiao to see me. I have my own arrangements for the rest!” There was a strange look in the commander’s deep eyes.","Even though Chang Feng still wanted to say something, he could only leave helplessly.","Below the Imperial City.","Outside the palace.","This was the gathering place of the nobles of Great Peace City.","It was also the core of the entire dynasty.","Most of the people who could live here were members of the royal family, and some of them were officials of the imperial court. All of them were officials of the third rank and above.","Therefore, most of the Imperial City was filled with deep courtyards. There were very few small courtyards. Even if there were a few small courtyards, they were all people with noble statuses.","The drizzle gradually turned into a downpour.","In the rainy night, people rushed and the clouds moved in all directions.","Although the Tang Emperor was indifferent to this matter, the Immortal Slaying Troop did not relax at all. They continued to patrol the entire Imperial City with the highest alert.","Swoosh!","A group of figures flew past the roof of a large courtyard.","One of the figures paused for a moment.","“Leave two people to guard the princess’s manor!”","“Yes, sir!”","Two black-robed figures instantly descended and hid in the princess’s manor.","The rest of them gradually disappeared in the heavy rain.","After they had walked far away, three figures suddenly appeared behind a fake mountain in the princess’s manor.","This was a secret passage in the rockery.","However, it had been abandoned for a long time. Even many people in the manor did not know about it and had long forgotten about it, let alone those Zhanxian Guardss.","This was a very suitable place to hide.","Coincidentally, a Five-Coin Golden Snake Guard had also hidden himself here.","It happened to be hiding in the same place as Jian Wushuang and the other two.","“Brother Wushuang, should we kill him?”Xiang Yang’s eyes were filled with ruthlessness.","Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes and said,” Didn’t you hear what they said?” This is the princess’s manor, so it’s best to be careful. Since he didn’t notice us...”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","“Not good!”","He was the first to attack. He condensed his Psyche Power into a single point. Although he had lost a lot of it because of the previous burning, it was still more than enough to deal with a mid-stage Aurous Core cultivator. However, this attack carried the threat of being discovered.","This was the Imperial City, so there might be a Nascent Soul cultivator watching this place from the shadows.","Although his Psyche Power had already been burned once, it wasn’t a problem for him to hide from the Nascent Soul stage. However, once he started fighting, if even a trace of his aura leaked out, he might be discovered. Moreover, he couldn’t kill the captured Celestial Execution Guards, or else he would be traced to their hiding place.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang didn’t prepare to attack. However, the other party discovered his position at a close distance.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically. A Mid Gold Core Realm expert would not be able to detect them. However, the other party was able to detect them. He must have a rare treasure.","“Freeze!”","Jian Wushuang pointed his finger and the dim light penetrated the man’s forehead, directly stunning his soul.","“Cripple his cultivation first!” As soon as he gave the order, Xiang Yang instantly attacked.","He directly crushed the Golden Core of the Five Coins Golden Snake Guard.","Xiang Yang’s movements are very fast. In just an instant, he has broken the other party’s golden core.","“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. He waved his hand to signal the two of them to step back and walked over alone.","“Now, answer whatever I ask. If you understand, nod your head!”","The Golden Snake Guard standing in the corner nodded his head stiffly. His eyes were empty, as if he had been enslaved.","Jian Wushuang’s powerful Psyche Power had shattered the other party’s consciousness, leaving only the memories in his sea of consciousness. In this way, he could ask the other party what he wanted to know and ensure that the other party would not die.","This way, the Zhanxian Guards wouldn’t notice.","However, there was also a drawback. If the Zhanxian Guards couldn’t find this person, they would definitely send someone else.","Moreover, he had only controlled one of the two remaining Immortal Execution Guards, the Golden Snake Guard. To be on the safe side, Jian Wushuang had to deal with the other one.","“Are there any Nascent Soul cultivators in the Celestial Slaying Troop?” Jian Wushuang asked the first question.","He was also quite curious if there were any Nascent Soul cultivators in the Zhanxian Guards. If there were, he would have to be extra careful.","“Yes, the commander is a False Nascent Soul cultivator!” The Golden Snake Guard replied like a puppet.","“Fake Nascent Soul?”","Jian Wushuang was a little surprised. He would have been calm if it was a Nascent Soul Realm cultivator. After all, there were many late-stage Golden Core Realm cultivators in the Immortal Slaying Troop, so it was normal for them to have Nascent Soul Realm cultivators. However, he did not expect the commander to be a False Nascent Soul Realm cultivator.","Fake Nascent Soul cultivators were different from Nascent Soul cultivators.","At the very least, there was a huge difference in their combat strength and cultivation level.","It was more accurate to call it a dead Nascent Soul cultivator because the Nascent Soul had yet to form and had become a dead Nascent Soul. Generally speaking, this kind of cultivator would explode and die. However, if they prepared treasures in advance to maintain their breathing, they could save their lives, but they would also lose all their cultivation.","To be able to condense a dead infant, the other party must have some kind of unique inheritance.","This inheritance was nothing to Jian Wushuang. He had ten thousand ways to deal with it. However, for a mortal cultivator to obtain such an inheritance, it was obvious that he was not simple.","Jian Wushuang asked a lot of questions about the commander, such as his age and characteristics, and what kind of cultivation method he practiced.","Initially, he had thought that he would be fishing for fish with a big net and ask more questions. He did not care if he could answer them or not.","However, he did not expect him to ask so many questions."]},{"number":6299,"title":"Chapter 6299: Jiang Shang?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6299: Jiang Shang?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This commander was originally an orphan. By a twist of fate, he entered the palace and became a eunuch. Due to his unique constitution, he was naturally able to cultivate. The former emperor saw him as promising and kept him close to nurture him, effectively cultivating one of his own.","Throughout the history of the Tang dynasty, every emperor practiced cultivation, yet they all suffered short lives.","Many of those who reached the late stage of the Golden Core cultivation fell due to their cultivation practices.","Only by reaching the Nascent Soul stage could one attain some longevity, though not for long.","For instance, some at the Nascent Soul stage could live for a thousand years, but Tang emperors only had lifespans of two or three hundred years.","The reason for this remained unknown.","To consolidate imperial power, each Tang emperor cultivated a group of trusted and powerful mysterious cultivators.","Thus, the Zhanxian Guard came into being.","However, they were not originally called the Zhanxian Guard, as the name was too exaggerated and might offend cultivation sects.","It wasn’t until three years ago, after the Tang emperor was forced to abdicate and the throne was usurped, that the name was changed to Zhanxian Guard. Since then, their supervision of sects across the land had become increasingly stringent.","Jian Wushuang carefully pondered the information he had obtained.","The commander was a trusted minister of the former emperor and naturally became a close confidant of the new emperor after the change of power. His strength was formidable. Although he was a pseudo-Nascent Soul stage cultivator, three years ago, he had resisted a surprise attack from a foreign king, single-handedly fighting off three adversaries while successfully helping the current emperor escape. Later, he assisted the current Tang emperor in reclaiming the throne.","Such merit and such strength.","Even Jian Wushuang had to take him seriously.","“Let’s go!”","Under the current circumstances, leaving was the best option.","Due to Jiang Shang’s situation, Jian Wushuang suspected that they were already targeted by the Tang emperor.","However, he was curious as to why the Tang emperor hadn’t sent the Zhanxian Guard to capture them, but instead, a group of demonic cultivators.","There was also the warning from Baoguang Temple.","“One last question. How much do you know about the Jiang Kingdom in the Southern Sky Realm?”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but ask this question.","This also caused Jiang Shang behind him to be taken aback and equally curious.","The clever Jiang Shang was well aware of the current situation. As soon as she entered Tai’an City, she was warned by Master Fengjue of Baoguang Temple to leave the city. Subsequently, they were ambushed by demonic sects, which must have some indescribable connection to her background.","Moreover, she had an inexplicable feeling towards Baoguang Temple. All these things led her to suspect that the Jiang Kingdom, or perhaps her mother, had some complex ties with the Tang dynasty.","After all, her mother came from the Tang dynasty and was no ordinary person there. She might even be connected to the royal family.","The wooden-faced Golden Snake Guard paused for a moment and then slowly said, “I know a little. I was once ordered to go to the Jiang Kingdom to find a female immortal named Jiang Shang!”","“Jiang Shang?” Jian Wushuang was incredulous and then asked excitedly, “What happened next?”","“We didn’t find her!”","Jiang Shang and Jiang Shang?","Jian Wushuang gasped, glancing back at Jiang Shang, as two figures emerged in his mind.","One was Jiang Shang, and the other was Jiang Shang.","He had always been mistaken. Jiang Shang was not the Jiang Shang he once knew, but very likely her mother.","It was quite normal for the two to look identical, and the totem on their bodies could be inherited through bloodline.","With this thought, Jian Wushuang’s breath reversed.","Seeing his strange expression, Jiang Shang was at a loss.","“Why are you looking for Jiang Shang? How much do you know about her?” Jian Wushuang asked two questions in a row.","Xiang Yang, standing beside him, was a little confused. He didn’t understand much about this, so he asked, puzzled, “Is Jiang Shang confused with Jiang Shang?”","“Shut up!” Jian Wushuang turned and glared at Xiang Yang.","Frightened, Xiang Yang immediately shut his mouth and remained silent.","“I don’t know!” The Golden Snake Guard replied in a wooden tone.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang slightly closed his eyes. When he opened them again, his figure flickered suddenly and rushed straight to the backyard of the Princess’s Mansion. He reached out and grabbed another Golden Snake Guard.","He directly used thought power to control the opponent and asked the same question again.","Unfortunately, the answer was still unknown.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to place the two of them in a dark secret passage.","At this time, Jiang Shang couldn’t help but speak, “Senior, do you know my mother?”","“Her name is Jiang Shang, right?”","Jiang Shang nodded apologetically upon hearing this, as she had not mentioned it to Jian Wushuang.","Because in her heart, her mother’s secret was more important, and she hadn’t mentioned it even to those closest to her.","Jian Wushuang did not blame her, as it was a personal matter. He was just curious and asked, “Why do you have the same surname as your mother?”","“I don’t know either. Maybe it’s just a coincidence!” Jiang Shang shook her head.","This was just a matter of curiosity; Jian Wushuang was more concerned about where Jiang Shang was.","Would the other party recognize her?","Or did they know what was going on in this world?","He was increasingly curious about this place.","Perhaps this time, he did not come in vain. It might be the opportunity for him to undergo the divine tribulation, but now he was stuck in the lower realm, and he couldn’t rush. He had to explore slowly.","At this moment, his mindset had naturally changed, coming from the mortal world and returning to the mortal world, using this as a foundation to strive for the divine tribulation.","Now, what he needed to do was to return to his original state, that is, to restore the full power of his true self, and then undergo the divine tribulation.","“Hopefully,” Jian Wushuang muttered in his heart.","The rainy night continued.","There were only scattered lights in the Princess’s Mansion, and as for Jian Wushuang’s hiding place, it was an abandoned garden that few people visited during the day, let alone at night. Moreover, the servants in the Princess’s Mansion were spreading rumors that the garden was haunted recently, often hearing someone crying, and it was a male ghost crying miserably.","And today was no exception.","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow, and his figure ghosted out of the rockery.","It wasn’t that he heard crying, but someone had quietly entered the back garden.","Clad in white, with a noble face, yet there was a hint of sorrow between the brows.","Jian Wushuang recognized the person’s identity and was surprised in his heart, “Is it him?”","In the entire Princess’s Mansion, he was the person with the highest thought power and fortune.","Apart from him, there was the princess, whose fortune could suppress the imperial princess, and this person was undoubtedly the prince consort.","It was just unexpected that this prince consort would come to this remote back garden in the middle of the night.","Jian Wushuang was not worried that the other party would enter the secret passage in the rockery. He wasn’t that unlucky. The passage had been abandoned for a long time, and the prince consort probably didn’t know about it.","As expected, the other party just walked to a peach tree, holding a lantern, and rummaged at the root for a while, as if looking for something. Unfortunately, he didn’t find anything. Unconvinced, he searched the other peach trees, muttering something under his breath.","But the distance was too far for others to hear.","However, Jian Wushuang’s powerful thought power clearly captured the other party’s voice.","“Impossible, Chai Jiu said he would help me check!”","The prince consort muttered as he held the lantern and searched, anxiously digging into the black soil with his delicate hands, which soon bled."]},{"number":6300,"title":"Chapter 6300: Chen Yuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 6300: Chen Yuan","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The pain was excruciating as if the fingers were connected to his heart, but it didn’t stop him. Instead, he seemed to have lost his mind, tossing away the lantern and sitting down heavily, crying out in agony.","Fortunately, the garden was vast and far from the inhabited courtyards, making it difficult to hear unless one listened carefully.","Jian Wushuang found it somewhat amusing. He used his thought power to isolate the surroundings, not intending to engage with the person but also not wanting the noise to attract others, so he silenced the area.","However, just as he closed his eyes, the mention of “Chai Jiu” from the other person came to mind.","This Chai Jiu was the very Golden Snake Guard he had first captured.","No wonder he entered this rockery, and the secret passage behind it was so familiar; it turned out he knew the prince consort and frequently visited here, which explained his familiarity.","Thinking of how the prince consort was searching for news brought by Chai Jiu, Jian Wushuang asked, “Do you know the prince consort?”","“Yes!” Chai Jiu nodded woodenly.","Beside him, Xiang Yang grinned mischievously, “This guy isn’t having an affair with the prince consort, is he?”","“Ah?” Jiang Shang blushed but had heard of such preferences and shyly lowered his head.","Jian Wushuang sighed, feeling that it was no wonder Xing Luo had no interest in Xiang Yang; this guy appeared upright but was full of treacherous thoughts.","Rolling his eyes, he continued, “What is your relationship with the prince consort, and what has he asked you to investigate?”","“We’re friends. I often gamble and owe a lot of money outside. The prince consort helped me clear my gambling debts, so I help him with some minor tasks. One of those tasks was to gather information about someone for the prince consort. She was his sweetheart before he passed the imperial exams. A month ago, I found out she was abused by a group of young lords. The prince consort was furious and asked me to investigate the culprits!”","Originally, it was just for amusement, but it turned out to be such a coincidence.","Jian Wushuang and his companions widened their eyes, asking in unison, “Is the sweetheart’s name A Zi?”","“Yes!” Chai Jiu nodded emphatically.","“What a coincidence!”","The girl they encountered at the dock, who asked him to find someone, turned out to be the prince consort squatting on the ground, crying.","“Sigh!” Jian Wushuang sighed again.","He had intended to find the heartless man and kill him with one sword but didn’t expect the two to be truly in love. The prince consort must have his reasons.","Such deep sorrow, he must truly be heartbroken.","Jian Wushuang took out an oil-paper letter from his bosom, intending to hand it to Chai Jiu to give to the prince consort.","But on second thought, he realized that his current situation in Tai’an City was precarious due to the lack of a stable foothold.","Perhaps he could use the prince consort’s influence to hide in the imperial city.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang held the letter between his fingers and stood up.","He decided to deliver it personally.","Whoosh!","He appeared directly, without any hesitation.","Swish!","His body hovered more than a foot above the ground, and Jian Wushuang looked down at the prince consort “Chen Yuan” before him.","“You!” Chen Yuan was startled and quickly stepped back.","Jian Wushuang casually tossed the letter to Chen Yuan and said calmly, “Don’t be afraid, I was just entrusted by someone to deliver this letter to you.”","“A letter?” Chen Yuan looked thoughtfully at the oil paper envelope.","At first, he thought of court disputes.","In the court, officials’ every word could be deadly.","Outside the court, swords and blades were everywhere, and every step was like walking on thin ice.","Even as the imperial son-in-law, he was not exempt.","Therefore, he assumed Jian Wushuang was a retainer of some important figure, intending to engage in secret correspondence with him.","But as he picked up the oil paper envelope, a sense of unease filled his heart.","Looking at the yellowed oil paper, his thoughts seemed to return to the summer three years ago.","In a village in the Shanhai County, there was a small stream.","On the bank, a young man and woman, talented and beautiful.","“Chen Yuan, after you go to the capital, will you come back?”","“I will, because I promised your parents I would marry you, of course, I will come back!”","“But you’ll be gone for more than a year...”","“I can write to you!”","“But I can’t write...”","“Then draw pictures!”","“But I don’t have money to send letters...”","The young scholar flipped through his book, his eyes fixed on the girl as he said, “Then draw everything you want to say to me, and give it to me in person when I return!”","“No, if it takes too long, the paper will rot...”","“Use oil paper!”","Three years passed in the blink of an eye.","Holding the oil paper envelope, Chen Yuan felt a lump in his throat, a thorn in his back, and his scalp tingled with emotion.","He thought of it but dared not believe it.","The girl was just a fisherman’s daughter; how could she have the means to entrust a celestial being with a letter?","But when he opened the oil paper envelope and saw the crooked handwriting inside, his eyes instantly turned red, bloodshot.","“A... Zi...”","Chen Yuan covered his mouth, trying to maintain his composure, but his heart was so twisted that he couldn’t stand up straight.","“Of all the words in the world, love is the most painful!” Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly, though outwardly he still intended to intimidate the other party.","“Chen Yuan, you heartless man, Miss A’zi waited for you every day at the dock, while you lived like royalty in Tai’an City. How can you face Miss A’zi?” His voice was like a great bell, as if scolding a junior.","Chen Yuan nodded like a pecking chicken, his voice hoarse as he said, “It’s my fault, I failed her!”","“Since you understand, then prepare to die! Miss A’zi saved my life at sea; today, I will avenge her by killing you, the heartless man, and then avenging her!” Jian Wushuang finished speaking and drew his sword, ready to strike.","Unexpectedly, the other party did not shout or scream, just stretched his neck, waiting to die.","This baffled Jian Wushuang. Although Chen Yuan was indeed deeply in love with A’zi, his calmness in the face of death made Jian Wushuang regard him in a new light.","“Since this approach doesn’t work, let’s try another way.”","Jian Wushuang hadn’t really intended to kill Chen Yuan; the sword rested on Chen Yuan’s neck, but there was no killing intent in his eyes.","“Senior, do it!” Chen Yuan twisted his neck, ready to accept death.","In this situation, Jian Wushuang had a backup plan. Looking at Chen Yuan, he said in a solemn tone, “Haha, A’zi was right about you. You’re not even afraid of death, so it seems there must be another reason for not returning from the capital. I was testing you; if you had been cowardly, I would have killed you and then gone after the murderer of Miss A’zi. Now, seeing that you are a man, I spare your life.”","“But I will never be able to get over A’zi’s death!” Chen Yuan’s face was ashen, without any joy of surviving, rather a bit of disappointment. He had truly intended to prove his sincerity with his death.","Jian Wushuang understood this sentiment. What followed was his skillful consolation and guidance, quickly shaping him into the imposing image of an overseas celestial just entering the mortal world.","He even detailed how A’zi had depleted her strength while saving him to ensure logical coherence and prevent any suspicion."]}]);
